window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_ANCIENT_MISS_CEO_WIFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Wishing Upon the Moon","paragraphs":["\"Acquiring the Xu Group should make them feel even worse. Not just Xu Zhengyang and Yang Cui, but Xu Guimin is the one who truly let Mom down.\"","This time Shen Yin remained silent. Whatever Xu Xiuhe decided to do, she would support him.","The moon had just risen from behind the western mountains, round and bright.","The temperature in Tibetan City dropped sharply at night, but the lively atmosphere didn't diminish at all. There were many traditional customs, such as worshipping the moon. Mid-Autumn moon worship has been a long-standing Tibetan tradition. When the moon rises, facing it, they set up an incense altar, arrange mooncakes, apples, plums, grapes, and other offerings, light incense and candles, and then the whole family kneels and prays together, praying for the family's health and good fortune.","Downstairs at the hotel, the Tibetan hotel owner had set up the incense altar early.","Shu Yi had gone out for a walk nearby today, with Chang Zhiyuan naturally following behind her.","When the two returned, the Tibetan hotel owner said, \"The young couple is back! You're just in time. Come quickly and worship the moon together, pray for each other's safety.\"","\"Um, we're not a couple,\" Shu Yi tried to explain.","The hotel owner was momentarily embarrassed, but within two seconds found a way to save face.","\"I understand, you young people call this 'playing coy'. I've been running this hotel for many years, especially in the past two years, there have been many couples like you. They look perfect together but insist they're not in a relationship. Later on, they all end up together.\"","...","Shu Yi was speechless.","Chang Zhiyuan was overjoyed and wanted to pull Shu Yi along to worship the moon. Shu Yi felt a bit embarrassed.","She had always taken relationships seriously, so when Chang Zhiyuan told her that she was meant to spend her life with him, not with his family, she was moved.","That's what he said, and while love is between two people, marriage involves two families.","She didn't want just a romance, but someone she could hold hands with for a lifetime.","Shu Yi didn't know what others' views on relationships were, but she knew what she wanted. If she knew from the start that a relationship had no future, she would never get involved.","\"I'm tired, I want to go upstairs.\"","Shu Yi still wanted to be alone with her thoughts.","The moon worship ceremony was still going on downstairs. Chang Zhiyuan watched Shu Yi go up, then hurriedly ran to the incense altar.","\"Moon Goddess, I've heard that the Moon Old Man ties red strings for lovers. You're both surnamed Moon, so you must know each other. Please help this ordinary mortal and pass on a message. If I can win Shu Yi's heart, I promise to worship the moon every year.\"","Chang Zhiyuan spoke with utmost sincerity, as devout as could be.","The hotel owner patted Chang Zhiyuan on the shoulder and said, \"Child, with such sincerity, the moon will surely hear you.\"","Chang Zhiyuan gave the hotel owner a grateful look and then headed upstairs.","\"I made a wish to the moon. We will definitely be together.\"","\"Aren't you being childish?\"","\"When it comes to you, I can't give up on even the slightest hope.\"","Chang Zhiyuan continued seriously, \"The woman you met last time was my sister. My parents favored sons over daughters, so she wasn't liked by them since childhood. After I was born, they treated her even worse.\"","\"I didn't understand why before, and even thought she might not be my parents' biological child, so I didn't treat her well either. But she never complained. She would bring me snacks after school and take care of me at home. When I was in fourth grade, I couldn't swim yet, and I was pushed into a lake. It was her who jumped in to save me. The water was cold, and she was on her period at the time.\"","Chang Zhiyuan paused here, recalling the memory.","\"What happened then?\" Shu Yi became curious.","\"She pushed me up onto the shore, and I saw that her pants were covered in blood. She looked like she was in pain. By the time the rescue team arrived, she was almost unconscious. The doctor said if it had been any later, her life would have been in danger. She was left with chronic health issues afterward, but my parents don't know about this. Only I know that she might not be able to have children now.\"","Shu Yi was shocked to hear this.","\"She continued to be good to me afterward. My parents started treating her a bit better because she saved me. But I've always felt guilty for causing her to lose her ability to have children. She won't let me tell them about it.\"","\"What about now?\"","\"Now she's in her early thirties and still single. My parents wanted her to have an arranged marriage before, but on one hand, she really doesn't want to because she likes Tan Xiao. On the other hand, she feels that since she can't have children, she'd end up divorced even after an arranged marriage. So to make her get noticed by our parents, I've been deliberately lazy, not going home, and refusing to take over the family business. This way, her abilities would be seen, and my parents wouldn't keep pressuring her.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had never told anyone else about these things. Even Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe only knew bits and pieces. They knew that Chang Ningjing had saved him, but they didn't know she was left with chronic health issues.","They also knew that Chang Ningjing liked Tan Xiao, but they didn't know that due to her insecurities, she never made a big effort to pursue him.","\"Who's Tan Xiao?\" Shu Yi didn't seem to have heard of him, or maybe she had heard but forgotten. In any case, she didn't have much of an impression of this name.","\"Tan Xiao is the captain of the Rong City Special Police Force. He's a bit younger than my sister and was her junior in high school. My sister has liked him for 13 years now.\"","Chang Zhiyuan explained.","\"13 years?\" Shu Yi couldn't believe it. She had only had a secret crush on someone for two years, but this sister had liked someone for 13 years.","\"Yes, my sister is a really good person. The reason she treated you that way before was because of me. My previous girlfriends all had some issues, either gold diggers or those with a lot of scandals. When she first met you, she probably thought you were problematic too.\"","\"Why was your taste so... before?\"","Shu Yi didn't finish the sentence, but having said this much, Chang Zhiyuan understood.","\"Are you stupid? Only by acting this way will my parents think I'm beyond help and stop forcing me to go back and inherit the company. This way, my sister can continue to stay unmarried.\"","\"Does Tan Xiao like your sister?\" Shu Yi was more curious about this question. She also liked gossip.","So she wanted to know, when a man has been liked by a woman for 13 years, does that man know about it? And if he does know, what does he think about it?","It wasn't just 3 years, it was 13 years. Do you realize what 13 years means? How many 13-year periods does one have in a lifetime?","\"I don't know if Tan Xiao knows, and I'd like to know too. But it's up to my sister to think what she wants. I don't ask about her business, and she certainly won't ask about mine. If you want to know about their relationship, after we get back, I'll take you to meet my sister. Whatever you want to know, you can ask her yourself.\""]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: Happy Mid-Autumn Festival","paragraphs":["\"I don't want to know anymore,\" Shu Yi immediately replied. She hadn't agreed to meet Chang Zhiyuan's sister.","\"We'll meet someday,\" Chang Zhiyuan said with inexplicable confidence.","He made this solemn promise to Shu Yi.","What could Shu Yi do? She could only pretend she hadn't heard.","\"I'm tired. I'm going to take a shower and go to bed.\"","Chang Zhiyuan walked out onto the balcony, gazed at the bright moon outside the window, and called Chang Ningjing.","\"Hello, sis.\"","\"Who are you calling sis?\" Chang Ningjing's tone was particularly unpleasant on the other end of the line.","\"Sis, I was wrong,\" Chang Zhiyuan said coyly.","\"Wrong about what?\"","\"I shouldn't have gone so long without calling my dear sister. I shouldn't have left Rong City without a word during the holiday and not gone home. I made you worry. It's all my fault. I'll definitely bring you some local specialties when I come back.\"","\"Get lost. Stop sweet-talking me. Do you know that Mom and Dad complain about you to me every day? They say you don't care about them, that you're unfilial, that you don't come home. Every day they pester me, asking when you'll be back. Can't you just give them a call?\"","Chang Zhiyuan wanted to say that if he called his parents, what would be left for Chang Ningjing to do? He didn't know what his parents were thinking. Was a son a child but a daughter not? Boys and girls were the same. He didn't know who had indulged them in this habit of favoring sons over daughters. He just couldn't stand it. When these two changed their habit of favoring sons over daughters, that's when he'd go home again.","\"Where are you? I've never seen you away from Rong City during holidays before. Don't tell me you're on a business trip. I haven't even settled accounts with you about you running off to act in a film a few months ago!\"","\"I'm in Tibetan City. I'll bring you some air-dried beef from here when I return. I've tried it, it's really good!\"","\"Why on earth did you go to Tibetan City? It's so dangerous. What if you get altitude sickness? You could lose half your life.\"","\"I didn't want to come to Tibetan City. It's far and remote. But my wife is here, so of course I came.\"","\"Your wife? Chang Zhiyuan, you've got some nerve. When did you get married? The household register is at home. How did you get married? Did you sneak back home and steal the household register when Mom and Dad weren't paying attention?\"","\"Sis, sister, keep your image. You need to maintain your image. Bring out your usual efficient and decisive style instead of yelling at me. Stay cool, keep up that domineering female CEO image.\"","\"Stop sweet-talking me. With you, I can chase you around and beat you with my shoe, no problem. Hurry up and explain what's going on with this wife business. Don't mess around again. Think about how many ex-girlfriends you've had. Then think about how many times those ex-girlfriends cheated on you. Don't you know yourself? Those eyes of yours are just for show.\"","Chang Ningjing started rambling on.","\"Sis, I was wrong. They don't count. This time I'm serious.\"","\"Shut up. You say you're serious every time.\"","\"Sis, this time I swear on my life and my character. If I'm not serious, may I be hit by a car when I go out, choke on water when I drink, and choke on food when I eat.\"","Chang Zhiyuan held up three fingers with one hand while holding his phone with the other.","Shu Yi came out of the bathroom to see Chang Zhiyuan making these vicious vows.","\"What are you swearing about? I'm done showering. You can go in now.\"","\"Alright, I'll go right in.\"","Chang Zhiyuan lowered his three fingers when he saw Shu Yi come out.","\"Chang Zhiyuan, Chang Zhiyuan, is that...\"","Before Chang Ningjing could finish her question, Chang Zhiyuan hung up the phone.","Chang Ningjing sat in her bedroom, fuming. She hadn't found out anything before the call was cut off. Indeed, the little brat had grown up and learned to hang up on people.","Chang Ningjing dialed another number.","\"Hello, I'd like to ask who the female lead is in the drama Chang Zhiyuan acted in. What's her background?\"","The person on the other end spoke for a while, then Chang Ningjing hung up.","She and Chang Zhiyuan had grown up together. How could she not understand him? He wasn't the type who would willingly act in a drama unless there was someone in the crew he was interested in.","This inquiry had indeed yielded results.","The female lead was Shu Yi.","Chang Ningjing remembered her. She was the one they had met during dinner last time.","If she wasn't mistaken, that was in May or June, right? Now it was already past October 1st. It had been quite a while. Could it be that this time he was really serious?","Chang Ningjing opened Baidu and searched for Shu Yi's entry. She was one of their own artists. Currently, there was no negative news about her, and her values seemed quite proper. Not bad. This time, his taste seemed normal.","A message popped up on her phone.","[Happy Mid-Autumn Festival!]","Chang Ningjing immediately became as excited as a young girl, showing no trace of her powerful businesswoman demeanor.","[Happy Mid-Autumn Festival! Thank you for last time.]","Xue Jingrui had asked Chang Ningjing for help last time, wondering if she could contact the captain of the Rong City Special Police Force to rescue someone.","When Chang Ningjing heard that Shen Yin was in danger, she immediately contacted Tan Xiao and asked for his help.","[No need to thank me. It's our duty, what we should do.]","[That won't do. Thanks should be given when due. Let me treat you to a meal sometime when you're free.]","[Haha, senior, how many times have we planned to have a meal together? We've never succeeded. It's always either you're busy or I'm busy.]","[That's true. Well, there's no time like the present. You should have a day off for Mid-Autumn Festival, right? Let's go eat now. We can even enjoy the moon while we're at it.]","[Sounds good. Where shall we meet?]","On this lovely Mid-Autumn Festival night, the full moon shone brightly.","Everyone was looking at the same moon.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were staying in a hotel that night.","This was Shen Yin's first Mid-Autumn Festival since arriving here.","Isn't the Mid-Autumn Festival a time for family reunions? In the past, before her uncle had returned to his hometown, she had always spent holidays at her uncle's house. Now, looking at the moon, Shen Yin felt a bit melancholic. Were they celebrating the festival too?","Shen Yin picked up her phone and called Fang Yue.","\"Hello, Mom, did you receive the mooncakes and the cardigan?\"","\"Yes, I did. The clothes are beautiful. The embroidery is so exquisite. My daughter is really amazing.\"","Shen Yin had made a formal dress for Fang Yue before. A few days ago, when autumn began, she made a cardigan for Fang Yue with numerous embroidered patterns.","The patterns were diverse, yet when combined, they were incredibly harmonious and not at all incongruous. It looked more like a work of art.","It could be said that because of this embroidery, the price of this cardigan had immediately skyrocketed. It would easily be worth over a million.","However, in Fang Yue's eyes, this cardigan was priceless. It was embroidered by her daughter's own hands, something that money simply couldn't buy.","\"Mom, I'm glad you like it. We're almost at Yun City now. Who would have thought we'd be spending this year's Mid-Autumn Festival away from home?\"","\"It's alright. You and Xiuhe work so hard all the time, it's good to get out and relax a bit. Next year's Mid-Autumn Festival, we'll spend it together - the whole family, lively and warm.\"","Shen Yin agreed. The idea of spending a holiday together with the whole family, in a lively and warm atmosphere, sounded quite nice indeed."]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: The Dream of Zhengzheng","paragraphs":["The family of three was getting closer to Yun City. Xu Xiuhe, driving the RV, felt a bit regretful. Had he known, they would have just flown here directly. Driving all this way was truly exhausting.","Xu Xiuhe never imagined there would come a day when he'd be troubled by such a thing.","\"When we get to Yun City, let's stay in a hotel. Living in the RV all the time isn't very convenient,\" Xu Xiuhe said, turning to Shen Yin.","\"Sounds good. You can make the arrangements,\" she replied.","\"Alright, then we'll stay in Yun City for a while longer and return to Rong City at the end of October.\"","The first thing the family of three did upon arriving in Yun City was to find a high-end five-star hotel.","\"We'd like to check in for two weeks, in a presidential suite,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","The hotel receptionist looked at them, feeling they seemed somewhat familiar, but couldn't quite place who they were.","\"Who are they? They're so extravagant, staying for half a month in the presidential suite. That costs several thousand per night,\" another staff member asked the receptionist after the family had gone upstairs.","\"Probably some tycoon traveling with his wife and child. But why do they look so familiar to me?\"","In the presidential suite, Shen Yin set Xu Yunzheng down as the staff brought up their luggage.","\"Let's give Zhengzheng a bath first. After his bath, we'll let him sleep. He's probably tired from sitting in the car for so long,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","Zhengzheng seemed to have forgotten about that dream during this time and was no longer so resistant to water.","During bath time, both Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were in the bathroom.","\"Zhengzheng, shall we play a game?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Okay, I love Daddy,\" the child replied.","\"Do you love Mommy too?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Zhengzheng loves Mommy too. Love Mommy. Let's play the game together.\"","\"Zhengzheng, for this game, you just need to answer whatever Daddy asks, okay? Let's see how many questions Zhengzheng can answer.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"The question is like this: One day, baby Zhengzheng had a dream, and when he woke up, he started crying. Can Zhengzheng tell Daddy what that dream was about?\"","Shen Yin nudged Xu Xiuhe upon hearing this, giving him a look to suggest he shouldn't ask such a question.","Zhengzheng had finally stopped being afraid, and if they asked about it now, what if he remembered and became traumatized again?","\"Zhengzheng, it's like this: dreams aren't real, but if Zhengzheng meets bad people in his dreams, Daddy can also dream and go punish those bad people in the dream for Zhengzheng, okay? So Zhengzheng doesn't need to be afraid. Whatever dream you had, you can tell Daddy about it.\"","Xu Xiuhe's tone was extremely gentle, even more patient than usual.","The little one sat in the water, thought for a while, and then said, \"Water... there was a person in the water. They couldn't get up.\"","\"What kind of person was it? Does Zhengzheng know them?\"","Zhengzheng shook his head, unwilling to think about this question anymore.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe weren't sure what this head shake meant.","Did he not know, or did he not recognize the person?","\"Alright, Daddy won't ask anymore. Zhengzheng should believe in Daddy. Daddy will always protect Zhengzheng, so Zhengzheng doesn't need to be afraid.\"","That night, after putting Zhengzheng to sleep, the couple went to another room.","\"You scared me to death just now. When you asked that question, I was afraid he'd start crying again,\" Shen Yin said.","\"I was afraid he'd cry too. I was also nervous about it.\"","\"Then why did you ask?\"","\"I was just worried, that's all.\"","Shen Yin realized something.","\"Are you worried that his dream might be like mine, able to foresee the future?\"","\"Yes. Your dreams can do that, so I'm afraid he might be able to as well.\""]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: Blow Drying Hair 02","paragraphs":["Shen Yin remained silent. Her ability to sense danger in advance was remarkable, but if Zhengzheng could also have such dreams, it wasn't a good thing.","Firstly, Zhengzheng was too young. Having such dangerous dreams could affect the child's psychological well-being and hinder healthy development. Secondly, being so young, his ability to express himself clearly was limited. Even if he had these dreams, he couldn't articulate them properly, rendering them useless.","But now that it had happened, she could only hope that it was just an ordinary nightmare, as common as they come for children.","\"We should be more careful from now on,\" Shen Yin said. \"He seems to understand everything. We should avoid certain topics around him.\"","\"Alright, I'll follow your lead.\"","\"Let's go back now. He might feel insecure otherwise.\" Shen Yin turned to return to their original room.","Xu Xiuhe pulled her back. \"We don't know who that person in the water was, the one who couldn't get up. We should try to avoid going near water from now on.\"","\"Okay. Do you think it could be me? I can't swim. After all, I came here because of drowning.\"","Shen Yin could still remember the feeling vividly. The helplessness, waiting for someone to rescue her. The pain in her respiratory tract as water entered her nose. Her limbs flailing desperately, grasping at nothing. Then, trying to lift her head above water, but having no strength left.","She sank slowly, the feeling unbearably painful. Panic set in, followed by regret. Why had she chosen this self-sacrificing plan? Why weren't they coming to save her?","She was still conscious as water filled her mouth and ears. The world seemed to fall silent. Her mind went blank. She tried to look up towards the sunlight but could see nothing.","Her body began to paralyze as water entered her lungs. Gradually, she gave up struggling.","Until she woke up here. Having experienced death once, no one could understand the feeling of drowning better than her.","She even began to feel sorry for the original owner of this body, wondering how much courage it must have taken to lose her life in a bathtub.","\"What are you thinking about?\"","\"I'm wondering if Zhengzheng's dream was about me. After all, I'm the one who couldn't get out of the water.\"","As Shen Yin spoke, she couldn't help but laugh at herself. It was absurd. Fate was unpredictable, and one could never know what the next moment might bring.","\"Don't worry. We'll be careful. What's past is past.\"","The autumn scenery in Yun City was beautiful. What was supposed to be a honeymoon had turned into a happy family trip for the three of them.","In just a few days, the little one had completely forgotten about the dream. He no longer curled up while sleeping, and even bath time didn't scare him anymore. Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe didn't need to be present together. Sometimes, after playing outside and getting hot, the little one would even ask Shen Yin for a bath when they returned to the hotel.","After his bath, Zhengzheng's eyes blinked sleepily, occasionally yawning and revealing a few tiny milk teeth.","\"Zhengzheng, are you tired? Ready for bed?\" Shen Yin asked as she applied some baby lotion to his body.","\"Mama, does Zhengzheng smell good?\"","Shen Yin hugged Zhengzheng and sniffed him. \"You smell wonderful. Zhengzheng is a good boy who loves baths. You're the best-smelling baby.\"","The little one played for a while before falling asleep.","Shen Yin grabbed some clothes and headed to the bathroom. Unbeknownst to her, Xu Xiuhe had followed.","While appearing to be focused on her bath, Shen Yin was actually observing Xu Xiuhe closely. She didn't trust this man, and more importantly, the bathroom wasn't suitable. It was slippery and lacked support. If they were to do anything, she would surely end up exhausted.","\"Don't guard against me like I'm some wolf. We won't do anything here. Rest assured. I promise, and I keep my word.\"","Only then did Shen Yin relax and start her bath properly. She lathered up with shower gel, rinsed off, washed her hair, quickly dried herself, and left the bathroom.","\"Let me blow-dry your hair for you.\"","\"How are you so quick? Are you done already?\" Shen Yin asked as she saw Xu Xiuhe emerge from the bathroom.","\"Am I quick? I'm not quick at all. I was just there to keep you company.\"","\"The hair dryer is too noisy. It might wake Zhengzheng up.\" Shen Yin hadn't planned on using it.","\"Don't be silly. Just because it's noisy doesn't mean you shouldn't use it. There are always more solutions than problems. I'll dry your hair outside.\"","Xu Xiuhe took the hair dryer and walked towards the door. He stopped at the bedroom doorway and looked back at Shen Yin.","Shen Yin felt his words had a double meaning.","\"Is it too hot? If it is, I can lower the temperature,\" the man said, grasping strands of her hair.","\"It's just right.\"","\"You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?\"","Xu Xiuhe held Shen Yin's hair, his fingers occasionally brushing against her ears and neck.","The man said nothing, only changing his position. Shen Yin was sitting on the sofa, and Xu Xiuhe had initially been standing behind it. Now he moved to the front.","The position was a bit awkward. Shen Yin was slender, sitting properly with her legs together.","Xu Xiuhe was clearly doing it on purpose, standing between Shen Yin's legs. She could feel her face almost touching his stomach.","Yet he acted as if nothing was happening, continuing to dry her hair, even playing with her embroidered locks in his hand.","\"Hurry up, I'm getting tired of sitting.\"","\"We haven't even started. How can you be tired already?\"","Their posture looked inappropriate from any angle. Shen Yin leaned back a little.","\"Don't move. Your hair isn't dry yet. It'll be done soon.\"","At some point, the hair dryer in Xu Xiuhe's hand had stopped. He lowered his head, his lips meeting Shen Yin's.","They parted and came together again.","\"Do you understand what I want to do now?\"","Shen Yin knew, of course, but she pretended not to understand, shaking her head. \"I don't know.\"","\"It's okay. I'll teach you.\"","Shen Yin was wearing a nightgown. The fabric felt comfortable as they kissed.","Xu Xiuhe couldn't bear to let go of the nightgown.","Before long, they both started to feel overwhelmed, their bodies beginning to change."]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Sho Yi Gao Fan","paragraphs":["\"I'm a bit hungry.\"","\"Want some more?\"","\"I meant my stomach is hungry.\"","\"Do you want me to make you some hot and sour soup, or should we order room service?\"","\"Hot and sour soup sounds good, but do we have enough ingredients in the kitchen? Maybe we should just have them send up some snacks.\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded and made a call to place the order.","In the Tibetan City, after several days of travel, Shu Yi's body was starting to feel the effects. They had spent two days there, visiting temples, burning incense, and making wishes.","Shu Yi's wish was simple - for her family and friends to be happy and free from worries.","Chang Zhiyuan's wish was even simpler - to win Shu Yi's heart.","He had prayed to every Buddha and deity he had ever heard of or seen.","\"Why did you pray to so many? What did you ask for?\" Shu Yi had never seen Chang Zhiyuan so devout before. She even began to wonder if he was a fervent Buddhist.","\"I didn't ask for much, just one thing - to marry you.\"","Shu Yi was speechless.","She wished she hadn't asked.","\"Aren't you going to ask why I prayed to so many?\"","Shu Yi had been so distracted by his previous answer that she'd almost forgotten her first question, which he hadn't answered yet.","\"Are you religious?\"","\"If they grant my wish, I can eat vegetarian for a week, but I can't give up sex or meat completely.\"","\"Unbelievable,\" Shu Yi couldn't help but laugh, her comedic nature shining through.","Chang Zhiyuan was pleased to see her smile.","\"I had to pray to each one because I don't know which ones are real. What if I have bad luck and all the ones I prayed to are fake? That would be terrible. Also, what if there's a real one that I missed, and it gets jealous and sabotages me? That would be even worse.\"","\"Your logic is quite impressive, I must say.\"","Shu Yi gave him a thumbs up.","\"Since I'm so impressive, when will you agree to be with me?\"","Shu Yi fell silent again.","The past few days had been fine, but now she could feel that her body wasn't doing well. Usually, her health was quite good, especially compared to other actors in the industry. She had always considered herself quite disciplined in her lifestyle.","She had been confident that she wouldn't suffer from altitude sickness. But since yesterday, her body had started showing some symptoms.","Loss of appetite, shortness of breath, and insomnia at night - she had looked it up online and found out it was mild altitude sickness.","Out of pride, she hadn't told Chang Zhiyuan about it.","\"What's wrong with you these past two days? You look pale. Are you tired, or is it altitude sickness?\"","\"Maybe a bit of altitude sickness, but it's not serious.\"","That evening at the hotel, there were plenty of rooms available, so Chang Zhiyuan had no excuse to linger in Shu Yi's room.","Shu Yi's condition was worsening, and after catching a chill in the night, she even developed a headache.","Sneezing occasionally, she felt even worse than if she had a fever.","There was a knock at the door. Shu Yi knew it was Chang Zhiyuan without looking. She didn't want to get up, preferring to lie still in bed.","\"Shu Yueru! Shu Yueru! Open the door!\"","Chang Zhiyuan called out several times and started banging on the door.","Shu Yi weakly got up to open it.","\"What's going on? Shu Yueru, are you feeling unwell? Is it altitude sickness?\"","Shu Yi frowned. She was genuinely unwell, but Chang Zhiyuan's expression made it seem like she was on her deathbed. What was that all about?","\"I'm not dead yet,\" she muttered.","\"You're still joking around? Look at how pale you are. I'm taking you to the hospital right now.\"","Chang Zhiyuan scooped Shu Yi up in his arms, grumbling as he carried her, \"You're so thin, why did you insist on coming here? Altitude sickness is no joke, it can be life-threatening if not treated properly.\"","As he said this, Chang Zhiyuan himself started to worry.","He drove Shu Yi to the nearest hospital.","The hospital was full of people on oxygen, receiving IV drips.","Upon hearing about another case of altitude sickness, the doctor immediately put Shu Yi on oxygen, as if it were a routine procedure.","Indeed, beautiful places often come with their own dangers. The Tibetan City was breathtaking, but not without its risks.","Chang Zhiyuan looked at the hospital's medical facilities with disdain.","\"Damn, it's so shabby,\" he thought, \"It's like a roadside clinic in Rong City, run-down and overcrowded.\"","Seeing Shu Yi on oxygen, he finally relaxed a bit and stepped outside to make a phone call.","\"Sis.\"","\"Now you remember me? Spit it out, what do you want? You don't call unless you need something. Last time, you even dared to hang up on your sister before I finished talking. You've really grown up, haven't you? Thinking you're all that.\"","\"Sis, I'm calling because there's a real problem. Shu Yi, the girl I'm pursuing, she's got altitude sickness. It seems pretty serious.\"","\"Oh no, what should we do? Has she seen a doctor?\"","Chang Ningjing's voice on the other end of the line suddenly filled with concern."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: Text Message","paragraphs":["\"I'm at the hospital, but the medical conditions here are not great.\"","\"Is the family member of the patient who just arrived here?\" Hearing this, Chang Zhiyuan immediately ran into the hospital room.","\"Sis, I'll go in and check first. I'll call you back later.\" Chang Zhiyuan hung up the phone without waiting for Chang Ningjing to speak.","\"I am. How is Shu Yueru?\"","Shu Yi was just her stage name; her legal name on her ID card was still Shu Yueru.","\"The patient not only has altitude sickness, but she also caught a cold. It's not suitable for her to stay here. Firstly, the high altitude here is not conducive to treatment. Secondly, the medical conditions here are indeed inadequate. Our recommendation is to return immediately. The medical facilities in Chuan City are very good.\"","\"Alright, I understand.\"","Chang Zhiyuan glanced at Shu Yi lying on the hospital bed. She was asleep, and her expression looked a bit better than before.","\"Hello, sis.\"","\"How is she?\"","\"We need to move her to a hospital with better conditions. She caught a cold, and her condition isn't good right now.\"","\"What's your plan? How did you get to Tibetan City?\"","\"I drove here from Chuan City, and now I'm driving her to a nearby clinic.\"","\"You mean you're going to drive back?\"","\"What I mean is, I need a helicopter now. Can you help me sort out the flight route issues?\"","...","\"That's a bit difficult,\" Chang Ningjing said honestly.","\"If it wasn't difficult, would I be asking you? It's a matter of life and death. Also, send a driver over. I need to get my car back. It's not a luxury car, but it still cost several hundred thousand.\"","...","Early the next morning, Shu Yi woke up and found herself in an unfamiliar environment.","White walls surrounded her.","\"You're awake?\" Chang Zhiyuan, who was leaning on the edge of the bed, asked as he saw Shu Yi wake up.","Shu Yi was a bit confused. This didn't seem like Tibetan City.","\"Where is this?\"","\"Rong City No.1 Hospital.\"","Hearing this, Shu Yi's eyes widened. She had just taken a nap and had crossed thousands of miles, returning from the distant Tibetan City to Rong City.","\"Can't believe it? You're not dreaming. Your altitude sickness was so severe last night that you had to use an oxygen tank. If we hadn't come back, you might have lost your life.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's words were quite exaggerated.","Shu Yi was truly frightened. Was her health really that poor? She had just gone on a trip and almost lost her life?","\"How did I get back?\"","Shu Yi still couldn't believe it. How could it have happened in such a short time?","\"By plane. My family's private helicopter.\"","...","Just as he finished speaking, someone entered the hospital room.","Shu Yi recognized her. It was Chang Zhiyuan's sister. She braced herself mentally.","Was Chang Ningjing's next words going to be telling her not to cling to Chang Zhiyuan?","After all, she was just an actress. The wealthy family probably looked down on her.","\"Are you feeling better?\"","\"Sis, why are you here?\"","Chang Zhiyuan asked. His sister's company wasn't like his; she was a very busy person.","\"Are you alright?\" Chang Ningjing turned to Chang Zhiyuan and asked.","\"I'm tough. How could anything happen to me?\"","Chang Ningjing then turned back to look at Shu Yi again. She was indeed pretty, quite pleasing to the eye.","\"Are you feeling better?\" Chang Ningjing asked again.","\"A bit better.\"","Shu Yi felt extremely awkward facing this question. Her relationship with Chang Zhiyuan was still just that of an employer and employee.","\"Sis, let me introduce you. This is Shu Yi. I usually call her Shu Yueru.\"","\"This is my sister.\"","\"Take good care of yourself. I'm heading back now.\"","Chang Ningjing left the hospital room with her arms crossed.","The room was left with just Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan, along with a bouquet of flowers and some fruit.","\"Thank you,\" Shu Yi said sincerely.","\"Don't go to Tibetan City again in the future. Although it's beautiful, it's not suitable for everyone.\"","\"Mm, I understand.\"","\"Good girl.\" Chang Zhiyuan reached out and ruffled Shu Yi's hair.","Shu Yi felt uneasy. Things weren't developing the way she had imagined at all.","In Yun City, Shen Yin was enjoying herself when she received a message on her phone.","[Send me 5 million, or I guarantee that by tomorrow, everyone in the country will know about your previous homosexual relationship.]","Shen Yin didn't need to think to know who sent this message.","A jumping clown. Why didn't Flower teach her a lesson last time?","\"What's wrong? You've been lost in thought since you looked at that message.\"","\"Zhou Man sent me a message.\"","As soon as Shen Yin said this, Xu Xiuhe's expression also became tense.","\"What did she say?\"","\"She wants me to send her money. If I don't, she'll expose our relationship.\"","\"Isn't she married? Why does she still want money?\"","Xu Xiuhe made a phone call to Chen Siming. If he remembered correctly, Chen Siming should be quite familiar with Pei City.","\"Hello, brother.\"","\"Are you familiar with the Guo family in Pei City?\"","\"The Guo family? Guo Wei?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"I know a bit. This Guo Wei, despite his age, is quite a player. He's been married several times, and he has even more affairs outside. He's not a good person at all.\"","\"Who's his current wife?\"","\"I'm not sure. A few months ago, I heard it was someone with a name that ended with 'Man'. That 'Man' person isn't a good one either. I heard she used to be with Xu Zhengyang before. You should know about this.\"","Chen Siming said. He wasn't particularly well-informed either.","Xu Xiuhe also knew about Xu Zhengyang's past relationship with Zhou Man, but if Zhou Man was still Guo Wei's wife, why would she be short of money?","\"Zhou Man? Can you find out what's going on with her now?\"","\"Sure, I'll call you back later.\"","\"How is it? What's Zhou Man's current situation?\" Shen Yin asked beside Xu Xiuhe.","\"He'll call me back later. He's investigating now.\"","\"Okay, so how should we handle this? We definitely can't give her money. If there's a first time, there will be a second time. We can't indulge people like her.\"","Shen Yin hadn't thought of a good way to handle it yet.","In the original host's memories, they didn't seem to have had any particularly inappropriate relationship.","But Shen Yin wasn't sure if the memories she had received were complete. What if Zhou Man really had some inappropriate photos or evidence? Wouldn't that be the end of her?","\"Don't worry for now. At most, she can reveal that you were previously in a same-sex relationship, but she won't have any concrete evidence.\"","\"How do you know?\"","\"Given her relationship with Yang Cui, and Yang Cui's hatred towards me, if there were any substantial evidence, it would have been exposed long ago. It wouldn't have waited until now. Yang Cui is a cunning person with a quick temper. She wouldn't let any evidence that could harm me slip by.\"","Shen Yin had considered this point, so she was somewhat curious to know if Zhou Man was just after money this time, or if she had any connection with Xu Zhengyang.","\"Then what should we do?\"","Xu Xiuhe was also pondering. He had plenty of money, but to just give her the money like that, wouldn't that make him a pure sucker?"]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: Return to Rong City","paragraphs":["If they didn't give it to her, and she really leaked the information, it would definitely be detrimental to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin had just gained some fame, and her career was developing. Given society's current level of tolerance, many people would certainly criticize Shen Yin.","At the same time, he was Shen Yin's husband, spouse, and lover. Naturally, he would also receive a lot of attention, which could potentially affect the company's stock price.","So, the most urgent task now was to block this information, and then find a way to restrain Zhou Man.","\"Let's go back to Rong City. It's not very convenient here.\"","\"Okay.\"","Xu Xiuhe had always been a man of action. As soon as he said to return to Rong City, he booked the flight tickets.","\"What about the RV?\" Shen Yin asked.","They couldn't just abandon the nearly ten-million-yuan RV, could they?","\"We'll hire someone to drive it back. Just spend a bit more money, and it'll be fine.\"","Just before boarding the plane, Shen Yin sent a message to their group chat of three:","[Ending the trip early. About to board a flight back to Rong City.]","Shen Yin and Shu Yi had been posting plenty of beautiful photos in the group chat lately. Shu Yi, in particular, shared various sunrise and sunset pictures, along with scenic landscapes.","Shen Yin was different. There was a place in Yun City known for its diverse cuisine, so most of her photos were of delicious food.","The two of them had made Qi Ji incredibly envious. Qi Ji would pout while clutching her phone every day. When Xue Jingrui noticed that Qi Ji was practically drooling over her phone all the time, he began to wonder.","Not understanding, he assumed it was just a pregnancy thing, that she was craving everything she saw. So he went to tell Ye Rong about it.","When Ye Rong heard this, she thought it made sense. Qi Ji had a good appetite every day, and her morning sickness wasn't too severe. There's a saying that craving sour foods means you're having a boy, while craving spicy foods means you're having a girl. She had been observing for quite some time but couldn't figure out what Qi Ji preferred to eat.","So, as a mother, she gave her son some advice. Ye Rong told Xue Jingrui to peek at Qi Ji's screen, see what food she was craving, and then tell her so she could prepare it.","Xue Jingrui actually followed Ye Rong's advice and went to sneak a look at the screen. To his surprise, he discovered that the group chat name for the three of them was: \"Three Sisters Getting Rich and Beautiful.\"","Xue Jingrui intentionally took a glance, and found that it was all beautiful scenery and delicious food.","He even mentioned it to Xu Xiuhe, asking him to control Shen Yin and stop her from posting food pictures in the group.","Xu Xiuhe said that his wife could do whatever she wanted, as long as she was happy. He wouldn't interfere.","When Chang Zhiyuan learned about their group name, he immediately changed the name of their own group to \"Three Brothers Getting Rich and Handsome.\"","He thought Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe would find this group name childish and terrible, but to his surprise, the other two said it was fine and that the new name was excellent. Great!","After the family of three boarded the plane, they set their phones to airplane mode.","Only Qi Ji and Shu Yi were chatting in the group.","[I'm back too. I'm already in Rong City.]","[Sister Shu Yi, weren't you still sending us photos from Tibetan City yesterday? How is it that you're in Rong City already? It hasn't even been 24 hours!]","Qi Ji expressed her disbelief, thinking Shu Yi must be joking.","[Surprised, right? I couldn't believe it either. I just slept and woke up in Rong City.]","[How did you manage that? You didn't sleepwalk onto a plane, did you?]","[I did fly here, but I wasn't sleepwalking. I got altitude sickness and was admitted to the hospital last night. Then Chang Zhiyuan arranged for a helicopter to bring us all back.]","When Chang Zhiyuan came to find her in Tibetan City, she was quite troubled and mentioned it in the group chat.","So Shen Yin and Qi Ji knew that Shu Yi wasn't alone in Tibetan City, which put their minds at ease.","[A helicopter? I've never ridden one. Is it fast? What does it feel like?]","[Can I say I don't know either? I just slept, and it felt like a dream. When I woke up, I had crossed thousands of miles.]","[...By the way, how are you feeling now? Which hospital are you in? I'll come visit you later.] Qi Ji was quite concerned.","[No, no need. I'm almost fine now. You take care of yourself and look after my goddaughter.]","[Alright then. Sister Shen Yin should be on the plane now. Why is she coming back so soon too? It's a week earlier than planned.] Qi Ji wondered.","But this was good. Now that everyone was back, they wouldn't be tempting her with food and scenery pictures anymore. She should be the happiest about this.","[Maybe she has some important matters to deal with too.]","[Oh right, they went in an RV before. That RV was really nice. But now they're flying back, what about the RV?]","Qi Ji, bored every day, had so many questions. She not only asked Xue Jingrui but now started asking Shu Yi too.","[Probably the same as Chang Zhiyuan. He drove here too, but when I asked him about the car just now, he said he had someone drive it back.]","[As expected of brothers, they handle things similarly. Sister Shu Yi, be honest with me, are you touched?]","[I don't dare to be moved.]","Shu Yi joked deliberately.","Was she touched? Of course she was. He accompanied her all the way to Tibetan City, and when she got altitude sickness, he immediately found a way to bring her back. He had just gone out to buy her lunch, taking care of every little detail. If she said she wasn't touched, she wouldn't even believe herself.","[Haha, follow your heart, don't question east or west, take it slow. That's my realization.]","Qi Ji had already gotten used to Xue Jingrui's care. Perhaps unknowingly, they had both grown accustomed to each other's presence.","Whether Xue Jingrui liked her or not, she didn't dwell on it anymore. After all, she quite liked Brother Jingrui.","There's still a long way to go. Having expectations is the foundation of love, right?","Reading Qi Ji's words, Shu Yi found them reasonable. Things had already reached this point, and she couldn't be ungrateful.","\"What are you thinking about?\" Chang Zhiyuan entered the hospital room carrying food.","Shu Yi, caught off guard, blurted out, \"Thinking about you.\"","Only after speaking did she realize something was off, and her ears immediately turned red.","\"Um, just now, I, I didn't... Ah, what I just said wasn't me speaking.\"","\"Mm-hmm, no need to explain. I understand. What was just said wasn't Shu Yi speaking, it was Shu Yueru speaking. Shu Yueru was thinking about me.\"","Chang Zhiyuan arranged all the food on the small table on the bed.","\"Thank you. You're too busy. You should go back now. I can ask Yan Yan to come and take care of me.\"","Shu Yi didn't want to see Chang Zhiyuan at all right now.","\"I'm your boss. When an employee is sick, who should take care of them if not the boss?\"","\"Huh?\"","Had she been away from the company for too long? Had workplace relationships changed so much? Do bosses now take care of sick employees?","\"I'll take care of you. You're not happy with that. If Yan Yan comes to take care of you, I'll still be the one paying her salary. So it's better if I take care of you myself and save that money.\"","\"You're not short on money. Do you really care about saving that little bit?\"","Shu Yi muttered softly.","\"Of course I care. We should save where we can and spend where necessary. Every little bit counts,\"","Chang Zhiyuan replied with a serious expression.","\"Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe have also returned. They came back by plane too. I feel like there might be some urgent matter.\"","\"Let's wait until they get off the plane and then ask them about it.\""]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: Private Detective","paragraphs":["At Rong City airport, a family of three disembarked from the plane. The driver had been waiting for them for some time.","Xu Xiuhe immediately called Liu Bo, instructing him to monitor various online messages and start managing public relations for any mentions related to Shen Yin.","In the small group chat of the three suddenly rich and handsome brothers:","Chang Zhiyuan frantically tagged Xu Xiuhe, asking why he had returned so early and if something had happened at the company.","[It's not about the company.]","Xu Xiuhe didn't know how to tell Chang Zhiyuan about Shen Yin's situation. It wasn't an easy topic to discuss, and probably only he, the Shen family, and Yang Cui knew about Zhou Man's involvement.","[Tell us. Good brothers face difficulties together.]","[It's about some negative news from my wife's past.]","[Huh? Your wife didn't love you before? Your wife had mental health issues in the past?]","That was all Chang Zhiyuan knew.","[It might be more serious than that.]","Xu Xiuhe didn't want to reveal it, but Chang Zhiyuan worked in media and had professional methods for dealing with public opinion.","[Even more serious?]","[Don't tell me your wife liked women before?]","...","[Wow, did I actually guess right? That's explosive.]","Chang Zhiyuan was originally sitting on the couch in Shu Yi's hospital room when he sent this message as a joke, but Xu Xiuhe didn't deny it.","Chang Zhiyuan slapped his own mouth, unable to believe that his casual remark had hit the mark.","He excitedly stood up from the couch.","\"What's wrong, you...\" Shu Yi asked, staring at Chang Zhiyuan's actions before she could finish her sentence.","\"It's nothing, nothing.\" Chang Zhiyuan ran his hand through his hair.","Trying to calm himself down, he sat back on the couch.","[Not exactly. That woman deceived her. She was young at the time and couldn't distinguish her feelings. The woman was nice to her, but in reality, it was to scam her for money.]","[Damn, that's disgusting. Why didn't that woman go scam men instead?]","[How do you know she didn't scam men? She's now the wife of Guo Wei in Pei City.]","Sitting on the couch, Chang Zhiyuan felt like he had just watched an exciting drama unfold. There's no shortage of gossip these days, but something this juicy happening to someone he knew was a first.","[Guo Wei isn't a good person.]","[That woman sent a message to my wife, asking her to transfer money, or else she'd expose their relationship.]","[What the hell? Is this woman crazy? It's ancient history, and now she's coming out asking for money? She must have some serious issues.]","[So how are you handling it?]","Xue Jingrui suddenly chimed in.","[We're doing PR work to prevent the news from leaking. If it gets out, online public opinion will be uncontrollable. Many people still can't accept these things.]","[Alright, I'll have someone keep an eye on it. But to completely control the situation, we need to find the source. Find that scammer.]","Xu Xiuhe naturally knew this, which was why he had rushed back to Rong City from far-away Yun City.","Xu Xiuhe dropped off Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng at Ziyue Manor, then drove to the company himself.","\"CEO, why are you back?\" Liu Bo, holding some documents, had just left the office when he saw Xu Xiuhe coming out of the elevator.","\"Come to my office.\"","Liu Bo didn't ask further and followed Xu Xiuhe into the office.","\"CEO.\"","\"Can you contact some private investigators?\"","\"Of course. With money, we can contact anyone.\"","\"Get in touch with several. Have them come over this afternoon. There's no negative news online, right?\"","\"No, none at all.\"","After Liu Bo left, Xu Xiuhe called Shen Yin.","\"Hey, I won't be coming back for lunch. If that woman sends you any more messages, let me know immediately.\"","This issue was indeed tricky. Xu Xiuhe was worried Zhou Man might do something, so he had already arranged for increased security around Ziyue Manor.","In the afternoon, several private investigators arrived at the reception room of Heyuan Group.","\"The job is in Pei City. Anyone uncomfortable with going there?\"","Xu Xiuhe asked.","The investigators in black clothing remained silent. Pei City was just next to Rong City, not far at all. As detectives, there was nowhere they couldn't go. Moreover, the client for this job was the CEO of Heyuan Group, so the pay would certainly be good.","They weren't fools. How could they pass up an opportunity to make money?","\"If no one objects, let's start investigating this person.\"","Xu Xiuhe took out a previous photo of Zhou Man.","\"I want to see all detailed information about this person. Her parents, her family, her various romantic histories. At the same time, these investigation results can only be seen by me. The compensation won't be low.\"","The investigators immediately expressed that they could set out at any time.","Xu Xiuhe sat on the couch, twisting the ring on his middle finger. After pondering for a while, he got up, drove back to Ziyue Manor.","\"It's nothing, give me your phone,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Shen Yin didn't know why Xu Xiuhe wanted her phone, but she knew this man always had his reasons for whatever he did.","The man took the phone and sat on the couch, holding Shen Yin's phone and navigating to the messages page.","The page still only showed that one message Zhou Man had sent, along with a bank account number.","\"You're not going to send her money, are you?\"","Shen Yin asked.","\"Your husband isn't stupid or a sucker.\"","Xu Xiuhe typed for a few minutes, then returned the phone to Shen Yin.","[Try it. You think just because you have something, I don't have anything on you?]","Shen Yin read the message, then looked at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Isn't that too risky?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"She probably doesn't have any substantial evidence, or she would have released it already. Now we need to intimidate her a bit. She can't be completely clean; at the very least, fraud counts as one charge.\"","\"Do you have a plan?\"","\"Yes. She probably won't dare to act rashly now. I've already had people gathering information on her. During this time, try not to go out as much as possible.\"","\"Alright, that's fine.\"","Going out or not didn't matter much to her. She could stay indoors for a whole month if needed.","\"If you get bored, you can come with me to the company.\"","\"I'm not bored!\"","\"You really don't want to be with me that much?\"","\"What would I do at your company? Wouldn't that be even more boring?\"","\"Daddy, Zhengzheng wants to go!\" Xu Yunzheng, who had been intently watching TV, moved to Xu Xiuhe's side and pleaded coquettishly after hearing their conversation.","\"Then ask your mom. If mom's willing to go, Zhengzheng can come to the company with daddy.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng moved next to Shen Yin and hugged her arm. His eyes blinked repeatedly.","\"Mom, Mommy.\"","\"Yes, dear.\"","\"Zhengzheng loves Mommy.\"","\"Mommy loves Zhengzheng too.\"","Shen Yin surely knew what Zhengzheng was thinking, but she deliberately didn't say it out loud.","\"Will Mommy take Zhengzheng to find Daddy?\"","\"Isn't Daddy right beside Zhengzheng?\" Shen Yin teased.","\"Zhengzheng means to always be by Daddy's side.\""]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: Chat","paragraphs":["Shen Yin finally gave in. Who could resist the little one's sweet voice? She just couldn't help but be tempted.","After Shen Yin agreed, the little one stood up from the sofa and ran to her side.","\"Mwah!\"","A quick kiss, and then he ran off.","Xu Xiuhe was stunned. He hadn't even kissed her yet, and he didn't think he had ever kissed Shen Yin in front of Xu Yunzheng before.","The next day, the little one indeed hadn't forgotten what was said yesterday.","He woke up even earlier than Shen Yin, and his first words upon waking were to find his dad.","Xu Xiuhe got up early, washed up, and went to the kitchen.","When Shen Yin opened her eyes, Zhengzheng was lying in front of her. Only the two of them were in bed.","\"Mommy, let's find Daddy,\" the little one said again.","Shen Yin didn't know where Xu Xiuhe had gone. During the time the family of three stayed in Yun City, they always woke up when it was already bright outside. She hadn't adjusted her sleep schedule yet. If Zhengzheng hadn't called her, she would have kept sleeping.","\"Can you hand Mommy her phone, sweetie?\"","Shen Yin asked with her eyes closed, not wanting to stretch out her hand.","The phone was on the bedside table.","Hearing this, the little one crawled past Shen Yin, got off the bed, walked to the bedside table, picked up the phone, and handed it to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin reached out to take the phone, groggily opened it, and dialed Xu Xiuhe.","\"Hello, Xiuhe, where are you?\"","Shen Yin's voice was clearly that of someone who had just woken up.","\"I'm in the kitchen. You're both up so early?\"","Xu Xiuhe held the phone with one hand while using the other to transfer the fried egg from the pan to a plate.","\"Our son woke up asking for you.\"","\"The son knows to look for me when he wakes up. Do you know to look for me when you wake up?\"","Xu Xiuhe chuckled in the kitchen.","Early in the morning, Shen Yin couldn't handle his flirting and hung up the phone directly.","\"Mommy, where's Daddy?\"","\"Daddy's downstairs.\"","Shen Yin hadn't even gotten out of bed yet, but Zhengzheng was already running out of the bedroom door.","\"Since when did he become so attached to his dad?\" Shen Yin muttered to herself.","She then got out of bed, walked to the closet to change clothes, and only then went to the bathroom to brush her teeth and wash her face.","Xu Yunzheng, wearing little pink slippers, went down the stairs one step at a time.","\"Daddy.\"","Zhengzheng trotted into the kitchen, hugged Xu Xiuhe's leg, and called out, \"Daddy.\"","\"Where's your mom?\"","\"Mommy hasn't gotten up yet.\"","\"Then why did you come down? Shouldn't you wait for Mommy?\"","\"Then Zhengzheng will go back up to wait for Mommy.\"","Xu Yunzheng let go of Xu Xiuhe's leg and turned to run back out.","Shen Yin had just come down the stairs.","\"Mommy's here, Zhengzheng doesn't need to go back upstairs.\"","\"Mommy, come, let's eat breakfast.\"","Xu Yunzheng walked to Shen Yin's side, tugging at her hand to pull her towards the dining table.","\"Will you come with me to the company today?\"","Before Shen Yin could answer, Xu Yunzheng raised his little hand and said loudly, \"Yes, I'll go with Daddy to the company.\"","What could Shen Yin say? Zhengzheng had already agreed, how could she refuse?","[I've been discharged from the hospital. The air outside is so fresh.]","[I was just about to ask you how you're feeling. I heard you slept and woke up back in Rong City from Tibetan City.]","[Yin Yin, I'm feeling much better, but why did you return to Rong City so quickly?]","Shen Yin didn't know how to explain. The person before wasn't her, and she wasn't clear about the things that had happened.","[When I wasn't in my right mind, I was tricked by a woman. I've come back to deal with it.]","The group chat remained silent for several minutes.","Hearing this, Shu Yi could guess the situation, but didn't know what to say.","Qi Ji was very shocked to see the message. She hadn't thought that someone as smart as Shen Yin could be tricked.","[It's all in the past now.]","[Bad people will surely face justice.]","Qi Ji only thought of the most superficial meaning, that bad people would surely face karma.","In the top-floor assistant office area of Heyuan Group, it became quiet again. The boss's wife had arrived, and they didn't dare to chat as freely as usual.","Shen Yin sat in Xu Xiuhe's office. Xu Xiuhe was working, dealing with documents from the past period.","Zhengzheng had brought a coloring book and was quietly coloring at the coffee table. Looking at this scene, Shen Yin felt she was the most bored.","She even thought about going back to the studio. The students at the martial arts hall hadn't had classes for two weeks. During these two weeks, the students had been practicing basic skills in the small building opposite the studio on their own.","As their martial arts instructor, she should go and evaluate their progress this week.","[So, how was your trip to Tibetan City?]","Bored, Shen Yin inquired about Shu Yi's love life.","[Tibetan City is beautiful, but it's not suitable for me. Just like Chang Zhiyuan is great, but not suitable for me.]","[Stop right there. How can you compare a person to scenery? You still care about him. I didn't even ask how things were between you two, and you brought it up yourself.]","Shu Yi was almost in tears. Why did she have to be so conflicted? She didn't want to be, but sometimes emotions can be defeated by reality.","[Follow what your heart tells you.]","Shen Yin had learned a lot lately. People grow. As someone once said, life is probably filled with more disappointments than satisfactions.","Many things don't go as smoothly as we'd like; we always encounter various problems.","When there's a problem, we need to solve it, not avoid it. In Shen Yin's view, Shu Yi was avoiding her relationship problems, both when filming and when traveling to Tibetan City.","People, ah, being able to see others clearly is wisdom, but being able to see oneself clearly takes courage. Most people have wisdom, but few have courage.","[His sister came to see me yesterday. I don't even know in what capacity I should face his sister.]","[How was it? I think Chang Zhiyuan's sister seems quite nice - decisive, brave, and wise.]","[I used to think his sister was too tough and hard to get along with, but later he told me about his sister's story. That's when I realized that behind every strong exterior, there's a hidden vulnerability that others don't see. His sister has had it tough too. I really admire her now.]","[Oh? Her career? Her personality?]","[His sister has loved someone for 13 years!]","[Goodness, that long!]","Qi Ji finally found a topic she could chime in on.","[Yes, and they've never been together.]","Sometimes love can be complicated, and sometimes it can be simple.","After Shu Yi sent the message about 13 years, the group chat fell into a brief silence.","[Shu Yi, the topic has drifted. We were talking about your relationship issues, how did we end up discussing Chang Ningjing?]","[Alright, let's get back on track and continue discussing my problem. I don't even know what I'm thinking right now. I'm conflicted and troubled. He's done so much for me and has been really good to me. During the film shoot, he specially made a moon for me, and he even came to find me in Tibetan City. My heart is in such a mess. There's always this hurdle I can't seem to get over. My family background is so ordinary; I'm not good enough for him.]"]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: Disfigurement","paragraphs":["The group chat fell silent once again.","Let nature take its course, let nature take its course.","On Sunday, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe discussed for a long time. Xu Xiuhe finally agreed to let Shen Yin go to the Martial Arts Club.","It had been a few weeks since she last visited, and it was time to check on the students' practice results.","When Shu Yi and Qi Ji learned that Shen Yin was going to the studio and the Martial Arts Club, they both expressed that they should also exercise.","Shen Yin thought about it and realized they were right. One had poor health and altitude sickness, while the other was pregnant and needed to exercise.","Shen Yin watched the students practice their punches and was quite satisfied. Their postures were correct, and the power was good.","Shen Yin taught them some new techniques.","By evening, the group decided to go straight from Qinghe Street to have dinner.","Shen Yin went to the studio to tidy up and gave some instructions.","There was a faint shadow at the corner, which Shen Yin had noticed since entering the studio.","\"Did you see it?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"You mean the shadow at the corner just now?\" As an actress, Shu Yi was quite observant, especially since she was often followed by paparazzi and photographed secretly. Now she was always cautious about everything.","\"Yes. Don't go out of the building later, take care of Zhengzheng. This person looks suspicious, not like a good person. I'll go out and check in a moment.\"","Shen Yin put Zhengzheng down. Zhengzheng understood Shen Yin's words and looked confused, not understanding why his mother wouldn't take him along.","\"Zhengzheng, Mommy has something to do outside. You need to be good and stay with your godmother and auntie.\"","Xu Yunzheng nodded.","Shen Yin went to the third floor and changed into a pair of flat shoes, not for anything else but to be able to chase or escape if necessary.","The weather was getting cooler at the end of October. Although it was only after 7 p.m., the sky was already pitch dark.","In the studio, Shen Yin looked at the surveillance video and had a vague feeling that the shadow standing in the corner was a woman.","Could it be Zhou Man coming to cause trouble again?","Shen Yin walked out the door, giving herself a pep talk. There was no one else in the video, so in a one-on-one situation, she could handle it.","Before Shen Yin could approach, the heavily covered woman suddenly rushed out, holding a small bottle in her hand, and sprayed its contents towards Shen Yin.","Shen Yin quickly dodged, and all the liquid from the bottle splashed onto the nearby wall.","The heavily covered woman seemed not to have expected this outcome. Unsatisfied, she reached out with the bottle in her hand, trying to restrain Shen Yin.","Unexpectedly, Shen Yin was stronger than this person and managed to restrain the woman first.","Qi Ji called Xu Xiuhe on the phone, while Shu Yi held Zhengzheng and covered his eyes again.","\"Godmother, why do you always like to cover Zhengzheng's eyes? Zhengzheng wants to see too.\"","Always? Shu Yi remembered several months ago in the underground parking lot when they encountered a robbery, and Shen Yin fought five people at once. At that time, she had also covered the little one's eyes, not letting him see the violent scene.","\"Sister Shu Yi, when else did you cover Zhengzheng's eyes?\" Qi Ji, who was watching the surveillance video, suddenly turned and asked.","\"Last time, when your Sister Shen Yin fought five people at once. They were all big guys, and Yin Yin knocked them all down. They're still in jail now.\"","\"No wonder you're not worried about Sister Shen Yin getting hurt at all.\"","\"Your Sister Shen Yin is a skilled fighter, no need to worry. Just watch them fight, this person will definitely be badly beaten.\"","\"Sister Shu Yi, look!\"","Shu Yi looked at the screen. In the video, the heavily covered person, clearly a woman, wasn't as tall as Shen Yin.","Her shoulders were tightly gripped by Shen Yin, but the hand holding the bottle was still moving.","\"What's in the bottle?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"It couldn't be sulfuric acid, could it?\"","\"What's sulfuric acid? Zhengzheng wants to see too.\" Zhengzheng tried to pry Shu Yi's hands away.","\"Sulfuric acid is a dangerous thing that can disfigure people.\"","\"Zhengzheng wants to see.\"","\"Little kids shouldn't watch, it's too dangerous.\"","\"Zhengzheng is a big boy! Not a little kid.\"","Shu Yi released her hands.","The little one watched the surveillance video intently, as if watching TV.","\"Zhengzheng, Mommy is fighting evil for the people. That person is bad. Mommy is beating up the bad person.\"","\"Mommy is so great.\" Xu Yunzheng clapped his little hands.","In the video, the heavily covered woman kept moving her hand, trying to pour out the liquid from the bottle.","Just as she was about to succeed, with the liquid almost touching Shen Yin's skin...","In the blink of an eye, Shen Yin used her arm strength and her foot power, and the heavily covered woman was thrown to the ground.","The liquid from the bottle spilled all over the woman's face.","\"Ah, ah~\" Painful screams, harsh and unpleasant to hear.","The woman hurriedly took off her mask, revealing a large red patch on her face.","\"It's Qi Yan!\" Qi Ji exclaimed from inside the room.","\"How can she still not give up? She's too vicious. Evil deeds will backfire,\" Shu Yi was also angry.","They truly hadn't expected this person to be Qi Yan.","\"That's sulfuric acid, it will burn the skin when it touches it,\" Qi Ji said.","Qi Yan touched her face, rolling left and right, kicking her legs wildly.","\"Save me!\" Qi Yan cried out in pain, unable to open her burned eyes.","Xu Xiuhe, Chang Zhiyuan, and Xue Jingrui all rushed over. Qi Ji and Shu Yi also came down from the small building, carrying Zhengzheng.","Xu Xiuhe had called the police immediately after receiving Qi Ji's call.","The sound of police sirens echoed throughout Qinghe Street. Many residents came out to see what was happening.","\"It's Qi Yan.\"","\"Xiuhe, Jingrui, save me, save me. I'm in so much pain, my face, my face hurts.\"","The woman knelt up from the ground, crying and looking towards Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe called over a police officer and said, \"She needs to be investigated. This outcome is entirely her own doing. We are the victims, and there's surveillance footage here.\"","\"Alright. We'll need to take the surveillance video.\"","\"What about her?\" one police officer asked.","\"Take her away for questioning. This is attempted assault, and we will pursue legal action,\" Xue Jingrui said.","Chang Zhiyuan looked at his two brothers with great satisfaction.","Two police officers walked over to Qi Yan, picked her up, and dragged her towards the police car.","\"Save me, I was wrong, I was really wrong. I'm disfigured,\" the woman cried.","\"Mommy, the bad person is crying,\" Zhengzheng said.","\"Is Zhengzheng scared?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Not scared, Mommy protects Zhengzheng!\"","Xu Yunzheng reached out his arms, wanting Shen Yin to hold him.","Shen Yin took Zhengzheng and held him in her arms.","\"Mom, don't be afraid. Zhengzheng will protect you from now on,\" Xu Yunzheng patted Shen Yin's shoulder.","\"Are you alright?\"","Xue Jingrui looked at Qi Ji, reached out to hold his hand, and pulled him to his side.","\"I'm fine. Sister Yin is amazing. She pinned that woman to the ground in an instant. That woman was so frightening - she actually wanted to disfigure Sister Yin's face.\"","As Qi Ji spoke, he deliberately glanced at Xue Jingrui."]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: Chang Zhiyuan Hospitalized","paragraphs":["Xue Jingrui's face showed no expression.","Qi Ji felt a bit happy inside, though she didn't know why. Her mood was simply good, and Qi Ji even felt her current thoughts were a bit sinful.","When they returned home, Ye Rong had been waiting for a long time. She had prepared several new dishes. Since Qi Ji hadn't come back for lunch, she was worried her daughter-in-law might not eat well outside.","Now it was evening, and they had finally returned. If they hadn't come back soon, she would have gone out to look for them.","\"Why are you so late? Are you tired? You shouldn't overwork yourself. Whatever needs to be done, just let Jingrui do it,\" Ye Rong glanced at Jingrui.","\"I was at Sister Yin's place. There was a problem in the evening, so we didn't have time to go out for dinner.\"","\"It's fortunate there was a problem, otherwise my dinner would have been wasted again. What kind of problem was it?\"","Ye Rong was slow to react.","Qi Ji didn't know how to explain. After all, Xue Jingrui used to like Qi Yan. If she told her mother-in-law about Qi Yan's encounter tonight, wouldn't it seem a bit like gloating?","\"It was a problem with Qi Yan,\" Xue Jingrui said.","This light remark terrified Ye Rong, causing her to sit down immediately.","She worried her son might have done something rash.","\"Qi Ji, can you tell mom what the problem was?\" Ye Rong asked cautiously.","\"This afternoon we were at Sister Yin's place, and in the evening we planned to go out for dinner. At the corner of Sister Yin's studio, there was a shadowy figure. When Sister Yin went over, that person tried to throw sulfuric acid on her.\"","\"Was that person Qi Yan?\"","Though it was a question, Ye Rong said it with the tone of a statement.","\"Yes.\"","\"How is Shen Yin now? Is she alright? And that woman called Qi Yan, when will she ever behave herself?\"","\"Sister Yin is fine. She managed to dodge it. Later, when Qi Yan tried to throw it again, Sister Yin used a bit of force, and Qi Yan fell down. The remaining acid spilled on her own face.\"","\"Oh my, that's frightening. I thought...\"","Ye Rong didn't finish her sentence. She had thought her son had lost his mind.","\"How was the matter handled?\"","\"She was taken away. Xiuhe decided to press criminal charges.\"","\"That's good. She should be charged, otherwise who knows what trouble she might cause in the future,\" Ye Rong said.","\"Come, let's eat.\"","Learning that it had nothing to do with her son and that Qi Yan had brought this upon herself, Ye Rong felt much more at ease.","\"I've never seen someone with such thick skin before. Mom's judgement of people is quite accurate. You, working at the prosecutor's office, what do you think? How many years might she be sentenced to?\"","\"I'm not sure. It depends on what Xiuhe ultimately decides. It's possible she could be in for life.\"","He knew Xu Xiuhe too well. Xu Xiuhe was skilled at handling such matters; he had known this since childhood.","\"That's good.\"","Qi Ji listened to the conversation between mother and son, not knowing how to join in. But there was no need for her to speak; her mouth was already full of various dishes.","At Ziyue Manor, Xu Xiuhe was heartbroken. He was truly fed up. One problem after another – first Zhou Man, then Qi Yan. When would these unfortunate individuals stop appearing in front of their family of three?","\"I thought it was Zhou Man,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Zhou Man is in Pei City. The detectives are watching her. If she comes to Rong City, I'll know immediately.\"","\"Was that thing really sulfuric acid?\"","\"Yes, it's a chemical product with corrosive properties. If it touches the skin, it causes burns.\"","\"So her face is red?\"","\"It's disfigured.\"","\"Do you feel sorry for her?\" Shen Yin joked.","\"Hm? How could I? What I had with her doesn't count. You're my true love. She wasn't the right person, nor was it the right time when we met. Moreover, she's not the one I love – you are.\"","\"Smooth talker!\"","Shen Yin, hearing the satisfactory answer, acted a bit coy.","\"Since Zhou Man is under your surveillance, can I go out as usual tomorrow?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Where do you want to go?\"","\"On a date with Shu Yi.\"","\"I'm your husband. You can only go on dates with me.\"","\"But Shu Yi said she found a great ice cream shop. Zheng wants to try it.\"","...","\"I doubt it's Zheng who wants to try it. Zheng probably doesn't even know about this, right?\"","Shen Yin pretended to know nothing, smiling foolishly.","What could Xu Xiuhe do? Could he refuse? This was his wife; he had to indulge her.","\"Keep me updated at all times. No matter what happens, safety comes first.\"","\"I got it!\"","\"What do you call me?\"","\"I got it, hubby!\"","Only then was the man satisfied.","But Shen Yin never imagined that Shu Yi would stand her up.","\"Shu Yueru? Explain yourself.\"","\"If I say I'm working overtime, would you believe me?\"","\"Do you think I should believe you?\"","\"It's like this – I'm at the hospital.\"","\"Why are you in the hospital again? Is it serious?\" Shen Yin's tone was a bit anxious. How could someone end up in the hospital so frequently, especially a big star and public figure? In a few days, there might be rumors circulating that Shu Yi was caught having a prenatal check-up at the hospital.","\"It's not me.\"","\"Then who is it?\"","\"It's Chang Zhiyuan. This morning, he was going down the stairs – I don't know how he managed it – but he fell and fractured his leg.\"","...","So they were taking turns going to the hospital.","The rumors were likely to continue.","Shen Yin was already imagining a big piece of gossip.","Famous actress goes for prenatal check-up, while her boss gets a vasectomy.","Of course, she didn't dare say it out loud.","\"Are you going to take care of him?\"","Shen Yin asked, already knowing the answer. She didn't know when she had developed this little amusement, but she enjoyed seeing Shu Yi's contradictory behavior. Shu Yi clearly wanted to go herself, but would always find an excuse, like Chang Zhiyuan forcing her to go.","Sure enough, just as Shen Yin expected, that's exactly what Shu Yi said.","\"I don't want to go, but he said that when I was sick with altitude sickness, he took care of me the whole time. Now that he can't walk, of course he needs me to take care of him.\"","\"Alright, taking care of the boss is important.\"","At the hospital, Chang Zhiyuan lay with his leg in a cast, suspended in the air.","\"I want some water.\"","\"Here you go.\"","\"Feed me.\"","\"Boss, it's your leg that's broken, not your arms.\"","Shu Yi now felt that, relying on Chang Zhiyuan's affection, she had become fearless, speaking in a tone quite different from before.","\"I'm the boss, and now my arms are uncomfortable too.\"","When the man acted shamelessly, Shu Yi truly couldn't handle it. She held the cup to Chang Zhiyuan's lips.","\"My neck, I can't move my neck. I can't drink.\"","Although Shu Yi knew Chang Zhiyuan was pretending, she still had no choice but to help. She supported Chang Zhiyuan's head with one hand while holding the cup with the other.","\"Are you done?\"","\"I've finished drinking.\"","Shu Yi had just put the cup aside when the man spoke again.","\"I'm done drinking. Now I want to go to the bathroom.\"","Shu Yi looked at Chang Zhiyuan's large frame and felt troubled.","\"Can you move your other foot?\"","Chang Zhiyuan nodded.","Shu Yi supported Chang Zhiyuan as he put one foot on the ground. As Shu Yi tried to move closer, her foot accidentally tripped over Chang Zhiyuan's, causing her to fall forward and land between his legs."]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: Encountering Awkwardness","paragraphs":["The scene froze, with the two people in an extremely awkward position. Chang Zhiyuan's one leg was immobilized, while the other rested on the bed.","Shu Yi tried to get up, struggling a bit, her head brushing against the man's stomach.","Without either of them noticing, the hospital room door opened.","\"Ahem.\"","Shu Yi immediately sat up, looking at the three people who had entered.","Of the three, she only recognized one—Chang Ningjing, whom she had met previously in the hospital.","There was also a middle-aged couple.","Shu Yi smoothed her hair and stepped back.","\"Dad, why are you here?\" Chang Zhiyuan's tone suggested he wasn't pleased with their arrival.","Chang Ningjing felt they had interrupted something and looked apologetic, her eyes darting around the room.","\"So you still remember I'm your father. Have you counted how long it's been since you've been home? You're in the hospital and still can't behave yourself.\"","Chang's Father stared at Chang Zhiyuan, while Chang's Mother turned her gaze to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi didn't dare move, having already cursed Chang Zhiyuan 180 times in her mind.","Their position just moments ago would have looked inappropriate to anyone. As a young woman, she was already self-conscious and couldn't bear the middle-aged woman's constant scrutiny.","Chang Huaiming said sternly, \"Come out with me.\"","\"Dad, his leg is in a cast. He can't move around freely,\" Chang Ningjing quickly intervened.","Chang Huaiming's expression kept shifting from dark to red.","Chang Zhiyuan, for his part, showed no reaction and refused to look up.","\"Let's step outside for a moment,\" Chang Ningjing said, walking over to Shu Yi.","Feeling awkward, Shu Yi nodded immediately and followed Chang Ningjing out of the room.","Only Chang Zhiyuan, Chang Huaiming, and Nie Ling remained in the hospital room.","Nie Ling seemed to be holding back words, while Chang Zhiyuan was so startled by their arrival that he'd held back even going to the bathroom.","\"Dad, Mom, did Ningjing tell you I was crippled? I'm fine, you didn't need to come.\"","\"Indeed, we didn't need to come. Seems we've interrupted your good time,\" Chang Huaiming said sarcastically.","\"It's not what you think.\"","\"If it's not what we think, then what is it? Early in the morning, and she was already on top of you. We've never interfered much with your antics before, but now you're hospitalized with a broken leg. How can you be so reckless? Are actresses these days so shameless?\"","Nie Ling's words were particularly harsh. She walked to Chang Zhiyuan's side and, touching his cast, said tearfully, \"Yuanyuan, your father and I only want what's best for you. You should know what's appropriate and when. You're our only son. If anything happened to you, how could your father and I go on living?\"","Tears streamed down her face.","Chang Zhiyuan always found this behavior irritating. It had been the same since he was young—she cried as if he was on his deathbed.","\"I'm not dead yet, am I?\"","\"Tsk, watch your language. Don't talk about death, it's bad luck.\"","\"Mom, you should go home. I'm fine.\"","\"How can we leave when you're like this? You can't even walk, and there's this vixen here. Your mother and I will stay to take care of you.\"","Chang Huaiming also looked concerned.","\"Yes, your father and I will stay and look after you. And that woman from earlier—break it off immediately. You can't be together. No sense of propriety, no consideration for time and place. It's disgraceful.\"","Nie Ling's face was full of reproach as she spoke.","\"First of all, I don't need you to take care of me. I have a fracture, see? My leg can still move.\" Chang Zhiyuan demonstrated by wiggling his casted leg.","\"Secondly, she's great, and I haven't even won her over yet. Don't interfere with my love life.\"","Chang Zhiyuan picked up his phone and messaged Shu Yi, asking where she had gone.","Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling's expressions darkened further upon hearing Chang Zhiyuan's words.","\"Yuanyuan, if you can't win her over, just let it go. You could find any kind of woman you want. I've recently found quite a few nice girls. That girl just now, she's nothing special. You know what the entertainment industry is like.\"","Nie Ling tried to persuade him gently.","Chang Zhiyuan frowned at her words.","\"I do know, and I like her anyway.\"","Chang Huaiming turned to Nie Ling and said, \"This is all your fault. You've spoiled him since he was little, giving him whatever he wanted. Look at him now, he won't even come home, let alone listen to your advice.\"","\"Me? You spoiled him too. Why don't you mention that? Before he was born, you wanted a son so badly. After he was born, you indulged him every day.\"","\"Stop arguing, both of you. You've both spoiled me. You've been too indulgent, and that's why I am the way I am now. You'll have to accept the consequences. I know I'm not young anymore and I could get married, but I want my life partner to be someone I truly love. Not someone you think is suitable and arrange for me. I know you love me, but you shouldn't only love me. I have a sister too.\"","It would be absurd to say that Chang Ningjing deserved their love only because she was good to him. It's the 21st century, after all.","Chang Ningjing never said anything, but he knew—who wouldn't yearn for their parents' love?","No matter how strong or excellent Chang Ningjing was, she was still just a girl.","\"How can you say we don't love your sister?\"","Chang Zhiyuan remained silent.","\"You should go home now. I don't need you to take care of me. I know you mean well, but it would be better if you didn't interfere with my relationships or my sister's.\"","\"You—\"","Before Chang Huaiming could finish, Nie Ling stopped him.","\"Fine, we'll go home.\"","In the park downstairs, Chang Ningjing and Shu Yi walked side by side, the initial awkwardness of their first meeting now gone.","\"Ms. Chang, I'm sorry. What you saw earlier wasn't what it looked like,\" Shu Yi explained. She had only intended to help Chang Zhiyuan get up, not expecting things to turn out as they did.","Chang Ningjing smiled, \"It's alright. Just call me Sister Ningjing.\"","Shu Yi nodded, and they continued walking.","\"How have you been feeling lately?\" Chang Ningjing asked.","\"I'm fine now, thank you for your concern, Sister Ningjing.\"","Since learning more about Shu Yi, Chang Ningjing had let go of her previous prejudices.","It wasn't her fault for being prejudiced before. After all, Chang Zhiyuan's previous girlfriends were all peculiar characters with plenty of scandals to uncover. She even suspected Chang Zhiyuan was doing it on purpose. What kind of taste did he have, picking a bunch of beautiful but morally questionable arm candies?","In comparison, Shu Yi seemed quite decent. Although her family background was modest, she had impressive academic credentials. Moreover, there weren't any scandals associated with her. She was intelligent and had good acting skills too.","\"We should be done here. Let's head back,\" Chang Ningjing suggested.","\"Alright.\"","\"Dad, Mom, you've come down.\"","Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling were approaching them from the opposite direction."]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: Parental Intervention","paragraphs":["\"Ningjing, go upstairs and check on your brother first. We'd like to have a word with this young lady.\"","Chang Ningjing nodded in response.","Shu Yi tensed up. Drawing from her years of experience with novels and acting, she anticipated the next scene: they would offer her a credit card and ask her to leave their son.","\"Come, young lady. We'd like to have a chat with you.\"","Shu Yi grew increasingly nervous.","The couple led Shu Yi to an upscale café near the hospital.","\"Please, have a seat.\"","Shu Yi obediently sat down.","\"We'll cut to the chase and speak frankly,\" Nie Ling said.","The couple's strong presence was palpable; as they sat there, Shu Yi felt intimidated.","\"What's your name?\"","\"Shu Yueru.\"","\"You're an actress, aren't you? You're quite beautiful.\"","Nie Ling sat poised, holding a cup of coffee, scrutinizing Shu Yi.","\"Yes, I am.\"","\"You two aren't compatible. I don't think you should be together.\"","Nie Ling's voice was devoid of emotion, utterly neutral.","\"Mrs. Chang, we're not together.\"","\"Yes, I know you're not together yet. I hope you won't be in the future either.\"","Shu Yi fell silent. This turn of events deviated slightly from her expectations.","\"Are you listening?\" Nie Ling asked again.","\"Yes, I am.\"","\"Can you do as we ask?\"","Chang Huaiming's fingers drummed on the coffee table.","Although Shu Yi had anticipated this outcome, hearing it spoken aloud still left her feeling dazed.","Indeed, incompatibility is incompatibility. In the adult world, love isn't always enough. Often, reality trumps romance.","Fortunately, she hadn't fallen too deeply and could extricate herself in time, cutting her losses.","\"I understand. If there's nothing else, I'll take my leave now.\"","Shu Yi maintained her composure as she spoke and stood up. It wasn't until she turned to leave that her nose tingled, and a tear rolled down her cheek.","Perhaps it was for the best. There was no point in wasting time on a relationship without a future. From now on, she would have to learn to be neither sad nor happy, to stop thinking about him, and to stay away as much as possible.","\"The girl is quite pretty, but she's been tainted by the entertainment industry. She's not good enough for Zhiyuan,\" Chang Huaiming remarked, taking a sip of coffee.","\"She was quite calm. I thought she might put up a fight. We didn't even bring our credit cards. If she had made a scene, we would've been at a loss.\"","\"Alright, let's head back. We can't let Zhiyuan know about this, or he'll be upset again,\" Chang Huaiming said.","In the hospital room, Chang Zhiyuan had been waiting for a long time, but no one had returned. What could his sister possibly be discussing with Shu Yueru that was taking so long?","Chang Ningjing didn't dare return. If she did, Chang Zhiyuan would undoubtedly ask her where Shu Yi had gone. How could she tell him that their parents had taken Shu Yi aside for a chat?","She preferred to stay out of her brother's romantic affairs. It was better to pretend she knew nothing.","Shu Yi sat in her car, trying to collect herself.","Her phone rang. It was Shen Yin calling. Shu Yi looked at the caller ID, wiped away her tears, and cleared her throat.","\"Hello, Yin Yin.\"","\"Shu Yi, are you busy right now?\"","\"No, not at all.\"","\"I wanted to ask about that delicious ice cream shop you mentioned before. Where is it?\"","Shen Yin was just feeling bored. Although the weather had turned cooler, who doesn't love ice cream? A foodie has no resistance to delicious treats.","After some hesitation, she decided to call Shu Yi.","\"Wait for me at home. I'll come pick you up, and we'll go together.\"","\"Huh? Weren't you supposed to be at the hospital taking care of Chang Zhiyuan?\"","\"His family is there now. They don't need me anymore. So I can accompany you and my godson for some ice cream!\"","Shu Yi was unhappy, but people often put on a mask when they're feeling down, pretending to be happy.","That's exactly what she was doing now, smiling in a way that looked more painful than crying.","Hearing this, Shen Yin sensed something different in Shu Yi's voice.","When Shu Yi arrived at Ziyue Manor, she parked her car in front of Shen Yin's house.","\"Come on, son. Get in the car. Godmother's going to treat you to something delicious.\"","Afraid that Shen Yin might notice she had been crying, Shu Yi deliberately put on her sunglasses as she stopped the car and opened the door.","\"Should we invite Qi Ji?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Probably not. She might not be able to eat it. It would be too cruel to make her watch us eat.\"","\"Haha, you're right. We'll invite her next time when we're having something milder.\"","\"When are you starting your next project?\"","\"I'm not sure yet. The company has sent me several scripts recently, but none of them were suitable. I think I'll hold off for now.\"","\"Good. Don't settle for less.\"","As soon as they entered the private room, Shen Yin couldn't help but ask.","\"Are you feeling down?\"","\"How did you notice? Is it that obvious?\"","Shu Yi took out her mirror from her bag and checked her reflection repeatedly, but couldn't see anything different about herself. She wasn't wearing makeup, and her eyes weren't red.","\"When someone is pretending to be happy, it's noticeable. The tone of voice, the subtle expressions on the face – they all give it away. Right now, you're trying hard to conceal something.\"","\"Really? That's amazing. As expected, Yin Yin knows me best. Even my micro-expressions can't escape your keen eye.\"","\"Tell me about it.\"","While Shen Yin was ordering, Shu Yi was organizing her thoughts.","\"You met Chang Zhiyuan's parents, didn't you?\"","\"How did you know?\"","\"Didn't you say they went to take care of him, so you weren't needed anymore?\"","\"Impressive deduction skills, my friend.\"","Shu Yi gave Shen Yin a thumbs up.","\"What did they say?\"","Shu Yi sighed and said, \"They told me that Chang Zhiyuan and I aren't compatible. They asked me not to be with him, not now, not ever.\"","\"And you agreed?\"","Shu Yi nodded.","\"What else could I do? We really aren't a good match. They're practically aristocracy. They'd never allow an actress to enter their family. Rather than begging and struggling, it's more dignified to agree gracefully.\"","Pride was still important, and now Shu Yi could only confide in Shen Yin.","\"Don't be sad, Godmother. Have some ice cream.\" Xu Yunzheng scooped up some ice cream and offered it to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi was so touched she almost cried.","\"Zhengzheng, Godmother loves you!\"","Shu Yi took a bite and instantly felt better. How could there be such a sweet, understanding, and heart-warming child?","In an instant, all her unhappiness melted away.","Meanwhile, in the hospital room, Chang Zhiyuan was about to explode with frustration. What was going on? Four people had left, and half a day had passed, but not a single one had returned. He was about to burst from needing to use the bathroom. Who could he turn to now?","\"The number you have dialed is switched off. Please try again later.\"","\"The number you have dialed is currently busy. Please try again later.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had never imagined he would one day feel so desperate.","\"Hello, Xiuhe, help me.\"","\"Explain clearly.\"","\"I'm at the hospital.\"","\"You can still talk, so it can't be too serious.\"","\"It's about to become serious. Get to the hospital as fast as you can!\""]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: Wheelchair","paragraphs":["When Xu Xiuhe arrived, Chang Zhiyuan was howling.","\"You finally came! If you'd been any later, my bladder would have exploded.\"","\"Serve you right. Why didn't you call a nurse?\"","\"Nurses are women. How could I let another woman touch my body? No way, no way. A good man must keep himself pure.\" Chang Zhiyuan waved his hand dismissively.","\"Sure, I believe you,\" Xu Xiuhe said sarcastically, wondering how anyone could be even more thick-skinned than him.","\"Xiuhe, what do you mean? You don't believe me? I admit, I might have been a bit of a player before, but that was only because I hadn't found true love yet. It's different now. Now I have to stay chaste for my dear Shu Yi.\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at him with disgust. \"Has your bladder grown larger?\"","\"Quick, I'm about to burst. Hurry up and help me to the bathroom.\"","Xu Xiuhe reached out and pulled Chang Zhiyuan up by one arm.","When Chang Zhiyuan came out of the bathroom, he let out a sigh of relief. \"Finally took care of that. Xiuhe, I absolutely must treat you to a meal.\"","\"What happened to you? How did you end up like this? Will you be able to walk in the future?\"","\"Don't curse me. It's just a fracture. I'll be fine in a while.\"","\"It takes a hundred days for muscles and bones to heal. You're telling me it'll only take a few days?\"","Xu Xiuhe's words hit a sore spot for Chang Zhiyuan. It was just bad luck that he could break a bone going down stairs. He was too embarrassed to tell anyone.","\"Where is everyone? Where's the caregiver?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Don't even mention it. I purposely didn't hire a caregiver so that Shu Yi could take care of me. But then my parents showed up this morning, and she left. Now I'm all alone here, lonely and pitiful.\"","\"Zhiyuan, you didn't hurt yourself like this on purpose just to get her to take care of you, did you?\" Xu Xiuhe looked at Chang Zhiyuan's right leg, which was covered in a plaster cast.","\"Do I look crazy to you?\"","\"You look like you're sick, the kind that needs medication.\"","\"Alright, let's talk about what's important. Why did Shu Yi leave? I called her, but her phone is turned off.\"","Xu Xiuhe walked to Chang Zhiyuan's bedside and put his hand on Chang Zhiyuan's head, examining him. \"It's your leg that's broken, not your brain.\"","Chang Zhiyuan immediately caught on.","\"If you're my friend, don't beat around the bush. Just say it straight.\"","\"Didn't you say your parents came? When she saw your parents arrive, of course she would leave. Her phone is off – think carefully, what could be the reason? Is it possible they said something to Shu Yi?\"","\"How did I not think of that?\" Chang Zhiyuan slapped his forehead.","Xu Xiuhe marveled again at how a man in love could be so irrational.","\"Alright, I'm leaving. The company is busy. You should get a caregiver. If worse comes to worst, there are male caregivers too.\"","With that, Xu Xiuhe grabbed his coat and left the hospital room. Chang Zhiyuan lay in bed, still pondering where things had gone wrong.","\"Hey, Chang Ningjing, why did it take you so long to answer the phone? Did you do it on purpose? Everyone left without saying a word to me. My bladder was about to explode!\"","\"Uh, little brother, let me explain.\"","\"I don't want to hear it. I just want to know, did you say something to Shu Yue? Why hasn't she come back yet?\"","\"Shu Yue?\"","\"Shu Yi, I mean Shu Yi.\"","Chang Ningjing was silent for a moment, then said, \"You know what our parents are like. If I put it this way, do you understand?\"","Chang Ningjing didn't spell it out explicitly.","Chang Zhiyuan angrily hung up the phone. He was fed up with his parents. They had to meddle in everything. He had told them not to interfere in his love life, but as soon as he said it, they started meddling?","His parents were really something. If they had just waited a while before starting to interfere, he wouldn't have said anything.","Chang Zhiyuan was furious. Damn it, he was crippled, and not only did they not come to take care of him, they went and messed up his affairs. He had been making some progress recently and could feel that Shu Yi wasn't as resistant to him as before.","Now with this interference, they were back to square one.","Good grief, he used to think his parents simply favored sons over daughters, but now it seemed they only cared about themselves and didn't consider his feelings at all.","Under the pretext of doing what was best for him, they interfered in all his affairs.","Chang Zhiyuan pressed the call button by his bed. It hadn't even been two minutes when a nurse came.","This was a VIP room, after all, with better service.","The young nurse entered respectfully.","\"Sir, do you need anything?\"","\"I want a wheelchair.\"","\"Certainly, please wait a moment.\"","Chang Zhiyuan made a phone call to his company assistant. He did have an assistant, but usually the assistant was only visible at the company, and he spent very little time there.","\"Xiao Zhang, drive to Rong City No.1 Hospital and pick me up.\"","Two young nurses came into the room, one pushing a wheelchair.","The other nurse walked to the bedside and used the handle to manually raise the head of the bed.","\"Sir, do you want to get down?\"","The nurse pushing the wheelchair came over, making a motion to help Chang Zhiyuan.","Chang Zhiyuan quickly waved them off. As a good man, he had to uphold male virtues. Men and women shouldn't touch casually. It would be better if he got into the wheelchair himself.","Chang Zhiyuan first put his left foot on the ground, then supported himself with both hands on the bed and sat down in the wheelchair.","\"Push me to the hospital entrance.\"","The young nurse complied.","Chang Zhiyuan was wearing hospital clothes and only took his phone when he left the room.","Chang Zhiyuan called Shu Yi many times, but each time he heard the message: \"The number you have dialed is powered off.\"","Chang Zhiyuan sat in the wheelchair and waited for a while. His assistant drove up and stopped at the hospital entrance.","\"Boss.\"","\"Quick, get me into the car.\"","The assistant supported Chang Zhiyuan with one hand as Chang Zhiyuan hopped on his left foot to the back seat of the car.","\"Put the wheelchair in the trunk.\"","The assistant opened the trunk, and the young nurse pushed the wheelchair forward. With the assistant's help, they put it in the trunk.","\"The patient needs to return by tonight. We have another examination,\" the nurse said.","The assistant quickly agreed, closed the trunk and the back door, then got into the driver's seat.","At the ice cream shop, Shu Yi felt half of her unhappiness melt away after the therapeutic effects of the dessert.","\"How do you plan to face him next?\" Shen Yin asked.","Shu Yi shook her head. She was an artist under his company. As long as she stayed with his company, it would be impossible for them to avoid crossing paths. In the past, it wasn't so bad, but now they had filmed a drama together and still had to coordinate to make official announcements. They would have to work together in the future as well.","\"Let it be. If I'm not mistaken, your phone is probably turned off right now.\"","Shen Yin took a sip of her drink.","\"Who is he?\"","Xu Yunzheng looked up, glancing at Shu Yi, then back at Shen Yin.","\"He's my godfather.\"","\"Didn't Dad say that godfather likes godmother?\"","Shen Yin quickly covered Xu Yunzheng's mouth with her hand, but Shu Yi had already heard.","Shen Yin had expected Shu Yi to be upset for a while."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Returning to Chang's Home","paragraphs":["Shu Yi smiled and pinched Xu Yunzheng's little face, saying, \"Zheng Zheng, your godmother might like your godfather too, but you know, the adult world is complicated. You won't understand if I explain it now, but you'll get it when you're older.\"","Zheng Zheng indeed didn't understand. If even adults couldn't figure out these issues, how could a two-year-old child possibly comprehend?","Life is vast like the sea and as varied as mountains and rivers. It doesn't always go smoothly. The waxing and waning, the ups and downs - that's reality, isn't it?","Liking someone, loving someone, being together, and getting married are all different things. They shouldn't be confused with one another.","Chang Zhiyuan sat in his assistant's car as they arrived at the Chang family's old residence. Once he and Chang Ningjing had the means, they had moved out of the old house to live on their own. At first, he was just dissatisfied with his parents' favoritism towards sons over daughters, but now he realized that Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling's mindset was the real problem.","\"Push me in,\" he said.","Chang Zhiyuan sat back in his wheelchair, with his assistant pushing from behind. The door was opened by the family's housekeeper.","\"Madam, the young master is back,\" the housekeeper announced.","Nie Ling, who had been sitting on the sofa drinking tea, was surprised. Upon hearing the housekeeper's voice, she quickly stood up and walked over.","\"Zhiyuan, why are you here? Weren't you supposed to be recovering in the hospital? Huaiming, Zhiyuan is back!\" Nie Ling called out, raising her head.","\"Why I'm back? Don't you know?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","Nie Ling felt guilty; of course, she knew.","\"What's wrong? Has something major happened? Mom really doesn't know why you're back,\" she said, her eyes darting around, occasionally glancing at the staircase, waiting for Chang Huaiming to come and rescue her from this situation.","Chang Zhiyuan, dressed in hospital clothes, sat on the sofa, appearing particularly calm, but his gaze was sharp as he stared directly at Nie Ling.","\"Son, don't look at me like that. I'm not a criminal. That look in your eyes is quite frightening,\" Nie Ling said nervously.","\"Frightening? I don't think so,\" he replied coolly.","\"Is that any way to speak to your mother? Show some respect,\" Chang Huaiming said as he came down the stairs.","Nie Ling breathed a sigh of relief.","\"And how did you speak to Shu Yi? Was that respectful?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"You found out?\" his father questioned.","\"I'm not stupid. I was alone in the hospital room with no one coming to visit me. Don't you think I should have figured it out?\"","\"Zhiyuan, your mother and I only want what's best for you. That young girl is in the entertainment industry. She's not suitable for you,\" Chang Huaiming explained.","\"How is she not suitable? I'm in the entertainment industry too. I've been in it even longer than her. I even filmed a movie recently.\"","\"That's different. You're at the top of the industry. And didn't you only act in that film because of her?\"","Chang Zhiyuan almost laughed in frustration. So they knew he had acted in the film for her sake.","\"Mom, Dad, you're getting older, and there are some things I shouldn't say to you. But precisely because you're older, you should be more open-minded. Children have their own destiny. If you keep acting like this, when will you ever have grandchildren? There are some things I've never wanted to say, because I felt there was no need. But now, I have no choice.\"","Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling exchanged a glance.","\"From childhood, you've always doted on me, and I know that. But what about my sister? Haven't you neglected her? At first, I understood. The older generation has strong family values, and there's often some favoritism towards sons. But you've taken it too far. Since we were little, anything good always came to me first. When I was young, I didn't understand. I even thought she might not be your real daughter. Growing up, it was mostly my sister who took care of me. Unlike others, she never resented me because of your favoritism. On the contrary, my sister was smart. She knew from the start that only by being good to me would she be noticed by you.\"","Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling remained silent.","\"Isn't it sad? The world is full of wonders, and sometimes I find it unbelievable. That time I fell into the water, it was she who saved me. After pulling me out, she was the one left in the water, and she got sick. Did you blame her then for not taking good care of me? You say you love me, but it was my sister who took care of me the most. She's only two years older than me. Dad, I can understand you were busy with work, but Mom, what were you doing? Playing mahjong. Do you know why my sister has never married? Because saving me left her with an illness that made her infertile!\"","As Chang Zhiyuan said this, Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling's expressions changed. They clearly hadn't expected this reason.","\"Mom, Dad, I know it hasn't been easy for you. But we're grown up now. You didn't take care of us much when we were little, so please don't interfere now that we're adults. My feelings for Shu Yi are serious.\"","\"But that girl...\" Nie Ling began, but Chang Zhiyuan quickly cut her off.","\"No buts. She's wonderful. She has education, ability, and beauty. In what way is she not good enough for me? Her family background? A simple background is just fine. Besides, I used to have a terrible reputation. Everyone would say, 'Chang Zhiyuan? Isn't he the one who changes women faster than he changes clothes?' How could someone like that be worthy of her? Anyway, she's the one for me, for life. I'm informing you of this. If you won't accept her as your daughter-in-law, then you might as well not have me as a son. Think it over carefully. I've said my piece. It's up to you now.\"","With that, Chang Zhiyuan turned his wheelchair around and left.","The couple stood there, stunned for a good while, seemingly unable to accept this reality.","Nie Ling cried, hitting Chang Huaiming. \"How did it come to this? We truly wanted the best for him. Why are his words so final?\"","Chang Huaiming watched Chang Zhiyuan's retreating figure, lost in thought. Had they really been wrong all this time?","After all these years, had they failed so miserably as parents?","At the ice cream shop, Shen Yin took a bite of her ice cream and said, \"It's true that being from similar backgrounds is important. Love rarely triumphs over reality. Parents genuinely want what's best for their children, but they often don't know what their children truly desire.\"","\"Whether it's a match of equals or not, we can't predict how relationships will turn out. Who can guarantee that a couple from similar backgrounds will always be happy? And who can say that a love match won't have a good outcome? It might be rare, but it does happen. In the future, when it comes to our little Zheng Zheng's relationships, I'll absolutely not interfere. You see how Qi Ji is always joking about Zheng Zheng being her son-in-law? I bet when the time comes, if the kids don't like each other, she definitely won't force them.\"","\"Little Qi Ji hasn't even determined whether it's a boy or a girl in her belly yet.\"","\"Boy or girl, it's all the same.\"","Shen Yin's way of thinking was quite progressive. She herself was a unique individual who had experienced many unusual things, so naturally, her perspective was broader than most.","\"Hmm, I'm feeling better now. I haven't let myself get too caught up in it yet. Quick, praise me – a good meal is all it takes to heal me.\"","Shu Yi lifted her head, seeking approval.","\"Let's praise godmother! Godmother is awesome!\"","Xu Yunzheng clapped his hands enthusiastically."]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: The Past of Zhou Man","paragraphs":["After it all ended, Shu Yi and Shen Yin returned together to Ziyue Manor. Shu Yi's phone remained switched off, and she did not turn it on even after reaching home.","Shen Yin cooked dinner. When Xu Xiuhe returned home, he mentioned that the case concerning Qi Yan was about to reach a verdict, aiming for a sentence between three to ten years.","Shen Yin didn't show any significant reaction. After all, one must bear the consequences of multiple wrongdoings. Qi Yan was going in, so was Qi Shengwu, and no one else could be blamed for that.","\"Today, I went for ice cream with Shu Yi.\"","\"She was with you?\"","\"Did Chang Zhiyuan look for you?\"","The couple each posed their questions, knowing the answers without needing a reply from each other.","\"As for their business, we should not interfere. If they are meant to be, nothing can separate them.\"","Shen Yin agreed, as the nature of destiny is truly mysterious.","Xu Xiuhe was playing with Zhengzheng, while Shen Yin was preparing dinner in the kitchen.","Suddenly, Xu Xiuhe’s phone began to ring.","\"Zhengzheng, play by yourself for a while. Daddy needs to take this call.”","\"Okay.\"","Xu Xiuhe moved into the bathroom.","The number was unfamiliar.","\"Hello, Mr. Xu.\"","\"Any progress?\"","\"We found out that Zhou Man, prior to her wedding, had illicit relationships with multiple individuals, both men and women.”","\"I am aware.\"","Of course, Xu Xiuhe already knew this. What he wanted now was evidence, which he knew was hard to find. If he could locate it himself, he wouldn't need detectives.","\"What's her current status? What about her family background?\"","\"She has no distinguished family background. She's originally from Pei City, and comes from a single-parent family. She used to frequent bars in high school, making money by accompanying others for drinks.\"","\"What does she need so much money for?\"","Xu Xiuhe questioned, well aware of the fact that Zhou Man had scammed 20 million from the Shen family.","\"That is, her mother has leukemia. Initially, she made money to pay for her mother's treatment. Later, she indeed used her body and earned quite a lot. Her mother’s condition was controlled. She...\"","The person on the other end of the call did not continue.","\"Keep talking.\"","\"She met Shen Yin online. At that time, she happened to take a job overseas and managed to coax Shen Yin to come along. She took advantage of Shen Yin's sympathy, making Shen Yin transfer money to her. Her mother then underwent a bone marrow transplant in China. Her illness was cured. Because of Shen family's intervention, their relationship ended. After leaving Shen Yin, she successively had relationships with many men and finally married Guo Wei.”","After listening to the detective's report on the phone, Xu Xiuhe felt a myriad of emotions. Zhou Man was overwhelmingly greedy. Her mother's illness had been cured, yet she had scammed 20 million from the Shen family.","\"How did she meet Yang Cui?\"","\"Because of Xu Zhengyang. Xu Zhengyang was in Pei City on a business trip two years ago and she seduced him. They had an affair, and after learning about Xu Zhengyang's identity, she lied to him, saying her ex-girlfriend was forced into a marriage with Xu Zhengyang's brother. Xu Zhengyang investigated, unable to uncover Shen Yin’s true identity, and only found that Zhou Man did indeed have a past with Shen Yin.\"","Xu Xiuhe, having heard this, understood that Zhou Man was only after money.","In the evening, while lying in bed, Xu Xiuhe shared the incident with Shen Yin. It seemed to Shen Yin as if she was hearing a story, winding and incredibly complex.","“In my impression, they never committed any outrageous actions. The Shen Yin from the past was probably blinded by what she thought was love.”","“Right, don't worry too much, there will be no issues.”","Shen Yin nodded.","The couple had the same thought in mind. Zhou Man had no evidence to prove that they were lesbians. There were also no inappropriate photos. If it did leak out, Shen Yin could say they were just good friends.","Everything required evidence. It was normal for two girls to be close, and without any concrete evidence, it would not pose any substantial threat to either Xu Xiuhe or herself.","\"She is stilling investigating. Once we compile everything she has done and send it to her, she will likely get a scare.\"","\"How could Xu Guimin have such a child as Xu Zhengyang? Xu Zhengyang gives off a sinister aura, you can tell he's nefarious at first glance.\"","\"Why don't you also mention that he himself isn't any good?\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Yin agreed, some people are simply not meant to be parents.","Shen Yin touched Xu Xiuhe’s eyebrows and said: “It is truly a blessing that you have grown up so safely, healthy and excellently.”","“Are you praising me?”","\"Isn't it obvious? I'm really complimenting you!\" Shen Yin, excited, sat up.","“Let's sleep.”","The next day, Zhengzheng kept insisting on seeing her father. Left with no choice, Shen Yin had to ask the driver to bring Zhengzheng and herself to the company.","Most of the Heyuan Group employees recognized her. As she visited often, they weren’t surprised to see her.","At the office, Shen Yin, finding herself bored, began to look at some of Heyuan Group's files.","\"Aren't you afraid that I'll steal your company's secrets and sell them?\"","\"I'm not, the company isn't just mine, you are also a shareholder.\"","\"I’m a shareholder? When did that happen?”","Shen Yin was surprised, she put down the files in her hands and looked at Xu Xiuhe.","\"You have a 10% stake. But I’m still the majority shareholder, how else would I be the CEO?”","“When did I become a shareholder?”","\"The first time you cooked dinner, I had Liu Bo transfer 5% to you. The time you moved into the small building, I transferred another 5% to you.”","“That would explain the large amount in my bank account.”","“Is it a lot for you? What’s mine is now yours.”","“Is Liu Bo also a shareholder?”","“He is, but his share is slightly less than yours.”","Speak of the devil, and he shall appear.","As soon as the words came out of the mouths, Liu Bo, with a grimace, knocked on the office door.","“Boss.”","“Come in.”","\"Is the project in Yang City finished?\"","\"Can it be done so soon?\"","\"So, what's the matter?\"","\"I'm taking leave.\"","Said Liu Bo.","\"You're taking a leave?\" Xu Xiuhe was a bit incredulous. Liu Bo usually complained about his long working hours, but when it came to work, he was more diligent than anyone else. The company's success today can't be separated from him.","\"Yes. Xiao Li's father has been hospitalized with high blood pressure. As her future son-in-law, I ought to visit him.\"","\"He's worth a visit. Go ahead.\"","Liu Bo didn't expect his leave application would go so smoothly.","\"Hold on, when are you guys holding the wedding ceremony? I'll come to gift some money.\"","Liu Bo was almost out of the office door when he was stopped by Xu Xiuhe.","\"A wedding ceremony?\" Liu Bo touched his head, is this something worth considering? He and Xiao Li are just pretending at present."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Hospital Visit","paragraphs":["\"You're not so young anymore, are you not thinking about marriage, or are you guys...\"","Before Xu Xiuhe could finish his sentence, Liu Bo was completely scared. Could it be that his boss knew they were faking?","\"We are thinking, we're thinking. Isn't it because I'm usually too busy at work with her? We just don't have the time.\"","\"Indeed, it's my fault as a boss. How about this, the New Year is three months away, I'll give you a long vacation before then, and the two of you can hold your wedding ceremony. It's not right to keep dragging this on. After the New Year, you can also have your honeymoon.\"","Xu Xiuhe made it sound nonchalant, but Liu Bo was scared out of his wits.","\"Isn't it too sudden?\"","Liu Bo was practically sweating in distress.","\"Not sudden at all. You've known each other for so long, you're familiar with each other's backgrounds, and you've even met each other's parents. You can't let the girl wait forever. I think you can go get the certificates now.\"","Shen Yin once again witnessed Xu Xiuhe's matchmaking tendencies. Is he starting to rush for their marriage already?","Such a good boss, are bosses these days really this humanized? Constantly considering their employees' personal matters.","\"President, I will go first.\"","Liu Bo wished he could fly out of this office.","\"Don't worry, by then, the whole Heyuan Group will be your in-law's home.\"","As soon as Liu Bo went out, a group of junior assistants outside were watching.","\"What's wrong with Assistant Liu, he is in such a hurry.\"","Xiao Li'er kept her head down. She hadn't told Yang Mo and the others that she had already taken leave and was about to go to the hospital.","\"Mo Mo, Elder Sister Gu, you guys carry on. I have almost finished dealing with the files. I've got something to do and have asked for leave to take off early.\"","\"Ok, drive slowly on your way back.\"","They could just tell Liu Bo if they need a leave, generally, it’s no problem to take time off, everyone has family matters to take care of. They bid Xiao Li'er to take care.","In a short while, Liu Bo also made his way to the elevator door.","As soon as he left, they could not keep their gossip hidden.","\"Did you see that? I think these two are taking time off together. It's strange indeed, Assistant Liu actually asked for leave, he must have been asking for it in the president's office just now.\"","\"He rarely takes leaves, usually only business trips, it’s indeed unusual.\"","\"You think, could these two be going to get the marriage certificate now?\" Elder Sister Gu said.","In an instant, their eyes seemed enlightened, filled with deep implications.","\"Why didn't you wait for me to come down together?\"","In the underground garage, Liu Bo asked sitting in the car.","\"Isn't it too obvious? If we go together, they'd notice right away.\"","\"Xiao Li, aren't you naive? If we go one after another, won't it look more conspicuous? It makes us look even guiltier.\"","\"What do we have to feel guilty about? We're not doing anything bad together.\"","\"With the imagination of your girl group, they probably think we're going to get our marriage certificate together.\"","\"How is that possible? Marriage certificate? Impossible, that's outrageous, we're faking.\"","Xiao Li'er waved her hands, making statements that she herself didn't believe.","\"Then what would make it real?\"","Liu Bo, who had been looking down, suddenly lifted his head to ask this question. Whether it was his gaze or expression, they were both incredibly serious.","Xiao Li'er's eyes widened, her expression frozen as if she hadn't expected Liu Bo to utter such words.","\"That, what do you mean by what you just said?\"","Xiao Li'er couldn't meet Liu Bo's gaze, and her words began to stutter.","\"What you think it means, is what it means.\"","After Liu Bo finished speaking, he started the car. Xiao Li'er felt an odd tingling sensation in her heart, something felt off.","She was silent for the whole drive.","The pair kept silent until the car pulled into the parking lot. Liu Bo exited and pulled several boxes of expensive-looking nutritional supplements from the trunk.","“Why did you go shopping? These must be expensive, let me transfer you some money.”","Xiao Li'er pulled out her phone and transferred Liu Bo 2000 yuan.","“Let's go.”","Liu Bo carried two boxes.","\"Sorry, I didn't mean to bother you.\"","“No problem.”","The two of them made their way to the hospital room. There were other patients there. Xiao's Mother was peeling an apple for Xiao's Father.","“Mom, how is dad?”","“Oh, Li'er, you're here. Ah, Liu Bo came too. You didn’t just come but also bought so many things.”","“That’s the least I can do. Auntie, how is Uncle?”","“I am doing fine.”","Xiao's Father was still lying in bed with an IV drip.","“Dad, you were fine. Why are you in the hospital?”","“Isn't it normal? As you age, your body isn't what it used to be. Some health issues are common, don't make a big deal out of it.”","“Oh, dear, that’s your daughter and son-in-law. How nice! Daughters are always better. My son...sigh.”","An older woman entered the room from outside.","The woman who walked in was the neighbour in the next bed, looking at Xiao Li'er with envy on her face.","“I have no serious problems. You shouldn't stay here. Hustle, go and get back to work.”","Xiao's Father waved his hand from the bed.","Xiao's Mother was unhappy and retorted: “You really have an issue. Liu Bo and Li'er came to see you out of goodwill, and you're not pleased.”","“You are blessed but unaware, my old man always yearns for our son to visit him. Till now, he hasn't shown up.” The woman from the next bed said.","“Is work busy?” Xiao's Mother asked.","“It’s okay.”","“Wow, handsome groom and beautiful bride, such a perfect match. Do you have children yet?”","The neighbour seemed to be a fairly familiar type, making everyone awkward with her question.","“No, Auntie, we're not married yet.”","“Oh, you aren't married yet? That will not do. You should marry early, especially girls. The earlier you get married, the earlier you'll recover. You two should get married soon. Hurry up, while your mom is still able to help with the kids.”","Xiao's Mother giggled and said nothing.","Xiao Li'er suddenly felt that the decision to visit her father today was a mistake.","“Yes, we will hurry up.”","“Ah, good lad. That’s like it.”","The woman from the next bed was very pleased upon hearing Liu Bo's words, feeling as if she had accomplished something great.","“Liu Bo, come have some fruit.”","Xiao's Mother handed Liu Bo a peeled apple.","“Auntie, I’m not hungry, you should give it to Uncle.”","\"Just eat it when I give it to you, don't talk too much.\"","Xiao's Father, who was in bed, said grumpily.","Liu Bo was a bit embarrassed and took the apple to eat for a while.","Xiao Li'er then asked some questions about the illness and discharge time. She was ready to leave once she confirmed that there were no significant issues.","Once she was back in the car, Xiao Li'er began to apologize again.","\"I apologize for how my father spoke earlier. If he came across as harsh, please don't take it to heart.\"","\"I don't mind at all. It's perfectly normal. If my daughter were to be lured away by some scoundrel in the future, I reckon my attitude would be even worse than that of your father's.\"","......"]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: Qiji Runs Away from Home","paragraphs":["Shen Yin has been quite idle recently. Other than spending Sundays teaching martial arts to a group of young girls at the dojo and sharpening her own skills, she usually has plenty of free time.","Xu Xiuhe often summons her to the Heyuan Group, and the employees are in the habit of having their boss' wife around every day. This is indeed a rarity for them.","Shen Yin, clever as she is, observes the operations of the Heyuan Group during her free time, and even has a knack for dealing with some documents.","\"Having you around puts me under a lot of pressure,\" said Xu Xiuhe jokingly.","\"What pressure?\" she asked.","\"You're capable and efficient. I can't help but worry that you might outshine me someday and leave me,\" he confided.","This remark elicited laughter from Shen Yin. Was Xu Xiuhe feeling insecure?","\"You better treat me well then,\" she teased.","\"Yes, I promise to treat you well.\"","Shen Yin couldn’t figure out what had caused Xu Xiuhe's perceived insecurity. She wasn’t one to frequently verbalize her affections or proclaim her love; Shen Yin preferred to let her actions do the talking.","Words don't matter, actions do. Talk is cheap, doesn't cost a dime, and requires no effort.","In order to soothe Xu Xiuhe's anxiety, she decided to make him a sumptuous dinner that night as a reward for his hard work.","\"I'll make you something delicious tonight,\" she said.","\"Hmm?\" He seemed surprised.","A mere glance from him was enough for Shen Yin to ascertain his thoughts. But she chose not to acknowledge it.","\"I'm going to buy the ingredients with Zhengzheng this afternoon\"","Shen Yin exited Xu Xiuhe's office with Zhengzheng in tow later that afternoon.","Passing through the office area, the assistants greeted her warmly. Seeing Shen Yin and Zhengzheng leave for the day, the secretaries found themselves wishing for a fairy-tale love like theirs.","\"A charming love story, such a happy marriage!\"","\"Lucky Mrs. CEO!\"","Shen Yin, holding Zhengzheng’s hand, noted that the child’s short legs could only move so fast. Just as they reached the parking garage, Shen Yin picked the child up.","\"Let's go to the nearby supermarket.\"","Responding to her instruction, the driver started the car.","There was a large shopping mall near the Heyuan Group. When Shen Yin ventured outside with Zhengzheng, they both wore masks to avoid being recognized.","\"Mama, can we buy corn?\" Zhengzheng asked.","\"How do you want to eat the corn?\"","\"With spare ribs.\"","\"Alright, if Zhengzheng wants it, we'll buy it.\"","They bought numerous items, and the supermarket staff took care of them all and delivered them to their car.","As they reached the gates of Ziyue Manor, a young woman was waiting for them.","\"Finally, you're back, Sister Yin Yin!\"","\"Qi Ji, what brings you here.\"","\"I missed you, wah wah.\"","Qi Ji wore a pouty, childlike expression. If it wasn't for her visible pregnancy, one might have mistaken her for a small child.","\"What's wrong, did Xue Jingrui give you a hard time?\"","Qi Ji gave a strong nod.","At the sight of this, Shen Yin was frightened, knowing Qi Ji was carrying a baby. She couldn't fathom the ongoing events between the two.","\"I'll call Xu Xiuhe, and ask him about the situation with Xue Jingrui,” Shen Yin suggested, pulling out her mobile phone.","\"No, no, don't call him. I don't want to see him,\" Qi Ji hastily stopped Shen Yin.","\"Auntie, what's wrong?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"I really crave something delicious,\" Qi Ji replied, her mouth watering at the sight of the pile of food ingredients Shen Yin had bought.","Understanding the unpredictable nature of a pregnant woman's mind, Shen Yin decided not to take any random actions. “Let's go inside,\" she finally said.","Shen Yin unlocked the villa using her fingerprint and the door slid open. The driver delivered all the food to the kitchen.","Qi Ji closely followed Shen Yin, sticking closer than Zhengzheng, who was struggling to find room near her and ended up behind Qi Ji.","\"How did you get here?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Jingrui brother went to work, and Mom was sleeping. I snuck out and took a cab. I have been waiting for you at your doorstep for a long time,\" Qi Ji explained.","\"Ah, when did you arrive?\"","\"Two hours ago.\"","\"Why didn't you go look for Shu Yi in our absence?\"","\"I went to Sister Shu Yi's house, but no one was there. I didn't take my mobile when I left, so I had to sit and wait here.\"","The young girl seemed oppressed, and Shen Yin felt sorry for her.","\"Zhengzheng, accompany your auntie, I will cook for you both,\" she told her son before entering the kitchen.","Pulling out her cellphone, Shen Yin sent a message to Xu Xiuhe, asking him to inform Xue Jingrui that Qi Ji was with her. She wasn't sure what was happening between the couple, and fearing agitating Qi Ji further, she refrained from asking too many questions.","Working in the kitchen, Shen Yin chopped vegetables and kept an eye on Zhu Zheng and Qi Ji. And as she watched the adult and child play, her thoughts raced, piecing together the possibilities of what might have happened between Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui.","“Auntie, what's wrong?\"","\"I crave different food every day, but your Uncle Jingrui never lets me eat. Yesterday, I stole some food, and when he found out, he scolded me.\"","After hearing Qi Ji's words, Zhengzheng ran to her side, slightly patting her shoulder.","\"Your uncle is mean! Don't worry, auntie, we have a lot of delicious food at home,\" Zhengzheng assured Qi Ji, who was so touched she nearly shed tears.","\"My son-in-law, you treat mommy the best, my love for you has never been unwarranted.\"","\"Mommy is preparing food.\"","Zhengzheng turned to look into the kitchen, and Shen Yin, multitasking between cooking and listening to their conversation, continued with her tasks.","\"In the future, I will be your mother too. You are my son-in-law,\" Qi Ji announced.","The little darling didn't quite understand what a 'son-in-law' was. He tried to figure it out but wasn't successful.","\"What's a 'son-in-law'?\" He asked.","\"Not 'Lu Xu,' but 'son-in-law.' A son-in-law is someone who marries my daughter. So, in that way, I also become your mother,\" Qi Ji patiently explained.","\"Auntie's daughter?\"","\"That's right, there's a small baby in your auntie's belly; wanna feel it?\"","Qi Ji held Zhengzheng's small hand and guided it to her stomach.","\"Auntie's stomach is big,\" he noted.","\"Yes, because there's a little life within. In just over half a year, she will emerge and play with Zhengzheng.\"","Xu Yunzheng's hand rested on Qi Ji's belly, marveling at the wonder of it all, touching here, and then touching there.","Shen Yin's phone vibrated, a message from Xu Xiuhe had arrived.","[I have informed Jingrui, and am now on my way home.]","Shen Yin sent another reminder, telling Xu Xiuhe to be careful on his way home.","At the Xue residence, Ye Rong was frantic. She had taken a nap in the afternoon, woke up to read a little, researched some new recipes, and prepared dinner in the kitchen. However, when she went up to ask Qi Ji to come down for dinner, she found Qi Ji's room emptied. There, to her utter shock, lay a runaway letter on the table."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Sweet and Sour Girl","paragraphs":["\"I've been feeling a bit down lately, don't look for me, I'm going for a walk.\"","Ye Rong read the note her daughter-in-law wrote, thinking that Xue Jingrui must have upset Qi Ji. Just as she was about to dial Xue Jingrui's number, her own phone rang.","\"Hello, Jingrui, what's going on? Did you upset Qi Ji?\"","Ye Rong fired off her accusations as soon as she picked up the phone.","\"Mom, I didn't. I called to tell you not to worry. She's at Xu Xiuhe's place, I'll go pick her up later.\"","\"She's lucky nothing happened. If something had, Xue Jingrui, you wait, I wouldn't let you off. We’ll settle this score when you get back tonight.\"","Xue Jingrui was rebuked into silence, not daring to argue.","Ye Rong hung up first, leaving Xue Jingrui to reflect. He hadn't done anything wrong, so why did he feel like he was being abandoned at home?","Xu Xiuhe got home first. The meal prepared by Shen Yin was ready. Xue Jingrui waited outside Xu Xiuhe's door, waiting for a reply from him.","[How's it going? Can I come in yet?]","[Wait a little longer.]","Inside, everyone was enjoying Shen Yin's meal. She had cooked a variety of nutritious dishes. Qi Ji was hungry and ate a lot that night.","\"Sister Yin Yin, your cooking is delicious.\"","\"Then come find me whenever you want to eat something.\"","\"Really? You treat me better than brother Jingrui. He was mean to me yesterday.\"","\"How was he mean to you?\"","Qi Ji knew she was wrong in the first place, and guiltily lowered her head.","\"Xue Jingrui has been waiting outside all this time. He probably hasn't had dinner. Without your permission, he doesn't dare to come in,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Ah, how did he know I am here?\"","After seeing the puzzled look on Qi Ji's face, Shen Yin laughed, realizing that the saying \"once pregnant, three years of folly\" was true.","\"Do you want to let him in?\"","Shen Yin asked.","Qi Ji, with a conflicted expression on her face, said, \"I’m a good person, so I suppose I can allow him in.\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe stood up, opened the door, and Xue Jingrui rushed in.","\"Qi Ji.\"","Xue Jingrui looked worried and wanted to continue speaking, but Xu Xiuhe covered his mouth.","\"You haven't eaten, have you? Come eat first.\"","Xue Jingrui sat down at the dining table. Shen Yin had anticipated Xue Jingrui's arrival and had set an extra pair of chopsticks and bowl.","Qi Ji guiltily lowered her head. Xue Jingrui kept his gaze on her.","\"Brother Jingrui, don't look at me like that, I'm scared,\" Qi Ji said softly.","\"I'm scared too.\"","\"What are you scared of?\"","\"I'm scared you'll get into trouble. I'm scared you can't take care of yourself alone outside. What did I do wrong? You can tell me directly. If something had happened to you...\"","\"You were too mean to me yesterday,\" Qi Ji's voice dropped low and carried a hint of coyness.","At this, Xue Jingrui lost all his anger.","\"I'm sorry, I was worried about you. The weather is changing and it's almost winter. Can you eat ice cream?\"","......","\"You ate ice cream?\"","Shen Yin asked.","The little girl nodded and then added, \"I was sneaking eat, and then Jingrui found me.\"","Shen Yin laughed immediately, indeed a pregnant woman, the cravings they get, it isn't strange to want to eat all sorts of things. But Qi Ji, clearly admitting her own wrongdoing, was too adorable.","\"So you knew all along you were sneaking?\" Shen Yin teased.","Qi Ji's face turned red, her voice softly said, \"I wanted it too much, I couldn't control myself. I thought of so many ways to get ice cream under my Mom’s watch. I just had two bites, two bites.\"","Qi Ji held up two fingers.","\"What's wrong with two bites?\"","\"I only had two bites, and Jingrui already caught me. He scolded me heavily, the key point is, he ate the rest of the ice cream. I only had two bites.\"","\"Jingrui, what were you thinking? Not letting Qi Ji eat is one thing, but you even ate her leftover ice cream right in front of her.\"","Xu Xiuhe watched the scene unfold amusingly, not minding the exaggeration. He initially thought something serious had happened between them, but it just turned out to be over an ice cream.","\"Exactly, you not only scolded me, but you also ate my ice cream.\"","\"I didn't eat it in front of her.\"","\"Where did you eat it then?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"He ate it in the bathroom, I saw it through the door gap. My ice cream, was a blue rose, so pretty. I only had two bites, just two petals, he took a bite and the whole rose petals were gone.\"","As Qi Ji spoke, her voice grew louder, feeling more wronged.","Xue Jingrui didn't expect that he was spotted eating Qi Ji's ice cream in the restroom.","\"Jingrui, that was your fault,\" Xu Xiuhe remarked.","\"I was wrong, I won't scold you again in the future, but for now, we really can't eat that, what if we get sick, we have to be very careful during pregnancy.\"","\"I forgive you. But I want to eat hawthorn! I want to eat something very sour.\"","\"Sweet for boys and sour for girls.\" Shen Yin interjected.","\"Shen Yin, I don't want the hawthron now, I want hotpot and sour and spicy vermicelli... \"","\"...\"","\"Mom, Yunzheng wants ice cream, last time's ice cream was so good. Have some hotpot, have some hawthorn.\" The little one listened to the adults' conversation and suddenly chimed in.","\"Didn't you just eat your fill?\" Shen Yin clearly saw that Xu Yunzheng just had a serious food battle and ate a lot.","\"I'm full now, let's go home. If we don't go now, Mom might want to chop me with a knife.\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"All right.\"","After the two left, Xu Xiuhe cleaned up the dining table, Shen Yin was happy, just now Qi Ji and Xue Jingrui were so funny, thankfully, she and Shu Yi didn't bring Qi Ji to the ice cream shop last time, otherwise, Qi Ji would have been crazy for the ice cream.","Sure enough, after the two got home, Xue Jingrui was thoroughly scolded by Ye Rong.","Qi Ji, listening on the side, felt guilty at first, but later, it turned into sympathy.","\"Mom, it's my fault too, it's my fault, I've been having lots of strange cravings recently.\"","\"No problem, I'll accompany you for the prenatal checkup tomorrow. I would have to teach Xue Jingrui a lesson, otherwise, he will bully you in future.\"","\"Brother Jingrui didn't bully me.\"","Ye Rong doesn't care about these issues. At bedtime, she hugs her pillow and knocks on the door of Xue Jingrui's and Qi Ji's room.","Xue Jingrui gets scared and immediately picks up the quilt from the floor, running onto the bed.","\"What's the matter?\"","\"Mom is probably checking on us.\"","Only when Xue Jingrui looked around the room and couldn't find any faults did he open the door.","\"Mom? Why are you hugging a pillow?\"","\"I'm worried that you're bullying Qi Ji. You can either sleep on the sofa or in the guest room on the ground floor. From tonight, I'll sleep with Qi Ji.\""]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: Shen Lu's Birthday","paragraphs":["As soon as Ye Rong spoke these words, Xue Jingrui was dumbfounded, fearing that his mother might have overthought the situation.","\"Mom, I haven't bullied her,\" Xue Jingrui protested with his final struggle.","\"No, my dear son, I don't believe you. Her menstrual cycle hasn't even stabilized yet, there might be some mishap,\" Ye Rong's tone was firm, with an oppressively serious look in her eyes, it seemed like if Xue Jingrui dared to refuse, she would kick him without hesitation.","\"Mom, what about dad?\" asked Qi Ji.","\"Your father is not a child anymore, he is not afraid to sleep alone. Don't worry about him, go and take a bath, you will feel refreshed afterward.\"","Without getting a chance for Xue Jingrui to process it all, Ye Rong sat down on the bed.","\"You may leave now.\"","In early December, the weather in Rong City started to turn colder, making it necessary to wear a thick coat before venturing out.","In Yang City, Kang Guopeng made a call to Shen Yin, suggesting that their Chinese/Japanese joint venture furniture project was nearing completion and the products would be ready to view in a week.","Kang Guopeng sent Shen Yin many detailed diagrams which left her quite satisfied. After all, Kang Guopeng's technique was impeccable, and her blueprints were unique.","\"When will you come over to inspect the furniture?\" asked Kang Guopeng.","\"There's no need, you've sent all these detail diagrams already. I'll send someone to pick up the furniture in a while,\" Shen Yin replied.","Perhaps because Kang Guopeng resembled her maternal grandfather, she found herself trusting him implicitly.","After a few days, Shen Yin arranged for a driver to be sent out. She wasn't quite at ease with just that, so she discussed with Xu Xiuhe about making a trip to Yang city herself. Xu Xiuhe was even more concerned about Shen Yin going by herself.","\"I'll send someone with the driver, you stay at home with Zhengzheng. It's cold outside, try to stay in if possible.\"","Shen Yin simply replied with an acknowledgment.","Honestly, staying home all the time could get boring. Not many bosses could afford such leisure time like her. With the studio pretty much independent now, she occasionally conducted some training sessions for the young girls working there. Their skills were already miles ahead of their peers.","Anytime they faced a problem, a small hint from Shen Yin was enough for them to understand and move forward. For tougher designs, Shen Yin would sketch them out at home and send them to Wang Nannan.","As for Zhengzheng, being a toddler, staying at home all the time was not his cup of tea. Shen Yin spent most of her time playing educational games with Zhengzheng, like counting, recitation of ancient poems.","\"Mommy, let's go out.\"","\"Where do you want to go?\"","Shen Yin thought Xu Yunzheng would ask for his father again, but this time the little guy pondered for a while and still couldn't make up his mind.","\"Should we go to grandma's house?\"","\"Okay!\"","Shen Yin also hadn't been to the Shen family's house for a while, and she guessed that Fang Yue was missing her and Zhengzheng. After deciding, Shen Yin got little Zhengzheng changed into white cotton trousers and a pink cotton jacket on top.","\"Mommy, let's go.\"","Shen Yin put on a white cashmere coat. Knowing they were heading out, Zhengzheng ran to the stairway, carrying his little bag without waiting for Shen Yin to get fully dressed.","\"Zhengzheng, can you wait for mommy?\"","\"Okay.\"","The driver has already been waiting at the door.","Zhengzheng ran ahead, not wanting to be held by Shen Yin.","The little one ran in front of the car, looking at it, and casually touched the side of the vehicle.","The driver got out of the car and opened the door to the backseat just as Shen Yin stepped out of the house.","Upon seeing Shen Yin, Zhengzheng sprinted towards her and hugged her leg.","Shen Yin bent down, picked up Zhengzheng, and got into the car.","By the time they arrived at Yuelan Manor, it was almost noon.","\"Granny!\"","\"Ah!\"","Both of them exclaimed excitedly.","\"It's been a long time since you last visited.\"","Shen Yin got back smiling, \"Almost a month.\"","\"You're much better than your brother, who hasn't been home in even a longer while.\"","\"My brother has been busy working, hasn't he?\"","Ever since Shen Tianzheng fell ill, he stopped working entirely, spending everyday at home, gardening, reading newspapers, and often thinking about Zhengzheng. He occasionally grumbled to Fang Yue about Shen Lv being too old and still unmarried.","\"Just you defending your brother.\"","Zhengzheng was held by Fang Yue. He suddenly saw the cake on the dining table and his eyes lit up.","\"Cake.\"","Zhengzheng pointed at the cake.","\"Zhengzheng, do you want to eat? Granny will cut a piece for you.\"","Fang Yue, holding Zhengzheng, moved to the dining table. The cake looked quite lavish with a layer of chocolate on top.","Seeing such a huge cake, Shen Yin thought someone must be celebrating their birthday, so she quickly scanned her memory and was pretty sure today must be Shen Lv's birthday.","\"Today's Uncle's birthday, aren't you and Zhengzheng here for that? Let granny cut a piece of cake for Zhengzheng first.\"","Fang Yue put Zhengzheng next to a chair by the table, held a cake knife, and cut a piece with fruit in the middle.","\"Originally, we planned to call you in the afternoon and invite your whole family over. It seems we're telepathically connected.\"","\"Thank you, granny.\"","Xu Yunzheng took the cake, took a lick, and got chocolate all over his nose.","\"You're welcome.\"","\"Mom, but my older brother hasn't come back yet. We ate his cake. Isn't it somehow inconsiderate?\"","\"What's wrong with that? He's lucky to even get a cake prepared. He's almost 30 without a significant other; your father is really worried.\"","\"Uncle's cake is too delicious.\"","Xu Yunzheng, eating happily with twinkling eyes full of laughter.","\"Eat more if you like it.\"","\"Granny, I will visit you often in the future.\"","Fang Yue laughed at his words, asking, \"Is Zhengzheng here to see granny or the cake?\"","Xu Yunzheng thought seriously for a while then said, \"To see granny.\"","Shen Yin laughed alongside, thinking although Zhengzheng is small, he's quick-witted. Coming to see the cake is probably true. Normally at home, Shen Yin controls Zhengzheng's sweets intake. He's small, at a very tender age when teeth are growing; eating too much sweet is not good for teeth.","In the evening, Shen Lv came home with Xu Xiuhe.","The Shen's house hadn't been this lively in a long time. Shen's father sat on the sofa feeling quite content.","Inside the restaurant, a whole table of dishes were prepared by the aunt. The cake was placed in the middle. Shen Lv and Xu Xiuhe were at the side, discussing company matters. Shen Yin vaguely understood a bit. Real estate was not as good as it was in the past years. Whether or not they could get the land was crucial.","\"I want to get the land in Qingwan District,\" said Shen Lv.","\"That area is indeed not bad. There's a scenic spot nearby, suitable for development. Many people want that land, so the final land price might be very high.\"","\"How about we collaborate? We can get that land together. It's a big project. I can't handle it alone.\"","Xu Xiuhe thought for a while, seemingly considering the feasibility of this plan. He had already secured a lot of land in Rong City with his company, plus he had a new project in Yang City. He might not have enough resources to take on this big piece of land."]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: Wang Wang Meow Meow","paragraphs":["\"We're all home now, let's not talk about work. Discuss your work matters during work hours. Let's have dinner.\"","\"Dinner, dinner.\"","Xu Yunzheng ran towards the dining table.","Everyone else also followed him.","Ever since Xu Yunzheng's first visit, Fang Yue had prepared a child's high chair at home.","The high chair is somewhat taller than the dining table's built-in chairs. Xu Yunzheng couldn't climb onto it by himself, so he stood next to the chair, waiting for Shen Yin to lift him up.","\"Xu Yunzheng, call uncle, Uncle will lift you up.\"","\"Uncle.\"","Shen Lv did just that and lifted him up.","\"Thank You, Uncle.\"","\"Oh, no need to thank me, Xu Yunzheng. You're just like me, handsome, obedient, and polite.\"","All the while touting himself, Shen Lv praised Xu Yunzheng.","Hearing her son's comments from across the room, Fang Yue made a face. There's no way Shen Lv took after her. How could he have such thick skin?","\"Cough cough, Shen Lv, don't flatter yourself. Of everyone sitting here, you're the least good-looking. Saying Xu Yunzheng takes after you, if he did, he wouldn't find a partner. Isn't that right, Xu Yunzheng? You take after your mom and dad.\"","After speaking, Fang Yue looked at Xu Yunzheng and slipped a braised shrimp tail into his bowl.","\"Mom, are you personally attacking me again? How am I ugly? Tell me the truth, am I your biological son?\"","Looking at Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue and then at Shen Yin, Shen Lv's expression fell apart. Shen Yin has double eyelids, and so do Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue. Only he, in his whole family, has single eyelids.","This aroused deep suspicions in Shen Lv.","\"Who told you that you're our biological son? We picked you up from a garbage heap. Your suspicions were correct.\"","Shen Lv.........","\"When you find a partner, that's when you'll be our biological child.\"","Shen Tianzheng took the cue from Fang Yue and continued.","\"Dad, mom, it's my birthday today. Can we not talk about my upsetting situation?\"","The reason Shen Lv was unwilling to come home was his parents' nagging about getting married. He felt utterly powerless before it.","\"So you remember it's your birthday. You're another year older.\"","Shen Lv was on the verge of tears, hoping Xu Yunzheng would help him.","\"Uncle, what's wrong with your eyes?\"","Shen Lv's left eye kept winking at Xu Yunzheng.","\"Nothing, Uncle is about to make a wish.\"","Shen Lv stood up and put the birthday hat on Xu Yunzheng's head.","Shen Yin lit the candles on the cake.","\"Uncle will make a wish. Xu Yunzheng, would you like to blow out the candles with uncle?\"","Xu Yunzheng nodded his head.","\"Hold on, Wang Wang, are you sure about your wish?\"","\"Wang Wang is a dog?\" Biting his finger, Xu Yunzheng looked around when he heard the name Wang Wang. Could there really be a dog at grandma's house?","\"Mom, I told you, don’t call me by my nickname. Look, you never call sister by her nickname.\"","Shen Yin:???","\"That's because your sister is married. After getting married, you can't call her by her nickname. If you have the guts, get married and I won't call you Wang Wang.\"","Shen Lv... Was it that hard for him to have a meal or celebrate his birthday? Saying he's another year older, not wanting to be called by his nickname, and the talk turned to marriage again.","\"Wang Wang is Uncle?\"","The little one by the side, hearing the conversation between Fang Yue and Shen Lv, finally caught up to the fact: Wangwang was not a dog, but an uncle.","\"Correct, my pet name is Wangwang, and your mom is called Meow.\"","............","Shen Yin, just about to pick up some food with her chopsticks, stops abruptly upon hearing this. It was her first time hearing that she had another name, Meow.","Wangwang and Meow, sounds quite unique.","Shen Yin glanced at Xu Xiuhe. Xu Xiuhe mimed the words \"Meow.\"","Shen Yin immediately looked away, continuing to eat her food.","\"Is Meow mommy?\"","\"Yes, your mom's called Meow. It's no surprise you're mother and son: your mom used to always call me Dog.\"","\"Now she still does, but as a bachelor.\"","Fang Yue chimed in again. They can't be blamed for putting pressure, after all, which family's son hasn't gotten married by 30? It's not like they were poor.","\"Mom, my sweet mom, your son was wrong. He will find someone to marry tomorrow.\"","\"Weren't you pursuing Doctor Ji? How's that going?\"","Fang Yue's every utterance was like stepping on Shen Lv's landmine.","\"She got married a while ago.\"","As Shen Lv's voice trailed off, the dining table fell into a sudden silence.","His heartbreak was apparent at first glance.","Shen Lv likes beautiful women, and he has a lot of them saved on his Weibo. As the saying goes, love at first sight; that's how he felt for Ji Qingyan. Strange, but there was a certain allure - Ji Qingyan is the cool beauty type.","Shen Lv finds such looks irresistible. After pursuing her for a long time, gifting flowers and sending messages, Shen Tianzheng fell ill and Shen Lv became busy with work. For a good while, Shen Lv did not reach out to Ji Qingyan.","When everything in the company finally settled down, and he sought Ji Qingyan, she let him know she now had a boyfriend.","Shen Lv thought, having a boyfriend wasn't a problem, and as long as they weren't married, he would wait until they broke up.","A few days passed and Ji Qingyan sent Shen Lv a copy of her marriage certificate.","Shen Lv went on a self-pity spree for a few days, drinking quite a bit.","After regaining his strength, he threw himself into work. Not long after, Fang Yue brought it up again. That's like pouring salt on his wounds, isn't it?","\"How about I set you up for a blind date?\"","Fang Yue tentatively asked, having given up hope of Shen Lv finding a match on his own.","\"Whatever.\"","Despairing now, Shen Lv didn't care one way or the other.","\"Brother-in-law, how are you thinking about it? When can we step aside and discuss it in earnest? I really think Qingwan District is a good idea - it has great potential for growth.\"","\"Alright.\"","\"Another talk? Hurry up and eat, or the food will get cold. Yunzheng, what do you want to eat? Grandma will serve you.\"","\"I want to celebrate my birthday tomorrow.\"","Xu Yunzheng shook his head, wagging it from side to side.","\"Wow, Yunzheng, your birthday is still months away! Birthdays are not something you celebrate unless it's the right day.\"","\"When will my birthday be celebrated then? Yunzheng wants to celebrate.\"","\"Zheng Zheng's birthday is in the first half of the year, the day that Zheng Zheng was born. Zheng Zheng's birthday arrives before Uncle's, it has already passed and only after celebrating the New Year will be Zheng Zheng's birthday again. By then, Zheng Zheng can also make a wish.\"","Fang Yue patiently explained.","A puzzled expression appeared on Zheng Zheng's little face.","\"Grandma, is Zheng Zheng older than Uncle? But why is Uncle taller than Zheng Zheng?\"","\"Well, how can I explain this?\"","The little one's question stumped everyone.","\"Grandma said, the birthday is the day when one is born, Zheng Zheng's birthday was earlier than Uncle's, so Zheng Zheng was born before Uncle, so Zheng Zheng is older than Uncle!\"","\"Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha.\""]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Dragon and Phoenix Twins","paragraphs":["The Chinese-style furniture was sent to the furniture workshop at the far west of Qinghe Street by Xu Xiuhe's men.","Shen Yin registered a shop online and had someone take a detailed set of furniture photos to put up.","There weren't a few who came to ask about the furniture, but once the price was disclosed, they were deterred, and some even chided it as a black-hearted shop.","The most expensive Chinese-style furniture on the market retails for only a million or two, but here, it was priced at five million. Did they intend to rob?","Shen Yin did not respond to these comments. The quality and style of her works were here. They were more modern and sophisticated than the Chinese-style furniture on the market. True connoisseurs wouldn't mind the price at all.","Ever since Shu Yi was approached by Chang Huaiming and Nie Ling in the hospital, she disappeared for a long time.","Even the group chat of the 'Rags to Riches' trio went quiet for quite a while. Thanks to Qi Ji, who because of boredom, would communicate in the group every day, sending various messages.","\"[There's good news and bad news. Which do you want to hear first?]\"","Qi Ji tagged Shen Yin and Shu Yi in the group.","\"[Good news.]\"","\"[Bad news.]\"","Shen Yin and Shu Yi replied one after the other.","\"[I feel like having a hot pot. Let's go have hot pot, and when we meet, I'll announce the good and bad news.]\"","Qi Ji suggested.","She's been having cravings these past few days. She wanted to go out every day. Once a homebody who could stay at home for a week, she now yearned for outings every day.","How could pregnancy cause such a huge change?","\"[Do you want me to pick you up, or ask your husband to deliver you over?]\"","Shu Yi asked.","\"[Yes, yes; don’t let him bring me, we'll go to the hot pot restaurant.]\"","Shu Yi drove to the entrance of the Xue family's house and called Qi Ji.","Xue Jingrui was at work, and Qi Ji ran over to Ye Rong, cooing, \"Mom, I want to go out for hot pot with my friends.\"","Qi Ji's voice all sweet and soft, clinging to Ye Rong's arm.","Ye Rong was defenseless.","\"Qi Ji, let Mom send you there.\"","\"Thanks, Mom, but sister Shu Yi is already waiting for me outside.\"","\"Alright, be careful, all of you. Don't stay out too late. No drinking.\"","Ye Rong reached out and patted Qi Ji's nose.","Qi Ji bounded out of the house with joy. With her enormous belly, Ye Rong was worried. If something happened, what were they to do? Ye Rong began to resent her son again, for being too eager. They should have waited a couple more years, until Qi Ji was a little more mature before they had a child. She got lost in this thought, completely forgetting the fact that it was she who had been pushing for this in the first place.","As soon as Qi Ji decided to go out, she changed into a large, loose yellow pastry suit, wheat-colored corduroy pants underneath, matched with a pair of white snow boots.","Looking like a fresher who had just graduated from high school, she opened the passenger door of the car.","\"Stop, sweetheart; you should sit in the back. You are a pregnant woman; the passenger seat is a little risky. The back is safer.\"","Shu Yi deflected.","Upon hearing her, Qi Ji shut the passenger door and moved to the backseat.","Inside the car, the heater was on, blowing warmth. The first thing Qi Ji did after getting in was take off her yellow pastry suit.","\"Why are you still wearing so much inside?\" Shu Yi turned and incredulously remarked.","Inside Qi Ji’s outer clothing was a sweater.","\"The cold weather has set in recently, Brother Jingrui says it's risky for pregnant women to get sick, so I should keep myself warm and bundle up when going outside.\"","\"Wow, you have a good husband.\"","Upon hearing Shu Yi’s comment, Qi Ji felt a bit shy. She realized she had hardly ever called Jingrui her husband out loud.","\"Has Sister Shen Yin arrived?”","\"They should be here shortly.”","Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng were already waiting for them in the private room at the hot pot restaurant.","It was the first time that Shen Yin and Yunzheng visited a hot pot restaurant and they looked around curiously.","Shu Yi had parked the car, put on her hat, mask, and scarf, and then turned to look at Qi Ji, who was pulling on her puffy coat.","\"In just a short time, I feel like your belly has grown a lot.\" Shu Yi kept staring at Qi Ji’s belly.","\"Have they?\" Qi Ji merely smiled without saying anything more.","Following the waiter's guidance, they went straight to the private room.","\"Auntie, godmother.\"","Xu Yunzheng was the first to spot them.","\"Is it cold outside?\" asked Shen Yin.","\"It's cold, but it's okay, I dressed warmly.\" Qi Ji took off her yellow puffy coat and placed it on her chair.","Shen Yin pulled up a chair for Qi Ji.","\"I am going to announce some good news and bad news. Are you all excited?\"","\"We're excited!\" Yunzheng was the most enthusiastic, shouting out loud.","\"The good news is that I'm carrying twins, one boy and one girl. I just had the examination yesterday.\"","\"Wow! How lucky.” Shu Yi was amazed, she knew people with twins but had never met anyone with fraternal twins.","\"Indeed, that's great news.\"","Only Yunzheng was confused in the room, wondering why the adults were all so happy when there was no food on the table yet. He looked around, puzzled.","\"Yunzheng, Auntie Qi Ji has two little lives in her belly,\" Shu Yi explained.","\"What about the bad news?\" Shen Yin asked tentatively, a bit worried. She wondered if it had something to do with the babies.","\"The bad news is that the twins are the same size. The little princess already has a fiancé, but there is no one for the brother. How to solve this? I am still short of a daughter-in-law. I am sure the brother will be jealous. What if he gets upset and bullies his sister?”","Shen Yin and Shu Yi were speechless. Was this considered as bad news? They were horrified when Qi Ji said she had bad news.","Qi Ji sure had a long-term vision.","\"Given that you already have a son-in-law and you’re still short of a daughter-in-law, it is indeed some bad news.\"","\"Dear, future has its own future blessing. We don't have to worry about it. The brother won't get into trivialities. Don't think too much about it. What kind of hot pot do you want to eat?\" Shu Yi picked up the menu and looked at it again.","Fraternal twins are such a low probability event, but it happened to her good friend. Of course, this was worth celebrating.","\"We’ll have tomato hot pot, spicy hot pot, and mushroom hot pot.\" Said Qi Ji.","\"Okay, the pregnant woman is the boss here. We'll listen to you.\"","\"What do you want to eat son-in-law?\" Qi Ji asked Yunzheng.","\"Meat.\"","When the waiter brought in the food, the sight of Shu Yi stunned him.","\"Is that Shu Yi? The goddess?\"","Shu Yi didn’t expect to meet her own fan while dining.","The waiter was very young and seemed like a college student working part-time during the winter break. The sight of Shu Yi left him so excited that he stopped what he was doing.","“I am.”","“Wow, I'm your fan. Can you sign for me?”","The waiter took a pen from his pocket and handed it to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi, with a smile, took it and asked, \"Sign where?\"","The waiter looked around, found that he only had tissue paper in his pocket, so he pulled it out and said, \"Here, I really love you. I will cherish this tissue paper.”","\"Thank you for your love.\"","The waiter, faced with joy, could not suppress the smile on his face. Just as he was heading out the door, he suddenly turned back."]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: Shen Yin's Dream","paragraphs":["\"The goddess, isn't the drama you're in called 'I Just Want to Be With You'? It's about to be released soon, right? I really want to watch a goddess's romantic TV series.\"","Happiness etched on Shu Yi's face momentarily faded upon hearing this. She had almost forgotten that this drama had finished editing for a while and was set to air during the winter vacation.","\"Yes, soon.\"","\"Wow, I'm thrilled. I'm definitely going to follow it. I heard it's very sweet. A goddess should have sweet love.\"","After spouting these words, the waitress ran out joyfully, her steps now significantly lighter.","The room fell into silence for a while. Qi Ji did not know about Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan, but Shen Yin did. During this time, Shu Yi had not been staying at Ziyue Manor.","Often, she was unreachable by phone - \"The phone you dialed is switched off.\"","Chang Zhiyuan frequently asked Xu Xiuhe for any news of Shu Yi. Xu Xiuhe in turn asked Shen Yin for any information.","Shen Yin genuinely didn't know. Shu Yi seemed to vanish into thin air recently — untraceable unless she wanted to reach out.","Her phone was switched off, and she never replied to messages.","\"Shu Yi, have you been on set again lately? You've been barely visible in our group chat. It’s almost always Shen Yin and I chatting,\" asked Qi Ji.","\"I was feeling down, so I went back to Old Town to stay with my parents for a while,\" replied Shu Yi, clearly not in good spirits.","During that period, as she lay abed at night, she frequently dreamed of Chang Zhiyuan. The pain was unbearable, as the dreams brought back shared moments on set, or him making her a lunar charm, or his visit to Tibetan City.","The feeling was agonizing. She turned off her phone and spent her days engrossed in TV series, as if she had severed all connection from the outside world. She hadn't dared step out of the house since she returned.","Her parents didn't dare question what had happened.","She knew clearly that she had fallen for Chang Zhiyuan. Late at night, she'd sit blankly in bed, doing nothing for long periods.","During the day, while binging on series, she'd laugh at the sweet romance sequences on TV and cry endlessly at the tragedies.","Nobody knew about any of this.","\"Do you feel better now?\" asked Qi Ji.","Shu Yi had been asking herself the same question these past few days. Was she feeling better? It seemed like she wasn't.","\"He's contacted Xiuhe several times, asking him to find out from me where you are,\" said Shen Yin, as she began serving the cooked hotpot dishes.","\"Shu Yi, what happened between you and Chang Zhiyuan?\" Qi Ji asked, utterly puzzled. All she did was get pregnant, yet she felt like she'd been thrown out of the loop for a century.","\"Nothing major really, his parents just talked to me, said we aren't suitable for each other,\" replied Shu Yi.","\"When did this happen?\" asked Qi Ji, taken aback.","\"Not long after I returned from Tibetan City.\"","\"How is he now?\" inquired Shu Yi.","\"Healing takes time, a hundred days for fractured bones to mend. Xu Xiuhe told me he's been using a wheelchair these days.\"","\"A wheelchair?\" Qi Ji asked again, clearly shocked.","\"Chang Zhiyuan fell from the stairs and broke his leg.\"","\"Up next, I can't escape it anymore, so annoying, in two days' time, I'll be busy with the promotional activities for the new series.\" Shu Yi supporting her own forehead, picked up a piece of black chicken roll with her chopsticks. When she was in a bad mood, even good food tasted bland.","\"'I Just Want to Be With You'? Is Chang Zhiyuan the leading man?\"","Qi Ji asked.","Shu Yi nodded.","They were sure to release a photo of the male and female leads, as well as some behind-the-scenes footage. Shu Yi, looking back now at the series they both performed in, it just feels off every way she looked at it.","If only she could break her contract with the company. But doing so would cost so much money.","\"Don't think too much, enjoy the present, take one step at a time. When the boat gets to the bridge, it will straighten itself out naturally. The only way to relieve worries is through hot pot.\"","Qi Ji reached out to clamp a lot of meat for Shu Yi.","When they were returning home in the evening, Shen Yin and Zhengzheng were picked up by their driver, Qi Ji was also picked up by Xue Jingrui, Shu Yi, alone, drove back to the old city district.","\"Shu Yi, you're back, did you have fun?\" As soon as Shu Yi entered, Shu's Mother asked.","\"It was okay.\"","\"You should go out more, look at you, always locking yourself up at home, it must be so suffocating.\"","\"I got it, mom, I will return to my place tomorrow.\"","When Shen Yin got home, Xu Xiuhe had not yet returned, which was slightly unusual. Normally, Xu Xiuhe would be home by six or seven o’clock. It was now already 9 pm.","Zhengzheng was yawning.","Shen Yin pulled out her phone, as expected there was a text message from Xu Xiuhe stating he was working overtime and to not wait for him tonight.","Their villa had heating, so Shen Yin removed Zhengzheng's coat and her own as soon as she got home.","\"Mommy, I'm sleepy.\"","The little one covered his mouth and yawned. Shen Yin handed a cup to Zhengzheng, asking him to drink some water.","\"First shower, after the shower, can Zhengzheng then go to sleep?\"","\"Okay.\"","After Shen Yin gave Zhengzheng a bath, she carried him to her own bed.","By the time Shen Yin had finished freshening up, it was nearly 10 pm, she couldn't help but worry – at this point, he should be home by now.","Shen Yin dialed Xu Xiuhe's number.","Two seconds later, the call was answered.","\"Hello, wifey, you're still up?\"","\"Waiting for you. You're still working late?\"","\"Yes, a project is keeping me a bit busy, I might have to work late for a few days. You can go to sleep first, no need to wait for me.\"","\"Okay, be careful when you drive back home.\"","After hanging up the phone, Shen Yin laid down, went to sleep, and slept lightly.","She even had a dream, the dream was so realistic. In the dream, there was a middle-aged man, unable to surface in a body of water.","Shen Yin suddenly opened her eyes.","Water, a person, who can't get to the surface.","This was very familiar. Could it be Zhengzheng's dream?","She didn't recognize the man, she didn’t see his face; the water seemed to be a huge swimming pool.","He was struggling at first, but then she woke up. The man in the dream was just a silhouette, lone and helpless in the water.","An unexpected cold sweat broke out on Shen Yin; the dream she had was eerily the same dream she and Zhengzheng had before. In any past dreams, she had the ability to see who the protagonist was, who was in danger, but this time around, all she saw was a man unable to resurface in the water.","Unable to fall back to sleep, Shen Yin picked up her phone - it was precisely midnight.","Slowly, Shen Yin got up and entered Zhengzheng's room. Xu Yunzheng was sound asleep when she eased herself onto the bed next to him.","Approximately half an hour had passed, and sleep had yet to claim her when the bedroom door was pushed open.","There was no one in her room; the bedcovers were still tossed aside. The sight of the open door to Zhengzheng's room led Xu Xiuhe to wander in.","Without uttering a word, he consciously lightened his footsteps, making his way to the bedside.","\"You're back?\"","Shen Yin turned around, sitting up.","\"Mmm, I'm back. Why are you still awake?\" Xu Xiuhe inquired.","\"Had a dream and couldn't go back to sleep.\"","\"A dream?\""]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: The People in My Dreams","paragraphs":["\"Yes, it might be Zheng Zheng's dream. In the dream, I saw someone in the water. It was a man, but I couldn't see his face. I didn't recognize the background where he was floating on the surface either.\"","Shen Yin said she was a bit scared. It was too horrifying. If she had dreamed it herself, it wouldn't have been a big deal, but for little Zheng Zheng to have such a dream... If only they knew who the person was, it would be easier to handle. But now, they had no clue at all.","\"It's okay, don't be afraid. Not recognizing him is a good thing. It means he's not someone close to you. Don't panic,\" Xu Xiuhe said, patting Shen Yin gently.","In Xu Xiuhe's embrace, Shen Yin finally fell asleep.","The next morning when she woke up, Xu Xiuhe was still by her side.","\"Why haven't you gone to work yet?\"","\"I thought you might be scared if you woke up and found me gone.\"","\"I feel much better after sleeping.\"","Xu Xiuhe had prepared breakfast and only left for work after watching Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng finish eating.","After Xu Xiuhe left, Shen Yin took Xu Yunzheng upstairs. Having eaten his fill, Zheng Zheng pestered Shen Yin to play games with him.","Shen Yin took out various early education toys for Xu Yunzheng. Upon seeing them, he immediately ran over and picked up his toys, unable to put them down.","Shen Yin was lost in thought as she watched Zheng Zheng. Why did Zheng Zheng have that dream, and why did she dream about it after him? If only Zheng Zheng could be like other children, safe and sound.","\"Mom, this is how you put it together,\" Zheng Zheng said, piecing together the plastic parts bit by bit.","Before long, he had assembled half of a fire truck.","\"Zheng Zheng, you're amazing!\" Shen Yin praised.","\"Mom is amazing too!\"","\"What does Zheng Zheng want to be when he grows up?\"","\"Be what?\" Zheng Zheng fell into deep thought, seemingly not understanding the question.","\"Yes, what kind of person does Zheng Zheng want to become in the future?\"","\"Zheng Zheng wants to be a good person.\"","Shen Yin was speechless.","It was an ambitious goal, but the scope of being a \"good person\" was too broad. In this era, there were indeed quite a few bad people who were ruthless and committed all kinds of evil, as if they had no morals or heart.","By the same token, where there are villains, there are also embodiments of justice. Good people still made up the majority.","\"Zheng Zheng, there are many good people. What kind of good person do you want to be?\"","\"I want to be a good person who beats up bad people.\"","Shen Yin was struck speechless again.","It was a good answer, but Zheng Zheng still hadn't understood her question. She wanted to know what kind of dreams Zheng Zheng had for the future, what he wanted to become.","Clearly, it was too early to ask such a question.","\"Mom, you put this together,\" Zheng Zheng said, taking out plastic parts of another color from the toy box.","\"Zheng Zheng, what kind of vehicle is this?\" Shen Yin asked, pointing at the half-assembled fire truck.","\"This is a fire truck.\"","\"What does a fire truck do?\"","\"It puts out fires. Fire is scary.\"","\"Then what kind of vehicle will this one be when it's assembled?\"","\"An ambulance. It saves people.\"","Shen Yin picked up the small parts. They were quite complex, and it was her first time assembling them. All these toys were bought by Xu Xiuhe. There was even a room on the third floor specially for storing Zheng Zheng's toys.","\"Mom's not very good at this. Can Zheng Zheng teach Mom?\"","\"Okay.\"","The fire truck wasn't finished yet, but Xu Yunzheng scooted closer to Shen Yin. The two sat on the carpet, their distance narrowing.","\"This is the head,\" Zheng Zheng said, pointing to one of the small parts.","\"This is the body.\"","With Zheng Zheng's help, Shen Yin soon assembled the ambulance.","Just as they were about to continue assembling the fire truck, Shen Yin's phone rang.","\"Hello, Xiuhe.\"","\"Did you see the news online?\" Xu Xiuhe asked directly, without any other greeting.","\"What news online? I've been playing with the baby and his toys,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"The dream you had last night, it happened yesterday afternoon.\"","\"Huh?\" Shen Yin was shocked. Wasn't she supposed to have precognitive dreams? How had it turned into something that had already happened?","\"It's Xu Guimin. The news says he had a sudden incident while swimming and couldn't surface.\"","\"What?\"","Shen Yin was surprised again. Things were becoming increasingly strange. Hadn't she only dreamed about her loved ones and friends before? And they were all premonitions. Now she had dreamed about someone completely unrelated to her.","Xu Xiuhe wasn't even willing to call him \"Dad,\" so how could she possibly consider Xu Guimin as her father-in-law? Wasn't he just an unrelated person?","Moreover, it wasn't a premonition. The event had already happened before she dreamed about it. What use was that? Even if she wanted to save him, she couldn't. And the dream was so vague, just leaving her with a silhouette. She didn't even know who it was. It would have been better not to dream at all. It was a waste of time, leaving only fear behind.","But come to think of it, what about Zheng Zheng's dream? It was still unclear whether he had dreamed about the same person. After all, he was just a child who couldn't express himself clearly and was sometimes unwilling to talk. He might not even be able to distinguish between dreams and reality at times.","\"So now?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"There's no need to worry now. It's good that we've confirmed who the person in the dream was. It's a positive thing for us.\"","\"I mean, is he still...\"","Shen Yin didn't finish, but Xu Xiuhe understood what she meant.","\"I don't know. I just saw the news online. It's the headline, probably already trending in local hot searches. I don't know anything else.\"","\"Hmm...\"","Shen Yin didn't know what to say. Although Xu Xiuhe hated Xu Guimin, they were still related by blood.","\"It's best if nothing happens to him. Otherwise, it would be too easy on him.\"","Shen Yin was speechless.","Well, it seemed that blood relations meant nothing in this case. Perhaps some people were just not meant to be parents. If she were still in the Dasheng Dynasty, if she hadn't come here, she would probably feel the same way as Xu Xiuhe towards her worthless minister father. She would try every means to take revenge on him.","\"That's good, at least we know the outcome of this dream. But why did Zheng Zheng dream about it?\" Shen Yin still didn't understand.","\"Maybe it was just a coincidence, or perhaps it's because they're still related by blood.\"","\"Hmm, I'm not worried anymore. I'll bring you lunch at the company.\"","\"Okay, be careful on your way here.\"","After hanging up the phone, Shen Yin put it down.","Zheng Zheng had already put down his toys and even dragged over his toy box.","\"Mom, are we going to find Dad?\"","\"Yes, we are.\"","The little one was very attentive and understood perfectly.","\"Zheng Zheng will go with Mommy,\" he said.","Xu Yunzheng carefully placed his toys into the box, arranging them neatly one by one. If even one was slightly crooked, he would rearrange it.","\"No need to rush,\" his mother said. \"Mommy still needs to cook. After I finish making the meal, we'll take it to Daddy.\"","\"Okay, Zheng Zheng will help Mommy cook,\" the little boy replied.","After putting away all his toys, he followed Shen Yin downstairs."]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: Ward Torn Apart","paragraphs":["The online news continued to ferment, with many reporters camped out near the Xu Family residence, hoping to get the scoop on the latest developments.","How to describe the Xu Family situation? It was both significant and not so significant at the same time.","Sure, someone had fallen into the water and couldn't get out, but the Xu Family held a certain status in Rong City. Old Master Xu's mishap now affected the future development of the Xu Group.","The people of Rong City were well aware of the relationship between Xu Xiuhe, the CEO of Heyuan Group, and Xu Guimin. Now, the Xu Group also had Xu Zhengyang.","One born to the ex-wife, one to the current wife - the people of Rong City were eagerly waiting for the drama to unfold. Legally speaking, Xu Xiuhe also had inheritance rights.","Previously, when Xu Guimin hadn't encountered any issues, people didn't see much of a connection between Xu Xiuhe and Xu Guimin. But now it was different. With Xu Guimin's accident, Xu Xiuhe had become a point of interest.","At this moment, Xu Guimin's physical condition became extremely important.","In the hospital, Yang Cui was sprawled across Xu Guimin's legs, crying her eyes out.","\"Oh, Xu! You can't have anything happen to you. You must get better quickly. If you leave, what will I do? Who will protect me? Oh, Xu! Guimin! Wake up soon. How will Zhengyang and I manage without you? Boo-hoo, Guimin, wake up!\"","Xu Zhengyang sat in a chair, watching his mother cry, at a loss for words.","\"Please be quiet. The patient needs rest. He's not dead yet, so why are you wailing like it's a funeral? Don't the other patients need rest too?\"","The Little Nurse stood at the door, knocking, her tone rather unpleasant.","Yang Cui couldn't tolerate this. How dare a little nurse speak to her in such a manner?","\"How dare you speak like that? Who are you saying is having a funeral? Are you cursing my husband?\"","Yang Cui stood up and walked to the door, looking fierce. She raised her hand and slapped the Little Nurse across the face. The nurse cupped her cheek, her mouth agape, seemingly shocked.","She knew this patient's family had some influence, otherwise they wouldn't be in a VIP ward. But Rong City had plenty of influential people, and this wasn't the only one. Several other patients' families had already complained at the nurse's station.","And now she'd been slapped outright. Did they think she was easy to bully? She had people backing her too.","She was used to being overbearing, and when she saw patients or their families not heeding her advice, her tone would turn sour, and she'd start scolding loudly.","\"You dare hit me? Who do you think you are?\" The young and sturdy Little Nurse put one hand on her hip and swung the other towards Yang Cui.","She slapped Yang Cui three times across the face.","Not only was Yang Cui stunned, but Xu Zhengyang watching from the side was also dumbfounded. He hadn't expected the nurse to be so fierce and brave.","After recovering from the shock, Yang Cui and the Little Nurse began to scuffle. Yang Cui was shorter than the nurse, and as they grappled, Yang Cui slowly found herself at a disadvantage.","\"Zhengyang, why are you just sitting there like an idiot? Your mother is being beaten. Come and help me!\"","Yang Cui screamed hysterically.","Xu Zhengyang was clearly frightened by the situation. He put down his phone and ran over.","With his addition, the Little Nurse immediately found herself on the losing end.","\"Help! There's a hospital disturbance! The patient's family is beating people!\"","The Little Nurse's voice was also very loud.","Soon, many people gathered at the door of the ward - other patients' families, doctors, nurses, and even the department head rushed over.","\"What's going on? This is a hospital!\"","The three seemed not to hear, and the Little Nurse was being beaten badly.","Someone called for security to come up, and finally, the scuffling group was separated.","\"Cough, cough.\"","Xu Guimin on the hospital bed coughed a few times, and the room instantly fell silent.","This was a situation neither Yang Cui nor Xu Zhengyang had anticipated. Hadn't the doctor said Xu Guimin might become a vegetative patient? How was he coughing now?","\"Dad, Dad, you're finally awake?\" Xu Zhengyang immediately ran to the bedside.","\"Where am I?\" Xu Guimin's voice was extremely weak, and his gaze was still a bit unfocused as he looked around.","Yang Cui's hair was disheveled, two buttons had fallen off her clothes, and her face was bruised and swollen. Seeing Xu Guimin open his eyes, she burst into tears.","She crawled to the bedside, collapsing onto the bed with her hands on Xu Guimin's legs.","\"Oh, Guimin! Why did it take you so long to wake up? Do you know that while you were in a coma, your wife was almost beaten to death? Oh, oh, oh, if you hadn't woken up, how could I go on living? A widow and an orphan, even a little nurse bullies us now!\"","\"Dad, look at me.\" Xu Zhengyang's white shirt collar was torn.","In the ward, the others had retreated, and the nurse involved in the fight was led away by security.","Yang Cui suddenly said, \"Where is she? Where's that little nurse? I haven't gotten my revenge yet.\"","Xu Guimin looked at the crazed woman before him with disgust. Was this the same gentle Yang Cui who usually drank tea and tended to flowers?","\"Guimin, why aren't you saying anything?\"","Yang Cui grabbed Xu Guimin's hand and pressed it to her face.","Yang Cui's face was a mess of tears and snot, her makeup smeared. She looked ugly and frightening, like a shrew, a sight that made one's stomach turn.","\"Zhengyang, what happened to your clothes?\"","Xu Guimin looked at his son's collar. Even though his voice was weak, his words still carried some authority.","\"Dad, Mom was being hit by the little nurse just now, so I went to help break up the fight and got caught in the crossfire.\"","Xu Zhengyang knew what kind of person Xu Guimin was. Xu Guimin had always been strict with him since childhood, and if he knew that Xu Zhengyang had gotten involved in a fight, he would surely be angry.","\"Both of you, please leave. I want to be alone for a while.\"","Xu Guimin spoke up.","From the moment he woke up, there had been constant chattering and wailing in his ears. It was giving him a headache.","Xu Zhengyang and Yang Cui looked at each other, seemingly unable to believe what they had just heard. Xu Guimin was actually sending them away.","\"Dad, you've just woken up. Someone should stay with you. Let me take care of you.\"","Xu Guimin shook his head and said, \"Just go out, all of you. I want to be alone.\"","The mother and son left the ward very reluctantly.","Xu Guimin lay on the bed, his eyes fixed on the ceiling, lacking energy. It was as if he had taken a trip to the gates of hell.","The King of Hell hadn't taken his life and had sent him back, but the agony of drowning was worse than death. He never wanted to experience that again in this lifetime.","Outside the ward, Xu Zhengyang looked at Yang Cui and asked, \"Mom, what's wrong with Dad? Why did he make us leave?\"","Yang Cui shook her head. How would she know?","\"Mom, why don't you go back and change your clothes? And wash your face while you're at it.\"","Xu Zhengyang looked at his mother, noticing her smudged eyeliner. Indeed, she looked rather disheveled, almost ghostly, which was a bit frightening.","\"What's the matter, Zhengyang? Is it not enough that your father looks down on me? Now you're ashamed of me too?\"","\"Mom, that's not it.\"","Inside the room, Xu Guimin took out his phone."]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: Forced Marriage by the Boss","paragraphs":["\"Hello, Chairman Xu.\"","\"Can you help me find my son's phone number?\"","This question from Xu Guimin left the person on the other end bewildered. It was unheard of for a father to ask someone else for his own son's phone number.","After two seconds, the person suddenly remembered that Xu Guimin had more than one son. There was also an eldest son who hadn't returned home for nearly ten years.","In the CEO's office of Heyuan Group, Xu Xiuhe was handling various documents, not paying any attention to Xu Guimin's matter.","\"CEO, there are rumors outside that you'll return to inherit the shares of Xu Group,\" Liu Bo said as he entered.","\"Is there any news about Xu Guimin?\"","\"There's no news online about Xu Guimin's current physical condition.\"","\"Hmm, let's treat it as if nothing has happened.\"","\"But some people are saying that it's likely more bad news than good. Xu Guimin is quite old now, and his health was probably not great to begin with. Plus, with this weather, it's almost below zero...\"","\"Wasn't he having issues while swimming at home?\"","Xu Xiuhe had an impression of the family's swimming pool. The Xu family's pool was quite large; their villa was much bigger than Ziyue Manor. The pool in the courtyard alone was about 400 square meters, with a depth of about 1.6 meters. In theory, Xu Guimin shouldn't have just disappeared like that.","\"The exact reason is unknown, but in winter, no matter how good an outdoor pool is, the water will be cold.\"","\"I see, alright.\"","Seeing that Xu Xiuhe wasn't interested in this matter, Liu Bo didn't mention it further and continued to report on the recent work situation.","Just as he was about to leave, Xu Xiuhe called him back.","\"Liu Bo, have you set a wedding date?\"","Xu Xiuhe looked at Liu Bo and asked.","Liu Bo had thought Xu Xiuhe was just joking last time, but now it seemed that Xu Xiuhe wasn't the type to joke at all.","\"What's with that shocked expression? Haven't you set a date yet?\"","Liu Bo...","Could he say that he and Xiao Li'er were fake? If he did, would the CEO fire them both on the spot?","\"We've been quite busy with work lately, and neither of us has had time to discuss this matter.\"","\"Alright, that's my fault. I'll take care of the company's affairs for a while. You two take paid leave starting this afternoon. Go home and have a good discussion about the wedding arrangements and date. Try to have the wedding before the new year.\"","Liu Bo...","The CEO was being so good to him, not caring about his own inheritance rights, and now caring about his wedding. He felt overwhelmed by this favor.","\"Do you have any objections?\"","\"No, no.\" Did he dare to say he had any?","\"If not, then go pack up and leave with Xiao Li'er.\"","Liu Bo wanted to cry but had no tears. Indeed, one lie requires many more lies to cover it up.","Now the question was, how should he explain this to Xiao Li'er? Should he just say, \"Hey, fake girlfriend, the CEO wants us to get married before we come back to work\"?","With Xiao Li'er's personality, she'd probably call him a big idiot.","\"CEO, this isn't something I can decide on my own. Marriage is a matter for two people.\"","Liu Bo was making a last-ditch effort.","\"I understand. Go out and call Xiao Li'er in. I'll talk to her myself.\"","Liu Bo was truly impressed. How could there be such a meticulous boss, and his superior at that?","\"Go on.\"","Liu Bo left Xu Xiuhe's office door, feeling utterly helpless.","Xiao Li'er was engrossed in her work when Liu Bo walked to the assistant's office area. A group of assistants looked over, thinking that the \"Liu-Li CP\" hadn't been \"giving sugar\" lately, but here it was now.","\"Xiao Li, the CEO wants to see you,\" Liu Bo said, tapping on Xiao Li'er's desk.","Xiao Li'er thought she had misheard and asked again, \"What did you say?\"","\"The CEO wants to see you.\"","This time she heard clearly, and Xiao Li'er started to panic. The last time she went into the CEO's office was... well, the last time. She hadn't been talking badly about the CEO behind his back recently, nor had she sent any inappropriate messages in the group chat. Why was she being called into the office again?","\"Is it good news or bad news?\"","Xiao Li'er asked. It shouldn't be about work issues; work-related matters were usually handled by Liu Bo.","\"It's hard to say. It depends on how you look at it. Whether it's good or bad depends on you.\"","Liu Bo's response made Xiao Li'er even more anxious. Damn, what did he mean by \"it depends on how she looks at it\"?","\"Why are you being so wordy and beating around the bush? Can't you just tell me what it's about?\"","Xiao Li'er's tone became a bit agitated. She had been pretending to be in a relationship with Liu Bo for a while now, and their relationship had become incredibly close. She couldn't even distinguish what their relationship really was anymore. It seemed real yet fake, hard to say. Sometimes, she even felt like she actually had a boyfriend.","But soon after, she would come back to her senses. It was fake, each of them getting what they wanted and needed.","\"The CEO wants to give you time off, starting this afternoon and for the next few days,\" Liu Bo said.","\"That's good news, isn't it?\"","Xiao Li'er was a bit excited. Time off work, isn't that a good thing? Who genuinely wants to work, after all?","After being happy for just two seconds, Xiao Li'er's expression gradually froze. Why would they give her time off for no reason? Everyone else was still working, why just her?","Perhaps this \"time off\" had another meaning. Maybe the CEO wanted to fire her, and Liu Bo thought it would be too harsh to say it directly, so he was beating around the bush, saying the CEO wanted to give her time off.","\"Xiao Li'er, what's wrong with you? Your expression keeps changing from happy to terrified,\" Yang Mo asked from the side. She had never seen Xiao Li'er's face change so quickly.","\"It's nothing. I'll go in first.\"","As if walking on hot coals, each of Xiao Li'er's steps was incredibly heavy.","\"CEO,\" Xiao Li'er knocked on Xu Xiuhe's office door, her voice trembling.","\"Come in.\"","Hearing this, Xiao Li'er walked in, observing Xu Xiuhe's expression while preparing what she would say next.","Yes, she wanted to ask why they were suddenly planning to fire her. There should be a reason for everything, right?","\"What are your plans for the future?\" Xu Xiuhe looked up from his work as Xiao Li'er approached his desk.","This question caught Xiao Li'er off guard. Was he directly asking her to find a new job?","\"CEO, I'd like to ask, have I made any serious mistakes recently?\"","Xiao Li'er's tone was incredibly submissive. Fortunately, she didn't have an internal breakdown like last time. After all, once bitten, twice shy.","\"Hm? What do you mean?\"","Similarly, Xiao Li'er's question left Xu Xiuhe completely puzzled.","\"I want to know what plans I should have for the future.\"","\"Plans for marriage, of course. Didn't Liu Bo tell you?\"","!!!!","What?","Xiao Li'er's mind went blank. How could it be about this? And Liu Bo knew about it?","\"CEO, isn't it a bit too early to get married now? I'm only 26.\"","\"Is 26 too young? My wife is only 24, and my son is already two years old.\" Xu Xiuhe's face lit up with happiness as he mentioned Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng, his joy evident in his expression.","Xiao Li'er felt like she was being shown off to, but still had to agree: \"That's right, your wife is only 24, so young and beautiful.\""]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: Xu Guimin's Phone","paragraphs":["\"At 26, you're not young anymore. It's better to marry early, have children early, and recover early. Besides, Liu Bo isn't young either. He'll be 30 after the New Year.\"","\"But what if I get pregnant after marriage? I'd have to take maternity leave, which would really hinder my work.\"","Xiao Li'er was also looking for reasons. This was indeed too absurd. Who could have imagined that one day, she and her superior would be pressured into marriage by their top boss?","\"Don't worry about work. Just take the maternity leave when you need to. Heyuan Group has always been quite humane. Rest assured, pregnancy won't have any negative impact on female employees at Heyuan Group. Even if you have three children, Liu Bo can afford to raise them. He has shares in the company.\"","Xu Xiuhe, fearing that Xiao Li'er might look down on Liu Bo for being just an assistant, couldn't help speaking up for him.","\"But...\"","\"No more buts. You two have been together for quite a while, and you've known each other for almost two years, right? You know each other well and understand each other. Liu Bo's family background is simple, just him alone. He's worth choosing.\"","Xiao Li'er was in a dilemma. She did like Liu Bo, and she knew that Liu Bo had feelings for her too. They could be considered mutually fond of each other, but getting married now seemed too sudden and too early.","\"This afternoon, go back with Liu Bo and discuss it together. It's best if you can set the wedding date before the New Year. There's still nearly a month until then, so there's enough time. Any problems? If so, speak up, and I'll find a way to solve them for you.\"","Xiao Li'er now understood what Liu Bo meant. Whether this was good or bad depended on her attitude.","When Xiao Li'er came out, Liu Bo wasn't in the office. Yang Mo, Qin Zhenzhen, and the others all looked over at her.","\"Li'er, what's going on? What did the CEO want? Is it serious?\" Yang Mo asked worriedly.","\"The CEO wants me to go back this afternoon and discuss marriage plans with Liu Bo. He wants us to have the wedding before the New Year.\"","Xiao Li'er didn't know if this was good or bad for her, but deep down, she felt a little happy.","\"Wow, that's our CEO for you! Turns out he's the biggest fan of the 'Liu-Li' couple. He's practically forcing you to get married. He might as well bring the civil affairs bureau here!\"","\"The CEO is so awesome. Having such a boss is our blessing. Even if he cut my salary in half, I'd still be willing to work for him.\"","Yang Mo suddenly remembered when the CEO had called her and Qin Zhenzhen into his office to help them sign up for a matchmaking event.","\"I suddenly feel like Little Xu's CEO aura is gone. Now he's just a matchmaker, much more approachable. It's hard to imagine he used to be a cold and domineering CEO.\"","\"Maybe his wife is so great that his sense of happiness has increased, and he wants everyone around him to have a partner too.\"","Yang Mo looked up at Liu Bo's office and said, \"Li'er, your fiancé might have gone to the restroom. You should pack up your things. Don't forget to send us invitations when you get married.\"","Xiao Li'er slumped in her chair. Fiancé? Had the title changed so quickly?","After dealing with his employees' major life events, Xu Xiuhe got busy with his own work.","At 11:40 AM, the number of people in the company decreased. Most went to the cafeteria for lunch, while others headed to the nearby commercial street.","When Shen Yin arrived, Heyuan Group's building was much quieter than before.","Shen Yin entered the elevator, holding a lunch box in one hand and holding Yunzheng's hand with the other.","\"Mommy, press,\" the little one reached out, wanting to press the elevator button for their floor.","But being too short, he couldn't reach it even on tiptoes.","\"Yunzheng, do you want mommy to help?\"","\"Thank you, mommy.\"","After going upstairs, the mother and son went straight into Xu Xiuhe's office.","Xu Xiuhe didn't seem to expect Shen Yin to bring Yunzheng.","\"You didn't know we were coming this time,\" Shen Yin said.","\"My mistake. Next time you come, call me, and I'll come down to meet you.\"","\"Daddy!\" Xu Yunzheng trotted over to Xu Xiuhe excitedly.","\"Yunzheng.\" Xu Xiuhe stood up and took a couple of steps towards Yunzheng. When Yunzheng threw himself at him, he scooped him up and lifted him above his head.","Shen Yin walked to the sofa and placed the dishes from the lunch box on the nearby table.","\"Let's eat,\" Shen Yin called out.","\"Need to wash hands,\" Yunzheng looked down at his little hands in Xu Xiuhe's arms.","Shen Yin had always taught him to wash his hands before meals and after using the bathroom. Children have weak immune systems, so she was very particular about Yunzheng's living and eating habits.","Gradually, the little one had developed healthy habits, always asking to wash his hands before meals.","\"Mommy, wash hands.\"","\"Okay!\"","In Xu Xiuhe's office, there was a rest area with a bathroom. Led by Xu Xiuhe, the family of three went into the bathroom and washed their hands.","Coming out, Yunzheng saw the bed in the rest area and turned to look at Xu Xiuhe.","\"Daddy, bed.\"","\"Yes, that's where daddy takes naps sometimes.\"","\"Yunzheng wants to sleep.\"","\"So Yunzheng doesn't want to eat? You want to sleep now?\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng immediately shook his head. \"Eat. Sleep after eating.\"","They had just sat down on the sofa when the phone on the desk rang.","\"Phone, someone's calling.\"","Yunzheng hurried to the desk. The desk was a bit high, so the little one stood on tiptoes again, managed to reach the phone, and then rushed back to the sofa with it.","\"Daddy, answer.\"","\"You answer it.\"","This was Xu Xiuhe's private number, known only to a few family members and friends.","Yunzheng pressed the green answer button, but no one spoke.","\"Hello, who are you?\" Yunzheng asked in his childish voice.","After waiting for two seconds, there was still no response from the other end.","\"Daddy, he's not talking,\" Xu Yunzheng handed the phone to Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe took the phone and looked at the caller ID. It was an unfamiliar number.","\"Hello.\"","\"Hello, was that my grandson speaking just now?\" The man's voice was weak, his tone tentative.","\"No, I don't know you.\"","Xu Xiuhe hadn't expected that this person, whose fate was uncertain in the media's eyes, would call him.","After saying this, Xu Xiuhe hung up immediately.","\"Was that Xu Guimin?\" Shen Yin asked from the side.","\"Yes, it was him.\"","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe both fell silent. Only Zheng Zheng asked, \"Daddy, who was that? Why didn't they want to talk to Zheng Zheng?\"","\"It was someone who dialed the wrong number,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"Do they have the same surname as us? Are they also surnamed Xu?\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe suddenly realized that Xu Yunzheng could now understand conversations and felt a bit embarrassed about trying to deceive him.","\"Yes, they're also surnamed Xu,\" he admitted.","\"Let's eat now. The food will get cold if we wait any longer,\" Shen Yin said as she handed a spoon to Zheng Zheng.","Just then, Xu Xiuhe's phone rang again."]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: Go See Xu Guimin","paragraphs":["\"It's ringing again,\" Xu Xiuhe said, pointing at the phone.","Xu Guimin held the phone in his hand, hesitating for several seconds before finally answering.","\"Xiuhe, can you come and see me?\"","\"No.\"","...","Shen Yin, standing nearby, couldn't help but smile at the conversation between these two. One asked cautiously, while the other responded mercilessly. If it were her, she might have done the same.","\"Xiuhe, I've wronged you and your mother.\"","\"You don't deserve to mention my mom. If you have something to say, say it quickly. My time is limited. If you're here to admit your mistakes, don't bother. I don't need it.\"","Why didn't he realize this earlier? If he knew from the start that what he was doing was wrong, why did he do it? It's like those who knowingly break the law – their punishment is even more severe.","So, no matter what, Xu Xiuhe would never forgive Xu Guimin.","\"Xiuhe, I was wrong. Can you forgive me?\"","\"No. If I forgive you, how can I face my mother? Did you do right by her when you had an affair? Where were you when my mom was lying sick in the hospital bed? Where were you when her condition became critical? What right do you have to ask for my forgiveness?\" Xu Xiuhe demanded.","His mother's illness was inextricably linked to Xu Guimin. She had always known about his affair but never said anything. Over time, she became depressed and withdrawn. When one's mood is consistently low, all sorts of illnesses can manifest. But Xu Guimin hadn't noticed a thing. It wasn't until Sun Wenting was admitted to the hospital that he realized his wife was ill. He barely spent two days at the hospital before leaving, claiming he was busy with work. When Sun Wenting's condition became critical, he said he was in a meeting. By the time he arrived, she had already passed away. He didn't even get to see her one last time.","\"Xiuhe, I was wrong, truly wrong. When I see Wenting again, I'll apologize and make amends in person.\" Tears of remorse fell from Xu Guimin's eyes on the other end of the line.","\"If you have any conscience left, don't disturb her. Let her rest in peace in the other world. My mother's biggest mistake in this life was meeting you.\"","Xu Xiuhe's emotions were running high, his eyes reddening. From his earliest memories, Xu Guimin had rarely been home. Sun Wenting would always tell him that it was because his father was too busy with work to come home and play with him. His mother had always loved Xu Guimin, but that man had no heart, repeatedly betraying her.","Listening to this, Shen Yin felt a twinge in her heart. The last time the three of them visited Xu Xiuhe's mother's grave, Shen Yin had been struck by the photo on the tombstone.","The woman in the photo was clearly gentle to her very core. From her expression, one could almost glimpse her past.","As gentle as the waters of Jiangnan, as strong as thousand-year-old jade. When she looked up, she was like the bright moon; when she bowed her head, she was like the vast earth.","How could such a woman fall into a river of love that turned out to be hell?","Xu Xiuhe seemed to be lost in memories of his mother, the anger gradually fading from his face.","Caught up in his own recollections, Xu Guimin on the other end of the line could indeed be heard repenting. His choked voice continued unabated, but this repentance had come far too late to matter.","\"I want to see you. Is that alright?\" Xu Guimin pleaded once more.","\"What for? Isn't that son of yours enough for you to look at?\"","Xu Guimin had been through a brush with death, and such experiences often help people see things more clearly.","\"Zhengyang isn't as good as you.\"","\"And that woman isn't as good as my mom.\"","Xu Xiuhe's implication was clear. His mother, such a wonderful woman who never complained until her death, never fought or grasped for anything – and yet Xu Guimin still had an affair. Having a son who wasn't as good as him shouldn't be a big deal; he should be used to it by now.","Yang Cui might look innocent, but she had done so many terrible things behind the scenes. In front of Xu Guimin, she acted like a harmless rabbit, but when he wasn't looking, she was like a demon. He still couldn't forget how Yang Cui had viciously berated Mrs. Song.","\"It's my fault. I'm the one who's not good. I've only now realized that your mother was the only one who truly loved me.\"","Xu Guimin began to regret his actions. Why had he ever had an affair with Yang Cui? Because she was young, because she seemed delicate and refined. It was just as they say – the flowers at home never smell as sweet as the wild ones. But wild flowers are just that – wild. Now his realization had come too late.","\"Then can you come and save me?\" Xu Guimin begged, his voice weak, as if he only had one last breath left.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe exchanged glances. What did he mean? Save him?","\"Guimin, the doctor said you need more rest.\" A woman's voice suddenly came through the phone, and then the call was disconnected.","\"Honey, the doctor said you need to rest more. I'll keep your phone for you.\" Yang Cui entered from outside and took away Xu Guimin's phone.","Xu Guimin lay on the hospital bed, unable to get up. Even speaking was an effort; he had used all his strength to call Xu Xiuhe.","Yang Cui had changed her clothes and was wearing a face mask and sunglasses. Her face was so swollen that even the mask couldn't hide it.","Despite his weakness, Xu Guimin couldn't hide the look of disgust on his face.","\"Honey, look at my face. That impudent little nurse hit me. You need to get better quickly and avenge me.\"","Yang Cui, despite her age, was trying to act coy, which came across as both nauseating and cringeworthy.","Xu Guimin simply closed his eyes.","Back in the office, only Xu Yunzheng was eating. Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe had lost their appetites after Xu Guimin's last words.","They exchanged glances, with Shen Yin seeming to want to say something but holding back. She picked up her chopsticks and looked at Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe naturally knew what Shen Yin wanted to say, but considering Xu Yunzheng was still there, they couldn't discuss the matter just yet.","\"Let's eat first. After we finish, isn't it time for Zhengzheng to go to sleep?\" Xu Xiuhe looked down at Xu Yunzheng.","\"Yes, Daddy. Don't be sad,\" Zhengzheng put down his chopsticks and touched Xu Xiuhe's face.","Xu Xiuhe suddenly felt a lump in his throat. So Zhengzheng had noticed he was upset earlier?","\"Mm, Daddy's not sad. Daddy wants to be happy together with Zhengzheng.\"","\"Okay.\"","Zhengzheng picked up his chopsticks again and resumed eating.","After eating, the little one ran several laps around Xu Xiuhe's office. Xu Xiuhe kept him company the whole time. Sure enough, before long, the little one had no energy left. His eyes kept blinking and blinking until he finally fell asleep on the sofa.","\"Is he asleep?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes. I'll carry him to the rest room inside,\" Xu Xiuhe replied, his movements careful and gentle so as not to wake the little one.","After tucking Xu Yunzheng in and covering him with a blanket, Xu Xiuhe came back out.","\"Was he harmed?\" Shen Yin asked as soon as Xu Xiuhe emerged. Perhaps it was because she and Xu Yunzheng had both had that dream, coupled with what Xu Guimin had said at the end earlier - no matter how you looked at it, it seemed like he had been harmed and fallen into the water. After all, in her dream, she had only seen the image of that man unable to surface from the water. She hadn't seen how Xu Guimin had fallen in at the beginning.","\"It's possible. It's also possible that he was harmed by Xu Zhengyang and Yang Cui.\"","\"So what do you plan to do?\"","\"I don't know how to face him, but he asked me to save him. I don't know what to do.\"","Xu Xiuhe sat on the sofa, his mood low.","\"He's done so many wrong things, he'll face judgment for those. But he shouldn't be killed by that mother and son,\" Shen Yin replied.","\"How am I supposed to save him? Should I go get him out of the hospital? If things are really as we think, the hospital is probably heavily guarded.\"","\"Why don't you call back that number from earlier? It should be his.\"","\"I bet that phone number has already been turned off. Want to bet?\"","As he spoke, Xu Xiuhe picked up his phone, opened the recent call log, and dialed the number back.","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is powered off.\"","\"I'll go to the hospital this afternoon to take a look.\"","\"I'll go with you. I'm not comfortable with you going alone.\"","\"What about Zhengzheng?\"","\"We'll drop him off at my mom's later.\"","Shen Yin went to the rest room and saw Zhengzheng sleeping soundly. She gently picked him up.","Zhengzheng whimpered twice, and Shen Yin immediately patted him lightly. Zhengzheng quieted down.","Shen Yin carried Zhengzheng out of the rest room. In the office, Xu Xiuhe had taken advantage of this free moment to handle some documents.","\"Let's go. With you and Liu Assistant both away from the company, will there be any problems?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"It'll be fine, it's just half a day.\"","The two of them entered the elevator together. When they reached the underground parking garage, Xu Xiuhe drove while Shen Yin sat in the back seat holding Zhengzheng.","Afraid of disturbing Zhengzheng, they didn't talk the entire way.","Fang Yue was quite surprised to see the family of three arrive.","\"Yin Yin?\"","\"Mom, we need to trouble you to watch Zhengzheng this afternoon. Xu Xiuhe and I have some urgent business and can't take him with us.\"","\"Sure, no problem. Don't worry about it.\"","Fang Yue was actually delighted to have her eldest grandson come keep her company.","\"He's asleep now. He'll probably wake up around 4:30 in the afternoon and will want water when he wakes up.\"","\"Alright, you two go take care of your business. He'll be fine with me.\"","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe didn't enter the house. Fang Yue took Zhengzheng, and the two of them left.","\"Which hospital are they at?\"","\"Most likely Rong City No.1 Hospital. We'll go straight to the VIP ward there. Whichever door has people guarding it is probably Xu Guimin's room.\"","Xu Xiuhe drove the whole way.","Although he hated Xu Guimin and didn't want him to have a good outcome, he also didn't want Xu Guimin to ultimately die at the hands of that mother and son. That would be too easy for that ruthless pair.","When they arrived at Rong City No.1 Hospital, they went directly to the inpatient department and found the VIP ward.","There weren't many VIP rooms, and sure enough, at the end of the hallway, they saw several people standing guard outside a door.","Xu Xiuhe walked straight towards that room, with Shen Yin following behind him.","As soon as they got close, the people at the door blocked their way.","\"Excuse me, sir, madam, there's an important patient in this room. No unauthorized entry allowed.\"","\"Move aside,\" Xu Xiuhe said, looking at the group with warning in his eyes.","Seeing this, the men immediately stood up straight, hands outstretched, ready to take action. Shen Yin, who had just caught up, swept her leg, kicking the face of the man who was about to make a move. Clutching his kicked face, he said defiantly, \"What are you all standing around for?\"","\"Do you want to come at us one by one, or all together?\" Shen Yin taunted.","They dared to lay hands on Xu Xiuhe without asking her first? She might look delicate, but when it came to fighting, she had never been afraid of anyone.","\"All together,\" Xu Xiuhe said. How could he possibly let Shen Yin fight them alone?","Shen Yin moved swiftly, her strikes accurate and fierce. Xu Xiuhe didn't even need to step in. The men on the other side couldn't gain any advantage at all.","The noise of the fight had already attracted quite a few people to come out of their rooms to watch.","It was quite interesting, this hospital ward. There had been a fight in the morning, and now another one in the afternoon. Each fight was more exciting than the last.","\"If you don't want to lose any arms or legs, stop now,\" Shen Yin warned again.","Hearing this, the men looked at each other, then back at Shen Yin. They actually saw killing intent in her eyes.","\"Stay put outside,\" Shen Yin said as she and Xu Xiuhe entered the room.","Inside the room was only Xu Guimin, lying pale-faced on the bed, looking quite pitiful.","\"How do we get him out of here?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"We'll send him to another hospital. I'll carry him down in a bit.\"","Their conversation woke Xu Guimin on the bed.","\"Xiuhe, you came after all,\" Xu Guimin said weakly, opening his eyes.","\"Shut up. I just don't want to see you die so easily,\" Xu Xiuhe said, not even willing to carry Xu Guimin.","Shen Yin saw the disgust on Xu Xiuhe's face. So, she walked out of the room and said to the battered men at the door, \"Help me carry the patient in the room downstairs. 20,000 yuan.\"","Hearing this, the men's eyes lit up.","\"Me, me!\"","\"I can do it, I'm strong!\"","\"I can do it, I barely fought against you just now.\"","Shen Yin looked at the last person who spoke and said, \"Alright, you.\"","The others looked at the man who spoke last with resentful eyes.","This man walked into the room and said he would carry the patient.","Xu Xiuhe glanced at Shen Yin and immediately understood that this was arranged by her. He felt as if he were the delicate wife in this situation. The way Shen Yin had just reached out to protect him behind her was something he would probably never forget for the rest of his life.","The man was carrying Xu Guimin on his back.","Xu Xiuhe walked over and directly removed the IV drip from Xu Guimin's hand.","\"Where are you carrying him?\"","\"Downstairs.\"","Xu Xiuhe led the way, with Shen Yin and Xu Guimin behind him.","Xu Xiuhe drove the car, taking Xu Guimin to another hospital.","After arranging the hospital room, he found a caregiver. He instructed the doctor to treat him well, then contacted some security guards to come over. He directed them to guard the door of the hospital room no matter what, and to call him immediately if anyone tried to force their way in.","After doing all this, the two of them decided to go back.","Xu Guimin kept calling out as he watched Xu Xiuhe's retreating figure, \"Xiuhe, Xiuhe.\"","Xu Xiuhe never responded.","\"We can go back directly now. As long as he can stay alive, that's enough. We'll discuss the rest when we get back tonight.\""]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: The Madwoman","paragraphs":["After making all the arrangements, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe left the hospital room.","By the time they returned to Yuelan Manor, night had fallen.","\"You're finally back. Any longer and Zheng would have cried from feeling abandoned,\" Fang Yue said, holding Zheng in her arms. Upon seeing Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe, the child's expression immediately brightened.","Why did they do this to him? He thought his parents had abandoned him. He had just taken a nap, and when he woke up, his parents were nowhere to be seen, and he was in a different place.","\"Mama,\" Xu Yunzheng reached out, gesturing for Shen Yin to hold him.","Shen Yin took Zheng from Fang Yue's arms. As soon as he was in Shen Yin's embrace, Zheng planted a kiss on her cheek.","\"Hurry, go wash your hands. The housekeeper has already prepared dinner,\" Fang Yue urged.","\"Why didn't you start eating without us?\" Shen Yin asked.","It was already past six, and in winter it gets dark early. By this time, they should have finished dinner.","\"We were about to call and ask if you were coming back. If you did return and we had finished eating, there wouldn't be anything left for you.\"","Shen Tianzheng came down from upstairs.","\"Ah, Yin and Xiuhe are back,\" Shen Tianzheng greeted them.","\"Yes, Dad. Are you feeling better?\" Xu Xiuhe walked to the dining table and arranged the chairs neatly.","\"Much better.\"","Shen Lv hadn't returned, so there were five people at the table. Shen Yin placed the little one in the high chair.","\"You left in such a hurry this afternoon. I was worried something had happened, but I didn't want to disturb you by calling,\" Fang Yue inquired.","Shen Yin didn't know how to respond. This was Xu Xiuhe's matter, and she wasn't sure how to answer properly, so she shifted her gaze to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Haven't you seen the news? Xu Guimin is in trouble. No matter how strained their relationship is, Xiuhe can't change the fact that his surname is Xu,\" Shen Tianzheng glanced at Fang Yue, who suddenly realized her oversight.","Shen Tianzheng started eating his rice. Although he was also curious about the aftermath of this incident, there was currently no concrete information online.","He was waiting patiently, knowing that without him having to ask anything, Fang Yue would soon inquire about every detail.","Sure enough, Fang Yue began firing off one question after another.","Wealthy housewives tend to be bored and particularly gossipy about such matters. This incident involved her son-in-law's family, so she was even more interested.","\"So, what's his current situation?\" Fang Yue asked. She knew about the poor relationship between Xu Xiuhe and Xu Guimin, so she didn't directly ask about \"your father's\" condition.","\"He's still in the hospital. I don't know the specifics,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"So he's still alive?\" Fang Yue's gossip instinct was fully awakened.","\"Ahem, ahem...\" Shen Tianzheng fake-coughed twice. What kind of question was that? It was tantamount to asking if he was dead yet.","\"Mm,\" Xu Xiuhe responded.","\"So what were you doing all afternoon? You were gone for so long,\" Fang Yue continued to probe.","\"We went to the hospital in the afternoon. He called me asking for help. I suspect his falling into the water wasn't as simple as it seems.\"","Xu Xiuhe explained everything. If it were anyone else, he wouldn't have said anything, but these were his in-laws, so there was no need to keep secrets.","Fang Yue perked up even more at this information.","\"Xiuhe, I'm not speaking ill of people, but that Yang Cui is indeed a vicious character. She's capable of the most ruthless acts.\"","Fang Yue had met Yang Cui before. Women like them, who stay at home with nothing to do, always have their own social circles. They often meet for tea, snacks, or mahjong. She had even played mahjong with Yang Cui a few years ago.","Her impression of Yang Cui was that she was manipulative and calculating. Even during a mahjong game, she would spend ages planning her moves.","Later, when Shen Yin told her about Yang Cui trying to harm her great-grandson, she realized this woman might even be capable of murder.","So when Xu Xiuhe mentioned that Xu Guimin's fall into the water might not be that simple, Fang Yue's first thought was that Yang Cui was behind it.","Xu Xiuhe had lived under the same roof with Yang Cui for a few years, so he knew very well what kind of person she was. That woman had one face in public and another in private. Considering the previous incidents, there probably wasn't a single one that she wasn't involved in. She could truly be described as having a heart of snake and scorpion.","\"I'm still investigating the specifics. This afternoon, Yin and I moved Xu Guimin to a different location.\"","\"You two?\" Shen Tianzheng was a bit shocked. These two spent the afternoon moving Xu Guimin? What was the situation now? Xu Guimin asked Xu Xiuhe to save him, and Xu Xiuhe actually rescued him? Was it that easy? Would Yang Cui allow it?","\"He was originally in the First People's Hospital, but we've moved him to another hospital now.\"","\"And Yang Cui agreed to this? If Xu Guimin asked to be rescued, surely there must have been people guarding his hospital room door,\" Fang Yue voiced the question Shen Tianzheng wanted to ask. See? He didn't even need to open his mouth; Fang Yue would ask all the questions he had in mind.","\"Yes, there were guards, but Yang Cui wasn't in the room, and the people outside didn't dare to really intervene.\"","Xu Xiuhe spoke while eating, his eyes darting towards Shen Yin. He dared not say that those people didn't dare to act because they couldn't overpower Shen Yin.","He had never seen Shen Yin fight in person before, but this afternoon, he was truly impressed by her aura. Even her way of speaking was like that of an ancient hero, drawing their sword to right wrongs.","Shen Yin had no idea what Xu Xiuhe was thinking, nor did she have time to consider whether her tone had been too arrogant. She simply couldn't stand anyone laying a hand on Xu Xiuhe. He was her man, and no one dared to touch him.","\"That sounds relatively smooth. But what about later? They are legally married after all. When the husband disappears, she'll surely look for him. With today's technology, they'll probably find Xu Guimin's location by tonight,\" Fang Yue offered her thoughts.","Meanwhile, in the Xu family villa, Yang Cui was furiously smashing various objects on the table.","\"Zhengyang, just look at the kind of bodyguards you hired. Several grown men couldn't even guard a small hospital room door?\" she raged.","\"Mom, the bodyguard said he couldn't overpower the two people who came,\" Xu Zhengyang replied.","\"What a bunch of idiots! How can so many of you fail to subdue just two people?\" Yang Cui completely forgot that she and Xu Zhengyang had also failed to overpower a single nurse.","\"Where is your father now? We must bring him back, no matter the cost.\"","\"He's at the Second Hospital.\"","\"Why are you all just standing there? Go and bring him back immediately! I'm his wife!\" The woman was hysterical with anger.","\"Mom, please calm down. It's so late now. Why don't we wait until tomorrow?\"","\"Wait until tomorrow? Why don't we wait until next year while we're at it?\""]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: Always Together","paragraphs":["As expected, Xu Zhengyang brought people to the Second Hospital that evening, heading straight for Xu Guimin's ward. There were indeed several people guarding the door of the ward.","Xu Zhengyang was prepared; he had brought quite a few people with him, confident he could take his father back. However, before they could even get close to the ward door, an alarm went off. Perhaps feeling guilty, Xu Zhengyang lost his nerve and immediately retreated with his men.","That night, the family of three returned to Ziyue Manor. Zhengzheng had slept too much during the day and showed no signs of drowsiness even at nine o'clock. Shen Yin had no choice but to stay and play with Zhengzheng in her room.","Xu Xiuhe was also too preoccupied to sleep. He shut himself in the study, pondering how to handle this thorny issue. For him, this matter was far more challenging than any work-related problem.","Xu Xiuhe felt utterly conflicted. While he harbored a deep hatred for Xu Guimin, he couldn't bear to see him harmed by others. Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue were right; no matter what, he couldn't change the fact that his surname was Xu.","No matter how much he tried to avoid it, he couldn't escape.","The blood of Xu Guimin flowed through his veins, and he couldn't ignore this situation.","As he was lost in thought, his phone on the desk rang. Xu Xiuhe answered; it was Xue Jingrui making a group voice call.","\"Hey, Xiuhe, I saw today's trending news,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"Yeah, I saw him this afternoon.\"","\"How is he?\"","\"Not dead yet.\"","\"The old man's got a tough life. People outside are saying he might already be...\"","Chang Zhiyuan had joined the call at some point.","\"If you need any help, just say the word. We're brothers after all,\" Xue Jingrui offered.","\"Alright, thanks.\"","\"So, what's your plan now? Are you going to respond to the news?\"","\"I've taken him away from Yang Cui.\"","\"What? Did I hear that right? You got Xu Guimin away from Yang Cui?\" Chang Zhiyuan exclaimed in shock.","\"You heard correctly.\"","\"Brother, I'm impressed. As soon as my leg heals and I can walk, I'll come to praise you in person.\"","\"Did you catch up with Shu Yi?\" Xue Jingrui interjected.","\"Has Qi Ji fallen for you?\" Chang Zhiyuan retorted, not to be outdone.","\"Come on, let's hurt each other's feelings. Who can't do that?\" Chang Zhiyuan said thickly. Just from his tone of voice, one could imagine his expression – eyes half-closed, a look of resignation on his face.","\"You two are being a bit childish,\" Xu Xiuhe commented.","\"You can leave now. Your problem is much harder than ours,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, his words sharp and to the point as always.","Xu Xiuhe hung up without another word.","\"Did he really leave?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"What do you think? He probably needs to figure out how to handle this sudden situation. Now that he's got the person, there's a ton of stuff to deal with,\" Xue Jingrui replied.","\"So, how are things with you and Qi Ji? I heard you're expecting twins, or was it a boy and a girl?\" Chang Zhiyuan teased.","\"You've got it wrong. Qi Ji is the one who's pregnant. How the hell would I, a grown man, get pregnant?\" Xue Jingrui shot back.","\"Not bad, brother. You've got a complete family in one go. You still haven't answered my first question, though.\"","\"What question?\" Xue Jingrui feigned ignorance.","\"About Qi Ji, of course. You're having a baby together, so how's your relationship? How do you two get along now?\"","Xue Jingrui thought for a moment. His relationship with Qi Ji was quite comfortable. He could feel that Qi Ji depended on him, but he wasn't sure if that was love.","\"Same as always,\" he finally said.","\"Have you made your feelings clear?\" Chang Zhiyuan pressed.","\"Not yet. I'm afraid of scaring her off.\"","\"Are you not man enough? If you don't tell her, how will she know how you feel? Men should be more proactive. Learn from me – if you love someone, say it out loud.\"","\"You mean like how you scared Shu Yi into disappearing for months?\" The two continued their childish banter, neither willing to back down.","\"If you're not teasing me, does that mean you're feeling insecure? Jingrui, we're not the same. You're already together, and the baby's almost here. She's not going to run away now, is she? Sometimes I envy you and Xiuhe. You've both married the women you love, and there's nothing standing in your way anymore. Not like me – my family doesn't approve, and she can't get past that hurdle.\"","\"Take it slow. Keep trying. You have to believe that sincerity can move people. So, you're saying I should tell her?\"","\"What are you saving it for? Chinese New Year?\"","As soon as Chang Zhiyuan finished speaking, Xue Jingrui hung up the phone.","Ah, he was the most pitiful one, wasn't he? With a broken leg, unable to walk, and Shu Yi avoiding him. Even when they were promoting their TV drama, Shu Yi was overly professional, conscientious to a fault, without a hint of personal emotion.","After hanging up, Xue Jingrui rushed to Qi Ji's room. As soon as he entered, Ye Rong shooed him out.","\"It's late, and Qi Ji is about to sleep. What are you doing here?\" Ye Rong asked, looking annoyed.","\"Mom, I need to talk to Qi Ji about something very important. Extremely important,\" Xue Jingrui insisted.","\"Can't it wait until tomorrow?\" Ye Rong asked.","Xue Jingrui considered that Qi Ji was already in bed, and getting up would be too much trouble. He was about to give up when he thought, what if he lost his courage by tomorrow? He had to do it now, while he was fired up.","\"It can't. It's too important,\" he said firmly.","Seeing Xue Jingrui's serious and determined expression, Ye Rong stopped objecting.","\"Qi Ji, put on a coat. Make sure to stay warm,\" Ye Rong said, handing Qi Ji her coat.","\"Thanks, Mom,\" Qi Ji replied.","Qi Ji followed Xue Jingrui to the adjacent study.","\"Jingrui, why did you call me out so late? Is there something urgent?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"Yes.\"","\"Qi Ji, do you like me?\"","\"Of course I do.\"","Xue Jingrui was taken aback for a moment.","\"I don't mean the kind of like where you see me as a brother. I mean the kind of like – no, love – between a man and a woman. The kind of love I feel for you.\"","Qi Ji was stunned by this sudden confession. Was this really happening? He called her out in the middle of the night to confess his love?","\"Jingrui, are you... confessing your love to me?\" Qi Ji knew that they had a ambiguous relationship before, and she could feel that Jingrui liked her, but she never expected him to say it out loud so soon.","\"Yes, I am confessing. I love you, and I want to be with you always.\"","...","Was this how older men confessed their love? So direct, without any beating around the bush?","Qi Ji's face turned red with embarrassment.","\"Oh,\" was all she could manage.","\"You can't just say 'oh.' What do you think? Do you love me?\" Xue Jingrui pressed.","\"Why are you being so direct? Don't you think I might be shy?\" Qi Ji said in a small voice, almost as if she were pouting.","\"Then how should I ask? Can you stay with me forever?\"","\"I want to stay with you forever.\"","Qi Ji didn't beat around the bush either. This was how adult love should be - ambiguous when it's ambiguous, and straightforward once things are clear.","After getting the answer he wanted, Xue Jingrui wished he could scoop Qi Ji into his arms and spin him around. However, his delicate wife was pregnant, so he could only imagine it.","\"Can I kiss you?\""]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: Car Accident","paragraphs":["Qi Ji lowered her head and took two steps back. Xue Jingrui followed, standing a head taller than her.","Xue Jingrui raised his hands and cupped Qi Ji's face. Her face was small, fitting perfectly in his palms.","Qi Ji didn't dare move as they drew closer.","\"Knock, knock, knock.\"","Suddenly, someone knocked on the study door. Xue Jingrui startled, immediately releasing Qi Ji and stepping back.","\"Qi Ji, it's time for bed. It's getting late.\"","Xue Jingrui glanced at the clock in the study. It was exactly 10 PM. His mother's timing was impeccable.","Qi Ji had grown accustomed to this routine. Ever since she became pregnant, Ye Rong had been bustling about, preparing various meals during the day, reminding her to sleep at night, and even getting up to tuck her in.","One could say that Ye Rong's care was comprehensive. Qi Ji's daily routine had become so regular that even her mental state had visibly improved.","Xue Jingrui opened the door, feeling somewhat annoyed. They were so close to kissing, only to be interrupted at the last moment.","\"Qi Ji, come sleep with Mom.\" Ye Rong walked up to Qi Ji, took her hand, and led her towards the door. As they reached the doorway, Ye Rong shot Xue Jingrui a knowing look.","She wasn't oblivious to her son's intentions. Seeing Qi Ji's flushed cheeks, she understood all too well. If she had come any later, who knows what might have happened...","Back in the bedroom, Qi Ji lay down, and Ye Rong tucked her in.","\"Sweetie, you're further along now, and with twins. You need to be careful. Jingrui might not know his limits, and we can't risk any complications at this stage.\"","\"I understand, Mom.\"","Early the next morning, Xu Xiuhe received a call from the hospital, informing him that the patient had stabilized and was out of danger.","That morning, news about Xu Guimin trended again, but this time the headline was Yang Cui's voluntary disclosure.","Yang Cui held a press conference. In the video, she appeared frail and pitiful.","\"My husband, Xu Guimin, had an accident while swimming. As soon as I found out, I rushed him to the hospital. When he finally woke up, my son and I went home briefly. When we returned, my husband had vanished.\"","The woman burst into tears, her face a picture of sorrow that tugged at the heartstrings.","\"Mr. Xu, do you have any leads? Have you reported this to the police?\" a reporter asked.","\"We haven't reported it yet. What I can say is that he's probably not in danger. After all, they are father and son.\"","Her words left much to the imagination.","The press conference was being live-streamed, with a flurry of diverse comments.","[Doesn't Xu Guimin have another son?]","[Yes, the CEO of Heyuan Group, Xu Xiuhe. I heard he's self-made, started from scratch.]","[I also heard that Xu Xiuhe left the Xu family right after his college entrance exams.]","[That suggests their father-son relationship isn't good. This woman isn't Xu Xiuhe's birth mother.]","Soon, public opinion shifted to Xu Xiuhe. Many people messaged his Weibo account, asking if he had indeed taken Xu Guimin away.","Xu Xiuhe was at the company. Given the current situation, he couldn't ignore it any longer.","Liu Bo wasn't in the office, but fortunately, the assistant department was capable.","Xu Xiuhe walked into the office area and said, \"Prepare for a press conference shortly.\"","The assistant department immediately understood.","The press conference was set in Heyuan Group's large conference room. No reporters, no media, just a group of assistants. This conference had no other purpose than to simply clarify the situation.","\"Regarding Xu Guimin, he is indeed my biological father. He called saying he missed me, and as his nominal son, I brought him back for treatment. Is there a problem with that?\"","The number of viewers in the live stream was no less than Yang Cui's, perhaps even several times more.","[No problem at all. They are father and son, after all.]","[In ancient times, Xu Xiuhe would be the eldest legitimate son.]","[So how is Xu Guimin's condition now?]","[Yeah, how is he? We want to know about the future development of the Xu Group. It affects our housing and stock purchases.]","\"CEO, they're all asking about Xu Guimin's condition,\" Qin Zhenzhen's voice came through Xu Xiuhe's earpiece.","\"Regarding Xu Guimin, he is now out of danger.\"","After the press conference, Heyuan Group's stock price rose significantly.","Yang Cui was furious. She had only intended to garner sympathy and use public opinion to pressure Xu Xiuhe, but she had forgotten that the person they had been ignoring was, after all, the Xu family's eldest son.","\"Mom, what do we do now?\"","\"You're asking me? How should I know? Didn't I tell you to bring your father back last night?\"","\"Mom, you don't understand. There's an alarm on his hospital room door.\"","\"Now we can only target his wife. What about Zhou Man? Do we have any concrete evidence?\"","\"Useless.\"","\"Mom, if worse comes to worst...\"","The man didn't finish his sentence, but Yang Cui understood what Xu Zhengyang was suggesting. She didn't stop him.","Several days later, Xu Xiuhe entered Xu Guimin's hospital room.","Xu Guimin could now get out of bed. As soon as Xu Xiuhe entered, Xu Guimin wiped away a tear. \"Xiuhe, you've finally come.\"","\"Why did you ask me to save you?\"","Xu Guimin looked at Xu Xiuhe, then lowered his head, remaining silent.","\"If you don't speak, I'm leaving.\"","Xu Xiuhe walked to the door, but Xu Guimin still didn't say a word.","Xu Xiuhe sat in his car, fuming all the way home. He shouldn't have taken Xu Guimin out of the First Hospital.","\"Is this Ms. Shen Yin? Your partner has been in a car accident. The situation is quite serious, and he's been sent to the First Hospital.\"","Shen Yin felt as if something had exploded in her mind. What was going on? Had the doctor dialed the wrong number? Her partner wasn't Xu Xiuhe?","It must be fake. Why hadn't she dreamed about this? It must be fake, it must be fake. The woman refused to believe this phone call.","\"Is it Xu Xiuhe?\"","Shen Yin asked, her voice trembling.","\"Yes, that's correct. It's Xu Xiuhe.\"","For a moment, it felt as if the sky had fallen. Shen Yin froze for two seconds, then snapped back to reality and picked up Zheng Zheng.","\"Mommy, what's wrong?\"","Shen Yin was on the verge of tears. How could this be happening?","\"Mommy's fine.\"","Shen Yin didn't know how to explain this to such a young child. Was this what they called fate? They had perfectly avoided the car accident last time, but now, did Xu Xiuhe have to face this alone?","Shen Yin didn't even dare to imagine what state Xu Xiuhe was in now.","\"Hello? Why did it take you so long to answer? I was scared to death. Don't panic, go to the hospital first. I'm coming to the hospital to be with you right away,\" Shu Yi comforted over the phone. She and Chang Zhiyuan were in the middle of promoting their new drama when they saw the news online.","So many people get into car accidents every day, and they never paid attention before. Only when it happened to their friend did they feel anxious.","After hanging up the phone, Shen Yin forced herself to calm down, constantly reassuring herself.","Her phone rang again. It was Shen Lv calling.","\"Don't worry, I'm almost at your door. Stay at home and try not to panic.\"","\"Okay.\"","Soon after, Shen Lv knocked on the door. During this time, Shen Yin didn't dare to check any information online. She packed all the things Zhengzheng would need to go out, just in time for Shen Lv's arrival.","\"Brother.\" Shen Yin opened the door while holding Zhengzheng. Shen Lv's car was parked in the yard.","\"I'll take you to the hospital.\"","When Shen Yin saw Shen Lv, she finally couldn't hold back anymore. Tears started falling down her cheeks. No matter how strong she was, she was still a woman. It was already remarkable that she could maintain her composure when facing her husband's unknown fate.","Shen Yin's state was a bit better than Shen Lv had anticipated.","Sitting in the car, Shen Yin's mind was filled with thoughts. She had never felt a road to be so long before. They had been driving for so long, why hadn't they reached the hospital yet?","When they arrived at the hospital entrance, it was already surrounded by reporters, with security guards struggling to maintain order. The scene was even more chaotic than for a celebrity.","How could it not be? Xu Xiuhe was already a well-known business figure in Rong City, and recently he had been mentioned again due to Xu Guimin's incident. Add to that the traffic he and Shen Yin naturally attracted, with a wave of CP fans online, their fame was no less than that of popular celebrities. Such a major incident was far more newsworthy than Xu Guimin's fall into the water.","\"Mrs. Xu, hello. Your husband has been in such a serious accident. How are you feeling right now?\"","Idiot. Which news outlet was this reporter from? The other reporters were stunned by this bespectacled man's question. Did he lack brains or emotional intelligence?","\"Move aside,\" Shen Yin said coldly, still holding Zhengzheng in her arms.","If she hadn't been carrying Zhengzheng, she probably would have kicked that bespectacled man. What did he mean, how was she feeling? She wasn't feeling good at all.","The other reporters voluntarily cleared a path for Shen Yin. No matter how valuable the news was, they still had to abide by professional ethics.","Shen Lv followed beside Shen Yin, extending his arm to protect her and Xu Yunzheng.","When they arrived at the hospital, Xu Xiuhe was still in emergency surgery.","\"We're still investigating the specific cause of the accident. Preliminary judgment suggests driver error, causing the car to crash into the nearby green belt and catch fire. Fortunately, passersby rescued them in time. Otherwise...\"","The police officer didn't continue.","\"How much longer will it take?\" Shen Lv asked.","\"It's hard to say. The driver is also in emergency surgery next door.\"","\"How is it?\" Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi came running.","\"Still in surgery.\"","\"Daddy, Daddy~~\" At first, Zhengzheng didn't understand, but later he seemed to have heard clearly that his dad was sick and in emergency surgery.","\"Zhengzheng, be good. Don't cry. Dad will be fine for sure. Dad definitely won't leave us behind.\"","Shen Yin hugged Xu Yunzheng tightly, gently patting the little one's back to comfort him.","Xu Yunzheng wiped his tears. The adults standing nearby felt heartbroken.","\"How's the CEO?\" Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er also came running. Just yesterday they were discussing how to avoid marriage, and today this happened. How could this be?","\"Still in emergency surgery for now.\"","Many people had gathered at the operating room door. Even Qi Ji, with her big pregnant belly, had rushed over.","Online, news about the Heyuan Group's CEO was already flying everywhere. Many people were saying that the Xu father and son must have been cursed, with one incident following another.","The father hadn't even been discharged from the hospital, and now the son's fate was unknown.","No one was more worried than Shen Yin. Xu Xiuhe was the most trustworthy person in her world. He knew her secrets, he doted on her, loved her, and was someone she could entrust her life to. If anything were to happen to him, what would she and Zhengzheng do?","Several hours later, the emergency room door finally opened. A doctor walked out, and a group of people rushed to surround him.","\"Doctor, how is he?\" Shen Yin asked anxiously.","\"He's out of immediate danger for now, but we can't say when he'll wake up.\"","Everyone let out a sigh. It was good that there was no immediate danger to his life. The rest could be treated gradually; he would get better eventually.","Upon hearing this, Liu Bo ran to the adjacent emergency room where Xu Xiuhe's driver, Wang Driver, was. He had been Xu Xiuhe's driver for several years. Even now, Liu Bo couldn't believe that a car driven by Wang Driver would get into an accident.","Wang Driver only had one daughter, who hadn't arrived yet. So Liu Bo waited at the door.","\"Has the patient's family arrived?\"","\"No, but you can tell me. He's from our company.\"","\"The patient has multiple fractures and a concussion. We'll need to keep him under observation for a while.\"","\"Is he out of danger?\"","\"We still need to observe. We've done everything we can.\"","Xu Xiuhe was finally moved to a VIP ward. The room was filled with people, all silent, waiting for Xu Xiuhe to wake up.","No one knows whether tomorrow or an accident will come first. Xu Yunzheng stood by the ward, staring at Xu Xiuhe's face without moving.","\"What's wrong with Daddy?\"","\"Daddy is sick and needs to rest well,\" Shen Yin said, holding back tears to comfort the little one.","\"When will Daddy get better? Zhengzheng is still waiting for Daddy to build blocks with me.\"","The little one's words made everyone present feel uneasy.","Everyone busied themselves with various tasks. Chang Zhiyuan ordered food, Liu Bo went to pay the fees, and Shen Lv kept following up on the progress with the police.","In the afternoon, news came that Wang Driver had woken up. Liu Bo ran to the adjacent ward again. The neighboring ward was much quieter, with only nurses and caregivers present.","Liu Bo had thought that Wang Driver, having woken up, would be able to speak. But upon entering the room, he discovered that Wang Driver was lying on the hospital bed, blinking his eyes, yet not saying a word.","\"Nurse, how long will it take before he can speak?\"","\"It's hard to say.\"","As evening approached, Shen Yin told the others to go home first, as they had been here all day and were probably tired.","The others were still a bit worried.","\"Go on, I'll be fine here,\" Shen Lv said.","\"Then we'll come back tomorrow,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"Sister Yin, take care of yourself and don't get too tired,\" Qi Ji said to Shen Yin as he was leaving.","\"Mmm, you too. Go home and rest early. You shouldn't overexert yourself while pregnant.\"","Shu Yi was still a bit concerned about Shen Yin. Shen Yin had a child to look after, and Shu Yi didn't trust Shen Lv. What if something happened and Shen Yin couldn't handle it on her own?"]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: Talk About Cooperation","paragraphs":["Shen Yin had been keeping watch in the hospital room for a long time, growing more worried as time passed. Shen Lv stood by, feeling uneasy as he watched.","\"Why don't you take Zhengzheng home to rest? I can stay here,\" Shen Lv suggested, concerned about Shen Yin and Zhengzheng's health.","Research has shown that severe heartache can trigger autonomic nervous system disorders. The onset of autonomic nervous system disorders is often related to psychosocial stress factors and can manifest symptoms in multiple systems, such as postural hypotension, which may cause dizziness, fainting, and blurred vision.","When Shen Yin was depressed, Shen Lv had researched these topics extensively, but what could he do?","\"No, I'm staying here. I'll watch over him,\" Shen Yin insisted.","\"How long are you planning to stay? I mean, what if it takes a long time for him to wake up? Will you just keep watching over him here?\"","Shen Yin nodded. With her basic medical knowledge, she felt more at ease staying by his side.","\"Brother, please go back and bring some clothes and daily necessities for Zhengzheng.\"","\"Are you planning to stay here long-term?\" Shen Lv asked incredulously.","\"Yes. This hospital room is spacious, and it even has an extra room. There's a bathroom, shower, and even a small kitchen. We can buy groceries and cook here. Why can't we stay for an extended period? Zhengzheng should be fine here too, but if he doesn't adjust well later, you can take him to mom's place.\"","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng wants to stay with Daddy and Mommy,\" the little one chimed in, running over.","\"Alright,\" Shen Yin agreed.","Shen Lv didn't try to persuade her further. He'd let Shen Yin handle things her way.","There was too much public opinion online that needed to be addressed. As the brother-in-law, he certainly couldn't stand by and do nothing.","\"Oh, brother, can you do me a favor? Go to Rong City Second Hospital. Xu Guimin is there. Ask him what exactly he said to Xiuhe when they met.\"","\"Sure.\"","Upon hearing this, Shen Lv left the hospital room and drove to Rong City Hospital.","When he arrived at the VIP ward in Rong City Second Hospital, the staff outside the room didn't stop Shen Lv, as Shen Yin had called ahead.","As Shen Lv entered the room, Xu Guimin looked up.","\"You're Shen Lv from Shen Group? You...\"","Being from the same city, they had naturally seen each other before.","Xu Guimin seemed unable to recall why someone from Shen Group would come to see him.","\"Old man, what did you say to my brother-in-law this morning?\" Shen Lv's tone was very impolite. He was protective of his family. From the beginning, he knew that Xu Xiuhe's relationship with the Xu family wasn't good. When his father was looking for a suitable husband for Shen Yin, he had thoroughly investigated Xu Xiuhe's background.","Knowing that this old man hadn't treated his brother-in-law well, how could he show him any courtesy? Calling him \"old man\" was already being polite.","Xu Guimin suddenly realized that the son he had never valued was already married.","\"Why are you here? Where's Xiuhe?\"","\"You have the nerve to ask? Xiuhe is lying in the hospital. What did you two talk about this morning?\"","\"What? How did Xiuhe end up in the hospital?\"","\"How should I know? I'm asking you what you two discussed.\"","Xu Guimin thought deeply for a moment but still didn't speak.","\"You should leave. This is between him and me. Outsiders shouldn't interfere.\"","Shen Lv couldn't believe it. He was an outsider?","Well, he supposed he was. Damn it, if Shen Yin hadn't asked him to come, he wouldn't be willing to run between hospitals late at night.","\"Are you going to tell me or not? It's extremely important!\" Shen Lv asked one last time.","Xu Guimin remained unmoved, his face expressionless, infuriating Shen Lv. The old bastard, he thought, might as well drown and be done with it.","Shen Lv cursed under his breath. If it weren't for the fact that the old man was a patient, he might have resorted to physical force.","As he left, Shen Lv slammed the door hard.","\"Keep an eye on him,\" he instructed the staff outside.","After that, Shen Lv drove to Yuelan Manor. He had it tough enough already, and the two elderly people at home were probably worried sick. He needed to hurry back to comfort them.","Sure enough, as soon as he parked the car, Fang Yue came running out.","\"Mom, why are you out here? It's so cold outside.\"","As Shen Lv got out of the car, he could feel the chill in the air. After all, it was December, with only 20 days left until the New Year.","\"I've been worried sick. How's Xiuhe? If your dad hadn't stopped me, I would have gone to the hospital already.\"","\"It's a good thing dad stopped you. Otherwise, you wouldn't even have had a place to stand in the hospital room. His friends and assistant are all there.\"","\"Why can't you get to the point? I'm asking you, how is Xiuhe?\" Fang Yue smacked Shen Lv's arm. Was this child being deliberately obtuse? What she said wasn't that hard to understand.","\"Not great. He's not dead, but we don't know when he'll wake up.\"","Hearing this, Fang Yue immediately gave Shen Lv a hard slap. Ever since Shen Tianzheng fell ill, she hated hearing anything about life and death. It was so inauspicious. Couldn't he say something more positive?","\"Mom, that hurts.\"","Shen Lv cupped his cheek, looking aggrieved. Was his life easy? He had been busy all day, and now he came home only to be hit by his mother.","\"How's your sister? She must be devastated. And Zhengzheng? Is Zhengzheng okay?\"","\"You know how stubborn your daughter is. I'll have to go back to the hospital later. Let me eat something first.\"","\"What's going on? Is Yin Yin planning to stay at the hospital the whole time?\"","\"You know the answer, why are you asking?\"","When Shen Lv returned to the hospital, he not only brought clothes and daily necessities for Zhengzheng but also food for both mother and son.","When Shen Lv arrived, Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan were there. Shu Yi had prepared change of clothes, pajamas, and daily necessities for Shen Yin, while Chang Zhiyuan had bought basins and towels.","\"Xiuhe, if you don't wake up soon, your son won't recognize you anymore,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, standing by the bed. In truth, he was heartbroken. He, Xiuhe, and Jing Rui had grown up together, closer than brothers. Whenever one of them needed help, the others would come without hesitation. Now, he was standing here while Xiuhe lay unconscious. Just thinking about it made him emotional.","\"Zhengzheng recognizes Daddy. Daddy is just sick. He'll get better soon,\" the little one said, sitting on the sofa, seemingly understanding everything, neither crying nor making a fuss.","\"That's right. Zhengzheng is so good. Zhengzheng is so adorable, Daddy will definitely want to see you,\" Shen Yin said, having finished tidying up the hospital room, prepared for a long stay.","\"How's the news online?\"","\"Xiuhe's assistant is handling it.\"","\"If this hadn't happened, Liu's assistant and the other junior assistant would probably be getting married, and we could have attended their wedding,\" Shen Yin said, her eyes devoid of light.","Everyone fell silent upon hearing this, knowing that no one could be more devastated than Shen Yin.","After the others left, it was already very late. Shen Yin gave Zhengzheng a bath and then carried her to the inner bedroom.","\"Zhengzheng, be good and sleep by yourself, okay? Mommy needs to go wash Daddy's face.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin kissed her baby's forehead and went back to the bathroom. When she came out, she was carrying a basin and a towel.","As she approached the bed, Shen Yin took the towel and gently wiped Xu Xiuhe's face. He looked as if he were merely sleeping.","After finishing, Shen Yin reached for Xu Xiuhe's wrist, feeling for his pulse. From what she could tell, there didn't seem to be any major issues, so why wasn't he waking up?","During the night, Zhengzheng slept in the inner room while Shen Yin lay down next to Xu Xiuhe on the outside.","She held his hand tightly, reflecting on how difficult Xu Xiuhe's first 20-plus years had been. His mother died early, his stepmother disliked him, his father didn't love him. He had experienced the harsh realities of society at a young age and built everything from scratch. Just when he finally had happiness within his grasp, this car accident happened.","Shen Yin couldn't sleep at all. Her left hand reached out to Xu Xiuhe's face, her fingers tracing the contours of his features before finally resting on his eyebrows.","He was so handsome. She realized she had never looked at Xu Xiuhe so closely and quietly before.","Early the next morning, Liu Bo came to the hospital and informed Shen Yin that the investigation results were out. The car's dashboard camera showed that it was indeed driver error – he had mistaken the accelerator for the brake pedal. After crashing into the green belt, he hadn't applied the brakes, which naturally led to the accident.","\"Has the driver woken up?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, but the driver suffered extensive external injuries. He underwent a comprehensive examination yesterday afternoon, and it turns out he's in the late stages of a terminal illness. The accident might have been caused by him losing consciousness due to a sudden onset of symptoms.\"","\"Late stages? Weren't there regular health check-ups?\"","\"There were, but I went back last night and checked the medical reports he submitted to the company. They were fake.\"","\"He deliberately concealed his condition?\"","Liu Bo nodded. He felt partially responsible for not emphasizing the importance of thoroughly verifying the medical reports to the relevant departments.","\"Driver Wang has been with the CEO since the company's inception. He probably wanted to keep earning money and didn't want to lose his job, so he paid to have fake medical reports made.\"","\"I see. How's the company doing? Has the stock price dropped?\"","At this point, there was no use in dwelling on what had happened. Shen Yin turned her attention to the company's affairs. Heyuan Group was Xu Xiuhe's life's work of many years, and it couldn't afford any setbacks.","\"It's manageable. The stock price hasn't dropped much,\" Liu Bo replied. He had already released a statement saying that Xu Xiuhe didn't have any major issues and just needed some time to recuperate, so the situation wasn't too bad.","The big problem now was when the CEO would wake up. The company had an extremely important collaboration coming up that required Xu Xiuhe's personal involvement. Without him, the deal couldn't be closed.","\"Whatever happens with the company, let me know immediately. You'll have to work a bit harder during this time, and we absolutely cannot afford any mistakes,\" Shen Yin instructed.","\"Understood.\"","\"Alright, you should head back to the company then. Don't worry too much about things here.\"","Shen Yin was telling herself not to worry too much as much as she was telling Liu Bo. In reality, she was the most concerned. It had been 24 hours, so why wasn't there any change?","One day, two days, three days passed, and Xu Xiuhe still hadn't woken up. He was surviving on nutrient solutions to replenish his energy. Gradually, people stopped concerning themselves with his situation, and even the company continued to operate normally.","The world kept turning, days went by, and only Shen Yin grew thinner with each passing day.","\"Ma'am.\" Liu Bo's phone call startled Shen Yin.","\"Has something happened at the company?\"","\"Yes and no.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"There's a collaboration that requires the CEO's presence, but he's still not awake. This partnership is extremely important – it's with a foreign company – so we're not sure how to proceed.\"","\"I'll go. When is it?\"","Over the past few days, Fang Yue had been coming to the hospital room to check on everyone. Her son-in-law lay unconscious in bed, her daughter was growing thinner by the day, and her grandchild was being heart-wrenchingly well-behaved. Fang Yue saw it all and felt the pain in her heart. She had prayed to every Buddha and deity she could think of.","\"Mom, I might need to go out this afternoon. Can you look after Zhengzheng?\"","\"Of course. Remember, if anything's bothering you, talk to me. Don't try to shoulder everything alone.\"","Shen Yin returned to Ziyue Manor and changed into a white suit. She applied light makeup, put on a pair of black high heels, and tied her hair up, giving her a capable and mature appearance. She hoped this look would make her seem more like a high-level company executive.","When Shen Yin arrived at the company, it caused quite a stir. Everyone had been speculating about the CEO's condition, but there had been no news, and the media had stopped reporting on it.","The lack of news was because there was no information on when he might wake up. The media silence was due to various influential parties – Shen Lv, Liu Bo, and Chang Zhiyuan – all paying to keep the story out of the press.","Shen Yin wore bright red lipstick, and as she walked through the company, she seemed to bring a gust of wind with her.","\"The CEO's wife is here, and we've never seen her dressed like this before. She looks every bit the powerful businesswoman.\"","\"She looks so fierce. I wonder how the CEO is doing, though.\"","Xu Xiuhe had always treated the company's employees well – paying double for overtime, never delaying wages, providing benefits during holidays, and never discriminating against female employees.","Everyone in the company could see what Xu Xiuhe had done for them. It was hard to find such a good boss nowadays, and many people outside the company were eager to join Heyuan Group.","There were many people who cared about Xu Xiuhe, and by extension, they treated Shen Yin with courtesy and respect. After all, they believed in Xu Xiuhe.","\"How's everything going? Have the people from Ruida Group arrived?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, they have.\"","Shen Yin hadn't come unprepared. When she learned this morning that she needed to negotiate the collaboration, she had quickly studied up on many topics and sought advice from Shen Lv.","Shen Yin was naturally intelligent, and on top of that, she had previously accompanied Xu Xiuhe to Heyuan Group out of boredom. During those times, she had read many documents and observed how Xu Xiuhe handled various situations.","\"Liu Bo, Qin Zhenzhen, you two come in with me.\"","At the very least, they couldn't lose face in terms of their lineup. Calling for Liu Bo was because he had been following this project all along. Calling for Qin Zhenzhen was because this young woman appeared to be the type with high professional quality and strong capabilities. When facing other companies, they certainly couldn't afford to lose face.","In the reception room of Heyuan Group, quite a few people were already seated. When Shen Yin learned it was a foreign company, she began to worry. What if her English skills weren't up to par and she ended up embarrassing herself? She practiced desperately for a while, but made no progress. With the original owner's memories, how could she possibly use English as fluently as a fish in water?","She decided to throw caution to the wind. She would just speak Chinese. Why should they accommodate others by speaking a foreign language when their own culture and history were so long-standing? The fact that they came to meet Heyuan Group showed that Heyuan Group had the strength worthy of Ruida's cooperation."]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: Wake Up","paragraphs":["When Shen Yin walked into the reception room, the people from Ruida Group hadn't arrived yet.","Shen Yin sat down in a chair. Qin Zhenzhen poured several glasses of water and placed them on the opposite side, while Liu Bo sat down next to Shen Yin.","\"Will they be speaking English or Chinese later?\" Shen Yin asked.","This question actually stumped Liu Bo. Previously, Xu Xiuhe had been the one negotiating with Ruida, and he hadn't even been present at their meetings. He had no idea what language the CEO spoke with them.","\"Madam Shen, I really don't know about that.\"","Shen Yin sat in her chair, calm and composed, waiting for the Ruida Group people to arrive.","Ten minutes later, a blond man, accompanied by two assistants, arrived at the ground floor of the Heyuan Group building.","\"They're here.\"","Chang Xue immediately called Qin Zhenzhen.","Everyone sat up straight.","A few minutes later, the Ruida Group people reached Heyuan Group's reception room.","As soon as the blond man entered the room, his expression changed slightly.","\"Where is the boss of your company? Where is Xu Xiuhe?\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin was also surprised. True to his blond appearance, he immediately spoke words she couldn't understand. Fortunately, what the blond man said wasn't too difficult, and relying on the original owner's memories, Shen Yin could now understand.","\"Hello, the CEO of this company, who is also my husband, Xu Xiuhe, has had a slight accident and is currently in the hospital. I will be replacing him here to discuss cooperation with you.\"","Shen Yin spoke in a voice that wasn't loud, but her enunciation was particularly clear. Her voice carried strength, and everyone in the reception room could hear her.","\"No, no,\" the blond man said in English-accented Chinese, waving his hands.","\"Anthony, you can speak Chinese,\" Shen Yin said, ignoring the blond man's refusal and instead changing the subject to compliment him.","Sure enough, the topic was successfully shifted. Hearing Shen Yin's praising tone, the blond man felt particularly pleased.","\"My Chinese is super super good. Can you, tell?\"","The blond man gave himself a thumbs up.","Listening to the accented Chinese, Shen Yin wanted to laugh, but she knew it wouldn't be appropriate in this setting. Laughing would also be disrespectful to Anthony, so she had to hold it in.","\"Anthony, your Chinese is very, very good,\" Shen Yin also gave a thumbs up.","\"Thank you, thank you.\"","\"So, how about our cooperation? I really admire your lover, I only want to discuss cooperation with your lover,\" the blond man continued in his broken Chinese after receiving Shen Yin's praise.","As they talked, Shen Yin's speaking style began to be slightly influenced by the blond man's accent.","\"Am I not suitable? We have an old saying in China that husband and wife are one body. My lover and I are one, so even though he's not here now, I can negotiate on his behalf.\"","The blond man pondered for a moment, then said, \"I see, Chinese culture, profound and extensive.\"","He gave another thumbs up after speaking.","Qin Zhenzhen and Liu Bo hadn't expected this Anthony to be so adorable and easily swayed by the CEO's wife.","\"But, I still want to discuss cooperation with your husband. I admire him very much, and it's because of him that I decided to cooperate with Heyuan Group. If he doesn't negotiate with me, I can find other companies to cooperate with.\"","Shen Yin...","Liu Bo...","Qin Zhenzhen...","The situation reached an impasse. Shen Yin wanted to continue persuading and guiding the blond man, but Anthony's expression was already becoming impatient. He fiddled with a lighter in one hand and crossed one leg over the other.","\"Anthony, although our Heyuan Group hasn't been established for long, our achievements are there for all to see. I believe that after your Ruida Group cooperates with our Heyuan Group, it will be all benefit and no harm.\"","\"I know, but Heyuan Group has such achievements because of Xu Xiuhe. So, I still want to wait for Xu Xiuhe. By the way, what does 'all benefit and no harm' mean?\"","The blond man looked at Shen Yin with an eager expression.","Shen Yin had to admit that this Anthony was a bit difficult to deal with.","\"Anthony, 'all benefit and no harm' means there are many advantages and nothing bad.\"","\"Saying it like that, I understand now.\"","Anthony wore an expression of having learned something new.","\"Anthony, my husband hasn't woken up yet, he really can't come to meet you,\" Shen Yin said with some difficulty.","This Anthony was so stubborn and persistent. It was indeed as Special Assistant Liu had said – not easy to handle.","\"I can go to see him.\"","...","Qin Zhenzhen and Liu Bo exchanged glances. This blond Anthony was really hard to deal with. Could it be that he had taken a liking to their CEO?","\"Is that so?\" Shen Yin smiled awkwardly. To be honest, she hadn't expected Anthony to say this.","\"Anthony, my husband hasn't woken up yet. Do you still want to see him?\"","\"Yes, I want to see.\"","\"Special Assistant Liu, prepare the car. We're going to First Hospital.\"","\"No need to prepare, just lead the way. We have our own car.\"","The group filed out of the reception room in an orderly manner and headed towards the underground parking garage.","\"Did you bring the contract?\" Anthony turned and asked.","\"Yes, we did.\"","Liu Bo was driving, with Qin Zhenzhen in the passenger seat. Shen Yin sat in the back. As soon as she got in the car, Shen Yin rubbed her brow. This Anthony was too stubborn; she had no idea what to do.","\"Madam Shen, don't worry. Anthony just asked if we brought the contract. Maybe we'll be able to sign it soon.\"","What Shen Yin was more worried about was when Xu Xiuhe would finally wake up.","In the VIP ward, Fang Yue was playing with Zheng on the sofa. When the group entered, the little one kept staring at the blond man.","\"Mommy,\" Xu Yunzheng called out when he saw Shen Yin.","\"Is this Xiuhe?\" Anthony walked to the bedside, looking at Xu Xiuhe lying on the bed, his sadness naturally apparent on his face.","Fang Yue looked at Shen Yin, confused. What was going on? Could it be that Xiuhe previously...","Unimaginable.","\"Yin Yin, what's this?\"","In the end, Fang Yue couldn't hold back and asked.","\"Mom, this is a partner from Heyuan Group. We were just discussing the contract.\"","Anthony turned to Xu Xiuhe on the hospital bed and said, \"My friend, rest assured, I will take our cooperation project seriously. I'll also study Chinese diligently. Today I learned another phrase, which means 'all benefits and no harm.'\"","The others stood nearby, speechless. What was going on now?","\"The contract, give me the pen.\"","Hearing this, Liu Bo immediately handed over the contract and pen.","Anthony took them, signed his name at the bottom, and then passed it to Shen Yin.","\"Teacher's wife, it's your turn to sign.\"","Teacher's wife?","Shen Yin was bewildered.","\"Xiuhe teaches me Chinese. He's my Chinese teacher. According to your custom, that makes you my teacher's wife.\"","As Anthony finished speaking, several people came in from outside, bringing in a few boxes of milk.","\"Alright, the contract is signed. I need to go now.\"","In the end, only Liu Bo and Qin Zhenzhen remained in the hospital room besides Fang Yue and Xu Yunzheng.","None of them could have imagined that this negotiation would end up being so perfunctory.","\"Madam.\" Liu Bo held the contract, looking at Shen Yin.","\"You can go back first. For the following matters, I'll trouble Assistant Liu.\"","\"No trouble at all.\"","After Liu Bo and Qin Zhen left, Fang Yue walked over and said, \"This foreigner is really strange.\"","Shen Yin wholeheartedly agreed. She felt that her outfit and makeup today had all been for nothing.","Looking at Xu Xiuhe again, Shen Yin felt even more distressed. Xu Xiuhe was so good that he could even win over business partners. Even lying in a hospital bed, he hadn't left her facing any difficulties.","\"Mom, did I see wrong just now? Did Xiuhe's hand move a little?\" Shen Yin said.","Fang Yue hadn't been watching Xu Xiuhe, so she had no idea.","Shen Yin walked to Xu Xiuhe's side, staring at him intently.","\"Mom, it moved.\"","\"Dad's eyelashes moved too.\" The little one leaned close to Xu Xiuhe's face.","Shen Yin looked, and sure enough, Xu Xiuhe's eyelashes really did move.","Shen Yin was so excited she almost cried. Xu Xiuhe had been lying there for four days already. If he didn't wake up soon, she was going to go crazy.","\"Xiuhe, Xiuhe, wake up.\"","\"Dad, Dad, Zheng Zheng wants to play with Dad.\"","The man's hand moved a few more times, and his eyes slowly opened.","\"Mom, Zheng Zheng, Xiuhe's awake!\"","Shen Yin covered Xu Xiuhe's hand with her own.","\"Why is it dark? Why haven't you turned on the lights?\" Xu Xiuhe's words were like a bucket of cold water, completely extinguishing all of Shen Yin's previous joy.","Outside, it was bright daylight. The window glass was slightly fogged due to the temperature difference, but other buildings could be faintly seen outside.","Shen Yin calmed herself down and said, \"Xiuhe, you haven't fully recovered yet, so your eyes might be temporarily blind. It will get better after a while.\"","She was comforting herself as much as she was comforting Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Xiuhe was quiet for a few seconds before asking, \"How many days have I been asleep?\"","\"Exactly four days.\"","\"Call the doctor to come check on you.\" Shen Yin said. What she had just said was indeed true. If she wasn't mistaken, Xu Xiuhe's blindness might be due to blood clots or bruising in his eyes.","Soon, the examination results came out, confirming Shen Yin's guess.","\"When will it get better?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"It's hard to say. It depends on the patient's own recovery. It could be a week, it could be a month.\"","\"Dad, Zheng Zheng will keep Dad company.\"","\"Mom, you've been here for so long, you must be tired. You should go back first. Dad will probably be looking for you soon.\"","\"I'm relieved now that you're awake. Xiuhe, don't worry. This is temporary blindness. It will get better soon.\"","\"Mm, don't worry, Mom.\"","After Fang Yue left, Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng remained by the bedside.","\"Can't Dad see anymore?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"Dad is just temporarily blind. When Dad gets better, he'll be able to see Zheng Zheng again.\"","\"Mm-hmm, Dad says eyes are the windows to the soul.\" The little one suddenly remembered what his father had told him before.","Hearing this, Shen Yin felt uneasy. Such an excellent person as Xu Xiuhe suddenly losing his sight must be very upsetting for him.","\"Don't be sad. It will get better. Zheng Zheng and I will always be here.\"","\"Mm, okay. What about the car accident?\"","\"So far, it's been determined that Driver Wang lost control of his body, resulting in an operational error that caused the engine to spontaneously combust.\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe felt something was off, but he couldn't pinpoint what exactly.","\"You must have been worried these past few days. Thank you for your hard work.\" Xu Xiuhe followed Shen Yin's hand and touched her head.","\"It wasn't hard. I'm just glad you're awake.\"","That afternoon, a group of people came to Xu Xiuhe's hospital room, including Chang Zhiyuan and Xue Jingrui.","Seeing the now-blind Xu Xiuhe, everyone felt a bit off-balance, afraid to mention words like \"see\" or \"eyes,\" fearing it would upset Xu Xiuhe even more.","\"Xiuhe, when you're up and about, you'll have to treat us to a good meal,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, trying to lighten the mood.","\"Sure.\"","\"We've found out some other information. That driver had contact with Xu Zhengyang's side.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's words shocked everyone in the room. Clearly, none of them had expected this.","\"Should we report it to the police?\" Xue Jingrui asked. This matter would be easy to handle if they could find solid evidence.","\"We don't have detailed evidence, but Driver Wang is definitely suspicious.\" Chang Zhiyuan had been busy promoting the new drama these past few days, but he had also been searching for information. He didn't believe in such coincidences – just as the old man fell into the water, the young one got into a car accident. If it was deliberate, everything would make sense.","\"This afternoon, I need to go to the Second Hospital. I want to see Xu Guimin again.\"","\"But your eyes?\" Xue Jingrui asked.","\"It's fine. I'll go with him.\" Shen Yin always unconditionally supported Xu Xiuhe's decisions. Whatever he wanted to do, she would accompany him.","As they left, Shen Yin held Zheng Zheng's hand with one hand and linked arms with Xu Xiuhe with the other, afraid of losing either of them.","Xu Xiuhe wore sunglasses and had changed out of his hospital gown, moving from one hospital to another.","As he entered the room, Xu Xiuhe didn't know what Xu Guimin was doing, but Shen Yin knew. That man was leisurely sipping tea, which irritated Shen Yin. Xu Guimin was largely to blame for the current situation.","\"Xiuhe, why are you here?\"","\"To see you,\" the man replied, his tone unreadable.","\"Why are you still wearing sunglasses indoors?\"","Xu Guimin hadn't noticed anything unusual about Xu Xiuhe at all.","\"What exactly did you mean when you asked me to save you?\" Xu Xiuhe repeated the question.","The man sitting on the bed fell silent again, instead turning to look at Shen Yin.","\"Speak up. If you don't, I'll send you right back,\" Xu Xiuhe threatened.","Upon hearing that he might be sent back, Xu Guimin became a bit nervous. He was living comfortably now, without much to worry about, but if he were sent back, he might be in danger again."]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Annual Big Melon","paragraphs":["\"When I was swimming, for some unknown reason, I couldn't get up. Later, I had a dream. I dreamed of your mother. She told me not to go home, saying that if I went back, she would take me away.\"","Xu Guimin finally revealed the reason why he had Xu Xiuhe save him.","Xu Xiuhe was wearing sunglasses. Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe but couldn't see any particular expression on his face. As for herself, she found Xu Guimin's words unbelievable.","\"What right do you have to mention my mother?\" Xu Xiuhe's voice wasn't loud, but his tone was accusatory.","\"Xiuhe, you have to believe your father. I really did dream of your mother. She appeared before me wearing a white dress, gently telling me not to return to the Xu family house, to stay away from Yang Cui, otherwise she would take me away.\"","\"Shut up. That's nonsense. I wish my mother could take you away.\"","\"How can you talk like that? I'm still your father. What kind of son wishes for his father to leave this world? Don't you know that's unfilial?\"","Xu Guimin said resentfully.","Xu Xiuhe removed his glasses. Guided by the sound of Xu Guimin's voice, he turned his head. Though he couldn't see, his eyes were directed towards Xu Guimin.","Xu Xiuhe's eyes were lifeless. Xu Guimin sensed something was off at first, and after a while, he asked, \"What's wrong with your eyes?\"","\"I'm blind.\"","Xu Guimin was momentarily stunned.","\"How did you go blind?\"","\"I bumped into something while walking.\"","\"Was what you just said the truth?\" Xu Xiuhe asked again.","\"It's the truth. I swear to heaven, I, Xu Guimin, really did dream of Sun Wenting. Sun Wenting told me not to go back. If I've spoken even half a lie, may heaven strike me down.\" Xu Guimin raised three fingers as he spoke.","\"Then you'd better stay here.\"","\"Can I have a phone?\" Xu Guimin asked weakly.","Xu Xiuhe turned and left. He shouldn't have brought Xu Guimin out in the first place. What kind of father, upon learning his son had gone blind, wouldn't even say a word of concern?","He had always only loved himself. Xu Guimin would forever be a selfish person.","Shen Yin supported Xu Xiuhe's arm as they left the hospital room.","\"Was what he said true?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Maybe. His tone didn't sound like he was lying, and he even swore an oath.\"","\"Could it be that mom appeared in his dream? Perhaps his near-drowning wasn't an accident. It's possible that mother and son duo really did have plans to harm her, but mom couldn't bear it and appeared in his dream to save his life.\"","Shen Yin shared her theory.","It made sense. Xu Xiuhe pondered it as well. This idea was entirely plausible because only he knew just how much his mother had loved that scoundrel.","Looking at it now, Sun Wenting might have always known about Xu Guimin's mistress, but her love was too humble.","In Xu Xiuhe's memory, Sun Wenting had always been very gentle, obeying and accommodating Xu Guimin in everything. She always put Xu Guimin first.","Sometimes, people are just like that. For some inexplicable reason, even when they know all of the other person's flaws, even when the other person might not love them, they still can't let go. They can't control their feelings and continue to love the other person recklessly.","Love is truly such a difficult thing to understand. How many people find happiness because of love, and how many fall into the abyss because of it?","Perhaps Sun Wenting still loved Xu Guimin even now, unable to bear seeing him hurt, which is why she appeared in his dream with a threatening message.","Men can sometimes be hard to understand too. They don't cherish what they have. Xu Guimin was a typical example, summed up in one word: \"despicable.\"","\"Let's go back.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe, worry rising in her again. When would his eyes heal? She wanted very much to treat Xu Xiuhe, but she didn't trust her medical skills. More importantly, she was facing the most important person in her world.","Just as they reached the ground floor of the hospital, Shen Yin's phone rang.","\"Hello, Mom.\"","\"Mama.\"","Shen Yin thought it was Fang Yue calling and immediately called out \"Mom,\" but the voice on the other end was actually the little one.","\"Oh, is that Zhengzheng?\"","\"It's Zhengzheng. Zhengzheng misses Mommy and Daddy. When are Mommy and Daddy coming back?\"","The little one's voice was sweet and childish.","Xu Xiuhe, standing nearby, said, \"Daddy and Mommy will be back soon.\"","When they arrived at the hospital, Zhengzheng immediately ran over and hugged Xu Xiuhe's legs.","\"Daddy, Zhengzheng wants you to play with me.\"","Fang Yue, who was nearby, quickly said, \"Zhengzheng, Daddy is still sick right now. Is it okay if Grandma plays with you? When Daddy feels better, he can play with Zhengzheng.\"","\"Then I hope Daddy gets better quickly.\"","Xu Xiuhe crouched down, and Xu Yunzheng patted Xu Xiuhe's back.","Shen Yin then led Xu Xiuhe out. The hospital staff gave Xu Xiuhe a comprehensive examination. The results were the same as before – there were no other issues, just that the blood clot near his eye had still not dissolved.","\"Doctor, how long will this take?\" Shen Yin asked again. In the Dasheng Dynasty, there had been people who went blind due to severe collisions. Some recovered on their own after a while, others sought out famous doctors and regained their sight, and some lived in darkness for the rest of their lives.","\"It's hard to say, but it shouldn't take too long. Mr. Xu's body has a relatively good recovery ability, and the blood clot isn't large. It shouldn't take too long.\"","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe felt somewhat relieved upon hearing this. If the doctor said so, it might really not take long.","When they returned, Fang Yue had already sent someone to bring dinner, and she was feeding Zhengzheng.","\"Xiuhe, Yin Yin, you should eat too. Eat and then get some rest early.\"","Fang Yue left only after Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe had finished eating.","In the evening, Shen Yin gave Zhengzheng a bath as usual. When she looked at Xu Xiuhe again, she was a bit at a loss. With his eyes unable to see, he obviously couldn't bathe himself.","\"I'll help you bathe.\"","\"Okay.\"","At night, Xu Xiuhe wouldn't let Shen Yin sleep on the inner bed, so Zhengzheng slept alone on the inside, while Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe lay on the outer 1.2-meter hospital bed.","\"You've had it tough these days. I've made you worry.\"","\"You know I've been worried, yet you woke up so late.\" The woman pouted.","\"It's my fault. It won't happen again.\"","\"You're planning on a next time?\" Hearing this, Shen Yin gently pinched the man's waist.","\"Stop moving around.\"","Shen Yin understood immediately. Indeed, they couldn't move much now, as the bed was only so big.","Xu Xiuhe changed the subject: \"It won't happen again in the future. Without your permission, I won't even get a fever.\"","\"You promise?\"","\"I promise.\"","\"It's a deal.\"","\"For a hundred years, it won't change.\"","\"How's the company been doing while I was unconscious?\" Xu Xiuhe had only just remembered he had a company.","\"Thanks to Liu Assistant, everything at the company has been running smoothly. We even signed a contract with Ruida this morning.\"","\"Did Liu Bo sign it?\"","\"I did,\" Shen Yin said with a hint of pride.","\"You went to the company this morning? Was the contract signed there?\"","\"I did go to the company this morning, but the contract wasn't signed there.\"","\"Oh? Where was it signed then?\" The man was a bit curious.","\"At the hospital. Anthony came too. Are you Anthony's Chinese teacher?\"","\"Did he say that?\"","\"Yes, Anthony is incredibly stubborn. At first, when we were at the company, no matter how I tried to persuade him, he refused to sign the contract because you weren't there. Even when I said I was your partner, he still wouldn't budge.\"","\"In Chinese, we'd say he's 'single-minded'.\"","\"Hahaha, his Chinese is quite good, just with a bit of an accent. I almost got carried away by his way of speaking.\"","\"He learned Chinese from me. How could it not be good?\" The man said narcissistically.","\"Do you know why he admires you so much? My mother was watching him react to you and almost thought you two had an inappropriate relationship.\"","\"Perhaps your husband just has a magnetic personality.\"","\"Hmm, like me.\"","...","\"By the way, has Liu Bo returned to work at the company?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Of course. If he hadn't gone back after you had an accident, you'd really be in trouble.\"","\"What about his wedding?\"","\"No news yet.\"","Xu Xiuhe became anxious upon hearing this, feeling a bit guilty. Because of him, the wedding was postponed – a blame he couldn't accept.","\"Then let the company organize his wedding. As compensation for them.\"","\"Alright, good. Let's sleep.\" Shen Yin had been busy all day and was indeed feeling tired now.","\"Okay.\"","The next day.","As soon as dawn broke, the little one crawled out of bed and ran outside, waking up the two adults.","Shen Yin opened her eyes groggily, while Xu Xiuhe's eyes were still in darkness.","Shen Yin's phone rang early in the morning. It was Shu Yi calling.","On days when Shu Yi wasn't filming, she had never woken up this early. Today, she got up so early only because she had gone to the bathroom, then checked her phone and saw the trending topics on Weibo. She instantly became alert, got out of bed, and called Shen Yin.","\"Yin Yin, are you awake?\"","Still groggy with sleep, Shen Yin mumbled, \"I am now. A second before your call, your godson crawled onto my bed.\"","Usually, Shu Yi would have made some jokes about this. But today was different. What Shen Yin had feared most had finally happened.","\"Yin Yin, check the trending topics on Weibo. That woman finally leaked the story.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin instantly woke up. Before she could even hang up the phone, she switched to the Weibo app.","Sure enough, the top trending topic was about Shen Yin.","\"Heyuan Group CEO's wife suspected of being a lesbian.\"","Shen Yin clicked to read more. Unsurprisingly, the comments were all criticizing her, with some even calling Xu Xiuhe a \"cuckold\".","The former CP fans reacted even more strongly, using increasingly harsh language to curse her. They were the first to unfollow. Some even went as far as to curse themselves, saying they must have been blind to have ever shipped such a couple.","\"What's wrong?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin hesitated, unsure whether to let Xu Xiuhe know about this issue in his current state.","\"If something's happened, you don't have to tell me. I can find out from others what's going on.\"","\"It's Zhou Man. She leaked the story about her and me.\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe's face showed no particular shock. He had been unconscious for a while, and the moment he let his guard down, they released the news. The timing was impeccable.","\"It's okay. We'll clarify it.\"","Xu Xiuhe made a phone call, and immediately received a document.","He had already investigated everything Zhou Man had done. Even if she leaked this information, he wasn't afraid.","\"Take a look at this document.\" Xu Xiuhe handed his phone to Shen Yin. This document was compiled later by a detective; he had already seen some of the earlier materials.","Shen Yin took the phone and opened the document, reading through it line by line.","It contained Zhou Man's background, age, work and marital status, as well as some of her past actions.","The thing Zhou Man had done most was fraud. Even after scamming the original Shen Yin, she hadn't stopped. She had tricked many men out of their money, specifically targeting married men who were afraid of their wives. After seducing them, she would threaten to tell their wives unless they gave her money.","Even more terrifying was that this woman had scammed several men simultaneously. Looking at the collected information, Shen Yin felt the world was too bizarre.","If Shu Yi saw this, she would probably give Zhou Man a thumbs up and say, \"Impressive.\"","Unbelievably, such a person had eventually married into a wealthy family and become a rich man's wife.","What surprised Shen Yin even more was that this woman had gotten involved with Guo Hui, the son of her husband Guo Wei, and Guo Wei had found out.","Guo Wei had cut off this woman's finances, but to save face for himself and his son, he chose to keep the matter quiet.","This was probably why Zhou Man had come back to Shen Yin asking for money.","\"I'll have them clarify that you were just friends before. She doesn't really have any substantial evidence. The previous Shen Yin was indeed too naive and was tricked by her. Releasing this evidence should be enough.\"","\"Send the document to Liu Bo.\"","Shen Yin did as told, realizing that Xu Xiuhe had already uncovered so much information behind the scenes.","After sending it, Xu Xiuhe took out his phone and used voice control to call Liu Bo.","\"Hello, CEO.\"","\"Are you awake?\"","\"Yes, yes, I've seen what's on Weibo. How should we handle it?\"","Liu Bo was looking at Weibo at the time, feeling extremely shocked. He knew what Shen Yin was like before, and if things were really as revealed online, everything would make sense.","\"Look at the document I sent you, then organize and release all the evidence to clear Madam's name. The gist is that Zhou Man fabricated rumors and defamed her for money.\"","\"Understood.\"","Liu Bo didn't bother investigating what actually happened; he just did whatever Xu Xiuhe told him to do.","After hanging up the phone, Liu Bo looked at the materials in the document and exclaimed that Zhou Man was one hell of a woman. She was incredibly impressive - for a woman to be so skilled and cunning was truly extraordinary.","When he read the last line of text, Liu Bo felt even more astonished. Holy crap, he thought, the world is full of wonders. Yet it's also so small that anything can happen.","This piece of gossip, he would call it the scandal of the year."]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: New Type of Scam","paragraphs":["Liu Bo rubbed his eyes, making sure he wasn't mistaken. When he read the first line, he felt that this woman had a rather tragic life - she only had a mother since childhood, came from a very ordinary family, her mother worked as a housekeeper, and now suffered from such a serious illness.","But as he read to the end, he was shocked to discover that Zhou Man's mother, Zhou Xiuxiu, had never been married or pregnant, which meant Zhou Man wasn't Zhou Xiuxiu's biological daughter.","What an incredible coincidence - Zhou Man turned out to be the daughter of the CEO's stepmother!!!","Liu Bo had no idea how the detectives had uncovered this, but there was even a DNA paternity test included.","What was even more alarming was the detailed record of Zhou Man's previous acquaintance with Xu Zhengyang, and how they had even become intimate.","Liu Bo's worldview was completely shattered. It was all too dramatic.","This was beyond his comprehension. Sitting in his office, staring at his phone, Liu Bo felt at a loss. Should he release all the evidence?","This involved the Xu Group. Liu Bo couldn't understand how Xu Xiuhe could be so calm about it, casually saying, \"Just clear things up.\"","After careful consideration, Liu Bo decided to call Xu Xiuhe.","\"CEO, should we release all the dirt on Zhou Man? Including those things at the end of the document.\"","\"Release it all. We warned her before, but she didn't know what was good for her.\"","\"Understood.\" Liu Bo was about to hang up.","Xu Xiuhe's curiosity was piqued. He wondered what was at the bottom of the document that made Liu Bo call specifically to ask about it.","\"Wait, what's at the end?\"","When Xu Xiuhe asked this, Liu Bo suddenly remembered that the CEO was temporarily blind and had no idea about the explosive news at the bottom.","\"Well, sir, it turns out this woman is Yang Cui's daughter.\"","Xu Xiuhe was momentarily stunned. Zhou Man was Yang Cui's daughter?","\"CEO, are you still there?\" Liu Bo, hearing no response from the other end, thought there might be a problem with the signal and asked again.","\"I'm listening.\"","\"This Zhou Man was born to Yang Cui and another man. Later, she abandoned the child because she thought the man was poor and came to Rong City. The man, disappointed that the child was a girl, abandoned her. Later, Zhou Xiuxiu found the child, took pity on her, and raised her herself, never marrying.\"","As Xu Xiuhe listened to this story from 26 or 27 years ago, he could only sigh. One woman's selfishness had ruined two lives, especially that of the woman called Zhou Xiuxiu.","Zhou Man was pitiful, but compared to children in orphanages, she was much luckier.","\"Don't release the last bit of information for now. Release all the previous dirt, focusing on her fraud.\"","Fraud? Liu Bo understood in seconds. Wasn't this indeed fraud? She had deceived so many men - a new type of scam, deceiving people's feelings and money, and when that failed, resorting to blackmail and extortion.","Quickly, Liu Bo used Heyuan Group's official account to post about how the wife of Heyuan Group had been scammed abroad. The key point was that they were just friends, not as Zhou Man had claimed. Liu Bo also released the text messages Zhou Man had sent to Shen Yin as evidence, along with many examples of Zhou Man knowingly being the third party just to scam money.","Soon, the direction of public opinion online began to change. Shen Yin gradually became seen as the victim, and netizens' focus became increasingly intrigued.","After all, the evidence released was crystal clear. Regardless of gender, people began to curse this woman called Zhou Man. Many didn't even notice the hot search about Shen Yin.","Not only men cursed her, but women did too. Men cursed because this woman was too vicious, first seducing and enticing, then threatening. Women cursed because Zhou Man was shameless, knowingly being a mistress.","Many people began to tag Pei City's police. Quite a few men in Pei City had been scammed. The number of spectators grew larger and larger. At first, it was just people from Rong City and Pei City following the drama, but on the internet, news spreads fast. This could be considered a large-scale fraud, and this woman could be considered quite a \"talent.\"","By noon, people across the country were following the drama.","At the same time, the police knocked on the door of Zhou Xiuxiu's home.","\"Hello, are you Zhou Man's mother?\"","Zhou Xiuxiu rarely went out or browsed the internet. After recovering from her illness, she had been resting at home. Another important reason was that Zhou Man kept everything from Zhou Xiuxiu; Zhou Xiuxiu didn't even know her daughter had gotten married.","\"I am. What's wrong? Did something happen to Man Man?\" Zhou Xiuxiu's tone was full of worry.","\"Where is Zhou Man currently? She's suspected of multiple fraud cases.\"","The police officer showed his badge.","Zhou Xiuxiu was stunned for a long time before asking, \"Officer, you must have the wrong person. How could our Man Man possibly commit fraud?\"","\"We have sufficient evidence and multiple witnesses. We're now arresting Zhou Man.\"","\"I don't know where Man Man is. She told me she's busy with work, calls me once a week to ask about my health, and sends me money once a month. I don't know anything else.\"","\"Do you know that she married Guo Wei?\"","\"Who's Guo Wei?\"","\"Guo Wei of the Guo Group, 56 years old this year.\"","Zhou Xiuxiu clearly didn't believe it. \"That's impossible. How could she marry a man even older than me? It must be false. No, no, you've got the wrong person.\"","The woman clearly didn't believe it, shaking her head continuously.","Seeing this situation, the police at the door realized they wouldn't get any useful information from Zhou Xiuxiu. After exchanging glances, they left.","At the Guo family house in Pei City, Guo Wei was furious. He had been blind to marry such a vixen who had scammed so many people, even entrapping his own son.","\"Where's that bitch? Is she still in her room?\" Guo Wei asked the housekeeper angrily.","\"Sir, I'll go check.\"","The housekeeper said, running upstairs. She came back down in seconds, saying, \"Sir, it's terrible, it's terrible.\"","\"What's terrible? What happened? Hurry up and say it, don't dawdle.\" Guo Wei said impatiently.","\"Madam is gone, and all the important things in the room are missing.\"","\"What? Gone?\"","At this moment, Zhou Man was driving on the road to Rong City.","The woman in the car was repeatedly dialing her phone, but no one answered.","The woman was cursing terribly, both at Shen Yin and Xu Zhengyang.","Finally, the phone call connected.","\"Zhengyang, please save me, save me! The police are about to arrest me now.\"","\"There's really nothing I can do to save you,\" Xu Zhengyang said teasingly. \"Look at all the bad things you've done. To be honest, I'm impressed. I can't believe you managed to be with multiple men at the same time.\"","\"Zhengyang, I did it all for you in the beginning. You can't just stand by and do nothing.\"","\"What am I supposed to do?\""]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Zhou Man Arrested","paragraphs":["After the man finished speaking, he hung up the phone.","\"Mom, your guess was right. That fickle woman Zhou Man indeed asked me to save her.\"","\"There really are all kinds of people in this world, to think she deceived so many. Zhengyang, were you deceived by her? If you were...\"","Yang Cui's words were interrupted by Xu Zhengyang.","\"Mom, I wasn't.\"","He wasn't that foolish. How could he possibly be deceived by Zhou Man? However, at the time, he did directly transfer money to Zhou Man.","\"Is she calling again?\"","Yang Cui asked, hearing Xu Zhengyang's phone ringing once more.","Xu Zhengyang looked at the caller ID, and it was indeed Zhou Man.","Xu Zhengyang was about to hang up and block the number, but Yang Cui said beside him, \"Answer it and see what she wants to say.\"","Xu Zhengyang listened to Yang Cui and answered the call.","\"Zhengyang, you have to save me. I'm driving to Rong City now. Please save me. Arrange a place for me to stay. The police in Pei City are trying to arrest me now. My mom just called me, asking what on earth happened.\"","Yang Cui grabbed Xu Zhengyang's phone and said, \"Just come over. When you get to Rong City, I'll arrange a place for you to stay.\"","\"Okay, thank you, Aunt Yang.\" Zhou Man expressed her gratitude profusely over the phone.","After hanging up, Xu Zhengyang looked at Yang Cui, a bit confused. Since when had his mother changed, becoming so kind-hearted and willing to help Zhou Man?","\"What are you looking at?\" Yang Cui asked.","\"Mom, are you really going to find her a place to stay and save her?\" Xu Zhengyang still couldn't believe it.","\"Are you stupid? When we know where she is, we'll have someone report her to the police. Don't worry, it's not just the Pei City police looking for her. Rong City will surely have police searching for her too. We'll just hand her over directly, so she won't be able to implicate us in the future.\"","So this was his mother's plan. Brilliant, truly brilliant. This way, Zhou Man wouldn't bother them anymore.","It's just a pity that the situation had turned again. Even with Xu Xiuhe in a car accident, how could they still investigate Zhou Man's affairs so thoroughly, even more detailed than his own investigation? Zhou Man was quite cunning, just applied her skills in the wrong place.","\"Mom, what about Dad?\"","\"What about him? It's better that he's not at home. I can be more free, do whatever I want. Besides, he's with Xu Xiuhe. No matter how much Xu Xiuhe hates him, he's still his biological son.\"","...","Online, many people began to criticize Zhou Man. Many who had just been criticizing Shen Yin started running to her Weibo comments, apologizing and admitting they were wrong for being misled, begging for forgiveness.","The \"CP fans\" were even more ashamed, starting to apologize in the Yin He Couple's super topic, admitting they had spoken too loudly earlier.","Shen Yin didn't care at all. She had already seen through the nature of the internet. Whether they apologized or not didn't matter; she didn't care and wouldn't forgive them. She'd just pretend it never happened, as long as it didn't affect Xu Xiuhe or Heyuan Group.","Shu Yi had already rushed over. Xu Xiuhe had handled this matter so quickly that she hadn't even had time to react before the public opinion had shifted. Indeed, a man who loves you won't let you suffer any harm, even if he's blind, he can still handle things well.","\"Zhengzheng, let godmother hug you.\" Shu Yi arrived and picked up Xu Yunzheng.","\"You must have started investigating her earlier, right?\" Shu Yi asked. Otherwise, the results wouldn't have come out so quickly.","\"Yes, from the moment we received her blackmail attempt, Xiuhe had detectives start following and investigating her.\"","\"This woman is really something else. If she were in the entertainment industry, she'd definitely be a force to be reckoned with.\"","\"Why?\" Shen Yin didn't quite understand.","\"Because, judging from her ability to be with four men simultaneously, she's not just a time management expert, she must have 108 tricks up her sleeve.\"","...","\"That makes sense.\"","\"By the way, do you have more details? The detectives' investigation must be very thorough, right?\"","What Liu Bo released was indeed just an overview, without specific details. But who was Shu Yi? She could guess that with Xu Xiuhe's personality, he probably even had records of when she entered hotels.","\"Yes, there's a document, many pages long. It's in Xiuhe's phone.\"","Shen Yin had only read the beginning, not even finishing it all.","\"Brother-in-law, you don't mind if I take a look, do you?\"","Shu Yi looked towards Xu Xiuhe, who was sitting on the bed with his eyes closed, resting.","Xu Xiuhe handed his phone to Shen Yin, who took it, opened the document, and passed it to Shu Yi.","Shu Yi put Zhengzheng down, took the phone, and started reading with great interest, as if it were a novel.","\"Oh my god, is this real? It's even more outrageous than the novels I've read.\"","\"What's wrong? Isn't it just about her deceiving one person after another, with me being one of them?\" Shen Yin joked.","She was the only woman among the many victims.","\"No, no, no, haven't you seen the content at the back? Her background is very bizarre. If she hadn't done so many bad things, I might even feel sorry for her.\"","\"What background?\"","\"It turns out she's not her mother's biological daughter. Her birth mother is actually Yang Cui!\"","Shen Yin was also stunned when she heard this. Is that so? She really didn't know. Indeed, like mother, like daughter. When the upper beam is not straight, the lower ones will go aslant. Even though Yang Cui didn't raise her, the innate malice was the same. Is this the power of genes?","\"My goodness, she even had a relationship with Xu Zhengyang.\"","Shu Yi covered her mouth.","Shen Yin knew about this; Xu Xiuhe had told her before.","\"What am I seeing?\" Shu Yi's eyes were wide with shock. Is this even viewable? It wouldn't pass censorship if made into a TV series.","Compared to Shu Yi's surprise, Shen Yin was much calmer.","\"You knew?\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe and asked.","\"Yes, Liu Bo told me this morning.\"","\"Does Yang Cui know that Zhou Man is her biological daughter?\"","Xu Xiuhe shook his head. Yang Cui probably doesn't know. When Yang Cui married his father, she said she had never been married before. Now it seems even Xu Guimin was deceived.","\"Look at the news. Zhou Man has been arrested by the police in Rong City.\"","Shen Yin opened the news. Zhou Man had driven from Pei City to Rong City, but as soon as she arrived in Rong City, before she could even step out of her car, she was surrounded by several police vehicles.","\"Your people?\" Shen Yin asked again.","Xu Xiuhe shook his head again. This matter was no longer his concern. He had the idea, but given his current blindness, it was inconvenient for him to do much of anything. He hadn't yet had the chance to order Zhou Man's arrest.","However, Zhou Man had committed too many sins, to the point where even the public could no longer tolerate it. If the police didn't take action, the people would be the first to object.","Zhou Man was intercepted at the highway exit. Before she could even react, she was handcuffed and ultimately placed in the police car."]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: Chinese New Year","paragraphs":["After Zhou Man's arrest, news spread online, and Shen Yin received another wave of attention, gaining many followers. However, she had already seen through the nature of the internet, and none of this mattered to her anymore.","Fame brings scrutiny, and people are quick to tear down those who fall. Only after the Zhou Man incident was resolved did Shen Yin feel some peace.","Xu Xiuhe no longer wanted to stay in the hospital, and Shen Yin supported his decision. They immediately completed the discharge procedures.","After returning to Ziyue Manor, Shen Yin wasn't idle. She constantly sought ways to treat Xu Xiuhe's eyes.","As the year-end approached, it was Shen Yin's first time experiencing a modern New Year celebration. With only three people in their spacious house, the holiday felt particularly quiet.","Fortunately, on the eve of New Year's Eve, Fang Yue called and invited Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe to spend the holiday with their family of three at Yuelan Manor. Shen Yin thought it would be better to have a lively New Year's celebration, so she agreed.","Early on New Year's Eve, Shen Yin packed their things and called her driver. The family of three, loaded with packages, arrived at Yuelan Manor.","Fang Yue had been waiting for them for a long time.","\"Grandma, Happy New Year,\" said Zhengzheng, dressed festively. Shen Yin had dressed Zhengzheng in a bright red jacket and put a tiger-head hat on him.","\"Oh my, where did this little cutie come from?\" Fang Yue couldn't stop smiling as she picked up Zhengzheng.","Fang Yue carried Zhengzheng into the house, while Shen Yin led Xu Xiuhe by the hand.","The house was decorated with \"Fu\" characters everywhere, and New Year paintings were pasted on the window glass. As soon as they entered, they could feel the strong festive atmosphere.","Shen Yin guided Xu Xiuhe to sit on the sofa. After playing with Zhengzheng for a while, Fang Yue also put him next to the sofa.","Zhengzheng seemed to have never experienced such a strong New Year atmosphere before. He was so excited that he ran around everywhere.","Shen Yin and Fang Yue went to the kitchen together to prepare lunch.","\"Yin Yin, how are Xiuhe's eyes? Can they still recover?\"","Shen Yin shook her head. She had prepared Chinese herbal medicine for Xu Xiuhe, the kind that promotes blood circulation and removes blood stasis, but it didn't seem to have much effect.","\"What did the doctor say?\"","\"The doctor said it might take some more time. We have to wait for the blood clot to dissolve before his vision can recover.\"","\"That's good then. As long as it can recover, it doesn't matter if it takes time. We just worry that...\"","Fang Yue didn't finish her sentence. During the New Year, one should say auspicious things for good luck in the coming year.","\"Zhou Man has been imprisoned,\" Fang Yue said to Shen Yin after they finished eating.","\"Yes, she has,\" Shen Yin also felt conflicted about Zhou Man's situation.","\"I told you, a woman like that would face karma sooner or later. I wonder who her parents are, how they could raise a perfectly good child to become like this,\" Fang Yue criticized.","\"Mom, her birth mother is Yang Cui, Xu Xiuhe's stepmother.\"","\"What? Doesn't that mean she's related to Xiuhe?\" Fang Yue was eating a tangerine, but upon hearing this, the fruit suddenly lost its taste.","\"No, no, no. She has no relation to Xiuhe. She's the child of Yang Cui and someone else.\"","\"Does Yang Cui know?\"","\"Yang Cui doesn't know. Zhou Man and Xu Zhengyang are both morally corrupt. How could Yang Cui possibly know that Zhou Man is her biological daughter?\"","\"What about Xu Guimin? How is he?\"","Fang Yue knew that Xu Guimin had been kept in the hospital by Xu Xiuhe.","\"He's still in the hospital. There's nothing seriously wrong with him. He said he dreamed of Xiuhe's mother, who told him not to return to the Xu family house, or she would come to take him away. That's why he asked Xiuhe to save him. He must feel guilty and afraid of Sun Wenting, so he wanted to see Xiuhe and admit his mistakes.\"","\"What a scumbag. He's far worse than your father. Fortunately, Xiuhe didn't take after Xu Guimin.\"","\"I think maybe Yang Cui and her son wanted to harm him, so Xiuhe's mother appeared in his dream. Xiuhe's mother loved that scumbag until her death.\"","\"Love makes people blind, literally,\" Fang Yue sighed.","\"I've prepared the room upstairs for you. You shouldn't go back tonight, it's too late and not safe.\"","Shen Yin agreed. Ziyue Manor indeed lacked the New Year atmosphere.","In the evening, while watching the Spring Festival Gala, Shen Lv couldn't stop talking. He complained that this program was boring, that person couldn't sing well, this sketch wasn't funny at all, and so on. He criticized everything, saying it was a mess and not attractive at all. The Gala lasted for hours, and he complained the entire time, his mouth never stopping.","Shen Tianzheng finally couldn't take it anymore.","\"If you don't like it, don't watch it. No one's forcing you. Have you stopped talking since eight o'clock? Aren't you thirsty? After this New Year, you'll be 30 years old. You're turning 30 and still don't have a partner, yet you have the nerve to critique the Spring Festival Gala.\"","\"Dad, just because I don't have a partner, does that mean I don't have the freedom to comment on the Gala? How can you say that? It's genuinely not good, and now I can't even say so?\"","Shen Lv looked indignant.","\"Go ahead and talk. When will you be able to talk yourself into getting a partner?\"","Hearing this, Shen Lv became upset. Did he not want one? The person he liked was already married, which was painful enough, and now his father was rubbing salt in his wound.","\"Oh, Yin Yin, don't you have a friend called Shu Yi? The one who starred in 'Yanxi Biography', that popular and beautiful young actress. Why isn't she performing at the Spring Festival Gala?\" Fang Yue asked while cracking sunflower seeds.","\"She thought participating in the Gala would be too troublesome. The production team invited her in July, but she declined.\"","\"What a great opportunity. Performing at the Gala is such an honor. Why would she refuse?\"","Shen Yin had asked Shu Yi this question before. Shu Yi's answer was that she wanted to spend New Year with her family.","\"Maybe she wanted to spend New Year with her parents. She's an only child. If she doesn't go home for New Year, her parents would be alone.\"","\"I see.\" But Fang Yue seemed to be thinking of something else.","Shu Yi was in the old town district, watching the Spring Festival Gala with her family. From time to time, she shared gossip about the TV performers in their small group chat with Qi Ji and Shen Yin.","She had been in the entertainment industry for quite a few years and knew some inside stories. She wasn't sure about the rumors circulating online, but what she shared was all true gossip.","For example, the male and female leads in the sketch currently playing on TV were actually a couple in real life.","After hearing this, Shen Yin started to observe the subtle interactions between the two on TV.","\"After watching so many sketches, this one's acting is somewhat watchable. They look so convincing,\" Shen Lv started commenting again.","Shen Yin thought of Shu Yi's message and said, \"Is there a possibility that they're genuinely expressing their feelings?\"","\"It's not an act,\" Xu Xiuhe suddenly interjected.","\"How do you know?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I've seen them together before.\"","\"Do you know who they are?\" Shen Lv inquired. The television report hadn't mentioned their names; the names were only shown in the subtitles. Could his brother-in-law be so skilled as to recognize them just by their voices?"]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: True Feelings","paragraphs":["\"I think I can see now,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","During their discussion, he had begun to vaguely make out blurry figures on the television. Gradually, he could see people's faces clearly.","\"Really? How many is this?\" Shen Lv seemed even more excited than Shen Yin.","He jumped off the sofa and ran in front of Xu Xiuhe, holding up two fingers.","\"Two.\"","\"Wow, that's amazing! You really can see! This is incredible.\"","Shen Yin was also excited. Had he finally regained his sight?","\"Daddy, how many is this?\" The little one held up three fingers.","\"Three.\"","\"He really can see! He really can see! This is wonderful.\" Fang Yue was overjoyed from the bottom of her heart. If he had remained blind, how would they have managed in the future?","After so many days, no one could be happier than Shen Yin.","The Spring Festival Gala continued playing on TV, but none of the many people in the living room paid any attention to whether it was good or not anymore.","Early the next morning, many people learned that Xu Xiuhe's eyesight had returned to normal. When Liu Bo heard the news, he was ecstatic - he finally wouldn't have to work overtime anymore.","\"Liu Assistant, because of my situation, your wedding was delayed. I'll arrange your wedding for you.\"","Liu Assistant was speechless...","New year, new beginnings. After the fourth day of the Lunar New Year, Rong City began to resume work and production. Xu Xiuhe also returned to his post.","Shen Yin hadn't been to her studio for a while because she had been taking care of Xu Xiuhe, but fortunately, the group of young women at the studio were quite capable.","Everything was proceeding in an orderly manner.","And that set of Chinese-style furniture had been bought by someone for 5 million yuan.","When Kang Guopeng learned that the furniture he made had ultimately sold for 5 million yuan, he still couldn't believe it. Only when he received his share of the profits did he understand that everything Shen Yin had said before was true.","Because Shen Yin had been quite busy lately, the Martial Arts Club classes had been suspended for several weeks. Fortunately, the basic skills of the dozen or so girls were already quite good. Shen Yin had a new idea: with technology being so advanced now, she could record videos of herself practicing martial arts and send them to the girls.","Their first stage had already ended, and the choice was in their hands now. If they wanted to continue learning, they could follow the videos. If they didn't want to, there was nothing she could do about it. In six months, she had taught them the basics, which should be enough for self-defense.","Thinking that the new year might be busier, Shen Yin composed a long message and sent it to the Martial Arts Club group chat.","The group members had no objections. About half were willing to continue learning from the videos, while the other half felt they had learned enough and didn't need to continue.","Shu Yi and Qi Ji were both in this group chat. When they saw this message, they both thought Shen Yin was planning to have a second child.","They immediately called Shen Yin, who laughed when she heard this. Had she ever hinted that she was planning to have another child? It didn't seem so. How had these two come to that conclusion?","Although Fang Yue had reminded her several times, both directly and indirectly, to hurry up and have another child while she was young so that Zheng Zheng would have a companion, Shen Yin still felt it was too early.","\"What about you? Are you joining a new production after the New Year?\" Shen Yin changed the subject.","\"I've agreed to do a variety show,\" Shu Yi replied.","\"'I Just Want to Be With You' is about to end, right?\" Shen Yin asked.","Shu Yi made a sound of agreement.","Shen Yin had been too busy to follow the drama, but Qi Ji was different. She was super free every day, even to the point of dragging Ye Rong to watch Shu Yi's urban romance drama with her. Of course, they had to support their good friend's TV series.","Little did they know before watching, but once they started, Qi Ji became obsessed. It didn't seem at all like what Shu Yi had described before. Neither of them seemed to be acting - Chang Zhiyuan must be using public funds to date.","At first, Qi Ji was worried that people online would criticize Shu Yi's acting skills for not being able to keep up with Chang Zhiyuan. After all, Shu Yi had often complained to them about how Chang Zhiyuan would improvise and change the script.","But now that it had been edited, you couldn't tell at all. The drama was hilarious. In the show, Shu Yi often blushed and looked flustered when being flirted with, but that was exactly the effect they wanted.","In the drama, Chang Zhiyuan was Shu Yi's boss. When netizens found out that in reality, Chang Zhiyuan was actually Shu Yi's top boss, they went crazy with excitement.","This was like a TV drama come to life!","Especially when they learned that Chang Zhiyuan had never acted before, they became even more convinced that he had only acted in this drama to pursue Shu Yi.","Most netizens were shipping the real-life couple. Damn, it was too sweet! They heard that it was the first on-screen kiss for both of them. It was killing everyone with sweetness.","During the winter holiday season, Shu Yi became popular again, directly entering the ranks of current top actresses.","There were even many people urging them to get married in her Weibo super topic.","[When will the civil affairs bureau be sensible and come to them? It's already come to this, why make the newlyweds go there?]","[Wow, that's so detailed. They must be real. My CP must be real. That moon wasn't a prop prepared by the crew, it was made by the male lead himself over several days and nights.]","[I heard this male lead has dated quite a few people before, changing partners every month. Is that true?]","[To the person above, shut up. According to the information I have, that's all in the past. How can changing partners every month be true love?]","[Alright, alright, everything you say is correct. They're real, okay?]","[Some crew members have revealed that the male lead is indeed pursuing the female lead, but whether he's succeeded or not is another matter.]","Chang Zhiyuan gained quite a few fans because of \"I Just Want to Be With You\". Many people sent private messages asking if they were really together.","His leg had just healed, and that woman Shu Yi only appeared when working. At other times, she was completely missing in action. When she saw him, she acted just like she was seeing her boss - strictly professional, with no other expressions or extra words.","Shu Yi was the same. She didn't reply to these kinds of private messages. The TV drama was the TV drama, and reality was reality. You had to distinguish between them and couldn't generalize.","But the drama was too popular, and there were too many CP fans. The super topic never stopped trending. Even her parents came to ask if it was true, and if the reason she had shut herself at home every day during that period was because of a breakup.","Who could blame them when their on-screen chemistry was so natural? The more people shipped them, the more invested they became. Shu Yi's parents were also caught up in it.","They would occasionally ask about Chang Zhiyuan's current situation, persistently inquiring if they had ever been together.","Shu Yi was feeling annoyed and didn't want to return to Ziyue Manor, so she asked her agent to find her a role. There weren't any suitable acting jobs available at the moment, but there was a decent variety show - an entertaining, comedic, and relaxing one. She could participate in that to unwind, so she agreed.","There were still two days before she had to join the production team. Shu Yi packed her things early in preparation. Qi Ji had been holding back all this time. She also stumbled, but knowing their current situation, she hadn't told Shu Yi that she was pursuing this drama series."]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: Live Show","paragraphs":["Chang Zhiyuan's leg had almost fully recovered, but Shu Yi still didn't want to see him.","On the eighth day of the first lunar month, to celebrate Xu Xiuhe regaining his sight, a small gathering was held at Qingfeng Mingyue.","When Shen Yin told Shu Yi about the gathering the day before, Shu Yi said she might have to join a variety show and wouldn't be able to make it, but promised to make it up when she returned.","In the private room, Qi Ji, with her big belly, started looking for Shu Yi as soon as she arrived. When everyone else had gathered and Shu Yi still hadn't shown up, seeing Chang Zhiyuan's gloomy face across from her, she could guess that Shu Yi must have decided not to come to avoid him.","Unlike before, the number of people at this gathering was the same as usual because Chen Siming had come.","Chen Siming was the last to arrive. He immediately penalized himself with a drink, explaining that he was late because he had gotten older and his family was forcing him to go on blind dates, so he had escaped from one to come here.","Shen Yin suddenly remembered that previously, Fang Yue and Xu Xiuhe had been planning to introduce Chen Siming to Fang Ning, but there hadn't been any progress yet.","\"So, do you want to meet my cousin? She's teaching at a university now, and her family background is pretty good.\"","\"Sister-in-law, if you're introducing her, I definitely have to meet her. If nothing else, just for the chance that if it works out, Brother Xu will have to call me cousin-in-law.\"","Xu Xiuhe glanced over.","One look said it all.","Chen Siming laughed awkwardly. Seeing that look made him even more excited - if Xu Xiuhe could call him brother-in-law, that would feel amazing.","\"Brother Yuan, how have you been? I heard you were in a drama recently that was quite popular. Was that for Sister-in-law?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Chen Siming felt another wave of murderous intent.","\"Siming, have some more wine,\" Xue Jingrui said from the side, unable to bear watching any longer.","Chen Siming really had a knack for bringing up the wrong topics.","\"Uh, did I say something wrong? I'll punish myself with three more drinks.\"","Chen Siming drank three more glasses of wine, finishing with a resentful expression on his face. He really was something, drinking four glasses right off the bat, but it wasn't entirely his fault.","He had been so busy lately with expanding his private restaurant that he hadn't been paying much attention to what was going on with everyone else.","At the table, Chang Zhiyuan kept drinking silently. Shu Yi must be avoiding him, that's why she didn't come.","Even Xu Xiuhe couldn't stand to watch anymore. At this rate, Chang Zhiyuan was sure to get drunk tonight.","\"Drink a little less.\"","\"Don't worry about me. Let me drown my sorrows in wine, until death do us part.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's speech was already becoming slurred, his eyes growing unfocused.","In the private room, three grown men watched one person drink, while two women and a child kept eating, as if they were in two separate worlds.","\"Shu Yi does like me, but why doesn't she want to be with me? Why, why?\" Chang Zhiyuan mumbled.","As if this wasn't enough, Chang Zhiyuan, emboldened by alcohol, picked up his phone and started dialing. The room suddenly fell silent.","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable.\"","Chang Zhiyuan seemed to have expected this result, and everyone present also knew what \"the number you have dialed is temporarily unavailable\" meant.","Chang Zhiyuan persisted and dialed again.","Everyone thought it would be the same result - no answer, or rather, the person on the other end deliberately hanging up, not wanting to answer.","\"Hello.\"","Clearly, even Chang Zhiyuan hadn't expected that this time, the call would actually be answered.","Everyone in the room held their breath.","\"Shu Yueru, why don't you answer my calls? Why are you ignoring me?\"","Chang Zhiyuan immediately asked two questions, which obviously confused the person on the other end.","\"May I ask who's calling? Shu Yueru is your original name, right?\"","Someone on the other end spoke.","Shen Yin suddenly realized that when Shu Yi said she was joining a show, she had initially thought Shu Yi was just saying that to avoid coming to this gathering. Now it seemed she was actually telling the truth - she had joined a show and was now recording it.","At that moment, Shu Yi sat in front of the camera, regretting her decision immensely. She had blocked Chang Zhiyuan a long time ago, but during the promotion of the show \"I Really Want to Be with You,\" she had been forced to unblock him. When she came to participate in this show, she had forgotten to block him again.","Although it was a recorded show, there were quite a few audience members present, many of whom had bought tickets to see the live recording because they were fans of Shu Yi and wanted to be closer to their idol.","In the studio, Shu Yi sat on stage with several other guests and the host.","This variety show was just a warm-up. The guests were getting to know each other, playing a game to become closer, before they would go to the countryside together to experience life there.","The rules of this game were that all guests had to open their phones. They would see whose phone rang first, and most importantly, they had to answer it.","Just a moment ago, a male guest had received a call from his mother, asking if he would be coming home for the Lantern Festival. She also reminded him to dress warmly as the weather was getting cold, to eat less cold food, and to avoid spicy dishes.","\"A mother's heart follows her child wherever they go.\" That phone call had brought emotion to the entire studio. Most mothers love their children, and no matter where their children are, mothers always worry.","Some audience members even started tearing up. Some called their own mothers, while others sent messages to their family members. It was a large-scale tear-jerking scene. Just as the emotions had successfully built up, another guest's phone rang - it was Shu Yi's.","The first time Chang Zhiyuan called her, she immediately hung up. But during the game, it was different. With so many audience members below the stage and so many cameras on stage, Shu Yi didn't dare make any small moves.","After hesitating for a long time, she finally answered the call, even following the game rules by putting it on speakerphone.","Shu Yueru, not answering calls, ignoring me.","These three key phrases not only made the other guests' imaginations run wild, but even the audience below the stage felt that this call was suspicious.","In the eyes of the audience, \"I Really Want to Be with You\" was the ultimate sweet drama, a TV series tailor-made by a media company's CEO to pursue his girlfriend.","Let's be honest, who wouldn't be obsessed with this storyline? Everyone's gone crazy over it, and for good reason. You've got a handsome man and a beautiful woman, both equally stunning. When they're together, you can feel the love flowing between them. It's impossible to imagine them not ending up together. They've clearly been secretly in love for ages, and all that's missing is an official announcement.","But the two main characters still haven't made a move, and people are starting to wonder. Could it be that actors these days have honed their skills to such perfection? If so, it's incredibly natural, without a trace of artifice. Even if it's all just acting, we're totally buying it. Who wouldn't praise this drama for being absolutely brilliant?"]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: I Miss You","paragraphs":["However, just now, what did they hear? The voice on the other end of the phone was so familiar, and the tone was equally intimate.","\"It's my boss.\"","\"If I remember correctly, Teacher Shu recently starred in a popular drama with her own boss, called 'I Really Want to Be with You',\" the host inquired.","Shu Yi smiled awkwardly, already trying her best to manage her expression.","The guests also grew curious. The guests present were all young people, both male and female, and most knew a thing or two about Shu Yi's affairs.","\"Mr. Chang, I'm recording a variety show, at the program site,\" Shu Yi didn't say directly that she had something to do and needed to hang up. She thought Chang Zhiyuan should know his boundaries, what to say and what not to say, and that it was time to end the call.","But she never expected that Chang Zhiyuan on the other end wasn't sober at all.","\"What show are you recording? What variety show? How come I don't know about this?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked hazily.","The people in the private room also realized the other end was at a show site. Xue Jingrui stood up, preparing to take Chang Zhiyuan's phone away, otherwise who knew what kind of trouble it might cause later.","\"Jingrui, don't touch me. I'm not drunk.\"","Well, the first reaction of the audience was that he was drowning his sorrows in alcohol.","Shu Yi wanted to hang up, but the game rules were there - only the other side could end the call. Otherwise, it would be breaking the rules. For a moment, she thought about hanging up, but she also knew how hard it had been for her to get to where she was. If she ended this call, it would definitely leave a bad impression.","Steeling herself, Shu Yi spoke again, \"Mr. Chang, did you dial the wrong number? You must be drunk.\"","\"Shu Yueru, let me tell you, I'm not drunk. You have to give me an explanation today. You clearly like me, you clearly have feelings for me too, but why are you avoiding me, not giving me a chance?\"","The private room at Qingfeng Mingyue and the studio of Banana TV, the two places that should have been the liveliest, were now quieter than each other.","\"I'm not avoiding you. I just don't know what to do.\"","Might as well go all in. Shu Yi was on the verge of tears. What kind of variety show was this? Why did it have to have this segment? And why did Chang Zhiyuan call her again? She had just started to move on a little.","\"Shu Yueru, I really like you.\" Chang Zhiyuan, with a drunken tone, repeated this sentence several times.","\"I really like you.\"","What's the most lethal sweetness? It's when the main character takes the lead in creating it themselves. Chang Zhiyuan's words made the audience below burst into laughter.","Is this still the domineering male lead and superior from \"I Really Want to Be with You\"? This is clearly a pitiful little crybaby begging for love.","It's too damn funny. This show was worth coming to. Getting to eat candy live, how about that?","A group of people who loved to watch the excitement, the host's earpiece constantly relaying the director's voice.","\"This is exactly the effect we want. Keep guiding it along.\" Isn't this where the show's highlight comes from? This is simply the key to ratings and traffic.","\"Teacher Shu's original name is Shu Yueru, right?\"","\"Shut up. Only I can call her Shu Yueru. No one else is allowed. You can only call her Shu Yi.\"","\"Alright, we can only call her Shu Yi.\"","The host went along with Chang Zhiyuan's words.","\"That's right. Shu Yueru, I've said it before, only I can call her by this name.\"","The man's tone was both aggrieved and pitiful, hazy and confused, making the audience below laugh loudly.","\"It's so noisy over there.\"","\"I told you I'm recording a show.\"","\"What show are you recording? Why are you recording a show without me? Shu Yueru, why didn't you bring me along?\"","Shu Yi held her forehead, feeling utterly hopeless. Help, can someone please save her?","\"Chang Zhiyuan, who are you with right now?\"","Shu Yi suddenly remembered that Shen Yin had mentioned they were going to gather today.","\"I'm with Xiuhe, and Jingrui, and also our godson.\" Chang Zhiyuan sat by the dining table, counting on his fingers one by one.","After Shu Yi called out Chang Zhiyuan's full name, the audience below went almost crazy. Something about that tone just didn't sound quite right.","\"Okay, can you pass the phone...\"","Shu Yi wanted to ask Chang Zhiyuan to pass the phone to Shen Yin nearby, but before she could finish, she was interrupted by the other end.","\"You mean, pass the phone to our godson? Wait a moment. Zhengzheng, godmother misses you, say hello to godmother.\"","Chang Zhiyuan stretched out his arm, passing the phone to Zhengzheng.","\"Godmother! Zhengzheng misses you!\"","The little one didn't understand why Chang Zhiyuan asked him to say this, but he did indeed miss his godmother. Today, so many people had come, but godmother wasn't here.","\"Oh, godmother misses you too.\"","Chang Zhiyuan immediately pulled back his hand and asked, \"Shu Yueru, you miss Zhengzheng, do you miss me?\"","Time froze again, the scene paused.","After several seconds, Shu Yi still hadn't spoken.","\"Shu Yueru, if you don't say anything, I'll take it as a yes. I miss you too. Where are you? I'll drive over to pick you up.\"","When Chang Zhiyuan mentioned driving, it startled Shu Yi.","\"No, no, no, you've been drinking. You can't drive, understand? You have to obey the law and follow traffic rules.\"","\"If I don't drive and follow traffic rules, will you like me then?\"","Damn, this joke just won't end, will it? They've only been on the phone for a few sentences, and half of them have been \"I like you,\" \"Do you miss me?\" \"Can you like me?\" Shu Yi was utterly speechless.","So this is what Chang Zhiyuan is like when he's drunk? How can he be so childish? Even more childish than Zhengzheng.","\"We'll talk about this later. I still need to record the show now. The audience and guests are all waiting, they'll get anxious. Can we pause for now?\"","The audience and guests at the scene all shook their heads. No, that's not right, they weren't anxious at all.","\"Are you all anxious?\"","Chang Zhiyuan suddenly became sociable. Everyone in the private room was scared. He managed to stand up straight from his chair, using a drink bottle as a microphone, and shouted loudly, \"Are you all anxious?\"","\"We're not anxious!\"","Whether it was the guests or the audience at the scene, they all spoke in unison.","The audience's thoughts: This is way more exciting than a TV drama, how could they possibly be anxious?","The guests: The longer this goes on, the higher the ratings. With high ratings, who's afraid the later shows won't be popular? If the show becomes popular, even if they're not the main characters, they can still bask in the reflected glory.","\"Look, everyone's saying there's no rush. Why are you in such a hurry? Shu Yueru, are you eager to come back and see me?\"","\"Fine, fine, fine. I'm in a hurry. So, can you please pass the phone to someone else next to you?\"","\"No, I can't. Everyone around me is listening to my phone call. They're not in a hurry either, and they're not interrupting me.\""]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: Variety","paragraphs":["Once more, the audience at the scene was shocked by Chang Zhiyuan's remarks over the phone — too adorable!","In a private dining room nearby, a group of people were laughing, among them Shen Yin. She too wanted to laugh, but the thought of Shu Yi over there, surely feeling helpless made her refrain.","Initially, Chang Zhiyuan was passionately in conversation, and Jing Rui failed to snatch the mobile away. However, he now seemed calmer, thus it should make it possible to hang up the call.","\"Yunzheng, could you ask your godfather to hang up?” Shen Yin whispered into Xu Yunzheng's ear.","Xu Yunzheng nodded.","\"Godfather, let's dine, you'll run out of battery if you continue on the phone.”","His childish voice melted the hearts of the audience once heard again.","Many of Shu Yi’s die-hard fans understood that the kid on the other end of the call was the baby who acted in the drama with Shu Yi before, they were surprised to know that he call Chang Zhiyuan godfather too.","Chang Zhiyuan noted his phone’s remaining battery was at 13%, he blurted out in a tipsy tone: \"I really am out of power.”","Shu Yi sighed in relief as Chang Zhiyuan finally disconnected the call.","“Just now, the phone call Shu Yi received, was probably from someone very important, right?” The host asked with a smile.","Shu Yi replied with an awkward smile, as she had an idea of what’s about to happen. Questions from the guests, hosts, and the audience along with the trending Weibo queries, although the show was being recorded, it was also happening live on Weibo. If her guess wasn’t wrong, the whole exchange earlier had been streamed live. For the first time, the show was attracting viewership via all these dramas.","\"Yes, he's a very good, dear friend.”","\"But then have you ever considered being together, after all, the drama 'I Just Want to Be With You' is too sweet.” The host asked.","'I Just Want to Be With You’ was a drama that had made it big without much publicity. Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan didn’t try to sensationalize anything either. The success was purely based on the quality of the drama and viewers' reviews.","Because of their low profile, viewers bought in more.","\"Not at the moment, he was possibly too intoxicated, too deep into the character.”","Shu Yi almost laughed at her own explanation. The dialogue between them just then was too telling, how can they merely be 'good friends'? How can he speak so much and appear so aggrieved when drunk?","She felt like she was made the primary instigator, she knew she had to be careful with her words next or else she might become a total internet sensation.","“What are your plans in your career and personal life, Shu Yi?” The host moved on to the next question.","\"I have not given thought to romance yet, I am 25 this year, isn’t it too early,” Shu Yi quipped, a touch of satire in her voice. The entertainment industry was full of examples of female celebrities not getting married by the age of 30, her being 25 was indeed early.","\"So you mean to focus on your career?” The host prompted.","\"Yes, I hope to win an award before I turn 30.”","Fortunately, the guests and the host have high emotional quotient, and didn't dwell on Shu Yi's issue. After all, they are insiders of the industry and they know the rules well.","After the show ended, Shu Yi, exhausted, exited the TV station. Outside, a crowd of fans were eagerly waiting for her. Yan Yan, following beside her, had seen the trending news online and wasn't sure what Shu Yi was currently thinking.","\"Our beloved, we want autographs!\" some female fans shouted.","Handing over papers, Shu Yi took out a pen and started signing.","\"We won't pry into your private life, as long as you take care of your work,\" they said.","Shu Yi responded to each one of them. By 11 pm, she arrived at the hotel.","She thought she would fall asleep immediately, given how exhausted she was, but to her surprise, found herself wide awake. She was distressed, turning and tossing in bed. The man seemed to have the knack to tug at her heartstrings, keeping her awake, causing restless nights until dawn.","The next morning, a hot search topic on Weibo, \"Famous Actress's Mysterious Phone Call,\" ranked first.","Upon clicking into it, she found the whole thread filled with fans who shipped her and Chang Zhiyuan.","\"It's the first time I see someone being pressured to marry in real life.\"","\"Is she the first actress who's being urged to marry?","\"Their conversations are hilarious. So, my goddess is called Shu Yueru.\"","\"The one above, you're not allowed to call her that. The boss said, only he can call her Shu Yueru. The rest of you cannot.\"","Shu Yi gazed at the comments online and chuckled. If Chang Zhiyuan was not this rich, if his family did not object, they probably would be happy together.","Regardless of their comments, neither Shu Yi nor Chang Zhiyuan responded. Chang Zhiyuan, recalling his words that night while browsing the live stream videos and netizens' comments, regretted his actions. He wished he could smack himself. He had been very disciplined and had not disturbed Shu Yi, but he hadn't anticipated that he would place Shu Yi in such an awkward situation after getting drunk.","As days passed, the issue finally calmed down, however, it didn't affect the fans who supported them as a couple. No response meant they were guilty, and guilt suggested they had feelings for each other.","The reason behind Xu Xiuhe's car accident still remained a mystery. The driver suggested it was due to an illness that he had no control over, leaving no further explanation.","Xu Xiuhe visited Xu Guimin in the hospital. With Xu Guimin insisting on being discharged, Xu Xiuhe didn't stop him and allowed him to leave.","Ever since Heyuan Group signed the contract with the foreign group, Ruida Group, the company had been doing well continuously, making profits.","Encouraged by Xu Xiuhe, Xiao Li'er and Liu Bo's wedding was successfully held in March.","As Xu Xiuhe said, he took care of the entire process. Shen Yin also arrived at the scene on the day, and this could be counted as her witness to another wedding.","At this time, Liu Bo and Xiao Li'er had developed feelings for each other. At the wedding, when the emcee mentioned about the groom kissing the bride, they were initially shy but then, they kissed for a long time, only to be interrupted by the emcee at last.","When the two were kissing, Shen Yin suddenly covered her son's eyes. Her little boy expressed great dissatisfaction and tried hard to open Shen Yin's hand from his eyes.","\"Mom, I can't see, and I'm unhappy,\" said the little guy.","Shen Yin placed her hands down this time, but when the little guy opened his eyes, the wedding had already moved on to the next session.","Xu Xiuhe specifically approved the couple to go on their honeymoon. Taking the opportunity of a sunny spring day, they could relax their minds.","After Liu Bo left, Xu Xiuhe became even busier. Shen Yin didn't get to idle around either. She continued drawing a design sketch of traditional Chinese furniture and sent it to Kang Guopeng.","Meanwhile, the Yunyin Clothing Workshop was in steady operation.","Chen Siming somehow heard about Shen Yin's delicious cooking and specifically ran over to learn from her, saying he was willing to pay tuition fees.","\"I heard you plan to expand your private kitchen business again?\" He asked.","\"Yes, sometimes business is not good, that's why I came to ask for your advice.\"","\"I think in the catering business, especially in the private kitchen, not only is the quality of the dishes important, but the environment also matters,\" said Shen Yin.","\"You're right, this has indeed given me a new perspective,\" said Chen Siming.","\"The catering industry is quite crowded nowadays, if you want to stand out and attract customers, your restaurant must be unique. Only when you're different can you stand out from the rest,\"","\"But how can we set ourselves apart? Should I get my place redesigned to become a trendy restaurant?\"","\"That's one way to go about it, but there are many kinds of trending restaurants, you need to have a clear direction in which you want yours to go,\"","Shen Yin's question stumped Chen Siming. He had always wanted to make his restaurant trendy, but he hadn't considered that even trendy restaurants could have different styles.","\"Modern, or elegant?\" asked Chen Siming.","\"That works, but I think it might be interesting to lean towards the cultural side. Some people fill their restaurant with books to create an elegant environment. The aim is not necessarily for food but for the place to have a cultural feel.\"","\"So, your suggestion is that I should steer towards a cultural theme for dining?\"","\"You can think about it. Our country has a profound historical culture, and this can be used. For example, the interior can be decorated to give an ancient feel, similar to ancient taverns. Nowadays many people are beginning to appreciate our culture, they wear Hanfu, recite poems, and listen to songs. As life's material level improves, we start seeking cultural nourishment. So, showing uniqueness from poetry, lyrics, and music would be a good starting point.\"","\"Have you ever been in the catering business? You seem to know a lot about it,\" asked Chen Siming.","\"It's not so much about familiarity, but rather a sense of deficiency in this area. Our own culture often ends up being plagiarized, and even our own people are unclear about it. So I believe that while we need to do business, we also need to promote our culture.\"","\"Sister-in-law, do you have any thoughts on this? Would you like to invest with your technology? Of course, I know you don't lack funds but...\"","Chen Siming didn't finish his sentence. What he really wanted to say was that nobody ever thinks they have too much money and what's more, having a successful business really gives a sense of achievement.","\"What do you mean?\"","\"My idea is for you to guide our restaurant operations and then you can share in the profits.\"","Shen Yin: Is there such a good deal? To her, wouldn't this be just like replicating the restaurant that she previously had in Da Sheng, and then transforming it a bit?","\"Are you sure?\"","\"Yes, do I look like I'm joking?\"","\"Well then, I have a demand.\"","\"Go ahead.\"","\"Everything, including the decor, atmosphere, cuisine, and even culture, must be in line with my requests.\"","On hearing this, Chen Siming could hardly contain his joy - this would save him a lot of trouble.","\"Absolutely, about the profit sharing, I'll discuss this with Brother Xu.\"","After Chen Siming left, Shen Yin started reminiscing about the structure, decor and atmosphere in her old restaurant, Da Sheng.","\"Mom, Zheng Zheng is hungry.\"","Shen Yin went into the kitchen to prepare lunch for the little one, and also had a bit herself.","After lunch, when the little one took a nap, Shen Yin would usually sleep a bit too. However, after what Chen Siming had said, she was brimming with ideas. Overcoming her lethargy, she ran to the study, grabbed a paper and pen, and started drawing a renovation plan.","Shu Yi suddenly called Shen Yin, mentioning that the guest star for this season of the variety show was Chang Zhiyuan.","Shen Yin: What!? It's only been a few days since the last trending incident, and now it's happening all over again?","\"You mean, both of you are gonna be on the same show?\"","\"Exactly, I have no idea why he agreed to it. Being a media company president and appearing on a variety show?\"","\"I mean, what's he thinking? I bet he wouldn't even know the name of the show if you weren't on it.\"","Shu Yi didn't say anything, it was true.","Chang Zhiyuan had been feeling guilty ever since the drunken phone call incident. He wanted to apologize but the thought of Shu Yi not answering his call, or perhaps even being annoyed with him, made him hold back.","However, the director of this variety show was bold and directly asked him through a mutual acquaintance if he would like to appear on an episode. The show was primarily for relaxation and entertainment, and was shot at a resort.","Chang Zhiyuan didn't pay much attention to the type of variety show it was, all he knew was that Shu Yi would be there and he would have a chance to see her. Without a second thought, he immediately agreed, delighting the director beyond measure.","Do you understand the significance of Chang Zhiyuan's appearance? During the first season of the variety show, a single call from him had pushed the viewership rating of the show \"Let's Depart Together\" straight to the top.","If Chang Zhiyuan could be invited again, this show could be called the pinnacle of the variety show industry. After all, who wouldn't want to watch the daily interaction between this popular pair? Most importantly, Chang Zhiyuan also happens to be the CEO of Shu Yi.","Ever since Chang Zhiyuan found out he was joining the show, he has been exercising every single day and even binge-watched previous episodes of the variety show.","The show \"Let's Start Together\" is exactly like what the director of the program said: it's all about casual entertainment, raising chickens and ducks, and playing games.","In it, Shu Yi is simply the star. Not only is she beautiful, but even the chickens and ducks listen to her. Without her, the other guests wouldn't even have food to eat.","Who gets to boss Shu Yi around, especially since she has basic cooking skills. Who wouldn't be thrilled to see the goddess cooking?","Shu Yi found out the night before the recording that Chang Zhiyuan was going to be the guest. By then, she was already at the holiday village, full of CCTV cameras. It wasn't until she returned to her room at night that she called Shen Yin to share the news.","\"Shen Yin, what should I do?\"","\"Face it calmly? Or avoid it subtly?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"You might as well tell me to play it by ear.\"","\"Exactly, play it by ear. The program group will also stir things up and make it entertaining, right?\"","\"Is entertainment worth the price of my freedom? And what about Chang Zhiyuan? He doesn't think to do his CEO job properly, instead, he's vying for food with the other guests.\"","\"What's done is done, face it calmly,\" Shen Yin comforted.","Shu Yi responded with a simple \"Hmm,\" suffering from insomnia once more."]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: Task Card","paragraphs":["Early the next morning, Shu Yi struggled to open her eyes, with someone knocking on her room's door persistently.","\"Miss Shu, get up. The cameraman will be here soon.\" Yan Yan yelled from the doorway.","Shu Yi rubbed her eyes, got out of bed, put on slippers, and opened the door.","\"The show team called, the cameraman will be shooting you soon, so you should get ready.\"","Yan Yan stepped into the room, while Shu Yi could barely keep her eyes open.","\"Did you stay up late last night?\" Yan Yan asked. She knew that Shu Yi must have had a sleepless night, but there was nothing she could do. Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan's relationship was too complicated - she had known that all along.","However, as an assistant, she's helpless. Emotions are between two people, marriage is between two families, so all problems have to be solved by oneself. Others are incapable of helping.","At eight o'clock in the morning, the cameraman, carrying his video camera, arrived at Shu Yi's place. Shu Yi was putting on her makeup, and Yan Yan opened the door for him.","The cameraman started filming the room right away. After a round of shooting, he finally caught Shu Yi during her makeup session.","Shu Yi deliberately delayed time until she received a call from the director, prompting her to get moving.","She didn't know how to deal with what was to come, she could only follow Shen Yin's advice, let things take their natural course and adapt as necessary.","When they arrived at the meeting point, Shu Yi took a look around - the guest had not arrived yet. That was when Shu Yi finally let out a sigh of relief.","The show team assigned tasks to them, and then waited for the guest.","Shu Yi hoped that time could slow down, that she could put off meeting this guest for a bit longer, but often, reality is contrary to one's wishes.","The only guest was Chang Zhiyuan. Shu Yi thought the show team had done it on purpose. Why had they invited him out of all the actors and singers they could have chosen?","\"Welcome our guest, Chang Zhiyuan to join 'Let’s Start Together.' Applaud to welcome him.\"","This was said by an older actor, Jia Haojie. Jia Haojie was known for his upright character and good acting skills. He cared for the other guests and had always played the big brother's role in 'Let’s Start Together.'","\"Welcome, welcome.\"","Aside from Shu Yi, the other guests were particularly welcoming to Chang Zhiyuan. After all, Chang Zhiyuan is a media tycoon. If they could establish a good relationship with him, they might have access to more resources in the future.","Chang Zhiyuan, being a social butterfly and a veteran in the entertainment circle, was skilled at navigating these situations.","\"I'm delighted to be a guest on 'Let's Start Together.' You all might not be familiar with me, let me introduce myself. My name is Chang Zhiyuan. As for my representative works, there's only 'I Just Want To Be With You' so far.\"","The other guests laughed. How could he tell that they weren't familiar with him? Was it possible that they weren't familiar before, but ever since he made that call, they've become too familiar?","\"What's so funny? What are you all laughing about?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"We're laughing because our guest is quite humorous.\"","Chang Zhiyuan ran his fingers through his hair, his eyes occasionally glancing at Shu Yi who pretended not to notice.","\"Our tasks have already been assigned. So, next up our flying guests will draw lots to select their own tasks. The rule is to draw a task card from my hand, each card corresponds to one of our regular guests. Let's see how lucky our flying guests are and who they end up paired with at the end.\"","The host took five task cards from his hand and walked towards Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Zhiyuan, before you draw a task card, we want to ask, who would you like to be paired with?\"","The guests on site were also looking forward to this answer. The show's crew had already done a fantastic job by inviting Chang Zhiyuan, and now they were asking such an exciting question.","Everyone had thought that Chang Zhiyuan’s answer would have been the expected Shu Yi. But to their surprise, Chang Zhiyuan’s answer was \"Jia Haojie.\"","\"Wow, it's our brother Haojie. Zhiyuan, can you explain why you want to team up with Haojie?\"","\"Because I feel like Brother Haojie is capable of doing anything. Being on his team gives me a sense of security.\"","\"Ha ha ha ha ha. Now, let's invite our Mr. Chang to start drawing. Destiny is predestined, let's see who he will end up with.\"","As destiny would have it, Chang Zhiyuan looked at the task card he had drawn with a secret delight.","After three days, the latest episode of \"Let's set off together\" finally ended.","Shu Yi went home once again, dragging her weary body.","Shen Yin also got busy with the restaurant. She visited the restaurant that Chen Siming mentioned.","It was a four-story building, which Shen Yin was very pleased with. It wasn’t the size of the restaurant or the height that made it well known, it was the aesthetic of the building that satisfied Shen Yin.","A little renovation on the straightforward design and it would give off the same vibe as the Grand Restaurant. Shen Yin, accompanied by Zhengzheng, checked every floor and made some suggestions for the exterior before leaving.","Chen Siming transformed the exterior of the building based on Shen Yin's suggestions. Following the blueprints that Shen Yin sent later, it was redecorated. The renovation surprisingly attracted many people to come and take photos.","The restaurant's name, written personally by Shen Yin, was \"Qingfan Tower.\"","The three-story building was not only high-end but also boasted a very \"bold\" exterior. A towering celebratory arch was set up in front of the door, as high as the tower itself.","The interior decoration would take some time, but Shen Yin was not in a hurry. She believed in finely crafted work and aesthetic beauty. The restaurant had to be distinctive enough to attract customers.","In a blink of an eye, a week had passed. The latest episode of \"Let's Set Off Together,\" which included Chang Zhiyuan's guest appearance, went on air on the Tomato Platform.","The trailer released two days before airing featured Chang Zhiyuan drawing task cards and even the brief trailer was trending on Weibo.","You can't even begin to imagine how high the anticipations of the audience were for this particular episode. The program team made a special adjustment to the broadcast time. Originally intended for Sunday evening, considering that everyone has to go to work the next morning, they advanced it to Saturday night.","At the very beginning of the show, the barrage of comments on screen was completely dominated by the fans of the Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi coupling.","[Finally, the moment we've been waiting for!]","[I'm totally convinced that my shipped couple is the real deal!]","[I declare that this variety show will be my all-time favorite from now on.]","[If they end up married one day, they absolutely have to invite the whole production crew.]","[It's starting, it's starting!]","With the end of the commercials, the army of screenshotted comments surged again.","Shu Yi first appeared in her room. The cameraman, upon entering, inadvertently captured Shu Yi in her natural, makeup-free look."]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: The Great White Goose","paragraphs":["[Oh my, I had never seen my wife without makeup before, but I just did, and it's incredible! Except for a slight dark circle under her eyes, there's not a single flaw anywhere else.]","[Let's just say, those dark circles, aren't they because she was too excited last night when she found out Chang Zhiyuan was the guest star, and couldn't sleep as a result?]","[I think you're right about that (throwing flowers)]","Shu Yi was also watching this variety show episode, holding a tablet in one hand and video chatting with Qi Ji and Shen Yin on her phone with the other.","\"I just want to say, is the person who posted that comment hiding under my bed? How would they know if I was excited or not? I wasn't excited at all.\"","\"Hahaha, can't you allow your fans to have a bit of imagination?\"","\"Sister Shu Yi, can you give us a spoiler? After that preview, he drew a task card, who did he end up partnered with? Was it Jia Haojie?\"","\"Little Qi Ji, you're still too naive. If the production team wants viewership, guess who they'll pair him with?\"","Qi Ji covered her mouth, suddenly realizing.","\"My brain wasn't working, but it's not my fault. Isn't it true that pregnancy makes you silly for three years?\"","As the show continued, Shen Yin watched Shu Yi applying makeup for what seemed like ages. She teased, \"Are you trying to avoid going to the recording by deliberately delaying?\"","\"No way.\"","Shu Yi's guilty response of \"No way\" lacked any conviction.","[Oh my god, why is my girl so adorable? Is she trying to delay on purpose?]","[I think so. Look at her skin, does she really need to apply foundation for that long? She's definitely doing it on purpose.]","[Hahahahaha, I'm dying of laughter.]","\"Sister Shu Yi, hahaha, the comments are hilarious. Your little tricks have been completely exposed.\"","Qi Ji was laughing so hard she started punching her blanket.","\"Honey, don't get too excited. You've got two babies in there, what if you go into premature labor...\" Xue Jingrui worriedly said from the side.","\"Tut tut tut, let's speak positively. How could there be premature labor?\" Shu Yi was also amused by Xue Jingrui's straightforwardness.","\"By the way, isn't it about two months until your due date?\" Shen Yin suddenly asked.","\"Yes, yes, yes, in less than two months, my son-in-law will be able to see his fiancée,\" Shu Yi replied.","\"It's May, which is good. It's not extremely hot. If it were too hot, it would be really tough,\" Shen Yin said.","\"What's this about it being too hot and tough?\" Xu Xiuhe asked, coming out of the bathroom after a shower.","\"Auntie said her son-in-law can meet his 'fen-cee' in May,\" the little one suddenly chimed in from the other end of the bed where he had been looking at a picture book.","Xu Xiuhe: ???","\"Zhengzheng, do you know who Aunt Qi Ji's son-in-law is?\" Xu Xiuhe asked while drying his hair.","The little one shook his head and said, \"I don't know.\"","\"It's you!\"","\"Then who's the 'fen-cee'?\"","\"It's 'fiancée', not 'fen-cee'. The fiancée is the baby in Aunt Qi Ji's tummy. The baby in her tummy is Zhengzheng's fiancée, which means Zhengzheng's future bride. Do you understand?\"","Xu Xiuhe had given such a long explanation that he almost got confused himself. He wasn't sure if Zhengzheng could understand, but at least he had explained.","\"I understand. Aunt Qi Ji has two babies in her tummy. Does that mean Zhengzheng will have two fiancées in the future?\"","...","Qi Ji couldn't stop laughing after hearing this.","Xue Jingrui: \"Zhengzheng, I'm reluctant to give you even one, and you want both?\"","The variety show was still playing, but everyone was amused by Zhengzheng's words.","\"Auntie, how many fiancées does Zhengzheng have?\"","\"Just one, just one.\"","\"Oh, I see.\"","\"Chang Zhiyuan is drawing a task card,\" Xue Jingrui said.","\"Sister Shu Yi, you were right. He really did draw your task.\"","Qi Ji got excited and started punching her blanket again.","She naturally knew about the complicated relationship between Chang Zhiyuan and Sister Shu Yi, and she knew the reasons behind it. But she couldn't help it; ever since she watched \"I Really Want to Be with You,\" she kept wanting to ship them. Well, who could blame her? Pregnant women often have such strange cravings.","However, she shipped them secretly. They had all agreed not to interfere with Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan's relationship. It was their private matter, and the choice was in their hands. Whether they ended up together or not in the future, they, as friends, would support them.","The comments on the screen almost covered the entire picture.","[Wow, this is so exciting! Is this their second collaboration?]","[If I remember correctly, aren't they supposed to feed geese next?]","On the screen, Shu Yi's expression was extremely unnatural. Chang Zhiyuan kept following behind her.","The two of them arrived near the goose farm.","Shu Yi was fully equipped: long pants, long sleeves, hat, glasses, gloves, and boots. She had experienced this kind of animal-feeding task several times before and knew what to expect.","But Chang Zhiyuan didn't know. The temperature at this resort was quite warm, warm enough to wear shorts and short sleeves. Chang Zhiyuan wore sunglasses, a brown floral shirt, and black vintage shorts. When he entered the goose farm, he was completely bewildered.","Why hadn't this scene appeared in all the variety show content he had studied?","There were about 10 to 20 large white geese in the farm. When they saw people coming, they all raised their heads.","Shu Yi held a lot of Chinese cabbage and walked into the middle of the geese.","The geese seemed hungry too.","\"Honk, honk, honk, honk honk~\"","Chang Zhiyuan had never seen such a scene before. A flock of geese surrounded them, honking non-stop. Some even stretched out their necks, seemingly wanting to bite him.","Shu Yi took some Chinese cabbage and threw it to the side.","Several geese rushed over to fight for the cabbage.","But a few geese seemed smarter. Seeing that Shu Yi still had some cabbage in her hands, they kept circling around her, honking incessantly.","Shu Yi was scared too, but as a regular guest, she had experienced such scenes before. So, she pretended to be calm and threw the remaining cabbage to the side.","\"Honk honk honk~~\"","A few geese, for some unknown reason, went crazy and ran towards Chang Zhiyuan behind Shu Yi.","Chang Zhiyuan had just arrived at this place, and he was already disgusted by the goose droppings scattered all over the ground. His shoes, which resembled vacation sandals in style, were particularly troublesome – he didn't even know where to step.","\"Honk!\"","Suddenly, a large white goose raised its head towards Chang Zhiyuan, causing him to jump in fright.","Shu Yi wanted to laugh but didn't dare do so openly, so she had to forcibly hold it in.","[Oh my God, hahahahaha, I can barely contain my laughter. The CEO never imagined that one day he would be chased by a big white goose, did he?]"]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: Everyone's Lady","paragraphs":["The look of nervousness on Chang Zhiyuan's face was clearly displayed on the screen, so intense that it seemed like he could take flight at any moment.","The cameraman intentionally zoomed in for a close-up shot. Terrified by the geese, Chang Zhiyuan's face contorted hilariously, filling the screen.","[HAHAHA, look at the shameless face of our CEO!]","Qi Ji saw this comment and immediately showed it to Xue Jingrui on his iPad.","“Check out your brother’s shameless face.”","Xue Jingrui joined in on the laughter about Chang Zhiyuan, opened the App on his phone, fast-forwarded to the scene, took a screenshot, and sent it off.","[Xiuhe, look at the shameless face of Chang Zhiyuan.] Xue Jingrui tagged Xu Xiuhe in his post.","[Yeah, I’m watching it too. He's scared out of his wits by a couple of geese, looks like he might fly higher than them.”]","Chang Zhiyuan secretly glanced at the conversation between Xue Jingrui and Xu Xiuhe and began to sulk.","The two spoke so lightly of it. Those geese, with their heads held high, were truly terrifying. They simply did not understand his fear. It was easy for them to talk without being in this situation.","[You guys are really enjoying this, aren’t you?] Chang Zhiyuan defended himself.","[What’s wrong with that? Aren't people enjoying it?] Xue Jingrui retorted.","[Don't I have dignity?]","[You lost it the moment you hid behind Shu Yi.]","Was Xu Xiuhe's response.","On-screen, Shu Yi noted the terrified look on Chang Zhiyuan’s face, and a wave of sympathy washed over her. He was pampered all his life; this must be so unlike what he's accustomed to.","“Do you want to wait outside?”","Shu Yi asked, turning to face him.","“No.”","Chang Zhiyuan immediately shook his head, refusing to show weakness at a crucial moment like this.","After refusing, Chang Zhiyuan mustered courage and tried to compose himself.","\"Don't force yourself.\"","\"I'm not.\"","[HAHAHA, he's clearly scared to death. His fake bravado is too funny.]","[The lengths our CEO will go to woo his wife sure is admirable.]","[Why can't those two be together? A perfect match, our CEO isn’t much older than Shu Yi. They're so right for each other.]","[Sometimes, whether a relationship is suitable or not isn’t for us outsiders to decide, it's their business.]","The net users were treating the live comments as a chat room.","[I hope they can be together in the future. After all, my beautiful 'Goose' is not getting any younger. I wish for her to be loved always.]","Shu Yi was too inspiring in their eyes. From an 'Ugly Duckling' to a 'Beautiful Swan', those numerous scandal-free years, entirely focused on her career, must've been hard. Indeed, a girl like her deserves love.","The episode 'Ready, Set, Go!' shot directly to the top of the ratings, becoming a hot topic online with loads of comments. The CP super topic area went berserk again, the two were subtly showing their affection on screen.","Although there wasn't much contact, the way they looked at each other revealed something more.","Chang Zhiyuan would definitely answer 'No regrets' if anyone asked him about his decision to come on this reality show. He might have lost face initially, but being able to spend the next few days with Shu Yi was all worth it. Scared of the great white geese? He wouldn’t even be scared of a giant tiger.","Shen Yin truly did not interfere in their affairs; her focus during this period was entirely on Qingfan Tower. Having decided to commit to a project, she was determined to do it well.","To Chen Siming, Shen Yin was nothing short of a savior. Adhering to a responsible attitude, she frequently visited Qingfan Tower to oversee the renovations.","Under Shen Yin's suggestion, Qingfan Tower expanded its area, incorporating an artificial lake that was stocked with fish and planted with lotuses. A pavilion was constructed over the lake, providing a spot for visitors to enjoy tea and admire the lotuses.","The interior of the tower was designed with an atmosphere of ancient elegance and luxurious subtlety. Upon entering, one would find the main and side buildings, with small private rooms partitioned off on the north and south sides. The decor was predominantly in the Chinese style, featuring courtyards, corridors, planted flowers and trees, and hanging curtains. Gold and red silk lanterns adorned the corridors, adding a touch of graceful refinement.","The overall layout closely resembled that of a grand inn from the Dasheng Dynasty.","\"Sister-in-law, where should we buy the calligraphy and paintings needed for the inn?\" Chen Siming asked.","\"No need to buy them, I'll paint them myself.\"","\"Wow, sister-in-law, you're talented in both arts and martial arts!\"","Shen Yin just smiled without a word. Chen Siming, a man who valued efficiency, had hired many workers. As the saying goes, many hands make light work, and in less than a month, Qingfan Tower was nearly finished.","The exterior was decorated with colorful silks and green curtains, blending opulence with elegance inside.","\"Get some good brushes and ink; I'll start painting this afternoon,\" Shen Yin told Chen Siming.","\"Wouldn't that be too much trouble for you, what about the fashion studio?\" Chen Siming expressed his concern.","\"It's fine.\"","Shen Yin had already trained those young girls well; now, the operations at Yunyin Studio didn’t require her direct involvement. The girls were very capable, and the training she had provided was not in vain. Yunyin Studio's reputation had grown so much that people from other cities would come specifically to order custom gowns.","After lunch, Chen Siming brought high-quality brushes, ink, paper, and inkstones. Shen Yin checked them and found them adequate.","There was an office in the inn that Chen Siming had specifically set aside.","Shen Yin entered the office, and Chen Siming laid out all the painting supplies, exciting the little one.","\"Mommy.\"","\"Do you want to paint too?\"","The little one nodded.","\"First, promise me, you can only paint on paper, not anywhere else, okay?\"","\"Okay!\"","Shen Yin was relieved; she hadn’t forgotten the time when Xu Yunzheng, with an ink-dipped brush, had stained his clothes.","Shen Yin picked the finest brush, dipped it in a little ink, and handed it to the little one.","The little one, now quiet, sat on the floor, doodling away, though it was unclear what he was drawing.","Shen Yin, however, was different. She picked up a brush and painted several famous paintings with ease, as if the images were etched in her mind, her skills remarkably proficient.","Indeed, the voice she had heard in her dreams was real—her skills were infinitely amplified, and it truly worked wonders.","In half a day, Shen Yin had painted five famous paintings and written many characters.","Outlining, underpainting, coloring—various literati painting techniques were integrated into her work.","\"Sis, how is it that you know how to do everything? If I did not firmly believe in materialism, I would have suspected that you are a refined lady from the ancient times who has traveled through time. What luck my brother Xu has, to have married you! He must have saved the Earth in his previous life.\"","Chen Siming was left wide-eyed and speechless. Had he not seen it with his own eyes, he would never have believed that anyone could paint with such speed and confidence, not even the slightest hint of hesitation.","\"Your brother Xu is pretty impressive himself, I'm also fortunate to have met him.\"","Chen Siming: ......"]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: Birthday Party","paragraphs":["\"When do you have the time to meet my cousin?\"","A panged Chen Siming, provoked by Shen Yin's earlier statement, promptly replied, \"Anytime, I am free tonight.\"","\"Hold up, don't rush. Just because you're free tonight doesn't mean my cousin is. I will ask her later, but I feel the weekend may be more suitable.\"","\"Alright, thank you sister-in-law. Can you gift me a painting if I get married? Hanging one at home would certainly add a posh feel.” Chen Siming held a painting in his hand, treasuring it dearly.","\"Sure, no problem.”","That night, Shen Yin went home and informed Fang Yue, who in turn consulted Fang Ningning. The meeting was quickly arranged for Saturday night. Shen Yin glanced at the calendar, noting her and Zhengzheng's birthdays were drawing near. Shen didn't need a celebration, but certainly couldn't overlook Zhengzheng's third birthday.","“Xiuhe.”","\"What?\"","\"Honey.\"","Only then did Xu Xiuhe seem satisfied.","\"Zhengzheng is about to have his birthday.\" Shen Yin spoke, and Xu Xiuhe, glancing at the peacefully sleeping toddler in the next room, added, \"You will also be having your birthday soon.\"","He then pulled out a box from his pocket and opened it.","\"Is it beautiful?\"","\"Yes, it is.\"","Inside the box was a jade bracelet of excellent quality, which, as Shen Yin felt it with her fingers, proved to be equal to the ones she used to have at the Dasheng Dynasty.","\"Is it expensive?\"","\"It's okay.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Then, Xu Xiuhe raised his mouth to say, \"Shouldn't you thank me with more than just words?\"","From his gaze, Shen Yin could guess what he was thinking.","\"So, how should I thank you?\"","\"You should thank me with actions, you wouldn't like me to be uncomfortable, would you?\"","Indeed, she really owed him some gratitude. He reached out and gently brushed a strand of hair behind her ear.","\"Darling.\"","Later that night, Shen Yin neatly tucked the bracelet away.","\"Let's celebrate Zhengzheng's third birthday.\" She proposed.","\"We will also celebrate yours. You both together.”","On Zhengzheng's birthday, Xu Xiuhe invited a moderate, but not insignificant, number of guests - those he was on good terms with, those with whom he did business. All received an invitation.","Who in Rong City would not be keen to remain on the good side of the Heyuan Group?","Decked in new clothes, Zhengzheng was busy receiving all kinds of gifts when a voice rang out, “Zhengzheng, it's grandpa's first time seeing you. I brought a peace-amulet for you, see if you like it.\"","Shen Yin, holding Zhengzheng's hand, looked at the man in front of her, stunned. How did he get here?","Xu Xiuhe, who was greeting his guests, immediately turned, his face paled,","\"How did you get here?\"","It was a questioning tone.","\"Can't I come to bring a gift to my grandchild on his birthday? My dear grandchild, I'm your grandpa. Will you allow me to hold you?\"","The little one stepped back, hiding behind Shen Yin.","\"No!\"","\"He is not your grandson. He doesn't need you here.\"","\"You are my son, if he is not my grandson, who would be?\", Xu Guimin's eyes then turned to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe both knew what those words and that gaze signified. Right there and then, Xu Xiuhe wished he had been reared in a rock crevice.","\"You senile old man, what are you saying? Your own son doesn't even acknowledge you as his father, where did you get your grandson? Zhengzheng is my grandson. Is that right, Zhengzheng? Let grandpa hold you.\"","Shen Tianzheng walked over from the side. The tones and sentiments of his preceding and subsequent words contrasted sharply.","Zhengzheng extended his hand.","\"Let me hold him.\" Fang Yue hurriedly picked up Zhengzheng. Shen Tianzheng was totally oblivious. He should at least be aware of his current physical condition, right? Zhengzheng weighs about 66 pounds now, could he possibly hold him?","\"Who are you calling a dead old man? You're the one who might die soon. You've just had surgery, do you even know how much longer you'll live?\" Xu Guimin retorted.","Hearing this, Shen Yin felt a bit irritated. Even if Shen Tianzheng had done many regrettable things to his former self, he was still her father. Xu Guimin, as an outsider, had no right to disparage him.","Compared to that, Shen Tianzheng was at least genuinely nice to Zhengzheng. What Xu Guimin's intentions were, who could tell?","As she was about to retort, Shen Tianzheng beat her to the punch.","\"I'm calling you, dead old man. You're the one who's closer to death. Why didn't you drown when you were swimming? You ought to have stayed under the water. That would've been justice for my mother-in-law.\"","Shen Tianzheng had always looked down upon Xu Guimin. In Shen Tianzheng's eyes, Xu Guimin was nothing more than a philandering cad and bigamist, who didn't deserve to live. Here was a man who was married, but still carried on promiscuously outside. Was he justified in his actions towards his wife? His children? A complete disgrace!","The moment Shen Tianzheng mentioned his mother-in-law, Xu Guimin fell silent, hesitating in his response.","Their argument attracted many spectators. After all, they were both notable figures in Rong City. Even if they had both taken a step back from their glory, their fame was still intact.","\"Your sister-in-law, Yang, didn't make it, I...\"","\"Shut up.\"","Before Xu Guimin could finish, he was interrupted by Xu Xiuhe.","\"Let me say it one more time, you're not welcome here. I'm giving you a friendly reminder out of our scant blood relations. You better look into your near-drowning incident properly. Don't get yourself killed and not even know why.\"","\"Xiuhe, what's the meaning of your words?\"","\"Show him out.\"","Once Xu Xiuhe uttered these words, someone immediately came over to escort Xu Guimin out.","Before leaving, he was still holding the safety lock that he didn't get to give.","\"I apologize for the earlier disruption. Now, let's proceed,\" Xu Xiuhe explained to the other guests.","Xu Guimin never expected to be kicked out. Furious, he got into his car and drove straight home.","\"Guimin, why are you back? Weren't you attending your grandson’s birthday party?\"","Xu Guimin, frustrated, didn't respond to Yang Cui and went straight upstairs.","Downstairs, Yang Cui smirked spitefully. Look, he'd still be sent packing no matter where he went.","In the beginning, when she found out that Xu Guimin was going to give Xu Xiuhe's son a safety lock as a present, she was incredibly jealous. But now, she didn't feel worried in the least.","“Mom, has dad come back?”","“He just went upstairs.” In the living room, Yang Cui continued to crack open sunflower seeds with a satisfied smile.","\"You're not getting any younger, your father is getting old, he wants to hold his grandchild. I'll check out a few girls for you, pick one, get married, have a kid. This seems to be the best solution now.\"","\"You handle it.\"","\"Hey, have you got any women pregnant out there? If you have a secret child, your father will probably want to bring them home.\"","\"None.\"","Xu Zhengyang thought about it carefully and indeed, there was none.","\"Do you have your eye on any girl? If she's suitable, just go after her. After all, the most pressing matter now is that you need a child.\""]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: Qingfan Tower","paragraphs":["At Qingfan Tower, Shen Yin spent her free time creating calligraphy and paintings, all of which were displayed by the end of April.","On May 1st, the formal opening day, the entrance of Qingfan Tower was bustling. Surprisingly, Shen Yin ran into Fang Ningning.","\"Yin Yin.\"","\"Cousin.\"","Since the original owner married Xu Xiuhe, she had severed contacts with everyone from before. Fang Ningning had been away from Rong City for several years and only returned last year. This encounter was the first time Shen Yin and Fang Ningning had seen each other since then.","Seeing Fang Ningning at the event allowed Shen Yin to vaguely understand the outcome of their blind date. If it had failed, there was no way Fang Ningning would be here.","Ningning began the conversation; \"I heard from Chen Siming that the entire decoration design was done by you?\"","\"More or less. I designed according to the descriptions from several books. For instance, I aimed at 'three-story building with five towers facing each other, each connected by flying bridges, light and shadow working together, pearl curtains and embroidered plaques, lanterns dazzling.' Still, it is probably lacking some feeling that it should have.\"","\"Yin Yin, it feels like you've become more impressive over the years! As expected of a top student in primary school.\"","\"Cousin, your compliment is making me blush.\" Shen Yin chuckled, well aware of how the original owner had been an exceptional scholar before meeting Zhou Man. Shen Yin wondered why there had been such a drastic change.","\"There's a feeling of time travel to the ancient times. This tower, it's somewhat reminiscent of the buildings in 'Along the River During the Qingming Festival.' It's simply breathtaking as a science student; I can't quite put it into words, but it's truly astonishing.\"","\"Have you seen the inside yet?\"","Not only did she put effort into the interior decoration, but Shen Yin also paid particular attention to the service and dishes. She manually wrote the menu based on traditional recipes in her memory.","Upon entering Qingfan Tower, one would first see the servers dressed in Song clothes, personally trained by Chen Siming.","With diverse dishes and attentive service, the tower housed numerous private rooms, with every door adorned with Shen Yin's own calligraphy.","What sets Qingfan Tower apart is its dedication to culture. Having decided to capitalize on culture, Shen Yin made sure to spread it as the main positioning of the tower.","One could select from singing, playing Guqin, blowing flute, and periodic performances of dance and song were held.","On this opening day, a variety of song and dance programs were performed. The tower was so crowded that Shen Yin didn’t dare to let go of Xiao Ren. With so many people coming and going, many young people even wore Song Dynasty clothes, mingling among the guests.","For a fleeting moment, Shen Yin felt like she had traveled back to the Dasheng Dynasty, witnessing the bustling and prosperous scenes.","Shu Yi reserved a private room for herself, claiming to support her sister's business.","All she could see was prosperity.","Looking at the full table of food, Shu Yi exclaimed it was the most appetzing feast she had ever seen.","There were roasted, grilled, mixed, fried, boiled, steamed dishes, clams, stir-fried crabs, nutmeg crabs, green onions and rabbits, scorching chickens, roast ducks, all were delicacies from sea and land.","\"Girl, you're not telling me you made all of these,\" Shu Yi said, admiring while peeling a crab","\"It's not entirely, just took the old menus from ancient times, researched them a bit and recreated them.\"","\"It’s so delicious. Honestly, even without such a lavish decoration, and all these songs and music dances, the food alone will attract many people over here.\"","\"It’s different. Sometimes, some things need embellishment. Like I’ve always said, it needs to have character. Just having food with character is not enough. The environment needs to have one too.\" Shen Yin also sat down. Anything that happens outside now is none of her business. She has done all she can.","“I don’t even know how fortunate I am to have met you and to be your friend.”","In front of Shen Yin, Shu Yi behaves entirely like herself, without a hint of the actress persona.","\"Are you still going to say that Xu Xiuhe saved the earth in his previous life?\"","\"How do you know?\"","\"Because Uncle Chen Siming said so.\" Even though the little lad was eating his meal, he could hear every word the adults were speaking.","\"Uncle Chen Siming is right.\" Shu Yi pointed a thumbs-up towards the little lad.","\"Look at the painting on the wall.\"","The little lad pointed to the painting on the wall, guiding Shu Yi to look.","It was then that Shu Yi noticed, hanging on the wall was a green landscape painting.","\"It was painted by my mom.\" Xu Yunzheng's tone could not be more proud, as if saying, my mom is the best.","Shu Yi was not even surprised anymore. This woman could stitch such intricate patterns, she totally believed she had a solid foundation in arts.","\"Are all of these painted by you?\"","\"Almost.\"","Shen Yin replied. Chen Siming had bought some good calligraphy and paintings outside, but after getting home, he told Shen Yin that they could not compare to her own work.","She even joked at that time: \"You can give me the money. I can draw better ones than you have.\"","Chen Siming immediately replied: \"I am broke now.\"","He had promised to give Shen Yin some shares, but after negotiating with Xu Xiuhe, he was already penniless.","At this time, Chen Siming was on the railing of the third floor, overlooking the entire Qingfan Tower. He never imagined he would be able to create such an ancient and classic Song Dynasty tavern.","The tavern was already full of people. Some did not even want to leave and had started lining up.","Chen Siming felt he would strike it rich again. This entertainment hot spot did not lose to Xu Xiuhe's Qingfeng Mingyue at all!","\"This tavern you've opened is really good. Feels like we've travelled back in time.\" Fang Ningning came up next to Chen Siming.","\"Yes, your cousin is pretty amazing. From the decoration to the layout, from the dishes to the service, it was all her.\"","\"She always has been fantastic since she was little, and very obstinate. Once she decides on something, no one can change it. She gets good at whatever she wants to learn, didn’t worry her mom a bit. Always the child others want to have. Luckily, I am a few years older than her, or I'd constantly be compared to her.\"","\"You are quite remarkable too. It’s not easy for a woman to be so highly educated.\" Chen Siming praised.","\"Thank you, but that's all I have, highly educated. I know nothing about music, chess, calligraphy, or painting.\"","\"Everyone excels in different areas, perhaps Shen Yin's level in natural sciences might not be as good as yours.\"","\"Hahaha, then you're wrong. You don't know how good her science grades were in high school. If she hadn't lost her way and given into a moment of despair, she could have been a scientist by now. But excellent people excel in every aspect. Even though Shen Yin took a wrong turn, she got back on track. She has a career, a family, and a child.\"","As Fang Ningning spoke, envy sparkled uncontrollably in her eyes. How wonderful, thankfully she had returned to the right path. Otherwise, we couldn't see such a prosperous restaurant today."]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: The Unfinished Wife","paragraphs":["In the private room, Shu Yi had totally forgotten her consciousness of being a female star, wishing she could devour all the dishes on the table.","\"Qi Ji, the little one, is definitely missing out big time by not coming. Sending these pictures to her, she's going to be drooling,\" Shu Yi finished saying and grabbed her phone to feverishly snap photos of the delicious food on the table.","\"You're letting her see it but not taste it, even after she calls you elder sister. That's quite harsh, isn't it?\" Shen Yin joked.","\"I can't help it. She's in the hospital now, with her mother-in-law watching her. Being a week away from her due date, they'd never let her come out. Imagine if her water broke while she was outside, how dangerous that would be—there are two tiny lives inside her,\" Shu Yi reasoned as she peeled a tangerine and popped it into her mouth.","\"Once we're done with the restaurant stuff, let's find some time to go visit her in the hospital, and bring her some delicious food.\"","\"I like that idea. She'd be moved to tears, and then she would say: 'Indeed, my mother-in-law treats me much better.'\"","\"Wouldn't she think that I'm not coming to see her, but my daughter-in-law instead?\"","As they were discussing all this, Xu Yunzheng overheard them. The little one continued in the conversation, \"You mean going to see Auntie Qi Ji and Yunzheng's two soon-to-be wives, right?\"","\"Godson, it's fiancée, not soon-to-be wife, and it's one, not two. The other one is not for you.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng bit his own finger, not bothered at all, thinking—one is good enough, Humph!","\"Yinyin, I can't control my appetite. I'm going to gain another two pounds after this meal,\" Shu Yi complained.","\"You're aware you will put on two pounds, but you still can't resist.\"","\"Can't help it.\" And with that, Shu Yi reached for the meat dish on the table.","Shen Yin quickly grabbed the meat dish before Shu Yi could reach it.","Shu Yi's hand fell into thin air, she pouted and withdrew her hand.","\"Yinyin, can I have just one more piece, please?\"","\"Where's that diligence of a female star? Be careful, or I'll snap a picture of you right now and send it to your fans. Let them see what their precious idol is like.\"","Shen Yin was joking about it.","But it sure worked as a warning, and Shu Yi sat up straight immediately.","She has an image to uphold in front of her fans, after all.","At night, Qingfan Tower was even busier than during the day. Music floated down from the upper floor, customers below sipped wine, nibbling on delicacies, and enjoyed the tunes—a heavenly pleasure.","\"Bang! Bang!\" Fireworks were lit outside, colorful and grand, it attracted many guests outside mid-meal.","\"Beautiful, was this your idea too? Is this how you do it where you come from?\" Xu Xiuhe asked Shen Yin.","\"Our grand opening back home was even more lively than this, but this particular idea was not mine, it was probably Chen Siming’s. The fireworks cover the entire sky, so beautiful.\"","\"New sounds and laughter fill the streets with willow trees and flowers, tuning the strings to the sound of the pipes in the tea and wine houses.\"","\"Getting cultural, aren't we?\"","\"Of course, my wife, so cultured, I must read more books, learn some phrases, in order to be worthy of you.\" Xu Xiuhe boasted about himself, not forgetting to compliment his wife.","\"Daddy, stepmom said, Uncle Siming also said.\"","The little one paused here, it seemed that he felt that what he was about to say might upset Xu Xiuhe.","\"What did they say?\"","\"They said, Daddy, you saved Earth in your previous life, that's why you could marry Mom in this life.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe was taken aback for a moment, but then it seemed to make sense.","\"Hahaha, Yunzheng, they're not entirely right in what they said. Daddy might have saved not just Earth in his past life, but the Universe, in order to be able to marry your mother.\"","\"What's the Universe?\"","The little one, still not fully understanding, heard a new term, and couldn't help but get curious.","\"Yunzheng, Universe is, nevermind, you're already three years old, when it gets to September, you'll start school, and then there will be a teacher to tell you what the Universe is.”","Xu Xiuhe realized he couldn't adequately explain the term \"Universe\", a term which encompasses all space, time, matter, and everything that derives from it, to Yunzheng. If he went along those lines, the little one would inevitably continue questioning.","Shen Yin listened to the father and son's conversation, finding it quite interesting. Xu Yunzheng always found ways to render Xu Xiuhe speechless.","\"Going to school? What’s that for?\"","\"Indeed, going to school is about learning knowledge, learning about culture.\"","\"Yunzheng has already learned, Yunzheng can learn at home as well, why do I have to go to school?\"","The little one's big eyes were full of confusion about why he needed to go to school. He feared school meant that he wouldn’t be able to stay at home anymore.","\"Because school is school and home is home.\"","Xu Xiuhe explained.","\"Yunzheng, your dad thinks you're too carefree and wants you to go to school so you can learn some discipline.\"","Shen Yin added, at least in her view, that was what Xu Xiuhe intended.","\"Daddy, is that what you think? Yunzheng needs to hear the truth.\"","The little one looked up, the voices from the surrounding firecrackers started to die down. The family of three was standing at the bridge behind the Qingfan Tower, Yunzheng’s voice in the quiet night was especially clear.","\"Daddy doesn't think that. Once Yunzheng starts school, you will meet a lot of little friends there. They are all about the same age as Yunzheng, and you can play with them.\"","Upon hearing this, Yunzheng nodded.","\"Who are all these people? Have I met them before?\"","\"...\"","\"Daddy doesn't know who they are either, but once you meet them, it's all destiny.\"","\"Understood, then Yunzheng will go to school starting tomorrow.\"","\"...\"","\"You'll have to wait a few months, will Yunzheng go with Mommy to visit Aunt Qi Ji tomorrow?\"","\"Yes.\"","The next morning, Shen Yin took Yunzheng to Qi Ji's hospital room.","Qi Ji's room was spacious. Ye Rong was sitting by the bedside peeling grapes for Qi Ji.","\"Yinyin, dear son-in-law, how come you are here?\" When Qi Ji looked up, she just happened to see Shen Yin leading Yunzheng into the room.","Ye Rong, upon hearing the news, looked up. This time, she truly saw the Shen Yin and her grandson-in-law that Qi Ji always talked about.","Ye Rong stood up, welcoming Shen Yin and the little one warmly, without a hint of a leader's wife's attitude.","\"So this is my grandson-in-law. He is really handsome.\"","As Xu Yunzheng grew up, his features became more exquisite, his skin extraordinarily fair, and his eyes sparkled like stars.","Ye Rong had seen this little one on TV before, but now seeing him in person, she was incredibly fond of him.","\"Darling, I'm your future grandmother.\"","Xu Yunzheng scrutinized Ye Rong for a moment, his voice childishly pitched, \"Are you really my future wife's grandmother?\"","Ye Rong burst into laughter, \"This child is really delightful.\"","Shen Yin rubbed her forehead, who asks upon meeting someone, \"Are you my future wife's grandmother?\"","Was the little one confused? His fiancee isn't even born yet."]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: Production of Qiji","paragraphs":["Shen Yin took out all the food she had brought in her lunchbox and placed it on the table by the hospital bed.","\"Oh my goodness, Sister Yin Yin, you're my savior,\" Qi Ji exclaimed excitedly as she sat up.","\"Your Sister Shu Yi didn't send you pictures of delicious food?\"","At Shen Yin's words, Qi Ji became dejected. Shu Yi had sent her many, many pictures of mouthwatering dishes, even saying they were \"super delicious.\"","It had made her crave them for days.","\"It smells so good,\" Ye Rong said as she approached.","\"Mom, try some. Sister Yin Yin's cooking is amazing,\" Qi Ji said, picking up a piece of spare rib and bringing it to Ye Rong's mouth.","\"I can do it myself, don't make such big movements,\" Ye Rong said, walking to the bedside and opening her mouth to eat the spare rib.","\"It's really delicious.\"","Ye Rong then showered Shen Yin with more praise.","Shen Yin felt embarrassed by Ye Rong's compliments. It was also her first time meeting Ye Rong in person. If she had to use one word to describe the woman before her, it would be \"gracefully strong.\"","\"How much longer for Qi Ji? It should be soon, right?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"The doctor said it would be any day now,\" Ye Rong replied.","\"Qi Ji needs to rest well during this time. If you want to eat anything, just tell me, and I'll bring it for you.\"","\"Really? Sister Yin Yin, you're the best!\" Qi Ji exclaimed.","\"Won't that be too much trouble for you, Yin Yin?\" Ye Rong also started calling Shen Yin by her nickname.","\"It's no trouble at all. I'm not busy these days.\"","Qingfan Tower was already running smoothly, and Chen Siming could handle things on her own. All Shen Yin had to do was come up with new dishes periodically and teach the performers at the restaurant some dance moves.","\"What about Sister Shu Yi? It feels like she's disappeared again these past few days.\"","\"Oh, her? She came for Qingfan Tower's opening, but now she's probably about to start filming. I heard she took on another role, a mystery this time.\"","\"Is 'Let's Set Off Together' finished?\"","\"Yeah, it's been about two months, so it should be wrapping up.\"","\"Do you think she and Chang Zhiyuan will end up together?\" Qi Ji asked curiously. It was frustrating to watch two people in love keep circling each other.","\"It's hard to say. We'll have to see how things develop between them,\" Shen Yin had just finished speaking when Qi Ji's expression suddenly changed.","\"Qi Ji, what's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?\" Ye Rong asked anxiously.","\"Mom, I think I'm going into labor.\"","Ye Rong immediately called for the doctor and nurses.","After they arrived, they quickly wheeled Qi Ji into the operating room. Shen Yin held Zhengzheng's hand as they waited outside the door. Ye Rong immediately called Xue Jingrui.","Before long, several people were standing outside the operating room.","\"Old Xue, why are you here?\" Ye Rong asked. Xue Kai had told her this morning that he had a meeting today. How did it end so early?","\"I came as soon as the meeting finished.\"","Xue Jingrui was also there, along with a few people Shen Yin didn't recognize.","\"Mom, I'm going in first. I'm worried about Qi Ji being alone in there.\"","After discussing with the doctor, Xue Jingrui entered the operating room. Outside, everyone was anxious and worried, considering there were two little lives in Qi Ji's belly.","As time ticked by, Shen Yin figured Zhengzheng must be getting hungry. Thinking that Ye Rong and Xue Kai probably hadn't eaten lunch either, she called Chen Siming and asked her to prepare some food and send it to the hospital.","There was still no news from inside when the food from Qingfan Tower arrived, almost at 1:30 PM.","\"Uncle, Auntie, please eat something to fill your stomachs,\" Shen Yin said.","Only then did Xue Kai and Ye Rong realize they were a bit hungry. With Qi Ji still in the operating room, even the most delicious food held little appeal.","But they needed to eat something. After thanking Shen Yin, the group started eating outside the operating room.","After finishing, Xue Kai couldn't sit still. He kept pacing back and forth in front of the operating room door.","\"Old Xue, stop pacing. You're making me dizzy,\" Ye Rong waved her hand.","Hearing this, Xue Kai sat down.","\"Mommy, why hasn't auntie come out yet?\" the little one asked, not crying or fussing, just sitting patiently with Shen Yin on the chairs outside the operating room, waiting for Qi Ji to give birth.","The chair was quite high, and the child's feet couldn't reach the ground. His little legs kept swinging back and forth. He propped his face up with his hands, his eyes squinting.","\"Is the baby tired?\" Ye Rong asked.","Shen Yin looked at Zhengzheng, whose eyes were almost closed.","\"Yes, he's tired. He usually takes a nap at this time.\"","\"Why don't you take him home? It's not good for him to wait here, and he can't sleep comfortably,\" Ye Rong suggested.","\"No, grandma. Zhengzheng doesn't want to go home. Zhengzheng wants to wait here for Auntie Qi Ji to come out,\" the little one said stubbornly, forcing his eyes wide open.","Ye Rong said kindly, \"Alright, we'll wait together for your little brother and sister to come out.\"","In the end, the little one couldn't resist and fell asleep sitting in the chair. Worried he wouldn't be comfortable sleeping like that, Shen Yin picked him up and placed him on her lap.","At around 4 PM, they finally heard the cry of babies from inside the operating room.","\"They're born!\" Ye Rong exclaimed excitedly.","The operating room door opened, and several doctors came out.","\"The mother and babies are all safe and sound.\"","Soon after, nurses wheeled Qi Ji out of the operating room, and the two babies were brought into the VIP ward.","Ye Rong immediately ran to Qi Ji's side, asking if she felt uncomfortable anywhere.","Meanwhile, the two newborns were crying non-stop in the nearby bed.","Zhengzheng ran to the bedside, looking at the two newborns as if marveling at the wonder of the world, constantly gesturing for Shen Yin to look.","With Ye Rong's help, Xue Jingrui carefully picked up one of the babies and brought it to Qi Ji's bedside for her to see.","Qi Ji's face, which had been smiling, suddenly fell. Why were they so ugly? They were nothing compared to Zhengzheng, all wrinkly and not pretty at all.","\"What's wrong, Qi Ji?\" Ye Rong noticed the change in Qi Ji's expression and asked.","\"It's a girl, right?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"Yes, I brought the little princess for you to see.\"","\"It's a bit different from what I imagined,\" Qi Ji said with a disappointed expression.","\"You think she's ugly? All newborns look like this, and since they're twins, they're bound to be a bit wrinkly. They'll look better in a few days. They look just like Jingrui when he was little, especially these eyes. They're like shiny black pearls, so adorable!\" Ye Rong said, holding the other baby.","\"The little brother and sister are so small,\" Zhengzheng marveled, as if looking at toys.","\"You were this small when you were born too. When they grow up, they can play with Zhengzheng,\" Shen Yin said.","\"When will they grow up?\"","\"When Zhengzheng starts kindergarten.\"","The ward was filled with joy. In the evening, Shen Yin was still there when Xu Xiuhe and Chang Zhiyuan arrived. After taking a look, Shen Yin told Xu Xiuhe they should go home, as Qi Ji had just given birth and needed to rest after expending so much energy.","Xu Xiuhe had driven there. After Shen Yin got in the car with Zhengzheng, the little one asked, \"Daddy, when will Zhengzheng start kindergarten?\"","\"Why? Are you in a hurry?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"Mommy said that after Zhengzheng starts kindergarten, little brother and sister can play with Zhengzheng,\" the child replied."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: Lights in the Dusk","paragraphs":["\"By September, Zhengzheng will be able to start kindergarten,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"At kindergarten, she'll meet lots and lots of little friends.\"","\"Hahahahaha\"","Xu Xiuhe's hearty laughter echoed through the car.","\"How's the company doing, and what about Xu Group?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"The company is still developing. As for Xu Group, under Xu Zhengyang's management, it's been on a downward slope. In about two years, it'll be just about done.\"","Xu Xiuhe had always felt that with Xu Zhengyang managing Xu Group, it wouldn't last long. In his hands, it was only a matter of time before the company would be acquired.","He was merely putting in extra effort to speed up the acquisition of Xu Group.","\"Shall we go for dinner?\" Shen Yin suggested.","\"Qingfan Tower?\"","\"Sure, I want to go and see how business has been in the first few days since Qingfan Tower opened.\"","\"You...\" Xu Xiuhe smiled indulgently. Shen Yin was certainly not a woman who could sit idle. Even though she didn't need to do anything except look beautiful, she insisted on taking on various business ventures.","She ran a furniture business, opened a clothing studio, and now the restaurant was thriving.","He felt almost inadequate in comparison.","The family of three arrived at Chen Siming's Qingfan Tower. The restaurant was as bustling as ever, with people queuing outside for the next seating. Outside, the pond was full of lotus leaves, with fish swimming beneath.","The early summer evening breeze was cool. Even though customers were waiting, they didn't seem impatient. After all, the scenery was beautiful, and the air was fresher than in other places.","Looking at this scene, Shen Yin felt quite pleased and couldn't help but say, \"The moonlight and lanterns create a dreamy atmosphere, as if we've traveled back a thousand years to the Song Dynasty.\"","\"Shall we take a boat ride?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"I just had another thought,\" Shen Yin said. \"We could expand this artificial lake in the future, build more bridges over it, and plant willow trees along both shores. We could turn this area into a place where people can not only dine and relax but also enjoy recreational activities.\"","Xu Xiuhe looked around the area. When Chen Siming had asked him about the location earlier, he had suggested that since they were creating a private kitchen, they shouldn't choose a busy area like ordinary restaurants.","While high foot traffic is good, it doesn't allow for showcasing unique features. It's better to choose a less crowded place; if you have something special to offer, people will come. This way, you can not only establish a brand but also benefit from lower real estate prices compared to busy areas.","Chen Siming had indeed followed his advice. This place was not only remote but had few buildings, offering ample space. There was plenty of parking available everywhere.","If they wanted to expand the restaurant in the future, it would be convenient. The surrounding area was open, so they could simply buy the land and expand outward from the original Qingfan Tower.","\"Have you considered buying this entire plot of land, expanding the artificial lake, building more buildings like this nearby, and even looking further ahead to turn this place into a cultural street? Make it a must-visit spot, create a famous scenic area,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Like the current old town?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Not exactly, but you could describe it that way. It would serve to promote culture on one hand, and on the other, it has great business potential.\"","Xu Xiuhe had always had a keen eye for opportunities. Otherwise, he wouldn't have been able to make Heyuan Group rival well-established companies in just a few short years.","So Shen Yin had great faith in Xu Xiuhe's vision and abilities. After hearing this proposal, she was seriously considering what he had said.","\"Let's discuss it with Chen Siming after a while,\" Shen Yin said. In reality, she was already thinking of various plans in her mind. She was a person of action, always ready to implement her ideas.","\"I'm hungry, Daddy and Mommy,\" came a little voice.","\"Then let's go up and eat.\"","Xu Xiuhe picked up the little one and headed towards the building.","\"I actually just thought of another plan,\" Shen Yin said.","\"What plan?\"","\"If we expand the artificial lake in the future, we could add more pleasure boats, and people could dine on the boats too.\"","Xu Xiuhe replied, \"That's a good idea, but right now, our most pressing matter is to go eat.\"","Chen Siming, knowing Shen Yin had arrived, immediately arranged a private room for them. After all, who was Shen Yin? Without her, there would be no Qingfan Tower.","\"Sister-in-law,\" Chen Siming greeted.","\"How's business been these past few days?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"The turnover has been consistently high. Even though the location is remote, we don't have enough private rooms every day.\"","\"Have you thought about expanding the restaurant?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","With Xu Xiuhe's question, Chen Siming was indeed tempted.","\"Let's discuss it slowly with sister-in-law after a while.\"","\"After a while, I should be calling you cousin-in-law,\" Shen Yin joked.","It wasn't really a joke, though. She had heard from Fang Yue that Chen Siming and Fang Ningning were getting along well. Everything seemed suitable, and given their age, if nothing unexpected happened, they would likely get married around National Day.","Shen Yin's words made Chen Siming a bit embarrassed, and he quickly changed the subject, asking Zhengzheng what she wanted to eat.","When Zhengzheng was younger, she would only say \"meat,\" but now it was different.","\"Lamb, fish, beef,\" she said.","\"Alright, you'll have everything you want,\" Chen Siming said.","He instructed the kitchen to prepare the dishes and then left the private room, not wanting to disturb the family of three during their meal.","\"It's great. If they get married on National Day, there'll be one less single person among our friends,\" Xu Xiuhe remarked.","Hearing this, Shen Yin truly felt that Xu Xiuhe was a bit abnormal, always eager to help those around him find partners, matching up as many couples as he could. He had already successfully paired up quite a few.","\"By the way, what about Shu Yi?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"She's off shooting a suspense drama. When I messaged her in the car earlier, she had just finished work. When she heard that Qi Ji had given birth to twins, she almost rushed back from the film set overnight.\"","\"Zhi Yuan has also been busy with company matters lately.\"","\"Don't meddle in their affairs. That's not something we should interfere with,\" Shen Yin emphasized once again.","After dinner, Shen Yin said she needed to use the restroom. Xu Xiuhe waited with Zhengzheng at the corner by the door.","As Shen Yin came out, she was stopped by a young man.","\"Beautiful lady, can I add you on WeChat?\" the man asked, holding out his phone. There were a few other people nearby.","\"I'm sorry, I'm married,\" Shen Yin refused directly.","\"Come on, you're so young. How could you possibly be married? That must be just an excuse, right?\" The man seemed skeptical and continued to press.","\"Mommy!\" Xu Yunzheng ran straight towards Shen Yin.","Shen Yin bent down and hugged the little one. The child had indeed grown; it was now somewhat difficult to lift her.","\"Mommy, Daddy says if you don't come over soon, he'll get angry.\""]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: Drinking to Forget Only Increases the Sorrow","paragraphs":["Shen Yin turned and held Zhengzheng's hand, looking over to where Xu Xiuhe stood, glaring unfavorably at the young man who had asked for her WeChat.","Sensing the cold gaze, the boy who had requested her WeChat meekly put his phone away.","Shen Yin ran over to Xu Xiuhe with Zhengzheng in tow, her face full of mirth. \"Don't be so fierce! He's just a student. You'll scare him with that look of yours.\"","Shen Yin joked.","Xu Xiuhe's jealousy was palpable, his eyes still fixed on the young man.","\"Alright, let's go home. I didn't give him my WeChat, did I?\"","\"Zhengzheng, when you grow up, you shouldn't casually ask girls for their contact information.\"","\"He's still young. You should teach him something positive.\"","Xu Xiuhe's jealousy persisted throughout the evening. After they got home, he first went to the study to handle some documents while Shen Yin gave their little one a bath.","Xu Xiuhe came in and said, \"From now on, Zhengzheng will bathe himself. He's already three years old.\"","Shen Yin: \"...\"","Zhengzheng's little eyes were practically rolling to the sky.","\"Were you busy in the study again?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Mm, Liu Bo took time off to accompany Xiao Li'er for a prenatal check-up.\"","\"!!!\"","Shen Yin did some quick math. It had been several months since Xiao Li'er and Liu Bo got married, so it was normal.","\"Are you satisfied now? This matchmaking was quite successful,\" Shen Yin teased.","\"I feel very accomplished.\"","The next evening at six o'clock, Chang Zhiyuan arrived at Chen Siming's Qingfan Tower. As soon as he entered, Chen Siming could tell that Chang Zhiyuan was in a bad mood.","\"Brother Yuan, what's wrong? You look so unhappy.\"","\"I want a private room. The one where Shu Yi sat.\"","\"...\"","\"Brother, do you even know which room she was in?\"","Chang Zhiyuan hesitated for a moment.","Chen Siming understood that Chang Zhiyuan had no idea which room Shu Yi had been in.","\"You're not going to just pick any room to fool me, are you?\" Chang Zhiyuan suddenly looked up and asked.","Chen Siming had initially thought of doing just that, but after Chang Zhiyuan's comment, he didn't dare to randomly choose a room.","Fortunately, Chen Siming remembered the room where Shu Yi had been. It was the day of the grand opening, and that particular room had been specially reserved by Shen Yin for its privacy.","\"Wait a few minutes. The people in that room just left,\" Chen Siming said, making a phone call to arrange it.","Many high-end cars were parked at the entrance of Qingfan Tower. The people coming and going were mostly dressed in designer clothes and carrying branded bags.","When Shen Yin stepped out of Xu Xiuhe's Mercedes G-Class, she attracted many glances.","Just as she lifted Zhengzheng out of the car, a familiar voice came from behind: \"Sister-in-law, you and my brother are dining here too? This place is great, very atmospheric. I've been here many times. Would you like me to recommend some dishes?\"","Shen Yin turned to see a man and a woman approaching. The man wore a black suit with gleaming, polished shoes. The woman had her arm linked with his, wearing an ultra-short skirt and carrying a designer handbag.","\"Zhengyang, let's go in quickly. They must be hungry,\" the woman's voice was coy and affected.","\"Brother, it's been a while. Dad seems to be in good health under your care.\"","\"Then you should continue to look after him. If something were to happen while he's with you, I don't know what people would think.\"","Hearing this, Xu Zhengyang's expression changed briefly. It was just for a moment, but Xu Xiuhe caught it. He had said it intentionally to test Xu Zhengyang, and unexpectedly, his facial expression had indeed changed.","\"Brother, don't worry. I'll definitely take good care of our father.\"","\"Sister-in-law, shall we go in?\" Xu Zhengyang looked at Shen Yin, his eyes appraising. He was increasingly curious about this woman. She had clearly been with Zhou Man before, so why did Xu Xiuhe trust her so much and handle her negative publicity? What was so special about her that made Xu Xiuhe so infatuated? Looking closely, Shen Yin was indeed young and beautiful, but there were plenty of young and beautiful women out there.","Xu Xiuhe seemed to notice Xu Zhengyang's gaze on Shen Yin and said, \"Know your place.\"","His tone carried a warning.","\"Brother, why so fierce? I won't harm sister-in-law.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin already felt nauseated. If it weren't for maintaining her image and having Zhengzheng with her, she would have kicked Xu Zhengyang where it hurts.","\"I'm not sure if I might harm you, so it's better if you keep your distance from me. I have androphobia. If I accidentally hurt you, it would be quite embarrassing.\"","Shen Yin turned her head and said with a smile. This wasn't an ordinary smile; Xu Zhengyang sensed a killing intent behind it.","The family of three finished speaking and entered Qingfan Tower. The staff inside all recognized Shen Yin; she was their second boss, naturally receiving polite and attentive service as they guided her upstairs.","Seeing this, Xu Zhengyang felt unbalanced.","\"Where's your manager? Is this how you treat customers? Is this how you receive guests?\"","Xu Zhengyang spoke arrogantly, and the woman beside him also looked at the waiter reproachfully.","\"Hello, we treat all our customers equally.\"","\"Then why is your attitude towards them so much better? Are they members? I want to become a member too. I'm not short on money.\"","After speaking, Xu Zhengyang sat down on a nearby wooden chair, disregarding the waiter's attitude.","\"Sir, we do indeed have a membership system. The annual membership fee is 1 million yuan.\"","\"I want to become a member.\"","Xu Zhengyang's tone was full of disdain. He wasn't short on money, so why should Xu Xiuhe have treatment that he didn't?","\"Sir, please follow me to the inner room to process your application.\"","The waiter, dressed in Song dynasty-style clothing, had been trained by Shen Yin and Chen Siming to be poised and neither servile nor arrogant when dealing with people, capable of handling various situations calmly.","After Xu Xiuhe's family of three went upstairs, they went directly to Chang Zhiyuan's private room.","\"Xiuhe, you've finally arrived. I've been waiting for you for a long time,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, holding a wine glass.","\"You're at it again?\"","Since after the New Year, Chang Zhiyuan seemed to have become a different person, more mature and steady, taking his work seriously and responsibly. However, he would still drink occasionally.","\"Drowning my sorrows in alcohol.\"","\"The more you drink to forget your sorrows, the more sorrowful you become,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Sister-in-law, can you not discourage me? I'm miserable enough as it is. The pain of longing is unbearable.\"","As Chang Zhiyuan spoke, he actually seemed somewhat pitiful.","\"Then don't think about it.\"","\"I wish I could stop thinking about it, but I can't control myself. Why can that woman be so heartless? I could clearly feel that she had feelings for me before.\"","\"Can you feel if she has feelings for you now?\" Shen Yin asked."]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: Self-Check","paragraphs":["\"How does it feel now? Now she's more polite to me than she is to strangers.\"","Shen Yin didn't know how to comfort Chang Zhiyuan. She could actually see that Shu Yi still had feelings for Chang Zhiyuan, or at the very least, still cared about him. But Shu Yi had learned to hide it, never mentioning their past situation.","\"Knock knock knock.\"","\"Come in.\"","Shen Yin thought it was the waiter coming to deliver food, so she responded. But when she saw who it was, she felt it was just bad luck.","\"What are you doing here?\"","\"Brother, someone downstairs just said there are no private rooms left. Can I share your room? After all, we're brothers.\"","Xu Zhengyang said shamelessly.","\"No, you can't. I don't have a brother like you. My mother only gave birth to me.\"","\"Brother, please help me out. You can't let your own brother take his girlfriend out for dinner with nowhere to sit, can you?\"","\"That's right, brother. For Zhengyang's sake as your brother, just let us sit down and have a meal.\"","The woman looked at Xu Xiuhe, pouting coquettishly.","Chang Zhiyuan suddenly became angry. He was drinking and feeling heartbroken, and now these two people suddenly showed up. What was the meaning of this?","\"Who the hell are you? I don't know you. And Xiuhe doesn't have a brother.\"","Chang Zhiyuan, emboldened by alcohol, stood up and started pushing Xu Zhengyang out. The woman beside him seemed to want to pull Chang Zhiyuan back, but as soon as her arm touched him, Chang Zhiyuan shook her off.","The girl, wearing high heels, stumbled backward and fell to the ground, starting to cry.","Chang Zhiyuan instantly felt even more irritated.","\"What are you crying for? Don't come showing off your love in front of me. I'm in a bad mood. Get the hell out of here.\"","With that, Chang Zhiyuan gave Xu Zhengyang another forceful push.","The woman beside him got up and stumbled out the door.","Xu Zhengyang wiped his mouth and left the private room.","\"What's going on? Didn't you say we should follow them to see which private room they enter so we could go and annoy them?\" the woman complained.","\"Shut up. You can't even handle this simple task. Why didn't you tell me there were other people in the room?\"","\"You didn't ask. Besides, how was I supposed to know there were other people in the room?\"","\"Damn it!\" Xu Zhengyang kicked the nearby railing.","\"Let's go back.\"","\"But we haven't eaten yet.\"","\"To hell with eating.\"","Inside the private room, the family of three was stunned. What was this situation? When did Chang Zhiyuan's fighting ability become so strong?","\"Where did they come from?\" Chang Zhiyuan sat back down in his chair and asked.","\"Xu Zhengyang,\" Xu Xiuhe explained.","\"Oh, it was him. If I had known, I would have kicked him a couple of times.\"","Chang Zhiyuan continued drinking.","\"You didn't know it was him just now?\"","Chang Zhiyuan shook his head. He felt like he was almost drunk, but those two people who came in wanting to share the room were disgusting. How could there be such people? Moreover, this was the room where Shu Yi had sat. How dare they try to share it?","\"You've had too much to drink,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"Waaah, Xiuhe, sister-in-law, son, I'm so sad. Why won't Shu Yi accept me?\"","\"Do you really want to know?\" Shen Yin asked.","Chang Zhiyuan kept nodding, eager to know the answer.","\"Shu Yi feels that she and you are not from the same world. You were born into a wealthy family, with a privileged background. She's been insecure since childhood, and just when she finally climbed out of that and regained some confidence, your parents came looking for her. Tell me, how could she dare to continue accepting you?\"","Shen Yin didn't want Shu Yi to become insecure again, so she had never tried to match-make the two. What was wrong with Shu Yi? She had looks, education, and ability. Why should she be looked down upon?","\"But I've already told my parents not to interfere with my relationships anymore.\"","\"Does saying it make it effective? Did your parents really listen?\"","Chang Zhiyuan was speechless.","He drank one glass after another.","\"Mom, Dad, is Uncle sick? Why does he look like he's about to cry?\"","\"He's not sick. It's just that people always face some hardships as they grow up, and we need to get through them. He's facing difficulties now, but it's something only he can overcome. We can't help even if we want to. Do you understand?\"","\"I understand.\"","\"Let's have someone send him home later,\" Shen Yin said.","\"I'll give Ningjing a call,\" Xu Xiuhe took out his phone and called Chang Ningjing.","Fifty minutes later, Chang Ningjing appeared in the private room.","\"Xiuhe, Yin Yin, is he drunk again?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I'm really at a loss with him. He might not be good at other things, but he's certainly a champion at drinking,\" Chang Ningjing complained.","This was the second time this month she had to take him home.","\"Zhiyuan, get up.\"","Chang Zhiyuan seemed not to hear, continuing to sleep on the dining table.","\"I'll help you get him to the car,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","Xu Xiuhe supported Chang Zhiyuan, who used his remaining consciousness to walk down the stairs one step at a time.","Finally, they reached Chang Ningjing's car.","\"Senior?\"","Chang Ningjing heard a familiar voice and turned to look.","\"Tan Xiao, you're here too?\"","\"Yes, I was having a meal. What's this?\" Tan Xiao asked, looking at Chang Zhiyuan leaning against the car window.","\"My brother. He's heartbroken and drowning his sorrows in alcohol.\"","\"Zhiyuan?\"","Tan Xiao asked. He had heard people mentioning Chang Zhiyuan's name recently. Usually, he didn't pay attention to such news, but because of Chang Ningjing, he had looked up some news about Chang Zhiyuan.","\"Yes, he's my only brother.\"","Tan Xiao came over to help, getting Chang Zhiyuan into the car.","\"Finally got him in. I'll take him home first. Thanks for your help just now. I'll treat you to a meal another day,\" Chang Ningjing said to Tan Xiao.","\"Let me come with you to help take him back.\"","\"No need, you go about your business. I can manage.\"","Tan Xiao got into his own car and followed behind Chang Ningjing's car.","\"Sister Ningjing likes him, right? The soldier?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Probably,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","\"It seems Tan Xiao must have feelings for Sister Ningjing too, otherwise he wouldn't have offered to help take Chang Zhiyuan home.\"","After a year's experience, Shen Yin had made progress compared to when she first arrived. At least now she knew what it meant to like someone and what love was. She could also see different things in the way two people interacted. This was also a kind of growth.","\"They're probably both not young anymore. Didn't we say last time that Sister Ningjing always thought she couldn't have children, so she's been secretly in love with him for so many years?\"","\"I think I could try to take her pulse and see what the real reason is. Maybe, possibly, there's still a chance.\"","\"You can take pulses?\"","Xu Xiuhe wasn't doubting her, he just always thought pulse-taking was a very mysterious thing.","\"Why not?\"","After saying this, Shen Yin began to take her own pulse."]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: Shen Yin Pulse Diagnosis in Pregnancy","paragraphs":["\"Honey, I think there might be something unusual with my pulse,\" Shen Yin said, pressing her right hand on her left wrist.","\"What do you mean unusual?\" Xu Xiuhe asked anxiously. In some matters, it's better to err on the side of caution, especially when it came to Shen Yin. He couldn't accept even the slightest problem.","\"I feel like it's a slippery pulse.\"","\"What does that mean?\"","Shen Yin, unsure, felt her pulse again. It was as if a row of bubbles passed under her right hand's ring finger, middle finger, and index finger in quick succession, one after another, with a strong, rhythmic beat.","\"When was the last time we...you know?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe understood what she meant by \"you know.\"","\"Didn't we have a time about a week ago?\"","\"And before that?\"","Shen Yin was perplexed, wondering if she had misread her own pulse.","\"Mommy,\" the little one tugged at Shen Yin's hand, pressing it against his own wrist. \"What are you doing?\"","\"What is it, Zhengzheng?\"","\"Check my pulse.\"","Shen Yin crouched down, feeling the little one's pulse. It was steady, neither floating nor sinking, flowing smoothly, neither too strong nor too weak.","\"Zhengzheng is very healthy. Well done!\"","\"Let's go home and discuss this later tonight,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","In the car, Xu Xiuhe sat in the driver's seat, his heart already racing with excitement.","\"Your body?\" he asked.","His question made Shen Yin suddenly realize. Her periods had always been very regular, and she never experienced pain, so she hadn't paid much attention to tracking them. Now that she thought about it, she might be late this month. Could she really have hit the jackpot?","Shen Yin's mouth gaped slightly, still trying to figure out where things might have gone off track.","From her expression, Xu Xiuhe had already guessed. There's no such thing as 100% safety, and if he remembered correctly, they had one particularly passionate encounter about a month ago where they might not have taken precautions.","\"Let's go to the hospital tomorrow to check,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"What if we really have won the lottery?\"","Xu Xiuhe couldn't help but laugh at Shen Yin's question. What else could they do but have the baby? It would be wonderful. Zhengzheng was old enough now, they were in a good position, and they had good genes. Why not have another child?","\"We'll have the baby, of course.\"","\"But Zhengzheng is still little.\"","The little one, hearing this, looked disapproving. He wasn't little at all.","\"Mommy, Zhengzheng has grown up. Zhengzheng is a big boy now and can protect Mommy.\"","The little one said, flexing his arms. He was even going to kindergarten now, how could he be considered little?","\"Zhengzheng, how would you feel if Mommy had a little baby in her tummy?\" Shen Yin asked, looking at the little one sitting next to her. She cared deeply about Zhengzheng's feelings. There had been news reports about only children not wanting their parents to have more kids. That's why she had wanted to wait a few more years until Zhengzheng was older before asking him. But sometimes, things don't always go according to plan.","The little one looked at Shen Yin and patted her stomach.","\"Is Mommy's tummy going to be like Aunt Qi Ji's? With a little baby inside?\"","\"Mommy's not sure if there's a baby inside yet. Mommy wants to know what Zhengzheng thinks. Would you like a little brother or sister?\"","Xu Yunzheng seemed fascinated and touched Shen Yin's stomach again.","\"Will they be as tiny as Aunt Qi Ji's babies? This small?\" Xu Yunzheng held out his hands to demonstrate how small Aunt Qi Ji's twins were.","\"That's right. Zhengzheng used to be that small too. You grew and grew from this tiny size into the little man you are now,\" Shen Yin said, mimicking his gesture.","\"Can they play with me?\"","\"Of course they can.\"","\"When can the baby in Mommy's tummy come out to play with Zhengzheng?\"","The little one's voice was full of impatience.","Shen Yin: ...","Xu Xiuhe: ...","If she remembered correctly, she had only asked how Zhengzheng would feel if there was a baby in her tummy. But the little one had taken it further, asking when the baby would come out to play. Goodness, they hadn't even confirmed anything yet.","\"Zhengzheng, do you prefer a little brother or a little sister?\" Xu Xiuhe asked from the driver's seat.","\"I like both. Will Mommy be like Aunt Qi Ji and have two babies come out of her tummy?\"","Shen Yin was once again at a loss for words.","\"Zhengzheng, Aunt Qi Ji is very special. It's rare for someone to have two babies at once.\"","The little one nodded, seeming to half-understand.","\"Mommy just said Zhengzheng is super great too. So Zhengzheng can have two babies too in the future!\"","The little one waved his arms excitedly, apparently very pleased with his deduction.","\"Ahem, ahem...\" Shen Yin had wanted to say something, but she was truly shocked by Xu Yunzheng's logical reasoning. That's not how analogies work!","\"Hahaha! Zhengzheng can't have babies because Zhengzheng is a boy. Boys can't carry babies. Carrying a baby is a very difficult thing, so girls have a tough job. That's why Zhengzheng should be gentlemanly towards girls in the future.\"","Xu Xiuhe wanted to say more but felt he might not express it well and Zhengzheng might misunderstand, so he stopped there.","After arriving home, Xu Xiuhe parked the car, quickly got out to open the door for Shen Yin, and helped her out of the car.","He opened the front door, got Shen Yin's slippers for her, and was careful not to let her bump into anything. He even followed behind her as she went up the stairs.","\"Honey, you don't need to be so...\"","\"Go sit in the bedroom. We can't risk anything. Zhengzheng, you stay with Mommy and protect her.\"","\"Okay!\"","Hearing this, Xu Xiuhe went downstairs, entered the kitchen, washed some fruit, cut it up, and brought it upstairs.","\"You eat first. I'll take Zhengzheng for a bath.\"","With that, Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng. Shen Yin sat on the sofa, turned on the projector, and started watching a variety show while eating fruit.","Soon after, Xu Xiuhe brought Zhengzheng out of the bathroom, put him on the bed, and told Shen Yin to go in and bathe.","\"Can I... maybe I should go in with you. What if you slip and fall?\"","Shen Yin: \"I might be pregnant, not incapacitated.\"","\"Oh.\" The man rubbed his nose sheepishly.","After Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng had gone to sleep, Xu Xiuhe went to the study alone and called Liu Bo.","\"Liu Bo, how is Xiao Li'er's prenatal check-up going?\"","\"Very well, everything's normal.\"","\"That's good. Be a bit busier tomorrow, I need to accompany my wife for a prenatal check-up. By the way, what should we pay attention to during the check-up?\"","Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"You mean your wife is pregnant?\"","\"Yeah, is your wife allowed to be pregnant but not mine?\"","\"No, no, that's not what I meant. I meant, have you confirmed the pregnancy? Is tomorrow's hospital visit for a prenatal check-up or to confirm if she's pregnant?\"","\"The latter.\"","\"Then she should fast in the morning.\""]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: Encountering Xu Zhengyang Again","paragraphs":["Early the next morning, Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin prepared to go to the hospital. Considering it would be inconvenient to bring Zhengzheng along, they directly sent Xu Yunzheng to Fang Yue at Yuelan Manor.","\"Are you going to the hospital?\" Fang Yue asked.","Ever since Shen Tianzheng fell ill and Xu Xiuhe was hospitalized, Fang Yue had become fearful at the mere mention of hospitals. After all, who would want to go to a hospital under normal circumstances?","\"Yes,\" they replied.","\"Which one of you is having issues?\" Fang Yue inquired cautiously, her expression growing tense.","\"Nothing's wrong. I'm going to check if I'm pregnant,\" Shen Yin explained.","Upon hearing this, Fang Yue patted her chest in relief. \"You scared me!\" Then she became excited. \"Yin Yin, is your period late?\"","\"There's a good chance it is. This is wonderful! I'm going to be a grandmother again.\"","Fang Yue's joy increased even more. It was truly wonderful. She had missed out on so much when her daughter gave birth to Zhengzheng, but this time, she could be there for her.","\"Alright, you two go ahead. Have a thorough check-up and don't worry. I'll take care of Zhengzheng,\" Fang Yue said, holding Zhengzheng's hand.","Xu Xiuhe drove the car. At first, Shen Yin wanted to sit in the front passenger seat, but Xu Xiuhe adamantly refused, saying it wasn't safe. So, Xu Xiuhe opened the back door and let Shen Yin sit there.","They went to the best hospital in Rong City. They had arrived early, and Xu Xiuhe had booked an appointment with a specialist, so everything went smoothly, and it was soon Shen Yin's turn.","While Shen Yin went in for her examination, Xu Xiuhe waited outside.","After about two hours, all of Shen Yin's tests were completed, and Xu Xiuhe went to collect the results.","Shen Yin sat in a chair, waiting for Xu Xiuhe.","\"Sister-in-law, you're here too? Are you feeling unwell, or are you pregnant?\"","Shen Yin turned to look and saw that gloomy man again. She must have left home on an unlucky day; how else could she keep running into Xu Zhengyang these past few days?","Shen Yin lowered her head and took out her phone, intending to call Xu Xiuhe to ask where he was so she could go find him. She didn't want to stay here for a moment longer, facing this man.","\"Sister-in-law, don't leave. My brother will probably be back soon. If you leave, what will he do when he can't find you?\"","Xu Zhengyang reached out and grabbed Shen Yin's arm.","Shen Yin forcefully shook him off, and Xu Xiuhe rushed over at that moment, causing Xu Zhengyang to fall to the ground once again.","\"Brother, look at you two. Is this how you treat your younger brother? I just fell last night, and today when I see you and try to say hello, you make me sit on the ground again,\" the man said, feigning innocence. His tone became aggrieved, as if he had been bullied. The passing nurses all turned to look.","The gloomy man continued his act.","Shen Yin walked to Xu Xiuhe's side and asked, \"Did you get the results?\"","Xu Xiuhe nodded and took Shen Yin's hand, preparing to leave.","\"Honey, what's going on? How are they bullying you again?\" a coquettish female voice came from behind them. The voice sounded familiar. Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe turned to look and saw that the woman next to Xu Zhengyang was the same one who had barged into their private room at Qingfan Tower last night.","\"Honey, I have good news for you. I'm pregnant! Look, the doctor says I'm one month along.\"","Upon hearing this news, Xu Zhengyang immediately stood up and snatched the report from the woman's hand.","\"Xinxin, you're really pregnant?\"","\"Yes, I really am. So, when are we going to get our marriage certificate?\"","The woman's gaze was eager.","Xu Zhengyang's eyes flickered for a moment before he said, \"There's no rush. We'll get the certificate after you're more stable.\"","\"Brother, I'll head back first. Dad doesn't know this good news yet.\"","Xu Xiuhe couldn't wait for these two nuisances to leave.","After they left, Shen Yin took the report from Xu Xiuhe's hand. Sure enough, her pulse reading hadn't been wrong.","\"Zhengzheng is going to have a little sister,\" she said.","\"How do you know?\"","\"I'm generally lucky. I'm sure I'll have both a son and a daughter. Zhengzheng is a boy, so the baby in my belly now must be a girl.\"","Xu Xiuhe drove Shen Yin to a nearby restaurant and ordered some light food for her.","\"Did you notice earlier? Xu Zhengyang doesn't seem too keen on marrying that woman,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"Mm, maybe he thinks her background isn't good enough. Yang Cui probably wants him to marry someone who can benefit Xu Zhengyang but can also be controlled by them,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"There's no such perfect scenario in this world. But Xu Zhengyang did look genuinely happy,\" Shen Yin noted, remembering that Xu Guimin had always wanted a grandson. After Yang Cui learned of this desire, she had even considered targeting Xu Yunzheng.","At the Xu family villa.","Xu Zhengyang brought the pregnant woman home.","Yang Cui was sitting on the sofa watching TV and cracking sunflower seeds.","\"What's going on? Who is she?\"","\"Hello, Auntie. I'm Zhengyang's girlfriend, Ge Xinxin.\"","\"Girlfriend?\" Yang Cui stood up to scrutinize her upon hearing this.","\"Yes, Zhengyang and I have been together for over a month. He just accompanied me to the hospital for a check-up, and I'm pregnant with his child. So, I think we should move up our wedding plans.\"","Yang Cui jumped to her feet when she heard about the pregnancy. A baby was good, and this child's timing was perfect.","\"It's wonderful that you're pregnant, but it's not convenient to have a wedding now. Don't worry, after you give birth to the child, our Xu family will definitely give you a grand wedding.\"","Ge Xinxin didn't seem to expect this answer. She had thought that being pregnant with a child from a wealthy family would make marrying into the family easier.","\"Auntie, you know, I'm still in the early stages of pregnancy, so there's nothing inconvenient. Why don't Zhengyang and I get our marriage certificate first, and we can have the wedding after the baby is born? What do you think, Zhengyang?\"","The woman turned her gaze to Xu Zhengyang.","\"I'm fine with anything. I'll listen to Mom.\"","\"Xinxin, you're still young, you don't understand. It's not appropriate to get the marriage certificate now. If Xu Xiuhe, Zhengyang's brother, finds out, you and the baby might be in danger. How about this: you two keep this quiet for now, you stay here, and after the baby is safely born, then you can get your marriage certificate and have the wedding.\"","\"But, this way...\"","\"There are no buts. You don't know how complicated things can be in wealthy families. Zhengyang isn't an only child. Right now, the priority is to ensure the baby is born safely. In the future, Zhengyang... do you understand? Who knows what might happen if others find out you're Zhengyang's wife? What if they try to harm you?\"","Yang Cui persuaded her.","\"Alright, but are you sure Zhengyang and I will get our marriage certificate after the baby is born?\" the woman asked again, still unsure.","\"Of course, absolutely. You're the mother of Zhengyang's child. If Zhengyang doesn't get the certificate with you, who else would he get it with? Don't worry, I'm here. Zhengyang won't abandon you. You can stay here for now. You can even call me Mom. As soon as the baby is born, you'll go get your marriage certificate right away.\"","\"Mrs. Wu, prepare a room. Make sure everything in it is of the best quality. From now on, treat Xinxin as Zhengyang's wife.\""]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: Shoo Yi Returns","paragraphs":["Hearing this, Xu Guimin came down from upstairs, his eyes fixed on Ge Xinxin.","\"Honey, you've come down. Look, this is Xinxin, she's pregnant with Zhengyang's child,\" said Yang Cui, hurrying over to Xu Guimin and wrapping her arm around his.","Xu Guimin glanced at Yang Cui before turning his gaze back to Ge Xinxin.","\"You're Ge Xinxin?\"","\"Yes, Mr. Xu. I'm Zhengyang's girlfriend.\"","\"How far along is the pregnancy?\"","Xu Guimin looked at Ge Xinxin's flat stomach, his face unreadable.","\"One month,\" she replied.","Without saying anything more, Xu Guimin turned his attention to Xu Zhengyang.","\"How are things going at the company?\"","\"Don't worry, Dad. The company's doing great. I've got everything under control.\"","\"I'll be back at the office tomorrow. I'll see for myself then.\"","As Xu Guimin finished speaking, Xu Zhengyang seemed not to have fully processed the information. Yang Cui, however, began to grow anxious.","\"Darling, you're not fully recovered yet. Why don't you rest at home a bit longer? We've been trying to bring you back home all this time, but we couldn't find you. You even missed spending the New Year with us.\"","Yang Cui's words stirred up hazy memories for Xu Guimin. When he had first regained consciousness, he only remembered Sun Wenting not allowing him to return in his dreams. He had been too scared and terrified to think about anything else.","Looking back now, he felt that Yang Cui and Xu Zhengyang's behavior at the time had been somewhat odd.","Xu Guimin sat down, and Yang Cui poured him a glass of water.","Meanwhile, at Yuelan Manor, Fang Yue was overjoyed to learn of Shen Yin's pregnancy.","\"Are you happy, sweetie? Mommy's going to have another little baby,\" Fang Yue asked, picking up Zhengzheng.","\"I'm happy! The little baby will play with me,\" Zhengzheng replied.","\"That's right. Zhengzheng is going to be a big brother now. You're a big boy.\"","Xu Xiuhe's current behavior mirrored Xue Jingrui's when he first learned he was going to be a father - cautious and not letting Shen Yin touch anything.","At lunchtime, Xu Xiuhe nearly began feeding Shen Yin herself.","\"Honey, open your mouth. Have a bite of fish. I've already removed the bones.\"","Xu Yunzheng, sitting nearby, felt a little dejected watching his father feed his mother, completely ignoring him.","\"Come, Zhengzheng darling. Let grandma peel a shrimp for you. Would you like that?\"","\"Thank you, grandma.\"","\"Oh, you're such a good boy. You don't need to thank grandma. When grandma gets old, will Zhengzheng buy candy for her?\"","Xu Yunzheng chewed his shrimp, mulling over the repeated use of the word \"old\" in his grandmother's speech.","\"Xiuhe, I'm pregnant, not disabled,\" Shen Yin said, feeling that Xu Xiuhe was making too much fuss.","\"It's alright. Just consider it indulging my pleasure,\" Xu Xiuhe replied.","Shen Yin: ...","Shen Tian watched silently from the side. He knew his judgment hadn't been wrong - Xu Xiuhe was such a good man.","In the afternoon, the family returned to Ziyue Manor. Shu Yi had just returned from the film set for a few days of rest.","On the way, Shu Yi spotted Shen Yin but couldn't talk comfortably in the car, so she called Shen Yin directly.","\"Yin Yin, is that you in the car ahead?\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin turned and saw Shu Yi through the rear window.","\"When did you come back? Weren't you filming a mystery drama?\"","\"Yes, I am. But we need breaks too, right? Can't keep filming non-stop.\"","\"What about you? Where are you coming from? Why isn't your husband at work today?\"","\"Oh, he accompanied me to the hospital this morning.\"","\"What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell? What did the doctor say?\"","\"Why are you panicking? I'm not sick. I just went for a check-up, and the results are in. I'm pregnant.\"","\"Wow! So much has happened while I've been away,\" Shu Yi exclaimed. She hadn't even been gone a month, and her two best friends were either having babies or getting pregnant. What had she missed?","\"It's not that much. Qi Ji gave birth to two beautiful babies, and I just found out I'm pregnant today.\"","\"If that's not big news, what is? I'll visit Qi Ji and the babies tonight.\"","As they spoke, Shu Yi parked in front of her house, and Xu Xiuhe pulled into their driveway.","\"I won't come over now. When Qi Ji's finished her postpartum confinement, let's take her to Qingfan Tower for a nice meal. She hasn't been there yet.\"","\"Sounds good!\"","That evening, Shu Yi arrived at the Xue family's grand house. She had been there before but had never gone inside. It was home to the highest-ranking official in Rong City.","Shu Yi gathered her courage and knocked on the door. Someone promptly opened it. Shu Yi had informed Qi Ji of her visit, so Ye Rong was expecting her.","\"You must be Shu Yi. I often see you on TV. You're even more beautiful in person.\"","Shu Yi had brought expensive nutritional supplements for Qi Ji, placing them by the door. She knew Qi Ji didn't lack such things, given her family's circumstances, but whether Qi Ji needed them or not was one thing, and whether Shu Yi should bring a gift was another.","Ye Rong was very welcoming, complimenting Shu Yi from the moment she entered.","\"You didn't have to bring so many things.\"","\"It's not much. But Mrs. Xue, you look incredibly young.\"","\"Really? You girls always say such nice things,\" Ye Rong replied, immediately drawing comparisons. Her son Jingrui would never say such things to make her happy. Thankfully, he had married Qi Ji, otherwise, she would have been quite upset.","\"How is Qi Ji doing?\"","\"Come, I'll take you upstairs. She's been wanting to go out and play with you all, but she can't right now. A woman must take proper care of herself after childbirth, or it could damage her health and lead to illness.\"","They reached the second floor as they talked.","\"Qi Ji, Shu Yi is here.\"","Since returning from the hospital, Qi Ji had felt like she was in prison. Her range of activity was extremely limited. She had just gone out for a short walk when Ye Rong called her back, saying she shouldn't be out in the wind too long before her confinement period was over.","Qi Ji didn't complain at all. She knew Ye Rong meant well and cared for her even more than her own mother. Her mother had visited her in Rong City once after she gave birth, then returned to Yang City.","Ye Rong was different. She looked after Qi Ji every day, even neglecting her company.","So Qi Ji only hoped time would pass quickly, allowing her to \"leave her cage\" and taste the delights of the outside world again.","\"Sister Shu Yi!\"","\"Did you miss me?\" Shu Yi handed Qi Ji a small box.","\"What's this?\" Qi Ji asked as she took it.","The small wooden box wasn't large, but it looked very exquisite."]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Happy and Joyful","paragraphs":["Qi Ji opened it to reveal two beautiful small jade pendants. Though not large, they were exquisite in their transparent luster and adorable shape, truly delicate pieces.","\"How cute,\" she remarked.","\"I bought them while filming in Xiangcheng. They have quite a lot of these things there. When I saw them, I thought these two little jade pendants would be perfect for our two treasures.\"","After speaking, Shu Yi leaned over to look at the two babies in the crib.","\"They're so beautiful. Cherry-like lips and such fair skin. You can tell they'll be great beauties when they grow up.\"","\"You don't know the half of it. When the babies were first born, she was quite disappointed,\" Ye Rong joked with a laugh.","\"They were all wrinkly then, like little monkeys,\" Qi Ji defended herself.","\"Hahaha, all newborns look like that. They improve once they fill out. How much space do you think there is in your belly? And there were two of them! They'd have to be a bit wrinkled to fit. Look how cute they are now, much prettier than Jing Rui was as a baby. When he was born, I almost wanted to throw him away,\" Ye Rong quipped.","Her words sent Qi Ji and Shu Yi into fits of laughter.","\"Alright, you two have fun. Call me when the babies wake up. I'm going downstairs to check if the auntie has finished making the soup.\"","The two nodded as Ye Rong left.","After she was gone, Shu Yi said with a smile, \"Your mother-in-law treats you like her own daughter, taking care of you so meticulously.\"","\"Mm-hmm, Mom is really good to me. Sometimes, even Jing Rui himself wonders if he's the one who married into the family instead.\"","\"That's too funny!\"","Shu Yi was genuinely happy for Qi Ji. How wonderful to have no mother-in-law conflicts. If there were such issues, someone with Qi Ji's personality would probably be bullied to death by her mother-in-law.","\"When do you leave next?\" Qi Ji asked.","\"In three days.\"","\"And when will you be back?\"","\"In about 20 days.\"","\"That's great! By then I'll be able to go out. We can go eat delicious food together. I'm craving spicy food so badly.\"","\"Just hold on a bit longer.\"","\"I'm so envious of you guys.\"","\"What's there to envy? My constant late nights filming? Or that your sister Yin will soon be in the same boat as you?\"","\"What do you mean?\"","\"Your sister Yin is pregnant!\"","Goodness, Qi Ji was stunned for a second. Just a few days ago, sister Yin had come to bring her some treats and even brought little silver bracelets for the two babies. Now sister Yin was pregnant? How did she not know? Sister Yin hadn't told her.","\"Such big news, and I had no idea. You guys are keeping secrets from me again. Boo-hoo, I'm heartbroken,\" Qi Ji pouted playfully.","\"Stop, stop, darling. We weren't hiding anything from you. I just got lucky. When I came back today, I happened to run into their family of three and found out they had just been to the hospital for a check-up this morning.\"","\"I can't believe our Suisui and Niannian will become big brother and sister so soon after being born,\" Qi Ji said, looking at the two sleeping babies with a tender expression.","\"Suisui and Niannian?\"","\"Yes, those are their nicknames. The boy is Suisui, and the girl is Niannian. Their full names are Xue Le'an and Xue Leyu respectively.\"","\"Those are lovely names!\"","Qi Ji smiled. She and Xue Jingrui had only come up with the nicknames. The formal names were chosen by Xue Kai. How could names picked by Xue Kai be anything but excellent?","\"Do you like Suisui and Niannian?\" Qi Ji asked, seeking Shu Yi's approval.","\"Of course, they're lovely. You know what little Zhengzheng once told me?\"","\"What?\"","\"He said his mommy's name is Mimi.\"","\"Oh, is sister Yin's nickname Mimi?\"","\"Yes, yes! Later when I asked Yin about it, she was completely stunned. She asked how I knew her childhood nickname, saying she had almost forgotten it herself.\"","\"My son-in-law is truly impressive.\"","\"Yin said her nickname was Mimi, and her brother's was Wangwang.\"","\"Her brother should find a girlfriend named Bingbing in the future,\" Qi Ji said, letting her imagination run wild.","Shu Yi immediately caught on to Qi Ji's joke.","\"Hahaha, anyway, I think they definitely shouldn't let her parents name the baby in Yin's belly.\"","The next evening, Shu Yi said she wanted to see how Qingfan Tower had changed. She had been there for its opening, but now a month had passed. During her time on set, Qingfan Tower had quietly become popular, turning into a trendy spot for social media check-ins.","It had gone viral on various short video platforms, attracting many tourists to visit and sightsee. However, many people only looked from the outside without going in, as it was too crowded. The tables inside and private rooms were impossible to book, with demand far exceeding supply.","Qingfan Tower had become a tourist attraction in its own right, driving up real estate prices in the surrounding area. Fortunately, Xu Xiuhe had the foresight to buy up the nearby vacant lots with Chen Siming.","Now they were proceeding with further development. There were also many people outside Qingfan Tower, with the pond full of green lotus leaves and lotus flowers in full bloom.","Even more people were taking boat rides, as who wouldn't want to experience the feeling of \"wandering deep into a sea of lotus\"?","So when Shu Yi stood on the bridge, she was fully disguised. But it was no match for the sheer number of people here, including many of Shu Yi's fans who could recognize her just from her silhouette.","\"Excuse me, are you Shu Yi?\" someone asked.","Shu Yi adjusted her sunglasses, never imagining she would be recognized.","The person asking was a pretty young girl, looking at her eagerly. Shu Yi smiled and made a shushing gesture.","The girl instantly became excited. She had just randomly encountered her idol!","\"Can I take a picture with you?\" she asked.","\"Like this?\" Shu Yi pointed to her fully disguised appearance.","\"That must be Shu Yi, right? She looks just like her.\"","\"It is! Look at her figure, and the color and length of her hair. It's definitely my goddess.\"","\"Even though her face is hidden by sunglasses and a mask, you can still tell it's her.\"","\"There was news yesterday saying Shu Yi had returned from Xiangcheng.\"","\"It's her, it's definitely her.\"","Shu Yi was curious how people nowadays had such keen observation skills. The lighting wasn't even good here, yet they recognized her instantly.","\"Can we take a photo together?\"","\"Actually, I'd love an autograph too.\"","Seeing that she had been discovered, Shu Yi decided not to hide anymore. She took off her mask and greeted them graciously.","\"One at a time, okay?\" she suggested.","\"Of course, of course.\"","\"Everyone, let's be orderly and show our quality as Shu Yi's fans,\" someone said.","Suddenly, Shu Yi felt the crowd around her become more organized, lining up to approach her one by one.","\"Goddess, you're even more beautiful in person than on TV.\"","\"Thank you.\"","\"We love you, Shu Shu baby!\" After taking photos, people conscientiously moved away.","\"Darling, we've taken enough photos. You're here to eat, right? Hurry and go in, don't let yourself go hungry,\" a fan advised.","It was Shu Yi's first time realizing her fans were like this."]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: Six-Person Dinner","paragraphs":["Shu Yi headed towards the private room that she had previously occupied. To her surprise, Chang Zhiyuan was there as well. Shu Yi's first instinct was to leave, but she noticed that Chang Zhiyuan's gaze was fixated on her.","\"Shen Yin isn't here?\" Shu Yi asked as she was about to leave. Shen Yin and her family had just entered the room followed by Chang Zhiyuan's sister, Chang Ningjing, and Tan Xiao who stood beside her.","\"Sis, you're here too?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"With all due respect, it was Tan Xiao who helped me get you home the last time you had too much to drink. It’s only right that I invite him for a meal,\" Chang Ningjing replied.","\"What about you two?\" Chang Zhiyuan pointed out. He was wondering why they’d appear in this private room. After Shu Yi had sat here, he had exclusively reserved this room for a while. Even when he wasn’t there, no one else would intrude.","Chen Siming had implicitly agreed that this private room was for their exclusive use, thus, when Shen Yin and Shu Yi arrived, the waiter ushered them straight in.","As it happened, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe bumped into Chang Ningjing on their way in. Since the restaurant was bustling and there were no private rooms left, Xu Xiuhe suggested that if Chang Ningjing and Tan Xiao didn’t mind, they could join them in their room.","Chang Zhiyuan had invited Xu Xiuhe, unaware that Shen Yin had invited Shu Yi and vice versa. And so, after what seemed like a lengthy period, Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan found themselves in the same room once again.","“There were no private rooms left, and we ran into Xiuhe who said you had a room, so here we are.\" They explained.","Chang Zhiyuan never imagined he would bump into Shu Yi here. Although it came as a pleasant surprise, the occasion turned out to be quite awkward.","\"Why don't we all sit down?\" Chang Ningjing noted the tension and tried to break it. Shu Yi was left with no option but to stay.","Reluctantly, she took a seat beside Shen Yin. On Shen Yin's left were Xu Yunzheng and Xu Xiuhe.","Chang Ningjing then sat next to Chang Zhiyuan and Tan Xiao also took a seat.","There they were, six adults and one child, all around one table.","Shen Yin shot Xu Xiuhe a glare, wondering why he didn't tell her Chang Zhiyuan was there.","Xu Xiuhe leaned towards Shen Yin's ear and whispered: “You didn't tell me you'd invited Shu Yi, either.”","\"Yin, I heard that you’re the main planner for Qingfan Tower.\" Chang Ningjing stated, her tone full of appreciation.","\"It's all right. It’s just that I find the cultural spirit quite essential, so I recreated an ancient tavern.\"","\"The place is a perfect recreation. It's so dreamy, I felt like I had travelled through time the first time I came here.\"","Chang Ningjing’s attention then turned to Shu Yi.","\"Shu Yi, you must surely be familiar with such architecture. You must see it pretty often on set.\"","Fearing Shu Yi might feel left out, Chang Ningjing attempted to engage her in the conversation. Having gotten to know Shu Yi, she liked the young lady especially after learning about her inspirational journey in high school.","She had told her parents about her admiration for Shu Yi to which Nie Ling replied that she no longer had any say over Chang Zhiyuan's affairs. He was free to live his life as he saw fit.","Later, Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi participated in a variety show together. The more she watched it, the better they seemed to fit together. Most importantly, this was the first time Chang Zhiyuan had ever pursued a girl so seriously in his life.","But then again, she should stop thinking about it. She didn't even know how to deal with her own feelings, let alone get involved in Chang Zhiyuan's.","\"Do you guys drink?\"","Chang Ningjing took her own bag and took out a 1.5L bottle of Macallan M Lalique crystal whisky.","Shu Yi shook her head. She had driven to the place and wouldn't drink. Besides, she always thought drinking was bad for the body and heart.","Shen Yin also shook her head.","\"None of you drink?\"","Shu Yi glanced at the expensive-looking bottle of alcohol held in Chang Ningjing's hand. It had a very refined look.","\"Just a little taste won't hurt. This bottle of Macallan is treasured in my collection.\"","Chang Ningjing glanced at the bottle of whisky. This bottle was not for sale. She had spent about 4 million to auction it from Hong Kong. Had it not been for tonight's dinner with Tan Xiao, she would not have brought it out, especially not in her oversized handbag.","After Chang Ningjing took out the bottle, she opened up the bottle cap and poured everyone a small cup.","\"Ningjing, I'm pregnant. You guys drink, I'll pass.\"","Shen Yin explained why she couldn’t drink. Apart from Shu Yi and Xu Xiuhe, everyone else was taken aback, then began to cheer up and congratulate her.","\"Pregnancy is wonderful. With a handsome husband like yours, your baby will surely be stunning,\" said Chang Ningjing. There was a touch of envy in her gaze. For a woman who adored children as she did, her infertility was a lifelong heartache.","Shen Yin saw the envy in Chang Ningjing's eyes and felt a surge of emotion. However, she decided not to say anything about it at the dinner table, especially with Tan Xiao, who was Chang Ningjing's crush, present.","\"Thanks for the rescue last time,\" Shen Yin said to Tan Xiao.","Tan Xiao, because of his job, looked mighty and heroic.","\"No need to thank me. It's my duty. And you’re friends with my schoolmate,\" Tan Xiao said, looking towards Chang Ningjing.","Although Shen Yin didn’t understand emotions and love, she now clearly saw the mutual hidden admiration between Tan Xiao and Chang Ningjing.","\"Looks like my son will have a little sister soon,\" Chang Zhiyuan interjected, trying to assert his presence.","\"Zhiyuan, you need to buckle up,\" Tan Xiao said. He knew Chang Zhiyuan had feelings for Shu Yi, but he did not understand why, like him, Chang Zhiyuan also chose to love her from afar.","But Chang Zhiyuan was different. He had a company. Besides, if the information on the internet was correct, he was Shu Yi's boss, so why would he choose to love her from afar?","\"Indeed, I should try harder. But this isn't something I can decide on my own.\" Chang Zhiyuan's gaze drifted towards Shu Yi.","Shu Yi immediately lowered her head again and drew out a tissue to wipe her hands.","Aware that he had upset Shu Yi again, Chang Zhiyuan changed the subject to Tan Xiao.","\"Tan Xiao, it's a bit rich coming from you. If I remember correctly, you are a year older than me. You should hurry up too. You can't follow my sister's path. She's been solo for 30 years now.”","Among those present, apart from Tan Xiao and Xu Yunzheng, everyone else knew that Chang Ningjing had liked Tan Xiao for as long as 13 years.","Thirteen years. How many thirteen years can one have in a lifetime?","\"People have never stopped chasing after my sister, it's just that she has high standards.\" Tan Xiao responded.","\"My sister has decent taste, doesn't she?\"","Chang Ningjing, sitting under the table, stomped on Chang Zhiyuan's foot. This cheeky boy, he always managed to bring the conversation back to her.","\"Over these many years, haven't you met a suitable boy yet?\" Tan Xiao tentatively asked.","Chang Ningjing stomped on Chang Zhiyuan's foot again. It was all his fault. Otherwise, Tan Xiao would never have asked such a question.","Shu Yi heaved a sigh of relief as she placed a piece of vegetable onto Yunzheng's plate, she was relieved that the conversation had finally moved on from her."]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: The Pulse","paragraphs":["Chang Ningjing only wanted to shift the topic away from herself. So she mentioned that it had been a long time since she had seen Xue Jingrui.","\"Jingrui is at home taking care of the children. They suddenly got two babies, twins - a boy and a girl,\" Chang Zhiyuan said.","\"That's wonderful. The probability of boy-girl twins is very low,\" Chang Ningjing's tone still carried a hint of envy.","\"Yes, Jingrui is now a stay-at-home dad,\" Chang Zhiyuan added.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe now felt that the food at Qingfan Tower didn't taste as good anymore. The two couples in love were sitting right across from them, clearly in love with each other but hiding and concealing it. One couple was even more frustrating than the other, and the two of them had no appetite for their meal.","For some reason, during these gatherings, Xu Yunzheng was always the only one at the table eating contentedly without a care in the world.","\"What are the two babies called?\" Chang Ningjing asked.","\"Suisui Niannian,\" the little one mumbled while nibbling on a piece of chicken.","\"What do you mean by Suisui Niannian?\" Chang Ningjing, who naturally loved children, started chatting with Zhengzheng upon hearing his words.","\"The little brother and sister are called Suisui Niannian.\"","Shen Yin couldn't bear it anymore and said with a laugh, \"The two babies are named Sui Sui and Nian Nian. Their formal names are Xue Le'an for the boy and Xue Leyu for the girl.\"","\"Those names sound so nice. Jingrui is indeed more cultured than Zhiyuan.\"","\"Sis, is that how you talk about your own brother? Besides, haven't you noticed that your name and mine are also cultured?\"","Ningjing yizhiyuan (tranquility leads to far-reaching goals) was indeed quite cultured, Chang Ningjing thought. At least they hadn't named her something like Zhaodi or Laidi.","\"Yes, yes, they are. But it's not like you came up with them. What's wrong with me saying Jingrui is more cultured than you?\"","\"When I have children in the future, I'll definitely give them names that are no worse than Jingrui's.\"","\"Ahem, you're just talking big. You're not even married yet, where are you going to get children to name?\"","The siblings' daily banter continued, neither giving an inch. Chang Zhiyuan suddenly deflated again.","He wanted to get married too.","\"It's nice to have siblings. You always have someone to bicker with. Unlike me, I've been alone since childhood, with no one to talk to when I wanted to,\" Tan Xiao said, taking a sip of his Macallan whisky.","\"You only say that because you don't have siblings. If you did, you wouldn't think that way,\" Shen Yin remarked.","\"Yin Yin, don't you have an older brother too?\"","\"Yes, my brother has always thought I was ugly. Even now that I'm married, he still bickers with me.\"","\"That's nice. If possible, it's best for a family to have two children,\" Tan Xiao said.","Hearing this, Chang Ningjing felt another pang of sadness. Tan Xiao was probably like her, fond of children, but...","\"How's this whisky?\"","\"It's alright, quite mellow and fragrant,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","The topic had dampened Chang Ningjing's mood considerably, so she stood up and said, \"I'm going to the restroom.\"","Shen Yin watched Chang Ningjing leave the private room, her retreating figure seemingly revealing her loneliness. She tapped Xu Xiuhe on the arm.","Xu Xiuhe naturally knew what Shen Yin wanted to do, so he nodded.","\"I feel like going to the restroom too. I'll go now,\" Shen Yin said as she stood up and left the room.","The restroom at Qingfan Tower was quite secluded, located in the farthest corner. When Shen Yin arrived, Chang Ningjing was already washing her hands at the sink.","\"Shen Yin, why did you come out?\"","\"It was too stuffy in there. I came out for some fresh air,\" Shen Yin said.","She actually had no intention of using the restroom, so she just went to the sink next to Chang Ningjing and washed her hands.","While washing, she glanced at Chang Ningjing's hands and said, \"Sister Ningjing, your hands are so beautiful, both fair and long.\"","Chang Ningjing stretched out her hand, looked at it, and said, \"Really? You're just good with words. Look at your own hands, they're beautiful too.\"","Shen Yin also extended her hand. Her fingers were long and slender, like spring onions, indeed beautiful. But the issue at hand wasn't whose hands were more attractive.","\"They're fine, but I feel like your fingers are longer than mine. Why don't we dry our hands and compare?\"","\"Sure.\"","The two dried their hands but didn't leave. They stood in front of the sink outside the restroom and held out their hands.","Both hands were beautiful, each with its own characteristics. As they placed them side by side, Shen Yin said, \"See, your fingers are indeed a bit longer than mine.\"","\"But your hands are fairer than mine.\"","\"No way, I think your wrists are more slender than mine,\" Shen Yin said, taking the opportunity to grasp Chang Ningjing's wrist.","\"Is that so? From my perspective, I think your wrists are more slender.\"","\"Let me measure,\" Shen Yin grasped again, this time placing her index and middle fingers on Chang Ningjing's pulse point.","There was indeed an issue with the pulse. Shen Yin put down Chang Ningjing's left hand and then held her right hand.","Not only was there cold energy in her body, but also a lot of dampness. It was probably the root cause of her illness. With such a body, how could she bear children?","\"Sister Ningjing, do you experience a lot of pain during your period?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"How did you know? The pain is unbearable. I can't even go to work for those few days each month.\"","\"Would you believe me if I said I could tell just by taking your pulse just now?\"","\"Really? Is pulse diagnosis that magical?\" Chang Ningjing was surprised. She had seen many traditional Chinese medicine doctors throughout her life, mainly because of the severe pain. The doctors' answers were always that she had a cold constitution, and they prescribed Chinese herbal medicine for treatment. But even after drinking so much, there was no effect. The doctors could only say that it had been too long and couldn't be cured. So she didn't have much faith in traditional Chinese medicine.","\"It really is. Why else do you think the country is promoting traditional Chinese medicine and culture so vigorously now? There must be some illnesses that are better treated with traditional Chinese medicine. Pulse diagnosis has been well-established since the Jin Dynasty.\"","\"Have you studied it?\"","\"I suppose you could say that. I've been interested in it since I was young, so I researched it and read all kinds of traditional Chinese medicine books. I know a little bit about it.\"","Shen Yin was being modest. In fact, when she was in the Dasheng Dynasty, she did study it out of interest, reading books and asking imperial doctors. She only had a superficial understanding then, but who knew that after coming here, her skills would be amplified? On top of her basic knowledge, she learned a billion more little things.","\"Why is the cold energy so severe?\" Shen Yin asked, already knowing the answer.","\"When I was young, I fell into a pond during my period,\" Chang Ningjing didn't try to hide it.","\"Oh no, did it leave any lasting effects?\"","\"It did. I can't have children,\" Chang Ningjing said in a small voice, as if she had shed her outer shell.","\"Have you sought treatment? I feel like your pulse doesn't indicate complete infertility.\""]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: Swimming Pool","paragraphs":["Chang Ningjing's eyes lit up as if she saw hope yet quickly dimmed again, \"Is that so? I've seen all sorts of doctors, both Western and Chinese medicine.\"","She traveled to many cities, always on her own, getting secret treatments without anyone knowing, but she was still infertile.","Gradually, she had given up.","\"I've seen so many doctors, and at first they all said there's hope, but after the treatments, it's always the same.\"","Chang Ningjing's mood was extremely low, this experience of seeing light, and then having that light die out, was indeed crushing.","\"Is there a possibility that they didn't treat the root of the problem?\" Shen Yin speculated.","\"Ah, let's leave it to fate.\" Chang Ningjing sighed.","\"Why don't I give it a try? Don't raise your hopes too high, if it can be cured, consider it an unexpected joy.\"","“All right then, I play the guinea pig for you.”","After saying this, both Chang Ningjing and Shen Yin laughed. Someone was coming to the restroom, so they didn't stay there any longer and went straight back to their private room.","In the private room, Shu Yi was still taking care of Xu Yunzheng's meal to ease her own awkwardness.","Chang Zhiyuan occasionally stole glances at Shu Yi, while Tan Xiao and Xu Xiuhe started to chat while eating.","Xu Yunzheng raised his head and called out: \"Mom.\"","\"My dear.\"","\"My dear, what do you want to call me?\" Chang Ningjing asked the little one with a smile.","Xu Yunzheng looked at Chang Ningjing and Shen Yin, finally returned his gaze to Chang Ningjing.","“Beautiful aunt.”","“Ah, so well-behaved.”","Chang Ningjing was overjoyed. Not only did he call her auntie, but he also called her beautiful auntie. The little darling really had a way with words. He would surely win the hearts of girls in the future.","\"You two came back together?\" Chang Zhiyuan asked.","\"What, Xu Xiuhe hasn't said anything, the little guy hasn't said anything, and you've started to inquire?\"","\"Fine, fine, you're older, you have the final say.\" Chang Zhiyuan took another sip of his drink.","The table resumed its original atmosphere.","\"Zhiyuan, drink less, this alcohol is strong, if you get drunk like last time, there will be no one to send you home.\"","\"Sis.\"","Upon hearing Chang Ningjing say this, Chang Zhiyuan guiltily glanced at Shu Yi.","When Shu Yi heard Chang Ningjing mention Chang Zhiyuan's drinking and getting drunk, her heart started to fluctuate. Chang Ningjing knowingly or unknowingly took a peek at Shu Yi and could see the momentary pause in Shu Yi's movements. She knew then she hit the nail.","\"Shu Yi, is it hectic filming recently? It must be tiring.\" Chang Ningjing asked.","\"It's okay, I was on the set recently, just came back yesterday for some rest.\"","\"I love your shows, what is the theme of this recently one?\"","Chang Ningjing intentionally tried to make friendly advances.","\"Thanks, Ningjing, the recent one is a suspense drama.\"","\"Can we connect on WeChat? When the drama airs, I will support it right away.\"","\"Sure.\"","Chang Ningjing took out her phone, opened WeChat, and Shu Yi also took out her phone, turned on her QR code. After adding each other, Chang Ningjing, contented, sent a knowing smile towards Chang Zhiyuan.","Chang Zhiyuan hung his head, taking another sip of wine. Fortunately, everyone had eaten, and it was getting late. Shen Yin glanced at the time and suggested it was time to leave.","“It’s getting late, we should go. Arrange for a driver since we’ve had wine,” advised Shen Yin. Although Xu Xiuhe was not drunk, drunk driving was against the law.","As the captain of the SWAT team, Tan Xiao would naturally obey the law.","“Zhiyuan, I’ll get a driver for you. My assistant will come to pick me up and take Tan Xiao back. As for Shu Yi...”","“I didn’t drink. I can drive,” Shu Yi quickly stated.","“Can you drive me back then? I’ve had drinks.” Chang Zhiyuan uttered these words with torrent eyes, although he realized he might have crossed a line.","“Never mind, consider it a dream. You wouldn’t drive me, too heartless,” he said with an exaggerated whimper.","Chang Ningjing rubbed her forehead, she felt so embarrassed. She wished she could disown her younger brother for his pitiful performance.","Yet, what Chang Zhiyuan had just said, his tone, and expression softened Shu Yi’s heart.","“I’ll drive you.”","“Really? Shu Yiru, I promise to behave. Let’s go.”","A bit wobbly, Chang Zhiyuan staggered to Shu Yi’s side.","The group headed down the building. Chen Siming, knowing they were leaving, personally saw them off.","“Drive safe. Let me know when you’re home.”","“Will do.”","Chang Zhiyuan sat on the passenger's side, staring at Shu Yi.","“Stop staring at me, I need to drive.” Shu Yi dared not meet Chang Zhiyuan’s gaze.","“You know, you’re beautiful. It’s been so long since I saw you. Your photos don’t do you justice,” Chang Zhiyuan muttered.","“You’ve seen my photos?” Shu Yi seemed interested.","“Of course. Look at my phone. Your photo is my screensaver.”","Chang Zhiyuan unlocked his phone. Shu Yi’s portrait was his wallpaper. Long hair, a black gown, and a red backdrop. To describe in two words, stunning. Three words? Absolutely stunning.","“How did you get this photo of me?”","“Shu Yiru, don’t be silly. You’re an employee of my company, my artist. I’m your boss. Isn’t it normal for me to have your portraits? Your reaction is too exaggerated.”","Was she exaggerating? Without her consent, Chang Zhiyuan had used her photo as his wallpaper. As the subject of the photo, wasn’t it normal for her to be surprised?","“I even have your portfolio at home. Would you like to see it? They are all beautiful, but none as beautiful as you. These photographers can’t capture your real value, so annoying. Going back, I'm going to fire any photographer who couldn’t take a good picture of you.”","“Chang Zhiyuan, can you stop being childish? It’s normal for a photo to be slightly different than real life. You can’t blame the photographers.”","\"It's the photographer's fault for sure. Everyone else has a normal photo, except for this one actress who can't act. The photos she took look far better than she herself looks in person. I'm going to discuss this with them tomorrow,\" said Chang Zhiyuan.","Shu Yi remained silent. This guy Chang Zhiyuan was behaving like a child, eager and spontaneous. And he was a big company's CEO! If anyone were to find out how he behaves once drunk, it would be a great embarrassment.","\"Give me the address,\" he demanded.","\"What address?\"","\"Your house address. I need to take you home, understand?\"","\"I don't want to go home. It's not easy for me to see you. I can't bear to go back. I fear I won't see you anymore if I go back,\" he confessed, sounding vulnerable.","Shu Yi's patience was diminishing. What was she supposed to do? She liked him too. She felt weak-hearted now, and it was quite impossible for her to just abandon him.","\"So what do you want? I need to go home.\"","\"You could take me home, just like before. I want to go home with you,\" he pleaded.","Alright! Shu Yi turned the ignition key, starting the car. On their way back, Chang Zhiyuan was jovial, non-stop laughing and constantly gazing at Shu Yi. His eyes never left her face even for a second. He looked like the good-for-nothing heir of a wealthy family.","Surely enough, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe had reached home and given the child a bath. They lay in the bed after putting the child to sleep.","\"Today, Xu Guimin visited me,\" Xu Xiuhe informed Shen Yin.","\"He didn't come again asking for your help, did he? He left on his own last time. Why is he calling you now?\" Shen Yin inquired.","Xu Xiuhe pulled Shen Yin closer into his arms, and Shen Yin adjusted her position for comfort.","\"No, he asked me about the remark I made last time. About his accident, that it was not as simple as it appears,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","\"He's asking about that incident now? It's been six months already. Is he still retaining that memory?\"","\"He might be getting feelings about it lately.\"","\"I always felt suspicious about his accident. I always thought Yang Cui and Xu Zhengyang might have something to do with it. I'm just waiting to have a dream about it, then it will be confirmed,\" she mused.","Meanwhile, at a villa owned by the Xu family, Ge Xinxin lay on her bed scrolling through videos on her phone. A call came in and her facial expression changed considerably. She was tentative but she answered it anyway.","\"Hello, how many times do I need to tell you this? I have a boyfriend now. He's very caring, wealthy too, can't you guys stop bothering me?\" demanded Ge Xinxin.","\"Xinxin, please hear me out. I didn't mean to, it wasn't intentional. My motive was purely to ensure a better lifestyle for us in the future. That's why I had sent you to please Xu Zhengyang,\" the caller tried to justify.","\"There's no need for an explanation. I should be thanking you instead. Thanks to your scheme, I had the opportunity to meet up with the scion of a wealthy clan and the chance to enter a privileged life!\"","“Xinxin...” he trailed off.","\"Enough already, I can also make decisions for myself. If you can betray your girlfriend for a petty collaboration, then can't I break up with you for future wealth and prosperity? I know how to choose between being a young mistress of a rich family and a slag wife. Don't disturb me anymore.\"","After finishing, Ge Xinxin hung up the phone. She did not regret her choice one bit. After all, a woman needs to be practical and live for herself. She is grateful that she is carrying Xu Zhengyang's child, which puts her one step closer to the position of young mistress.","However, she is not a fool. She can see that Xu Zhengyang's mother, Yang Cui, doesn't want her to marry into the Xu family because of her humble background. Wealthy families would generally not accept someone like her.","But she is not anxious, for the baby in her belly is her trump card. No matter how lowly her status is, didn't Yang Cui also rise from being a mistress? To be frank, she is far more upright than Yang Cui. She is much younger than Yang Cui and as long as her child is on her side in the future, she doesn't have anything to fear.","She could always outlive the old woman. Her life wouldn't be bad and she certainly won't lack money. She doesn't care about being nameless and shareless because she knows that the Xu family values the baby in her belly very much.","\"Oh my baby, you will definitely help me, won't you? I've had enough of the poor life. I don't want to rent a house anymore, or go drinking with men for their sake. Here's our opportunity, we have to seize it ourselves, right?\"","Ge Xinxin caressed her belly as she spoke.","In Xu Guimin's room, Yang Cui was sitting in front of the dressing table, observing her skin carefully while applying a facial mask.","Suddenly, a face appeared in the mirror.","\"Oh my gosh, honey, you scared me!\"","Yang Cui complained, patting her chest.","\"I just came to see how you are applying your mask, and you got scared? When did you become so timid?\"","Xu Guimin looked on with interest, observing Yang Cui's expressions in his pajamas.","The way Yang Cui acted was clearly different from usual. Could it really be as Xu Xiuhe said?","\"Cui Cui, why are you so nervous, is it because you think I'm old and you have someone outside?\"","Xu Guimin probed deliberately, he knew that Yang Cui wouldn't dare, and that she still needed him. He just wanted to see her reaction.","\"Honey, what are you talking about? How could I possibly betray you? Besides, you're so amazing, how could I possibly...\"","Yang Cui started to play the pity card, almost in tears, while clinging onto Xu Guimin's arm.","\"I was just messing with you. Look at how scared you were, you were about to drop your phone. Just because my face suddenly appeared in the mirror, you were this terrified? Can I not be suspicious?\"","Xu Guimin justified his actions.","\"Well, it's a mirror. There are many horrifying stories about mirrors, isn't it normal for me to be scared? After all, I'm just a weak woman.\"","Yang Cui acted coy, her voice gentle and seductive.","\"My bad, I just wanted to tease you. Don't worry, there's nothing to be scared of.\"","Xu Guimin reached out and patted Yang Cui's shoulder, his gaze changing.","When they went to sleep at night, Yang Cui was the one clinging to him, but Xu Guimin couldn't sleep at all. He kept thinking about what Xu Xiuhe had said.","He had always been a good swimmer. How could he suddenly drown? He himself wouldn't believe it if he told anyone. It was no wonder that the old man from the Shen family scoffed at him. It was downright embarrassing, to be a swimmer who ended up in the ICU because he had nearly drowned. Wasn't that a joke?","But if he was victimized, then this matter would need to be reconsidered.","Unable to sleep, Xu Guimin got up and made his way to his study to think. Close to midnight, he mustered up the courage and headed for the yard of the Xu's villa.","The dream, and the figure of Sun Wenting, was constantly in his mind. He wanted to see what would happen when he went to the poolside this time.","But halfway there, Xu Guimin faltered. He had to psych himself up, to bolster his courage, before making his way to the poolside.","As he got closer, he grew more fearful. There were actually sounds coming from the pool in the dead of night, and Xu Guimin was petrified.","However, curiosity got the better of him. Thus, he lightened his footsteps and started moving slowly towards that direction.","The nearer he got to the pool, the faster his heart beat. It felt as if his heart was going to leap out of his chest."]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: Women, I Command You","paragraphs":["As Xu Guimin approached the swimming pool, he kept trying to muster up his courage.","Finally, he could hear some voices more clearly.","\"Zhengyang, slow down.\"","Xu Guimin turned on his phone's flashlight and shone it over. Hearing Zhengyang's name made him feel a little less afraid.","\"Who's there?\"","There was a splash from the pool.","Xu Guimin moved closer, shining his light on the part of the pool where he had heard the voices. The water's surface rippled with waves.","Xu Guimin continued forward, determined to see for himself whether there were people or ghosts in the water.","\"Come out!\"","Xu Guimin shone the light directly at that spot. Bubbles were still coming up from the water, but no one was responding to him.","\"If you don't come out, I'm going to call people to drag the pool,\" Xu Guimin said sternly.","\"I'll count to three. One, two...\"","Before Xu Guimin could reach three, someone emerged from underwater.","\"Dad. It's me.\"","Xu Guimin was startled. \"What are you doing here?\"","The man clearly hadn't expected to find his own son in the swimming pool, much less his son embracing a woman.","\"Dad, it's me. Don't be angry.\"","\"What's going on here?\"","The woman in Xu Zhengyang's arms clung to him, showing only her back to Xu Guimin. She was wearing a swimsuit, so Xu Guimin couldn't make out her face.","\"Dad.\"","Xu Zhengyang just called out once. As a man himself, Xu Guimin of course knew what his son was up to.","\"Who is she?\" Xu Guimin asked.","The woman buried her head even lower. Whoever she was, being caught like this was truly embarrassing.","\"I'll turn around. You two get out and put some clothes on first, then we'll talk.\"","After saying this, Xu Guimin turned his back to them.","Two minutes later, Xu Guimin heard movement behind him.","\"Dad, we're ready.\"","Xu Guimin turned around. The two had wrapped themselves in towels. Xu Guimin focused his gaze on the woman, feeling she looked familiar but unable to place where he had seen her before.","\"Who are you?\"","Xu Guimin kept his eyes fixed on the woman.","\"I...\"","Before she could finish, Xu Guimin realized who she was - the family's housekeeper.","\"What were you thinking? Isn't the house big enough for you? Of all places to go in the middle of the night, you choose the swimming pool. Is it for the thrill, or some other experience?\"","Xu Guimin was furious. He knew Xu Zhengyang always had girlfriends and didn't usually interfere in his son's personal affairs. But he never imagined his son would act so inappropriately in the family pool.","\"Go back and reflect on your actions. Your girlfriend is pregnant, and this is how you behave? How inconsiderate can you be?\"","\"And you,\" he turned to the woman, \"as a housekeeper, don't you know what you should and shouldn't do? Tomorrow morning, pack your things and leave.\"","Meanwhile, at Ziyue Manor.","Shu Yi was lying awake again. After much thought, she realized it was her own fault. Her soft-heartedness had led her to agree to Chang Zhiyuan's request to bring her back. She had brought this upon herself, making the same mistake over and over. But she couldn't help it - seeing him in such pain made her suffer too. It wasn't just Chang Zhiyuan who had been drinking; she had been drinking as well.","Usually, when she was working on set, she didn't dare drink. Filming from dawn to dusk left her exhausted and with no energy to think about relationship matters. But once she had some downtime, she couldn't help but think of him.","She had always known she was a hopeless romantic, trying her best to control it, constantly torn between reason and emotion. On her days off, she would have a little drink to help her sleep, but in the middle of the night...","She would still dream of him.","As usual, Shu Yi went downstairs to the kitchen cabinet where she kept her hidden stash of alcohol.","As soon as she reached the first floor, she was startled. The lights were off, and Chang Zhiyuan was sitting on the sofa, just a dark silhouette.","\"Why aren't you sleeping? What are you doing here?\"","Shu Yi put a hand to her chest, trying to calm herself.","\"Thinking about you.\"","Shu Yi was momentarily speechless, then said, \"You've been drinking. Go to bed quickly.\"","Chang Zhiyuan seemed not to have heard Shu Yi's words and continued staring blankly at the TV.","Shu Yi didn't linger downstairs. After finding a bottle of alcohol in the kitchen cabinet, she went straight back upstairs.","Chang Zhiyuan followed her up.","\"Why are you following me?\"","\"To look at you.\"","\"What's there to look at?\"","Shu Yi, holding the bottle, turned her head and continued climbing.","\"I want to drink too.\"","Chang Zhiyuan's voice was small, like a child whining.","\"...\"","\"You've already had a lot to drink tonight. Go to sleep.\"","\"Can't sleep.\"","Shu Yi sighed. There was a bar next to the balcony on the second floor. She gave up trying to persuade Chang Zhiyuan to go to bed.","So, the two of them sat down on the chairs by the bar, facing each other, on the balcony at one in the morning.","Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan started drinking, one glass after another.","\"I still like you, woman. I order you to unblock me immediately.\"","Chang Zhiyuan used the meekest tone to say the toughest words.","\"What? Blocked? When did I ever block you?\"","Shu Yi looked at her phone, shaking her head.","\"Hehe, you're drunk,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, looking at Shu Yi with a silly grin.","\"I'm not drunk. I'm perfectly sober. How am I drunk? Don't say I'm drunk. Hmph!\"","After saying this, Shu Yi passed out, her face on the bar.","\"You say you're not drunk, but look at you now. Stubborn girl.\"","Using his last bit of consciousness, Chang Zhiyuan took Shu Yi's hand and used her fingerprint to unlock her phone. He opened her contacts and scrolled through but couldn't find his name.","\"I don't even have a name in her phone.\" After saying this, Chang Zhiyuan had a sudden idea. He input his own phone number and, surprisingly, there was an entry with a note.","\"Dog Man.\"","Seeing these words, Chang Zhiyuan's first reaction was anger. Why had she labeled him as \"Dog Man\"? How was he like a dog? But then he smiled happily. Having a label was better than having none at all. And \"Dog Man\" was special, wasn't it? Dogs were great, after all.","\"Dog Man, ah, Dog Man~~\"","Chang Zhiyuan started singing to himself, then picked up his glass and took a couple of big gulps before passing out as well.","The two of them remained slumped at the bar all night until 9 am the next morning when Shu Yi finally woke up.","She stretched her neck and yawned, opening her eyes to see Chang Zhiyuan's face.","Her mind quickly recapped the events of the previous night: she couldn't sleep, went downstairs for a drink, Chang Zhiyuan shamelessly followed her up, then they drank a lot, and after that... she couldn't remember.","Shu Yi felt sore all over. Who in their right mind would sleep sitting up all night? She must have some serious issues.","Chang Zhiyuan suddenly opened his eyes, immediately seeing Shu Yi's face. He instantly felt like he was dreaming or hallucinating.","\"Can I kiss you, woman?\"","Chang Zhiyuan wanted to take advantage of what he thought was a dream to do things he couldn't normally do.","As he said this, he leaned in, moving his lips towards Shu Yi's face.","Shu Yi was dumbfounded. What was wrong with him so early in the morning? She quickly raised her left hand and pressed it against Chang Zhiyuan's face, pushing him away."]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: Choose One: Marriage, Love, or Having Children","paragraphs":["\"Shu Yueru, oh Shu Yueru, you disobedient woman. You even resist me in dreams. I won't allow it.\"","As Chang Zhiyuan spoke, he leaned his face closer.","\"Chang Zhiyuan, this isn't a dream!\"","Chang Zhiyuan was pushed away by Shu Yi once again before he realized. This wasn't a dream; this was reality. How embarrassing. Just now, he had...","\"Ahem, I thought it was a dream,\" Chang Zhiyuan said, scratching his head.","\"Boss, you're sober now. You can go home.\"","\"I don't have a car.\"","\"You have a phone and an assistant.\"","\"I don't want to leave.\"","\"You...\" Shu Yi was speechless. How could someone be so thick-skinned?","\"Now that we're both sober and have time, can we sit down and talk properly about our issues?\"","Chang Zhiyuan pleaded.","Shu Yi also calmed down, her eyes fixed on Chang Zhiyuan. She could clearly see an unprecedented seriousness on his face.","\"How do you want to talk?\"","They sat face to face, their eyes locked on each other.","\"I know what you're worried about. My parents won't bother you again in the future.\"","Chang Zhiyuan got straight to the point.","\"Do you know that there's already a huge disparity between our social statuses? Most of the time, two people in love find it very difficult to end up together.\"","Shu Yi spoke with equal seriousness.","\"I know, but problems are meant to be overcome. We like each other, so why can't we be together? We're not minors, nor are we married. We're both single, so why is it so hard for us to be together? I know my parents approached you, and that's my fault. But they can't make decisions for me. I'm financially independent and I don't live with them. If I insist, they won't bother you again. You might say they still won't accept you in their hearts, but so what? I'm the one who will be living with you, not them. You don't need to care about what they think at all. As Xiu He once said, the only person who can accompany you to the end is your partner.\"","Chang Zhiyuan spoke at length, expressing all the thoughts he had been holding back.","\"Are you finished?\"","\"Your turn. I want to hear your thoughts.\"","\"I don't know what I think. My mind is a mess right now.\"","\"What's there to be confused about? Our relationship is between us and no one else. If we're together, you don't need to worry about your career at all. Your fans don't care about your personal life. They just want you to be happy, no matter what. Besides, you've gotten to where you are today because of your acting skills and talent. What are you afraid of? Are you worried about the difference in our social status? Do you think your background isn't good enough for me?\"","Chang Zhiyuan paused, and Shu Yi seemed to be pondering.","\"No one can choose their birth circumstances. That's not our fault. But we have the right to pursue love. So what if my family has some money? I feel like I'm not good enough for you. You're young and beautiful. As for me, I had a bad reputation before, and I'm older than you. I should be the one feeling unworthy. What's wrong with you? You can earn money, and you're smart. It's just my parents' outdated views that made them say those things to you. You're excellent. Others might not know how you've made it this far, but I do. It's not easy for a girl in the entertainment industry. You were just a little luckier than others, but everything else you've achieved, you deserve.\"","Chang Zhiyuan hadn't forgotten what he learned when he investigated her past, how she had risen from obscurity to her current position.","She took notes while acting, repeatedly observed veteran actors' techniques, constantly studied scripts to understand character profiles, worked late and rose early, never complained, never argued with directors, never deliberately tried to get close to directors. She just quietly did her job, neither fighting nor grabbing, but diligently practicing her acting skills.","The hardships she endured behind the scenes, perhaps only she knew.","\"Marriages without parental blessings are often unhappy,\" Shu Yi finally said after a long pause.","\"You said 'often,' not always. We can't generalize like that. There are always exceptions. Sometimes, parents' opinions aren't always right. We're adults now, capable of independent thinking and knowing what we want. Why should we give up something precious because of their opinions? Shu Yueru, let me tell you this: I won't marry anyone but you in this life. We'll get through this together. If you think it's because of my parents, that's okay. They're 30 years older than us after all, and we'll outlast them. But I'll say it again: we don't need their blessing. As long as I firmly choose you, what does their opinion matter? I'm not using their money now, and they can't control me. My sister likes you very much too. What else are you afraid of?\"","\"You've said too much.\"","Since waking up, Chang Zhiyuan's mouth hadn't stopped moving, spouting one rationale after another. He was just short of citing examples. But Shu Yi believed that with Chang Zhiyuan's personality, he was capable of doing just that. He might go and find many examples of marriages that weren't blessed by parents but turned out well, and present them to her.","\"Woman, do you see? This couple wasn't blessed by their parents, but they grew old together happily. This couple had a huge status gap between their families, but they...\"","Shu Yi imagined in her mind.","Chang Zhiyuan was observing Shu Yi beside her.","\"Have you made up your mind?\"","\"About what?\"","\"Marry me, date me, or have children with me. Choose one. It's a must-answer question.\"","\"Can I choose none?\"","\"No.\"","Shu Yi's mind was in a fog. Chang Zhiyuan had said too much today.","\"Can you give me some time to think about it?\"","Shu Yi said after nearly a minute of contemplation.","\"Alright, but I don't want to wait too long. Rest assured, my parents will never bother you again. And don't worry, if we really end up together and get married, we definitely won't live with them.\"","Chang Zhiyuan could guarantee this point. He wasn't living with them now, so how could he possibly live with them after getting married?","\"I'll give you three days to think it over slowly.\"","After saying this, Chang Zhiyuan left Ziyue Manor on his own, giving Shu Yi private space to think.","Shu Yi was indeed moved by Chang Zhiyuan's words, but she felt there was still a hurdle in her heart that she couldn't overcome.","\"Hey, Yin Yin.\"","\"I'm here.\"","\"I don't know what to do anymore.\""]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: Sending You to Kindergarten","paragraphs":["After listening to Shu Yi's words, Shen Yin was silent for a few seconds before saying, \"Listen to your own heart, follow what you feel inside.\"","Shu Yi instantly understood on the other end of the line.","In reality, Shen Yin hadn't said anything specific, yet she had said everything.","She couldn't interfere in this matter. As the saying goes, \"Advise reconciliation, not separation.\" But what if later on, the two of them ended up unhappy? Wouldn't she then be the one to blame?","So Shen Yin could only tell her to make her own choice and follow her heart.","\"Mommy, look at the picture I drew!\" Zhengzheng came running over on her little legs, holding a sheet of A4 paper.","\"What is this?\"","Shen Yin had just hung up the phone. She crouched down and took the drawing from Zhengzheng.","\"This is Flower and me, and this is Mommy,\" the little one pointed at the figures in the drawing.","Shen Yin held up the picture and compared it. Flower didn't look like Flower, Zhengzheng didn't look like Zhengzheng, and she didn't look like herself either.","But children have their own ideas and imagination, and Shen Yin didn't want to discourage her little one's enthusiasm for drawing.","So she praised her, \"Zhengzheng, you did a great job.\"","\"Who's this?\" Shen Yin pointed to another small figure in the drawing.","\"That's my little sister.\"","After saying this, Xu Yunzheng looked at Shen Yin's belly. The pregnancy was still in its early stages, not showing yet.","Who says children don't understand anything? Children actually know everything.","\"Where's Daddy?\"","\"Daddy went out to earn money to support us,\" the little one said very seriously.","How about Mommy goes out to earn money too?","\"No, Daddy told Zhengzheng to take good care of Mommy and little sister.\"","\"Oh, you.\"","Shen Yin gently tapped the little one's nose.","She then took the child to Qingfan Tower.","Business at Qingfan Tower was getting better day by day, even surpassing some small tourist attractions. Many people came specifically to experience the daily life of ancient people.","Listening to music, playing chess, reading books, appreciating paintings, watching dances.","As the flow of visitors increased, the surrounding land was already being expanded. Chen Siming was already a clever person, and with Shen Yin's ideas, the local economy had been stimulated. It had truly become a dark horse in the recent restaurant industry.","At this time, Xu Xiuhe was busy at Heyuan Group. Others might not know why he had been working overtime recently, but Shen Yin knew that Xu Xiuhe just wanted to get Xu Group back as soon as possible.","He wanted to present Xu Group as a gift to Shen Yin before she gave birth.","However, acquiring a group wasn't an easy task. The first thing Xu Xiuhe did was to negotiate partnerships, contacting all the companies that had stable cooperation with Xu Group before, openly competing for Xu Zhengyang's business.","Xu Zhengyang wasn't particularly stupid, he could see that Xu Xiuhe was intentionally suppressing him.","Xu Guimin had also returned to Xu Group. He hadn't been to the company for half a year. When he arrived at the company, he toured every floor, observing the company's recent development. He could naturally see that the company had been on a downward trend lately.","After careful consideration, he called Xu Xiuhe.","When Xu Xiuhe saw the incoming call, his first reaction was to hang up.","Thinking this, he actually did it, directly pressing the red disconnect button.","Xu Guimin didn't give up and called again.","\"Hello, Xiuhe.\"","\"If you have something to say, just say it.\"","\"You've been suppressing Xu Group recently, haven't you?\"","\"How I do things doesn't seem to have much to do with you.\"","\"Why are you doing this?\" Xu Guimin asked in a calm tone.","Xu Xiuhe clearly hadn't expected Xu Guimin's tone to be so calm on the other end.","\"What I do has nothing to do with you. How did Xu Group end up in this state? Don't you know in your heart?\"","\"Xiuhe, why are you doing this? I'm your father. In the future, this company will definitely belong to both of you. What's the point of what you're doing now?\"","\"Who says it belongs to both of us? It can only be mine. Oh, I forgot to tell you, that son of yours really isn't suited for business. In the past six months, Xu Group hasn't even ranked.\"","\"Was what you said last time true?\"","...","\"Do I have any reason to deceive you? Let me give you a warning, be careful or you might not even know how you died in the end.\"","Xu Xiuhe hung up after saying this.","He had become so strong that he felt no ripples when facing Xu Guimin.","After hanging up, Xu Xiuhe called Shen Yin. Before Shen Yin was pregnant, he used to call only two or three times a day. Now, he called whenever he had a free moment, afraid that Shen Yin might accidentally bump or knock into something.","He even had the idea of making Shen Yin stay at home all day without moving. To be honest, he was a bit envious of Liu Bo outside, whose wife was always right in front of him, how nice that must be.","\"Hello, this is the second time.\"","\"You're even keeping count?\"","\"Of course.\"","\"Is it almost lunchtime?\"","Xu Xiuhe asked. Ever since Shen Yin became pregnant, he hadn't even discussed it with her before hiring many housekeepers and nutritionists at home.","Before, Shen Yin didn't want many people in the house, but now she had no choice but to agree. Being pregnant, how could she go into the kitchen and smell the cooking fumes?","\"Not yet, I'm at Qingfan Tower with Zhengzheng.\"","\"It seems like Qingfan Tower is your home now. Before it was Qinghe Villa, now it's Qingfan Tower, who knows which tower it'll be next.\"","Xu Xiuhe teased.","\"Not at all, I have nothing to do. I've already listened to you, I don't even go to the martial arts gym myself now, I only go to the studio once every two weeks, and I have nothing to do with the Chinese furniture business. I'm bored every day.\"","\"Is it boring to see me?\"","\"Ahem, Zhengzheng is hungry, we're going to eat now.\" Shen Yin hung up the phone.","After having lunch with Yunzheng, Shen Yin began to ponder again about how to manage all these newly built Song dynasty-style buildings around her.","Should they be directly categorized and separated into tea houses, restaurants, and other leisure places?","Originally, she and Chen Siming just wanted to create a unique restaurant, but clearly now, it had gone beyond just being a restaurant.","Suddenly, Shen Yin had an idea. After she and Xu Yunzheng finished lunch, she wanted to rest, but Qingfan Tower didn't have accommodation. The restaurant also didn't offer lodging services.","But this area was already remote, with few nearby accommodation options, and the environment was generally average. So, they absolutely needed to build a hotel.","If the hotel was built like Qingfan Tower, it would definitely have to be in the Song dynasty style. Even the interior decoration and layout should be like ancient times. That way, it would be more attractive and show more cultural charm.","In the afternoon, Shen Yin recorded all her ideas and then sent them to Xu Xiuhe.","\"Honey, I originally wanted to give you Xu Group, but now I find that you're too powerful. In the future, you might not even care about Xu Group.\"","\"The more the merrier, I don't mind having more money,\" Shen Yin joked.","\"Daddy, what are you giving Zhengzheng?\"","\"I'm sending Zhengzheng to kindergarten.\"","\"Great, great! Go to kindergarten, make new friends.\"","Shen Yin was amused by the conversation between father and son.","The little one had never been to kindergarten before, but isn't there a joke online? It suggests sending children to kindergarten because you can't stand seeing them so carefree.","Shen Yin thought Xu Yunzheng still looked silly and happy even after being tricked by his own father."]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: I Owe You a Wedding","paragraphs":["In August, Rong City was sweltering. Shen Yin was three months pregnant and had started to feel drowsy often. Xu Xiuhe would return home before 8 PM every evening.","Upon arriving home, his first task was to bathe Zhengzheng. After that, he would put Zhengzheng to sleep, and then take a bath with Shen Yin.","Since Shen Yin became pregnant, he had become particularly sensitive, not daring to let her go to the bathroom alone. His reason was that the bathroom was too slippery and unsafe.","After bathing Shen Yin, he would then lull her to sleep. It was simple: he would massage her legs and rub her waist to prevent her from feeling tired or uncomfortable during the night.","Fang Yue often shuttled between two places. Initially, she wanted to go to Ziyue Manor to take care of Shen Yin, but Shen Yin didn't agree. If Fang Yue came, Shen Tianzheng would certainly not be able to manage alone at home.","Fang Yue seemed to have thought of this concern, so she suggested that their family of three move to Yuelan Manor to live, as the house was big enough to accommodate them.","But Shen Yin had concerns again. Putting aside whether Xu Xiuhe would be willing or not, she didn't really want to go to Yuelan Manor. Firstly, it was too far from Heyuan Group. If they went there, Xu Xiuhe would have to spend 4 hours commuting to and from the company every day, which was an hour and a half more than before. It wasn't realistic; it would be too exhausting for him.","Shen Yin refused again, but Fang Yue insisted on taking care of her. So, she came every other day. In reality, when she came, there wasn't much for her to do. The house had several housekeepers, all carefully selected and hired at a high price by Xu Xiuhe.","So when Fang Yue came to Ziyue Manor, she would play with Zhengzheng, keep Shen Yin company to prevent her from getting bored, chat with her, and prepare some desserts for her.","\"Mom, have you and Dad always had such a good relationship?\" Shen Yin asked, eating the fruit Fang Yue had peeled for her.","\"Haven't I told you before? Relationships are often cultivated over time. Married couples need to nurture their relationship. Don't worry, your relationship with Xiuhe will only get better in the future. Xiuhe is a sentimental person.\"","Fang Yue felt that while she might not excel in other areas, she had a particularly good eye for men.","Xu Xiuhe was quietly making big moves. During this time, he had been buying up shares from Xu Group's minor shareholders. Xu Zhengyang had noticed and was angry, but he was helpless.","The biggest difference between him and Xu Xiuhe was that Xu Xiuhe was spending his own money and could do whatever he wanted, while he had always been spending family money.","\"Mom, what should I do? Dad doesn't trust me to run the company anymore, and Xu Xiuhe is still buying up shares.\"","Yang Cui's face darkened at these words, but she was much calmer than Xu Zhengyang.","\"Don't panic yet. Let's think of other ways. See if we can start with Heyuan Group.\"","\"Mom, what do you mean?\"","\"Hmm, I'll handle this. You focus on working well and performing well recently. Also, put your personal matters aside for now. Look at what you did that night. We still have Ge Xinxin at home, and you were in the pool late at night... Your father was angry when he came back.\"","\"Alright, Mom. I understand.\"","During her pregnancy, Shen Yin did nothing but eat and sleep, occasionally drawing blueprints for furniture needed in the restaurant later, and having Chen Siming find people to make them.","She didn't ask Kang Guopeng. Kang Guopeng's craftsmanship was suitable for making those exquisite, million-dollar pieces of furniture, while the tables, chairs, and beds needed for the restaurant didn't need to be that refined. The wooden furniture in the restaurant just needed to be slightly better than regular furniture.","Now, whatever Shen Yin said, Chen Siming would do without question. He knew that Shen Yin was much more reliable than him. Following her lead was never wrong.","Several buildings had already risen nearby within two months. Chen Siming even had the illusion that this place would become more prosperous and lively in the near future, rivaling the old town and becoming a scenic spot.","At 8 PM, Xu Xiuhe was going to take Shen Yin and Zhengzheng out for dinner.","\"Where are we going?\"","\"You'll know when we get there.\"","The night in Rong City was brightly lit, with bustling streets and various advertisements playing on large billboards.","Suddenly, all the advertisements in the city went dark.","Sitting in the car, Shen Yin looked at the large electronic screens outside and said, \"Has Rong City been hacked?\"","Xu Xiuhe: ...","Many passersby also noticed that all the advertisements had stopped, which was unusual.","After about three minutes, all the billboards in the city lit up again. All the screens were filled with images of Shen Yin.","It was a compilation of Shen Yin's photos, including pictures of her receiving awards, attending charity events, and at embroidery competitions. Each photo was eye-catching, each frame dazzling. Then came Xu Xiuhe's voice.","\"Meeting you in this life brings joy to my brows; you are indeed my beloved.\"","Shen Yin was clearly surprised by the images on the advertisement screens. What kind of operation was this?","\"How is it? Are you satisfied?\" Xu Xiuhe asked smugly. He hadn't read those domineering CEO novels for nothing. Weren't they all like this in the novels?","After a while, Shen Yin spoke, \"How much did it cost?\"","\"What do you mean, how much?\"","\"How much did these advertisements cost?\"","\"200,000 yuan for one night. It's quite reasonable, I think it's pretty cheap.\"","\"Honey, we should save where we can and spend where we should.\"","\"That's right, and this is where we should spend. Don't you remember? Today is the Qixi Festival. You should value this holiday, right?\"","With Xu Xiuhe's reminder, Shen Yin realized it too.","Xu Xiuhe felt he had been quite low-key. At least he hadn't said to Shen Yin, \"Woman, are you moved?\" like in the novels.","\"I owe you a wedding ceremony,\" Xu Xiuhe said. He had always known that the red wedding dress in Qinghe Villa would look particularly good on Shen Yin. He wanted to see her wear it, wanted to give her a proper wedding ceremony.","\"But we're about to have our second child.\"","\"Why don't you say we got married first and then fell in love? There are many people now who have children first and then get married. Let's set the wedding for the end of the month, while the baby in your belly hasn't grown too big yet.\"","\"Dad, Mom, are you getting married?\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"Yes, Dad and Mom are having a wedding ceremony. Mom will look beautiful as she marries Dad. Would Zhengzheng like that?\"","\"Like Aunt Qi Ji's wedding, and Uncle Liu Bo's wedding?\""]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: Chinese Wedding","paragraphs":["\"It might be a bit different,\" said Xu Xiuhe.","In reality, he had already started preparing for their wedding. He just hadn't told Shen Yin.","One night, everyone in the city knew that the president of Heyuan Group had rented all the big screens in the entire city for his wife, continuously looping messages of love.","Most people were envious, saying, \"So this is how the rich express their love.\" Despite being quite high-profile, it was very desirable.","Shen Yin had no idea about the event at Qingfan Tower. Chen Siming hadn't discussed with her what he was planning to do. However, she was genuinely amazed when she arrived.","The streets were filled with colorful lights and banners. Boats on the lake released floating lanterns, and many people strolled on the bridge in Song Dynasty costumes.","Crowds bustling, peddlers calling...","\"Do you feel like it's similar to home?\"","\"Did you get Chen Siming to do this?\"","Indeed, the bustling streets were very similar to their hometown.","This Qixi Festival, Shen Yin was truly moved, by the omnipresent billboards in the city and the splendid scene at Qingfan Tower.","Tree branches held the moon aloft, lanterns lit the way.","Fireworks filled the sky, all meticulously prepared by Xu Xiuhe for Shen Yin.","In late-August, as the weather cooled, Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin held another wedding ceremony.","A traditional Chinese wedding.","Upon hearing the news, Shu Yi rushed back from the drama crew to attend Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe's wedding.","They chose Qingfan Tower as the location for the traditional wedding and hired the most famous (and most expensive) wedding planner in Rong City.","Shen Yin wore the wedding gown from the Qinghe Street store to the wedding. Dasheng Dynasty wedding gowns were not like those from the Song Dynasty.","In the Song Dynasty, women typically wore green while men wore red. Green was considered lucky in the Song Dynasty, but red is the color for both men and women in Dasheng Dynasty, so the rest of the ceremonies were similar.","Normally, the groom would pick up the bride from her family's home, and after they arrived at the groom's home, they would perform a bowing ceremony. Afterward, they would perform the \"spreading the coverlet\" and \"joining the hair-pins\" rites.","However, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were unique. They merely wanted to go through the wedding ceremony and didn't feel the need to follow the previous wedding procedures exactly.","Buildings near Qingfan Tower were already starting to spring up. They weren't high-rise, and it didn't take long to build. The whole street was a living snapshot of history.","Red carpets lined the streets, and red silk hung in the grand hall of the Qingfan Tower. Everyone including Qi Ji, Xue Jingrui, Chang Zhiyuan, Shu Yi, Chen Siming, and Fang Ningning had arrived, all dressed in Song Dynasty attire, as if they had a common understanding or perhaps Xu Xiuhe had specifically instructed them.","Even their makeup matched the clothing.","On her wedding day, Shen Yin did indeed sit in a palanquin. Eight bearers in festive red attire carried Shen Yin from the entrance of the street to the front gate of Qingfan Tower.","Xu Xiuhe, in his red wedding suit, paled in comparison to Shen Yin.","Shen Yin's red wedding dress was too exquisite, whether it was the quality of the fabric or the craftsmanship, it was much more superior than any ordinary wedding dress.","Shen Yin was lifted down from the bridal sedan chair by Xu Xiuhe. After they steadied their steps, the two hand in hand proceeded towards Qingfan Tower.","Even Qingfan Tower had closed for a day, but many people had come to witness this wedding. They filled the streets on both sides. A Chinese wedding, Chinese wedding attire, Chinese architecture, and a group of friends dressed in Song Dynasty wear.","Undoubtedly this wedding was special. It might not have been the grandest, but it certainly was a wedding that everyone would remember.","Zhengzheng was also wearing Song Dynasty attire. He was initially standing beside Shu Yi and was led by her.","However, the crowd was too large. When Xu Xiuhe led Shen Yin towards Qingfan Tower, the sides were filled with even more people.","Being short-statured, Zhengzheng was constantly blocked by the people standing next to him. He had put up a tough fight, pleading others to make way for him.","\"You are blocking my view of my parents' wedding!\" Zhengzheng's voice was rather loud as he said that to the people standing beside him.","Hearing this, the people then noticed that standing right under their feet was the son of the two newlyweds.","They naturally knew that the wedding of Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin was a make-up ceremony. Previously they were just betrothed, married in secret. Now that the time had come, it was time for an elaborate wedding.","\"How lucky, to be able to witness your parents getting married and attend your parents' wedding,\" someone commented.","\"Lucky? Haven't you witnessed your parents getting married?\" Zhengzheng lifted his head, questioning the person who spoke.","People attending the wedding and standing so close to the couple were all high-status individuals from Rong City. Furthermore, they had a good relationship with Xu Xiuhe and were also acquainted with Shu Yi nearby.","Shu Yi burst out laughing.","How adorable is this kid's train of thought? Not many kids like him get a chance to attend their parents' wedding, yet he was counter-questioning others.","\"Haven't you ever attended your parents' wedding?\"","\"I actually haven't.\"","\"Well, you are pitiful indeed for not witnessing your parents' wedding,\" Zhengzheng said with a saddened face, feeling sorry for the person who questioned him.","But this only lasted two seconds, just two seconds. After all, it was his parents' wedding.","\"Godmother, I can't see them.\"","On hearing this, Shu Yi picked Zhengzheng up, and they followed the pace of Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin into the main hall of Qingfan Tower.","\"Mutual respect and unity of two families result in this auspicious marriage. May the poetry of peace embellish your home, and tranquility bless the couple for a hundred years. Now, this is a vow!\"","Once the master of ceremony finished, Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe stood face to face.","\"Bow to heaven and earth.\"","After several bows, it was finally time for the couple to bow to each other.","Shen Tianzheng and Fang Yue sat nearby, their faces full of joy as they watched their daughter and son-in-law pay respects to each other.","Upon the conclusion of the rites, applause filled the room.","Zhengzheng climbed down Shu Yi and rushed towards Shen Yin.","Shen Yin, whose face was initially hidden behind the fan, put the fan down as Zhengzheng rushed towards her.","Next was the entry into the bridal chamber. However, after the master of ceremony announced it, Shen Yin did not go in.","She and Xu Xiuhe were already an old couple, even had their second child. To have or not to have a bridal chamber, she was no longer bothered about it.","But this lively scene was indeed worth watching.","There was joy and laughter at Qingfan Tower; it felt as if everyone there was getting married. It had been a long time since they last saw a wedding as grand as this.","The entire hall was filled with happiness.","“Thinking of having a little fun in the bridal chamber, huh, Xiuhe? You guys need to step it up,” Chang Zhiyuan joked from the side.","People around them burst into laughter.","\"Zhiyuan, are you envious?\" replied an elderly man. \"You're the only one left among us who's not married.\"","Zhiyuan scanned the crowd for Shu Yi.","Shu Yi, watching Xu Yunzheng, dared not meet the gaze she felt directed at her.","Once the wedding ceremony concluded, guests filled Qingfan Tower, still entranced by the wedding.","If one were to comment on this wedding, they'd say it was incredibly authentic. In Rong City, countless people had had traditional weddings over the years, but none quite as grand and heartfelt as this one.","Many guests noticed the wedding outfit Shen Yin wore.","Not only was the wedding outfit elegant, but its embroidery was also impressively luxurious. Su Jin sat in a nearby chair, her heart filled with satisfaction. She knew the outfit would be a hit.","Su Jin, with her silver hair and leaning on a cane, startled Shen Yin. She didn't even realize that Su Jin had attended.","\"Mother-in-law,\" Shen Yin greeted.","\"I never expected that it would be you wearing this wedding outfit in the end,\" Su Jin said, smiling kindly.","\"Neither did I,\" Shen Yin admitted. She had never even imagined that she'd be a bride, experiencing a wedding of her own.","In mid-August, Xu Xiuhe announced their plans to hold a wedding. By the end of the month, it took place.","The planning was all done by Xu Xiuhe, who urged Shen Yin not to lift a finger, telling her all she needed to do was wear the bridal outfit from Yunyin Clothing Workshop.","A dutiful bride, Shen Yin didn't expect Xiuhe to pull off a ceremony like this.","The wedding was richly traditional, filled with charm. She'd be lying if she said she wasn't moved.","Even the guests were intrigued; those unaware might even have thought they'd time-traveled.","That night, the news about CEO of Heyuan Group's wedding hit the trending list again.","The kind of comments showing up were like, \"They are deliberately flaishing their joy in front of us. Knew that we've been deprived of 'sugar' for so long, so they quickly got married for us to see.\"","Or, \"Isn’t this outfit the treasure of Yunyin Clothing Workshop, rumored to be handcrafted by Shen Yin herself?\"","Also, \"Didn’t you know? Shen Yin is the national champion of embroidery.\"","However, all of these happenings were unbeknownst to Shen Yin.","Xu Guimin stared at the news on his phone, falling into deep thought. When Xu Xiuhe got married the first time, he didn't go. Now, with this additional wedding, he still wasn't invited.","“Honey, look, how could he treat us this way? We were so good to him back then, and now he’s forgotten all about us, didn’t even send us a wedding invitation.”","Yang Cui said resentfully.","“Mom, Dad, is it Xu Zhengyang’s brother who’s getting married today?”","Ge Xinxin asked, sitting on the sofa nearby.","“Yes, Xu Zhengyang’s brother is getting married and didn’t even let us know. And why decide to have the wedding now? Didn’t they already get married before? And who has a wedding in such hot weather?”","“It’s simple, the bride is pregnant. If they waited until the weather cooled down, she’d be showing.”","Ge Xinxin suddenly remembered seeing them at the hospital before. At the time, she hadn’t thought much of it, but now it made sense why they were in such a hurry to have the wedding.","“Are you saying Shen Yin is pregnant?” Xu Guimin asked.","Yang Cui suddenly gave Ge Xinxin a look. Was this woman foolish? Why blurt out everything? If Shen Yin was pregnant, so be it. Why announce it?","Realizing Yang Cui’s displeasure, Ge Xinxin quickly waved her hands and said, “I’m not sure, just guessing.”","Xu Guimin didn’t say anything else and took his phone upstairs.","“Ge Xinxin, talk less in the future. You don’t have much say here, and you better hope the child you’re carrying is a boy.”","After saying that, Yang Cui also went upstairs.","Xu Guimin didn’t go straight to his room but entered his study instead.","He had been pondering what Xu Xiuhe had told him before, especially about why he had nearly drowned recently. He had checked the swimming pool’s surveillance footage, and there was indeed no one around him at the time.","It didn’t seem like foul play.","Business at the company had been declining day by day, and he was feeling his age, truly struggling to keep up. Yet, he couldn’t just hand over the company to Xu Zhengyang.","He felt more and more that Xu Xiuhe was suitable, but Xu Xiuhe had always been reluctant to engage with him.","“Husband.”","Yang Cui knocked on the study door.","“What are you doing here?”","“I wanted to remind you, you haven’t taken your medicine today.”","Yang Cui held a water glass in one hand and the medicine in the other.","Xu Guimin took them, drank some water, and swallowed his pills.","“You, what are you thinking about? Don’t overthink things. Xiuhe will understand eventually. You mean well. Now, it’s time to sleep.”","Yang Cui watched Xu Guimin take his medicine and didn’t leave, waiting for him to join her back in the bedroom.","At Ziyue Manor.","It was late when Xu Xiuhe and Shen Yin returned.","Although Shen Yin was pregnant, she hadn’t felt tired at all that day. Xu Xiuhe had taken such good care of her, not letting her worry about anything. She just followed the proceedings and completed the wedding.","“Tired?”","“Not at all.”","“You should still rest properly; it’s been a tough day.”","“We still have something left to do.”","After saying this, Shen Yin hugged Xu Xiuhe’s neck.","“Get it? There’s no wedding without the bridal chamber.”","“Cough, isn’t it a bit risky now?” Xu Xiuhe said, looking at Shen Yin’s belly.","His face was full of concern.","“It’s fine, we’re past the first three months.”","After speaking, Shen Yin leaned in for a kiss.","They spent the night peacefully.","Early the next morning, Xu Xiuhe brought breakfast upstairs from the ground floor.","\"Let's have breakfast.\"","\"Mmm, did you see Grandma Su yesterday?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"You saw her, of course, I saw her too,\" Xu Xiuhe responded.","\"I always feel that Grandma Su is extraordinary, there's a story in her eyes, I even feel that she can see right through me.\"","\"What makes you think so?\"","\"When I first saw her, she gazed at me so kindly, as if she wasn't looking at the Shen Yin she knew. Yesterday, she told me that this type of wedding was indeed special, and that it suited me perfectly.\"","Shen Yin, in her red wedding dress from yesterday, noble yet unapproachable, coupled with the grand bridal makeup, truly dazzled everyone present.","\"Maybe she thinks you're good at embroidery, so it's fitting for you to wear a wedding dress she embroidered,\" Xu Xiuhe suggested.","\"Maybe, I might be overthinking.\"","In the afternoon, Su Jin came to Ziyue Manor. Upon seeing Shen Yin, she asked, \"Are you adapting well to this world?\"","\"Grandma?\"","Shen Yin was surprised. Her sixth sense was indeed very strong.","\"Don't be afraid, I'm just like you. From the beginning, when I saw the wedding dress, I had a feeling it might end up this way.\""]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: Going to Kindergarten","paragraphs":["At first, Shen Yin didn't understand what it meant. Was Granny Su like her? Someone who had traveled through time from ancient times? Like her, coming from the Dasheng Dynasty?","\"Granny?\"","\"Seeing the Dasheng wedding dress again brings up indescribable feelings.\" Su Jin looked at Shen Yin, meeting a fellow countryman from another time and space.","\"Granny, how long have you been here?\" Shen Yin asked.","Su Jin said in an exceptionally calm tone, \"45 years.\"","Even for someone as composed as Shen Yin, hearing \"45 years\" was truly shocking.","\"You must have just arrived recently, right? Two years?\" Su Jin asked.","\"Not quite two years.\"","Shen Yin calculated that from March of last year to early September now, it had only been a year and a half.","In that short year and a half, so much had changed. She had gone from being the daughter of a Duke's Mansion to now being the wife of a CEO. She had adopted a baby and even had another on the way.","\"How did you come here?\"","\"I fell into the water and drowned my way here.\" As Shen Yin said this, she felt embarrassed. Who pretends to jump into a river only to actually drown?","\"Hahaha, not bad compared to my time. Indeed, the methods of coming here are always strange.\"","Su Jin laughed.","\"Do you know how I came here?\" Su Jin asked.","Shen Yin shook her head. She was very curious about how Granny Su had arrived here, after all, Su Jin had come so many years before her.","\"I drank poisoned wine given to me by the emperor. That year, I was 25, yet I had never left that grand yet not-so-grand palace.\"","As Su Jin recounted that story from half a lifetime ago, her tone remained flat, without hatred or love. It was as if she were telling someone else's story.","\"Granny Su, you couldn't be Empress Rongyuan, could you?\"","\"Oh, you little girl, you actually know about Empress Rongyuan.\" Su Jin became interested. She, a powerless, forgotten empress, was actually known by later generations.","\"Yes, legend has it that Empress Rongyuan passed away due to severe illness, having exhausted herself managing the six palaces.\"","Shen Yin recounted the story her adoptive father had once told her.","\"Hahaha, I had no idea my death was portrayed so nobly by you all.\"","\"Was it not like that?\"","\"Of course not. I was just a discarded empress. From the age of 18 when I entered the palace as empress, I never left again. Can you imagine? I spent five years in the Cold Palace, just a forgotten empress, even dying by drinking poison given by the emperor.\"","\"What?\"","Shen Yin was indeed shocked by this information. The rumors were wrong.","\"The world just believed the news that I died from exhaustion managing the six palaces. He really went to great lengths, for the woman he loved.\"","\"Perhaps even the heavens felt it was unfair to me, so they gave me another chance, letting me come to this world. So, I think you must have also encountered injustice. Little girl, tell me how you drowned.\"","\"Can I really talk about that?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Why not? It's just the two of us here. By the way, where's your baby? I don't see him.\"","\"My mother is watching him downstairs.\"","\"That's perfect. At my age, I'd like to hear some interesting stories.\"","\"I didn't want to be forced by my family to marry a prince, so I jumped into the water.\"","\"Such a strong-willed girl,\" Su Jin smiled.","\"Not really. I pretended to drown, but I can't swim at all. The person arranged to rescue me didn't come in time, so I ended up here.\"","In front of Su Jin, Shen Yin indeed seemed like a child.","\"Indeed, from ancient times to now, there have always been bad people. Actually, it's not good to say that. People are multifaceted, but some people's hearts are just dark.\"","Su Jin sighed.","Shen Yin strongly agreed with these words.","\"So, Granny Su, when you first came here, how did you adapt to life here?\"","\"When I first arrived, I thought this place was poor and rundown. That era was particularly difficult. I even felt that coming here was to suffer, living in a small broken house in the countryside. I thought it wasn't as good as my Cold Palace back then. Fortunately, development was quite fast, and I got to witness the progress of this era.\"","\"Granny, why did we come here? Why is our dynasty never mentioned in this era?\"","Shen Yin had guessed most of it herself, but still wanted to ask Su Jin, after all, Su Jin was her elder both in the Dasheng Dynasty and here.","\"Why we came, I don't know either. But when I came here, like you, I met the person I loved. After many hardships, we finally ended up together. So I believe that lovers are destined to be together.\"","\"Love is mutual. Granny, I'm really happy to have met you here.\"","\"You have an extraordinary demeanor. Which family were you from in the Dasheng Dynasty?\"","\"The Shen family.\"","\"The Duke's Mansion?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"I was also the daughter of a Duke's Mansion. From a young age, I was told I would marry the emperor. I thought that after entering the palace, I would enjoy endless glory and wealth. But later, I realized I was wrong.\"","As Su Jin said this, her tone carried a sense of acceptance.","\"Maybe this is the legacy of daughters from the Duke's Mansion.\"","Shen Yin could only explain it this way.","\"Live well in this era. The baby in your belly will surely be healthy and safe.\"","After saying this, Su Jin left Ziyue Manor.","Shen Yin stood at the doorway, watching Su Jin leave. It turns out that some encounters are destined for a reason.","When Xu Xiuhe returned, he felt that Shen Yin was particularly happy today.","\"What's going on? You're in such a good mood today.\"","\"I'm not telling you.\"","\"Alright, if you won't tell me, I won't ask. I've found a kindergarten for Zheng Zheng.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin was stunned. Xu Xiuhe's efficiency was indeed impressive.","\"Where is it? Is it far?\"","\"Not far, just a half-hour drive.\"","\"What, Zheng Zheng can go to kindergarten now?\" The little one exclaimed, jumping up excitedly.","\"Yes, we'll take you to kindergarten tomorrow.\"","\"Yay, yay!\" The little one clapped his hands.","Going to kindergarten meant he could play with brothers and sisters. Mom had said that going to kindergarten meant he could play with Aunt Qi Ji's two babies.","\"Can we go now?\" The little one was too excited to sleep.","\"No, it's dark now. Zheng Zheng needs to sleep. We can go tomorrow morning.\"","The little one became disappointed, but only for two seconds before becoming happy again.","The next morning, Xu Yunzheng woke up especially early, earlier than both Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe.","\"Dad, Mom, Zheng Zheng wants to go to kindergarten.\"","The little one stood by Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe's bedside, hands on his hips, shouting loudly.","Shen Yin was still groggy.","\"What kindergarten? Who's going to kindergarten?\"","\"Mom, I want to go to kindergarten.\"","Shen Yin finally woke up. How was this baby so different from her? She used to be so lazy about going to school. How could anyone want to go to school?","\"Stop shouting, your sister isn't awake yet.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng immediately covered his mouth. His eyes were wide open.","\"Mom, Zheng Zheng didn't mean to. You and sister keep sleeping.\" Zheng Zheng removed his hand and said softly.","Zheng Zheng obediently ran to the door, waiting for Xu Xiuhe to get up.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe couldn't sleep anymore, so they got up and changed clothes.","It was Xu Yunzheng's first day of school, and Shen Yin insisted on going with Xu Xiuhe to send their baby to school.","Xu Xiuhe drove, with Shen Yin and the little one sitting in the back seat. Xu Yunzheng wore his small backpack, full of anticipation for school.","On the first day of school, other children were crying at the gate, not wanting to go to kindergarten. Only Zheng Zheng was smiling foolishly at the entrance.","\"Dad, Mom, you can go back together now. Zheng Zheng is going to kindergarten. Don't worry about me. Bye-bye.\"","Shen Yin looked at Zheng Zheng, who had an expression of \"I'm grown up, I can do this.\"","The old mother instantly felt proud.","\"We're just leaving like this?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Should we stay here with him?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","The two stood outside the window looking in. Many parents were standing outside the window. This kindergarten was a noble kindergarten, and those who could come here were people with status and decent economic conditions in Rong City.","But now, these parents were all standing at the entrance, just like ordinary people.","\"Why aren't you crying?\" A little boy looked at Xu Yunzheng sitting on a small chair, motionless, watching the other children.","\"Why should I cry? And why are you all crying?\"","Xu Yunzheng asked.","The little boy next to him cried and said, \"Waa waa, I didn't want to cry at first. I came here happily, but they're all crying, so I feel like I should cry too.\"","\"They're crying because they're too young and miss their parents, but I'm a big boy, so I don't cry. You're one too, so you shouldn't cry either,\" Xu Yunzheng said.","The little boy beside him suddenly stopped crying and kept staring at Xu Yunzheng.","\"Then I won't cry anymore. I'm a big boy too. Are we friends now?\"","\"Yes, we are.\"","Xu Yunzheng sat like a little adult, hands on his knees, nodding. Even the teacher noticed this unusual little fellow.","But Zhengzheng didn't notice the teacher's gaze.","He propped his chin on his hands, watching the other children in the room crying, feeling quite bored.","\"Don't cry anymore. It's not like your parents have abandoned you. Why are you crying?\"","Xu Yunzheng said.","\"Waa waa waa, boo hoo hoo, waa waa waa, Mommy and Daddy don't want me anymore.\" After Xu Yunzheng spoke, the other children cried even more heartbrokenly.","\"Stop crying. Crybabies are naughty children,\" Xu Yunzheng shouted.","Finally, the classroom quieted down, and the other children looked over at him.","\"Who are you? Why aren't you crying?\" someone else asked.","\"My name is Xu Yunzheng. Mommy says boys can't shed little pearls, so boys aren't allowed to cry. Girls can cry.\"","There were quite a few little girls in the classroom, and hearing this, they started crying again.","They were girls, so they were allowed to cry. They weren't big boys after all.","The teachers were getting headaches too. They'd comfort one child only to have to comfort another, never getting a break. It was good that the boys weren't crying anymore, but now the girls were crying even harder, their voices seeming to lift the roof off.","\"Sweetie, you're so good. Can you think of a way to stop the girls from crying too? Girls shouldn't cry either,\" a teacher came up to Xu Yunzheng and said.","\"You shouldn't cry either. Don't be afraid, we won't bully you. Daddy says girls are to be protected. If you keep crying, the daddies outside will think we're bullying you. Then we'll get scolded.\"","Xu Yunzheng had been seeing people watching them from outside, but he hadn't seen his own parents. He knew they had gone home, so he wasn't sad at all.","Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe were watching their little one from the window behind him.","\"Did you teach him that?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I didn't teach him anything. I just said boys should be gentlemen and not bully girls.\"","Shen Yin felt proud again. Why was her son so excellent, obedient, and sensible?","The classroom indeed quieted down significantly. The teachers breathed a sigh of relief. Every year, they dreaded the babies' first day of kindergarten the most. No amount of comforting seemed to have much effect, and they just had to tough it out for half a day until the little ones got used to it and things got a bit better.","\"That's the child of Heyuan Group's CEO, right?\"","\"Yes, he looks like him. I heard he's called Xu Yunzheng, it must be him.\"","\"This child really takes after his father, he has leadership skills.\"","\"Indeed. If my child kept crying, their voice would probably go hoarse. Sigh, there's nothing we can do. Isn't the first day of school always like this?\"","They weren't short of money, but not all problems could be solved with money, especially when it came to children's issues. They felt helpless. There was no way around it. The children had been pampered since they were little, so suddenly going to kindergarten was certainly not easy for them. But they had to go to kindergarten.","\"Children, hello. We are your teachers. From now on, you are big kids. We can play games together, watch TV together, and learn together. Okay?\"","\"Okay.\"","Finally, introductions began in the classroom. There were four teachers and twelve students.","Outside, the parents started to feel relieved that the crying had finally stopped.","\"Let's go home,\" Shen Yin suggested.","Looking at Xu Yunzheng now, she really felt that her baby was great, strong, and independent. What did she have to worry about?","\"Okay, I'll drop you off at home, then I'll go to the company. I'll pick up Zhengzheng and bring him home in the afternoon.\"","\"Don't take me home, take me to Qi Ji's place. I want to see her and the two babies.\"","Xu Xiuhe did as she asked.","Qi Ji was at home, playing with her two babies.","Since giving birth, Ye Rong had been taking even more meticulous care of her. The state of being loved was different, for example, Qi Ji was glowing with happiness.","When Shen Yin was in the car, she had already told Qi Ji that she was coming over to see her.","At first, Qi Ji didn't agree. She was worried about Shen Yin's pregnancy and wanted to bring the two children to Ziyue Manor to see Shen Yin. But Shen Yin said she was already on her way.","When Shu Yi found out, she also wanted to join in, saying she wanted to go see what the two babies looked like now, since it had been a long time since she'd seen them.","Xue Le'an and Xue Leyu were lying in their cribs, with Qi Ji rocking them nearby. The two babies were playing by themselves, not disturbing each other.","Shen Yin leaned over to look at the babies, and was once again amazed."]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: Encounter of Men and Women","paragraphs":["Babies really do change with each passing day. The two little bundles grow more and more vibrant, their eyes as big and round as grapes. Their skin is young and smooth. Qi Ji stands by, rocking the baby crib.","Shen Yin is also captivated. She had never seen Zhengzheng when he was this small. When she first arrived, Zhengzheng was already talking. Now, looking at such a big baby, she can't help but think about the baby in her own belly.","\"Yinyin, how is your health lately?\" Qi Ji turned to ask Shen Yin.","\"Quite normal actually,\" she answered.","Shen Yin didn't feel any discomfort lately. Unlike the morning sickness and insomnia that Qi Ji experienced, she didn't feel any discomfort during her pregnancy, except for a slightly larger belly. Other than that, there was no difference compare to before her pregnancy.","\"Wow, that's great. I had severe morning sickness back then.\"","\"You have these two beautiful babies now,\" Shen Yin pointed out.","Just as she finished talking, Shu Yi entered from outside.","\"I came to see my two little treasures.\"","\"What about me?\" Qi Ji's voice was sweet. Shu Yi couldn't resist the sweetness even after Qi Ji gave birth.","\"I'll see you first.\" Shu Yi playfully pinched Qi Ji's face.","\"That's more like it.\"","After giving birth, Qi Ji was pampered by Ye Rong and Xue Jingrui. Her skin was supple, glowing, and she was in great spirits. Shu Yi pinched her cheek and couldn't resist touching it again.","\"Aren't you going to see me?\" Shen Yin asked with a smile.","\"Look here, I'll spread the love around.\" Shu Yi turned around and patted Shen Yin's belly.","\"Wait a minute, I think I felt the baby move in your belly.\" Shu Yi was surprised.","Shen Yin also patted her belly, indeed she could feel the baby's movements. However, she remained calm, having felt it several times before.","\"It's amazing, in another four or five months, the baby in your belly will come to this world just like Le An and Le Yu. At that time, it will be so lively.\"","Shen Yin's hand rested on her belly. Yes, Zhengzheng will soon have a playmate, with the addition of Le An and Le Yu, four children will certainly liven things up.","\"Speaking of which, where is my godson? Why haven't I seen him today?\"","Shu Yi scanned the room but didn't spot Zhengzheng.","\"He's at school.\"","\"Ah, pre-school. So sudden. I heard that when kids first start pre-school they usually cry. Did my godson cry today?\"","Shu Yi seemed a bit eager. He had never seen his godson cry much, and the idea of him crying at the start of preschool must be exciting.","\"I have a video, would you like to see it?\" Shen Yin took out her phone, she had secretly filmed it at the door of the classroom.","Hearing this, Shu Yi teased that Shen Yin was Zhengzheng's biggest haters. These videos are all in high definition. In the future, all of Zhengzheng's embarrassing moments may be revealed by Shen Yin.","\"Quick, quick, I want a copy of my godson's embarrassing past. Once Zhengzheng gets married, it can be played in a loop at his wedding.\"","Shu Yi said with a laugh.","Qi Ji was in a daze at the two's antics. How could they tarnish the reputation of her son-in-law like this?","\"I disagree. My son-in-law's image should not be tarnished unless you give me a copy too.\"","Swiftly raising her head, Qi Ji pouted, her cheeks puffing out a bit. Regardless of how you looked, she didn't seem like a woman who had children.","Shen Yin was confused about what was happening between these two. Why are they so eager to see Zhengzheng cry? Well, she would just let the two see some of Zhengzheng's remarkable moments then.","\"A real man doesn't cry.\"","Shu Yi and Qi Ji huddled next to Shen Yin's phone. However, they were disappointed. Zhengzheng wasn't crying. Instead, like a little gentleman, he sat obediently on the chair. Initially, he seemed slightly caught off guard by the multitude of crying people surrounding him. In a while, the little guy became calm, even telling another boy next to him not to cry.","The other child really stopped crying.","\"I never realized, my godson is so strong. He didn't cry when he started school.\"","Shu Yi kept scrolling.","\"Not only does he not cry, he also has great leadership skills,\" Qi Ji praised Zhengzheng again.","Shu Yi's eyes were filled with envy as she spoke. How great it was that her two friends had such happy families.","\"How have you been lately, Shu Yi? I mean, in terms of relationships,\" Qi Ji asked, serious as she sat next to the baby's cradle.","\"Relationships. He's still in the evaluation period.\"","\"What! You and Chang Zhiyuan have a chance now?\" Qi Ji gasped.","\"Previously, we spoke honestly and he asked me to reconsider him. So I did.\"","Shu Yi felt a bit embarrassed. After all, Chang Zhiyuan and she had a complicated history, and considering getting back together now was somewhat awkward.","\"When do you plan to get married? The last time during Shen Yin's wedding, I didn't get enough hugs. I want to hug everyone again.\"","\"You're just interested in the banquets, aren’t you? You wouldn't care who the groom was as long as I was marrying.\"","\"I’m not serious! Shu Yi, you're a star. Plus, I ship you and Chang Zhiyuan. But If a more handsome, richer man who loves you more and is more suitable than Chang Zhiyuan appears, I won't object! As long as you're happy.\"","Qi Ji got up, grabbed Shu Yi's arm and spoke earnestly.","\"If I were a man, I would certainly marry you and take you home.\"","Shen Yin also laughed. Qi Ji really had a way of attracting people.","\"Shen Yin, Shu Yi, don’t go back at noon. The house is pretty empty and I asked the maid to cook. Have lunch here.\"","Ye Rong knocked and popped her head in to tell them.","Shen Yin had intended to return home, for Xu Xiuhe had arranged a driver to fetch her in the afternoon, but Shu Yi came again who was likely to give her a ride home, but now, Ye Rong had insisted they stay.","\"Sister Shen Yin, Sister Shu Yi, please stay here. It's been awhile since we last had a meal together.\"","\"Alright, but I feel like we're inconveniencing Auntie Ye,\" Shen Yin said.","\"Not a turn-off at all, you continue having fun, I'm heading downstairs first. Oh yes, Qi Ji, don't forget to feed the babies later,\" cautioned Ye Rong as she left.","\"I know, mom.\"","\"Do the babies consume breast milk?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Yes, mom said it's healthier for the babies and they would feel closer to me. Luckily enough, my nutrition has kept up and I haven't starved the little ones.\"","Shen Yin helped Qi Ji hold up Le Yu, one of the babies. Qi Ji sat down, and Le Yu lay on her lap, enjoying her lunch.","Watching Qi Ji, Shen Yin couldn't help but think of herself in a few months' time, and Zhengzheng... Zhengzheng had been drinking cow's milk since he was a child, hadn't he?","At Heyuan Group, Liu Bo was reporting on the affairs of Xu Group in Xu Xiuhe's office.","\"How much of Xu Group's shares do I control now?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","\"About 18%.\"","\"A bit short still.\" Xu Xiuhe lowered his head, deep in thought.","\"Any movements from Xu Zhengyang lately?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Liu Bo understood. Xu Xiuhe wouldn't have asked about anything else.","\"He's lost quite a bit of his say in the company. Basically, everything's been recaptured by Xu Guimin.\"","\"How's the driver who got into the accident last time?\"","\"She passed away in May.\"","Upon hearing this, Xu Xiuhe paused.","\"Has her daughter returned?\"","Xu Xiuhe asked. As far as he could recall, the driver had a daughter who was out of town.","\"She returned for the funeral and then left. The insurance company compensated her after the accident,\" Liu Bo said.","\"Oh? What do you mean, aren't they supposed to compensate after an accident?\"","\" The compensation she received was disproportionately high, way more than your average traffic accident. It was several million at the very least,\" Liu Bo explained.","\"Why so much?\"","\"Last year, the driver suddenly bought a lot of insurance for himself - illness, accident, car accident.\"","\"And he got into an accident at the end of the year?\"","\"I suspect that he discovered at the beginning of the year that he might be terminally ill, so he bought various insurances to leave something behind for his daughter before he passed. Then, at year end, he had an accident intentionally, but he didn't expect to survive.\"","\"Hold on, you're suggesting that the accident was not caused by a loss of control due to his illness as he had said, but was intended for insurance fraud?\"","Liu Bo nodded.","\"No, if he wanted to commit insurance fraud alone, there would have been no need to have an accident when I was in the car.\"","He had had the driver for several years and he had been kind to him, and the driver didn't seem like a bad person.","\"Search for the insurances he has bought, and check if there's any link between the insurance company and Xu Zhengyang.\" Xu Xiuhe directed.","In the Xu residence, Ge Xinxin and Yang Cui kept out of each other’s way.","Both Xu Zhengyang and Xu Guimin were at the company, leaving the house relatively vacant.","Ge Xinxin received another call from her ex-boyfriend.","\"Come out in the afternoon, I must see you.\"","After hanging up, Ge Xinxin became nervous. She sweet-talked Yang Cui during lunch. After much cajoling, Yang Cui finally agreed to let Ge Xinxin go out.","\"You must return before four. And, be careful about your safety. You're not alone now.\"","Ge Xinxin walked out with a cynical smile. She muttered about the false pretense- if it wasn't for the child in her belly, would she still warn her about safety? How hypocritical, she wanted nothing but money. She didn't wish to stay here where she had lost herself.","Mengxi Teahouse.","\"The tea here is pretty good.\" Shu Yi commented.","\"The decor isn't bad either. Although not as luxurious as Qingfan Tower, it's still quite impressive. Look at these private rooms, you can't see inside from the outside, but those inside have a clear view of the exterior. It's quite innovative.\"","Shen Yin was sipping her tea and looking outside when she suddenly saw a familiar face.","\"Yinyin, what are you looking at? Do you know those two people outside?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"I don’t know them, but I've seen the woman before.\"","\"She's pregnant, isn't she? Seems like her term is about the same as yours.\" Shu Yi took a sip of her tea and evaluated.","\"What's this? She's pregnant and yet in a tug of war with the man. This man definitely doesn't love her, he's about to become a father and yet he's not concerned about the woman's safety. Poor woman.\"","\"The man isn't the father of the child in her belly.\" Shen Yin added, taking another sip of her tea.","\"Wait, he's not the child's father? Then what's their relationship? Is he her ex?\"","Shu Yi, fascinated by such scenarios after reading too many CEO romance novels, loved to make wild speculations about the story.","\"That woman, she was at the hospital with Xu Zhengyang for a prenatal check-up when Xu Xiuhe and I ran into them. She and Xu Zhengyang then had the audacity to show up at Qingfan Tower to freeload off the treasure box, only to be driven away by Chang Zhiyuan.\"","\"Holy crap!\" Shu Yi was utterly shocked.","\"What do you think that man wants to do?\" Shen Yin asked.","After observing closely, Shu Yi concluded that the man was trying to cling on to the woman, but she was constantly trying to break free.","\"A clingy ex-lover?\"","\"Why don't we gear up, sit next to them, and eavesdrop on them?\"","Shen Yin too was intrigued. She wouldn’t have bothered if this was any ordinary person. But this woman, she was connected to Xu Zhengyang.","Both Shu Yi and Shen Yin put on their masks, stepped out of their room, and settled at a booth next to the couple's table.","Both of them kept their masks on, took out their phones, and lowered their heads. It seemed like they were playing with their phones, but their real attention was on the conversation taking place at the table beside them.","\"Xin Xin, I was wrong, please forgive me. I will work hard to support you, please come back, okay?\"","\"Now you want me to go back? What were you doing earlier? Are you even a man? You even let your girlfriend serve drinks to men, are you lacking a brain? I told you, stop bothering me. I'm not stupid, I know how to choose.\"","\"Xin Xin, trust me, I had a hard time. I was wrong, please forgive me and come back to my side.\" The man pleaded.","\"What hardship? You can't handle it and want a woman to face it? If you send me to another man's bed once, there will be a second time. Why should I trust you?\"","The woman's expression was cold, not willing to look into the man's eyes.","\"It won't happen again, I will definitely treat you and our child well in the future.\"","\"Our child? Do you have the audacity to mention it? Shut up, don't mention it again, this child is mine, it's between me and Xu Zhengyang, it has nothing to do with you.\"","The woman became angry; her voice was a bit louder.","Upon hearing this, Shu Yi felt like she had just bitten into another juicy gossip. Was it that explosive?","[Yin Yin, what's happening with them? Is it what I'm thinking?]","[The child is hers and this man's, but she deceived Xu Zhengyang.]","\"How can there be no connection? You're carrying my child, living in someone else's home, and have my child call another man \"dad\"? You tell me, is there a connection or not?\""]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: Threat to Ge Xin Xin","paragraphs":["Shu Yi and Shen Yin didn't dare make a sound, fearing that the two people next door would discover they were eavesdropping. Shu Yi wanted to speak, so she could only send Shen Yin a message.","[Yin Yin, are wealthy families really this complicated?]","[Probably, possibly, should be, maybe? But don't worry, you're part of a wealthy family now.]","[Once my drama series airs, I'll be part of a wealthy family.]","\"Where's your shame? How dare you? Can you support me and the child in my womb? Can you give us a good life?\"","The man looked at Ge Xinxin, his face almost turning black. No man could endure such an insult.","\"I don't agree.\"","\"Name your price, and from now on, don't ever appear in front of me again.\" Ge Xinxin crossed her arms, though in reality, she wasn't sure if the man opposite her would agree.","\"One million.\"","Ge Xinxin thought for a moment. He really was asking for a lot, demanding one million right off the bat. For the sake of her future life, she decided to endure it.","\"Fine, deal. I'll transfer it directly to your card, but remember what you said. From now on, disappear from my world.\"","Ge Xinxin spoke seriously, emphasizing the last few words.","\"You gave it so easily, one million, huh? Looks like your current life really is extraordinary. One million, just like that.\"","Ge Xinxin widened her eyes, glaring at the man, then picked up her bag and walked out without looking back.","The man sat in his seat, taking a sip of tea.","Shen Yin and Shu Yi had both left, so they returned to their private room.","\"Wow, your husband's good-for-nothing brother, what a perfect cuckold!\"","\"What do you think he'll do if he finds out?\"","\"You're not thinking of telling him, are you? That's not allowed. Let him wear the green hat a bit longer. After all, didn't you suspect him of kidnapping you before?\"","If Shen Yin hadn't mentioned it, Shu Yi would have almost forgotten that she had been kidnapped before. But it was that crazy man who had kidnapped her; there was no evidence linking her abduction to Xu Zhengyang.","\"Do you want to start with this woman and see if you can find out some bad things that good-for-nothing brother has done? I think that guy has some dirt on him.\"","Shen Yin hadn't initially thought of this, but after Shu Yi's suggestion, she suddenly became interested. Now that she had leverage on this woman, she should be able to extract quite a bit of information about Xu Zhengyang from her.","\"As expected from someone who's read so many novels. I'll give it a try.\"","Shen Yin asked Liu Bo to find Ge Xinxin's number, and the next day, she called her.","Ge Xinxin was very surprised when she received the call.","\"Hello, who is this?\" Ge Xinxin asked.","\"Who I am, you should have seen before, but that's not important. What's important is that I know who you are, and whose child is in your belly.\" Shen Yin deliberately lowered her voice, making it sound very different from her usual tone.","When Ge Xinxin heard the latter part, she indeed became scared. Apart from her and that useless man, no one else knew about this. How did the woman on the phone know? Could it be that the bastard had received the money and then immediately broke his promise, leaking the information? Had she wasted one million for nothing?","\"What exactly do you want?\" Ge Xinxin's tone was extremely unsteady, even a bit hysterical.","\"I don't want anything. I just want to meet with you for a chat. You should agree, right? After all, it wouldn't be good if certain things became public knowledge, would it?\"","As Shen Yin spoke, she looked at her nails. Having lived in the palace for so many years and watched so many TV dramas here, she was all too familiar with this infuriating tone.","\"When?\" Ge Xinxin asked.","\"This afternoon, at the tea house in Qingfan Tower. You should know it, right?\"","Ge Xinxin became even more frightened. She did indeed know Qingfan Tower; she had been there before. But how did this woman know? Had she been following her?","\"Have you been following me? Or do you know me very well?\" the woman asked again.","Shen Yin thought for a moment. Did she count as following? Not really. Knowing her well? Even less so. She had just been lucky enough to overhear such information when she went out.","\"You don't need to know that. See you this afternoon.\"","Shen Yin hung up after saying this and checked the time. It was still early, and she was alone for lunch. Her little one had gone to kindergarten and wouldn't be back for lunch. She was getting bored at home by herself; she needed to find some entertainment.","In the afternoon, when Shen Yin arrived at Qingfan Tower, she sent Ge Xinxin the name of the private room, then entered it herself.","Ge Xinxin hadn't arrived yet, but Shen Yin wasn't in a hurry. She made herself a cup of osmanthus tea and ate some pastries.","Ge Xinxin was in the Xu family's villa, trying to figure out how to find an excuse to go out.","\"Mom, can I go out for a while this afternoon?\"","\"Can't you stay at home and take care of your pregnancy? Why go out again? Didn't you just go out yesterday?\" Yang Cui looked disapproving.","\"Since you're calling me mom, I have to be responsible for your safety. You're not alone now; you have a child in your belly. You're quite far along now. What if something dangerous happens when you go out?\"","Ge Xinxin lowered her head. Since she had moved into the Xu family's home, apart from going out yesterday, she hadn't been out at all. She couldn't even spend money. Every day she stayed in her room, feeling like her life had no meaning, like a bird in a cage or a beast in a prison.","\"I really have something urgent to do. I've been at your home for so long without going out. My family will be worried about me and want to know how I'm doing.\"","Ge Xinxin kept her head down. It wasn't entirely made up; her parents would indeed be concerned about her. But she wasn't from Rong City, and her parents lived far away, making it inconvenient for them to visit. However, she wasn't thinking about this now; she had to go to the meeting.","\"This is the last time. After you come back, you're not going out again until you give birth to the child in your belly.\"","After Yang Cui finished speaking, Ge Xinxin turned and left the Xu family's villa.","Fortunately, Yang Cui was concerned about the baby and had assigned her a driver.","In the car, Ge Xinxin began to feel uneasy. Regarding the child in her belly, she had never been certain whose it was. It was fifty-fifty, she supposed, since during those days, she had been intimate with both Xu Zhengyang and that scoundrel. She had always clung to the hope that the child was Xu Zhengyang's.","Until that scoundrel told her the child was his, she was willing to believe it. She hadn't used protection with that scoundrel, but with Xu Zhengyang...","So Xu Zhengyang was extremely happy about having this child, never even doubting if the child was his. He always thought he was quite capable. Ever since Yang Cui had urged him to have a child quickly, he hardly ever used protection when being intimate with those women.","But that night, he had drunk a little, and this woman had intentionally seduced him. Ge Xinxin didn't know what she was thinking at the time, but she had made him use protection.","From the moment she found out she was pregnant, she had always clung to the hope that it was Xu Zhengyang's, but the scoundrel's words made her understand what self-deception meant.","Shen Yin sat in the private room, waiting until Ge Xinxin arrived.","\"You should recognize me, right?\"","Shen Yin sipped her tea, occasionally swirling the cup in her hand, and looked up as Ge Xinxin entered.","Ge Xinxin thought for two seconds and realized. She would be a fool not to know.","\"You're the wife of Heyuan Group's CEO?\"","Shen Yin took another tactical sip of water and nodded.","\"Do you know why I called you out here?\"","\"I don't, but I want to know,\" Ge Xinxin asked.","It was too terrifying. This woman, like her, was also pregnant, yet she had called out another pregnant woman. What exactly did she want?","\"I want to make a deal with you.\"","\"What kind of deal? I'm not a businesswoman; what is there to discuss?\"","\"Xu Zhengyang doesn't know that the child in your belly belongs to someone else, right?\" Shen Yin asked directly, getting straight to the point.","Ge Xinxin nodded. She had only found out recently herself. Xu Zhengyang still thought he was going to be a father and was happy about it every day.","\"What do you think will happen if he finds out?\" Shen Yin looked at Ge Xinxin, smiling as she asked.","\"How did you find out about this? What exactly do you want?\" Ge Xinxin grew increasingly nervous, her voice becoming shrill.","\"I don't want anything, I just want you to help me a little.\"","\"Me? Help you? What do you need help with?\" Ge Xinxin didn't understand. The person sitting across from her was the envy of all the girls in Rong City. Rich, beautiful, and loved.","\"Tell me, when the child in your belly is born, who do you think it will look like? Paper can't wrap up fire. I see you're not that young anymore, trying to climb the social ladder with a child. But from what I know, the Xu family doesn't seem to have any intention of marrying you.\"","Shen Yin had seen the thoughts of that old woman Yang Cui - selfish, vicious, deep, and capable of anything for her own benefit.","Shen Yin continued, \"What do you think will happen if one day the truth comes out? If Yang Cui and Xu Zhengyang find out the child in your belly isn't from the Xu family, do you think they'll let you off?\"","Ge Xinxin was furious upon hearing this. She had always known Yang Cui didn't want her to marry Xu Zhengyang, and she knew Xu Zhengyang's interest in her was just a passing fancy. She had accidentally overheard about Xu Zhengyang's pool incident from the family's maid, and she was also aware of her own worth. But now she was in a desperate situation, trapped. Her only bargaining chip was the pregnancy.","But now the problem was that the child wasn't Xu Zhengyang's. If they found out...","Ge Xinxin didn't dare to think further. If they knew, not only would the child suffer, but she might not even be able to support herself in the future.","Ge Xinxin held her head in her hands, beginning to regret why she had risked everything for a moment of gain, doing such a thing.","\"Do me a favor, and I'll give you a sum of money. I believe you're a smart person and should know how to choose.\"","\"Choose? Choose what?\" Ge Xinxin asked.","Shen Yin: \"Choose whether you want to help me, or if I should tell the Xu family about your child.\"","Without a second thought, Ge Xinxin immediately replied, \"I'll help you, but after it's done, I want 10 million.\"","\"Deal.\"","For Shen Yin, 10 million was just the cost of two designer dresses, but for Ge Xinxin, it was a fortune. After all, that scumbag had already swindled her out of 1 million, which was all her savings. She suddenly felt that this life without freedom wasn't worth living. With 10 million, she could run far away, no longer living in constant fear and having to watch others' faces for approval.","Escaping this impossible situation and living the life she wanted, Ge Xinxin suddenly felt hope for the future.","\"I want you to get information, get Xu Zhengyang to talk. Ask him if he's ever kidnapped me before, and try to find evidence of other bad things he's done. You know, someone like him must have done plenty of bad deeds. You're living in the Xu household now, right? Keep a close eye on their daily lives and see if there's anything suspicious.\"","\"Is that all? So simple?\"","Ge Xinxin seemed surprised that earning 10 million could be so easy.","\"It's not that simple. If you can find evidence of his past misdeeds, it'll be 20 million.\"","Ge Xinxin was truly shocked. Are all rich people this impulsive?","\"Alright, deal. I'm leaving now.\" Ge Xinxin didn't dare stay out too long, after all, there was still that old woman at home.","From the moment she left, Ge Xinxin had made up her mind. For her future life, for 20 million, she knew what she had to do.","Shen Yin watched Ge Xinxin's retreating figure, took a sip of water, and stood up to leave as well.","Meanwhile, Xu Xiuhe was also reviewing the documents collected by Liu Bo. As expected, the car accident involving Wang the driver wasn't so simple. The problem lay with the insurance company.","The money was paid by the insurance company, but the flow of funds came from Xu Zhengyang. In other words, the accident wasn't an accident at all.","\"Can we find more detailed evidence? Concrete proof that Wang the driver did it intentionally, and that the insurance might just be a cover?\"","Xu Xiuhe asked.","At the same time, he knew that such evidence wouldn't be easy to find. They could only get detailed evidence from Xu Zhengyang himself, as the driver was already dead, leaving no leads to follow from that end.","If they could, it would be enough to send Xu Zhengyang to prison.","Shen Yin took a tour of Qingfan Tower. Business was good, and it was time to come up with new dishes for the menu.","In the afternoon, on her way back, Shen Yin asked the driver to pass by Zhengzheng's kindergarten to pick her up.","\"Mommy!\"","Shen Yin stood at the kindergarten entrance. As soon as the little one came out and saw Shen Yin, she ran towards her.","\"Did Zhengzheng make any new friends today?\"","Shen Yin lowered her head, took Zhengzheng's hand with her left hand, and turned to walk towards the car.","The driver opened the back door.","\"Yes, I made new friends. They all like to play with me.\"","Shen Yin was happy too. Zhengzheng was indeed great - not only did she not cry, but she was also popular."]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: XU Zhengyang Arrested","paragraphs":["After Shen Yin returned home, Xu Xiuhe had not yet arrived. As soon as the little one got home, he went to the shoe closet to get slippers for Shen Yin, then entered the living room to serve her tea.","\"Mommy, the teacher said you work very hard, so we should be extra nice to you,\" said Xu Yunzheng as he approached Shen Yin and began massaging her legs.","\"Mom, are you tired? Dad says pregnancy is exhausting. Let me rub your legs and shoulders,\" the little one said, climbing onto the sofa to knead Shen Yin's shoulders.","When Xu Xiuhe came home and saw this scene, he was a bit puzzled. Wasn't massaging legs and shoulders supposed to be his job? How had it become Yunzheng's task now?","\"Dad, praise me!\"","\"Yunzheng, you're amazing!\"","Father and son exchanged their lines.","\"Was work busy today?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Were you tired today?\" Xu Xiuhe inquired.","They each asked about the other, but neither received an answer.","Late that night, Ge Xinxin snuck into Xu Zhengyang's room. He wasn't back yet, but she knew he had a safe that likely contained important clues.","The safe had a combination lock. Ge Xinxin tried many combinations – Xu Zhengyang's birthday, her own birthday – but nothing worked. Finally, she had to give up.","However, Ge Xinxin now knew for certain that the safe held crucial information. Otherwise, it wouldn't be so difficult to crack.","Since brute force didn't work, she'd have to use her wits. Ge Xinxin bought a type of drug online that would lower people's guard when consumed.","The next evening, knowing Xu Zhengyang would return, Ge Xinxin slipped into his room while the old witch wasn't paying attention.","When Xu Zhengyang came back, he found Ge Xinxin lying in his room, gazing at him seductively. He had already had a few drinks.","Ge Xinxin had also lit some incense in the room.","\"Darling, have some water. You must be feeling unwell after drinking. Some water will make you feel better.\"","After drinking it, Xu Zhengyang felt unusually excited. Ge Xinxin's ploy had worked.","In the depths of night, after a passionate encounter, Ge Xinxin finally managed to extract information from Xu Zhengyang.","\"What's the password?\" she asked.","\"What password?\"","\"The one for your safe.\"","\"Why are you asking so many questions?\" Xu Zhengyang mumbled groggily.","\"I'm just curious. I'm the mother of your child. Can't I ask?\"","Xu Zhengyang seemed to soften.","\"You're still keeping secrets from me? I'm your lover, the one who will be by your side for life. We'll grow old together,\" Ge Xinxin said with a smile.","To Xu Zhengyang, Ge Xinxin's smile appeared to be that of a content, happy woman.","If only Ge Xinxin knew what kind of smile it really was. Men might make empty promises and use honeyed words, but she could play that game too. Anyone could say nice things.","\"You're right, you're my lifelong companion. I love you so much, of course I won't keep secrets from you. The password is 0712.\"","\"Why 0712?\"","Xu Zhengyang didn't answer this question. Why 0712? Perhaps it was the birthday of the woman by his side at that time.","Xu Zhengyang fell asleep.","To be safe, Ge Xinxin didn't immediately open the safe.","Instead, she crept back to her own room in the dead of night, massaging her sore waist. She had really put her all into tonight's performance, but it had paid off with this vital information.","The next day, after Xu Zhengyang left for work and with few people in the Xu Family home, Yang Cui went out shopping. Ge Xinxin tiptoed into Xu Zhengyang's bedroom.","0712.","The safe opened.","Inside were several pieces of fine jewelry and some documents.","There were insurance bills, transfer records to a woman named Zhou Man, and personal information about Wang Zhihao.","She wasn't sure if Xu Zhengyang would remember what she had done last night. She also didn't know which of these documents would serve as evidence.","To be thorough, she photographed all the documents in the safe and sent them to Shen Yin.","After receiving the files, Shen Yin looked them over briefly before forwarding them to Xu Xiuhe.","[Where did these come from?] Xu Xiuhe replied. He had recently hired a private investigator, but those findings were superficial and not substantial evidence.","However, what Shen Yin sent him perfectly matched what he had been looking for initially. This information would be devastating to Xu Zhengyang if revealed.","[Do you believe in luck?] Shen Yin texted.","[I do.]","Xu Xiuhe had always believed in luck. If losing his mother, being unloved by his father, and being sabotaged by his stepmother in the first half of his life was bad luck, then meeting Shen Yin later was incredibly good luck. One could even say he had used up all his luck from his first 25 years just to meet her.","[You're not going to tell me that you got lucky and someone just handed you this evidence, are you?]","[What if I did? Would you believe me?]","Xu Xiuhe was momentarily speechless. Could anyone really be that lucky?","He sent a shocked emoji in response.","[Remember that pregnant woman we saw with Xu Zhengyang at the hospital last time?]","Xu Xiuhe thought for a moment.","[Vaguely.]","[The child she's carrying isn't Xu Zhengyang's. Shu Yi and I went out and happened to see her with her ex-boyfriend. We accidentally overheard this important conversation. You know me, I've never been a saint. When evidence falls into my lap, why not take it?]","[How are you so sure that woman would get this evidence?]","[You have to believe that Xu Zhengyang isn't very smart. He's actually quite a mama's boy. And you should also believe that a woman's pillow talk can be very effective.]","[My wife is formidable.]","[The rest is up to you now. From what I saw, the kidnapping case from before is very likely related to him. But I don't understand what that insurance policy means.]","[I know what it means. It's related to my previous car accident.]","Xu Xiuhe instructed Liu Bo to compile all the evidence, organizing each charge meticulously.","Finally, on a day in late September, a group of police officers stormed into the Xu Group building. In front of everyone, they put handcuffs on Xu Zhengyang.","\"Why are you arresting me?\" he demanded.","\"Take him away,\" an officer ordered.","\"What's going on?\"","Xu Guimin, alarmed by the commotion, came down from upstairs to inquire.","\"Xu Zhengyang is suspected of involvement in multiple criminal cases. He needs to be detained now.\"","\"Dad, save me!\"","Xu Zhengyang called out repeatedly as two officers escorted him away.","Xu Guimin had no idea what was happening. When Ge Xinxin received the news, she immediately packed her bags. Pulling her suitcase, she headed for the door of the Xu Family home.","\"Ge Xinxin, what are you doing? Where are you going with that suitcase?\" Yang Cui asked, still watching TV.","Without looking back, Ge Xinxin tossed out a reply: \"Check the trending topics.\"","Yang Cui picked up her phone from nearby and opened it. The top Weibo headline read: \"Xu Family Crown Prince Xu Zhengyang Arrested.\""]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: Yang Cuixin's Guilt","paragraphs":["The woman covered her mouth, and her phone dropped to the ground. She then chased after her.","\"Ge Xinxin, come back! You're carrying Zhengyang's child in your belly. You can't leave!\"","Yang Cui ran outside, grabbing Ge Xinxin's suitcase.","\"Old woman, let go! Your son is a murderer now. Do you really think I'd let my child have a killer for a father? Besides, who told you the baby in my belly is Xu Zhengyang's?\"","After saying this, Ge Xinxin didn't care about Yang Cui's reaction. She pulled her suitcase and got into the taxi she had already called.","Yang Cui immediately called Xu Guimin, asking him what was going on.","\"What's happening with Zhengyang? Why was he suddenly taken away?\"","\"I should be asking you that. You've always spoiled him, and now he's involved in criminal cases, multiple ones at that? What on earth is going on?\"","Xu Guimin demanded.","After hearing this, Yang Cui began to feel guilty, but the current situation didn't allow her to dwell on it.","\"Honey, what are we going to do? Zhengyang is our only son. If he goes to prison, how will I go on living?\"","Yang Cui asked, crying.","\"Shut up, stop making a fuss. I'm going to the police station.\"","Xu Guimin hung up the phone but didn't immediately go to the police station. Instead, he dealt with some company matters first.","It was nearly noon when he finally headed to the police station with his people.","Xu Xiuhe took advantage of the falling stock prices of Xu Corporation and bought another batch.","At the police station, Xu Guimin sat outside while Xu Zhengyang sat inside.","\"Why did you arrest me?\"","Xu Zhengyang asked, pretending as if nothing had happened.","\"Why did we arrest you? Don't you know what you've done? Any single one of your actions is enough to put you in jail for years.\"","\"I want to see my father. I want a lawyer.\"","\"Your father is waiting for you outside.\"","Soon after, the father and son were in a separate room.","Xu Guimin remained calm when he entered, but Xu Zhengyang was far from calm.","Although he was handcuffed and couldn't even stand up from his chair, upon seeing Xu Guimin, he acted as if he had caught the last lifeline.","He struggled forcefully, trying to get closer to Xu Guimin.","\"Dad, you have to get me out of here. I'm innocent. They must have made a mistake. Someone must have paid to frame me. Dad, save me, use money to get me out.\"","\"Who framed you?\" Xu Guimin asked.","\"It's... it's... it's our competitors.\"","\"I've seen the evidence of all the things you've done outside. How can I save you? You fool.\"","\"Dad, I was wrong, I really was. I don't want to stay here. You have to save me.\"","\"You had someone frame Xiuhe in a car accident, you sent people to kidnap Xiuhe's wife. How am I supposed to save you? Now the evidence is irrefutable. You think I can just throw money at this? You think Xiuhe doesn't have money? You're on your own now. From today on, I, Xu Guimin, no longer have a son like you.\"","After saying this, Xu Guimin turned and left the chat room.","\"Dad, don't go, Dad...\"","Xu Xiuhe was very satisfied with the news online, but it wasn't enough.","At the Xu family villa.","Yang Cui was almost on her knees before Xu Guimin, begging him to save Xu Zhengyang.","\"Save him? How? Every single thing he did is serious. We're talking about intentional murder! Do you think I can save him with money?\"","Xu Guimin said impatiently. How the hell did he end up with such a son, useless in everything except causing trouble?","\"But he's still our son.\"","\"Shut up! Tell me, did you know about all these things he did?\"","Xu Guimin raised his voice. He didn't believe that Yang Cui, as his mother, knew nothing about it.","\"I didn't know. As his father, you didn't know either, did you?\"","\"What a joke. Not only did she know, but she was also involved in every single thing.\"","Xu Xiuhe's voice appeared in the Xu family's courtyard.","\"Why are you here?\" Xu Guimin asked.","\"Well, I probably shouldn't have come.\"","As Xu Xiuhe said this, he looked around. The place where he had lived ten years ago had changed quite a bit.","\"Then why did you come?\"","Yang Cui's eyes looked as if they could kill Xu Xiuhe.","\"If I didn't come, were you planning to play innocent and then beg for your good-for-nothing son?\"","Xu Xiuhe walked up to Yang Cui, lowering his head to look at her frightened face.","\"Xu Guimin, look at how blind you've been for so many years. All this time, you've been living with a heartless, vicious woman. How's your life been?\"","Xu Guimin remained silent.","\"Yang Cui, I admit your acting skills are quite good, excellent even. It's almost a shame you didn't go into the entertainment industry. Can you still remember how you treated me over a decade ago?\"","Yang Cui felt guilty upon hearing this.","Xu Guimin turned his gaze towards Yang Cui.","\"I was so good to you in middle school and high school. How can you be telling on me now?\"","Yang Cui put on a soft act.","\"Good to me? One way to my face and another behind my back? You even fired all the original housekeepers. I bet you've forgotten how you used to curse me behind my back.\"","Xu Xiuhe folded his arms.","\"That's not true. When I scolded you, it was to make you study hard. It was a mother's discipline towards her son. How could that be considered being unkind to you?\"","\"Hahahahaha, what a joke. Xu Guimin, did you hear that? Her ability to twist black and white has grown stronger. And you, has your ability to be blind to right and wrong also improved?\"","Xu Xiuhe said sarcastically.","\"You...\"","\"What 'you'? Did you investigate what I asked you to? Do you want to know what she did last year?\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Xu Xiuhe opened a video.","On the screen was Yang Cui at Blue Mountain Cafe, pressuring Shen Yin.","\"Yang Cui, this isn't unfamiliar to you, is it? Do I need to explain what this is?\"","Xu Xiuhe suddenly turned his gaze towards Xu Guimin.","\"My wife, because of some mental issues after giving birth, was manipulated by a woman named Yang Cui while she was ill. She tried to persuade my wife to get rid of my son. Tell me, how vicious is this woman?\"","\"I didn't, Guimin, I didn't. He's slandering me.\"","\"Do I need to slander you? Do you dare say you didn't know about a single thing your son did? I bet you not only knew but were also fully aware of everything.\"","Yang Cui felt guilty.","\"You two are quite a pair. Don't worry, you have something to look forward to. Cherish this time, because you won't have such leisurely days in the future. A family of three, spending the Mid-Autumn Festival in prison cells, that'll be quite an experience.\"","\"Which three?\"","\"The daughter she personally sent to prison, herself, and that son who just got locked up.\""]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: Clear Division of Labor","paragraphs":["When Xu Guimin heard what Xu Xiuhe said, he turned his head directly to look at Yang Cui.","Yang Cui was also stunned. When did she have a daughter? How come she didn't know?","\"Can't remember?\"","\"You should be able to recall that before you married him, you had a child.\"","Xu Xiuhe's words seemed to stir up that segment of Yang Cui's memory. Her face wrinkled like a bitter gourd.","Xu Guimin understood everything at a glance. Yang Cui indeed had a child before marrying him.","\"Why didn't I know about this? Yang Cui, how many more things are you hiding from me?\"","Xu Guimin gritted his teeth in anger.","\"Honey, that's all in the past. Let me explain.\" Yang Cui clung to Xu Guimin's arm.","\"Shut up. Xiuhe, tell me, did that daughter also go in, or how did she end up there?\"","Yang Cui looked terrified. Zhou Man, Zhou Man was the one she sent in. Could Zhou Man be the girl she abandoned over 20 years ago?","Realizing this, Yang Cui suddenly became aware of something else. Zhou Man was someone Zhengyang knew? Given Zhengyang's personality...","\"Unbelievable? The sins you commit will always be repaid by someone.\" Xu Xiuhe said calmly.","\"Impossible, impossible!\"","Yang Cui shook her head and suddenly sat down on the ground.","\"What do you mean? What's impossible?\"","Xu Guimin asked. Why did he feel like he knew nothing about what Yang Cui and Xu Xiuhe were talking about? He felt like an outsider, completely in the dark.","\"Hahahahaha, how absurd! I never imagined it would end up like this. Hahahahaha, Xu Guimin, you coward! Your own son gets arrested and you're not even trying to save him, you're still here. I... you... why didn't you just drown in that swimming pool back then?\"","Yang Cui's words became somewhat incoherent.","\"What do you mean, Yang Cui?\"","\"Hahahahaha, what do I mean? I've been sick of you for a long time. Where has your sincerity gone? I've been so good to you all these years, and you still won't give the company to Zhengyang. Tell me, how could I not be anxious?\"","Yang Cui seemed to have gone mad, sprawled on the ground, mumbling to herself.","\"Yang Cui, was it you who caused me to nearly drown?\"","\"Yes, I added something to your water, but who knew you'd be so lucky? You didn't even drown. How are you still alive? Fate really does play tricks on people.\"","\"Cough, cough, cough.\" Xu Guimin coughed continuously in anger.","\"Indeed, my intuition was right from the beginning. Xu Guimin, have you ever wondered why my mother appeared in your dream?\"","Xu Guimin carefully recalled that dream. In the dream, Sun Wenting threatened him, not allowing him to return.","Was she trying to save him?","As he pondered, Xu Guimin began to feel a bit dazed. How many years had it been?","\"You don't deserve to think about it.\"","After saying this, Xu Xiuhe turned and left.","At the entrance of the Xu family villa, Yang Cui sat on the ground while Xu Guimin stood.","Online, the hot search topics continued unabated, all about the Xu family affairs and Xu Zhengyang's case.","At Ziyue Manor.","Shen Yin was also following the various online information, and at the same time, she received quite a few private messages. After all, she was one of the parties involved in one of the cases. Some were curious, some were concerned.","[Yin Yin, all this evidence, it wasn't all obtained from that woman Ge Xinxin, was it?]","[Sort of, but not entirely? Ge Xinxin got some information, and Xu Xiuhe also did some investigation. When we combined the evidence from both sides, it was pretty much complete.]","Shen Yin replied.","[Impressive, you two really make an efficient team.]","[So what's the situation with Yang Cui now? Has she been taken into custody?]","Shu Yi's gossip instinct was flaring up again.","Shen Yin replied with a \"don't know\" emoji.","Xu Xiuhe had gone to the Xu family, but he hadn't returned yet, so she really didn't know.","Just as she was thinking about it, Xu Xiuhe came home.","\"Honey.\"","\"You're back!\" Shen Yin trotted over.","\"Slow down, slow down. There's still a baby in your belly.\" Xu Xiuhe was afraid Shen Yin might lose her balance and reached out to catch her.","\"But you're back now.\"","\"How's Yang Cui? Was she involved in the things Xu Zhengyang did?\"","Shen Yin held onto Xu Xiuhe's arm.","\"Not only was she involved, but she also confessed. The incident where Xu Guimin nearly drowned was her doing. She must have drugged Xu Guimin.\"","\"Oh my god, it really was her! A woman's heart can truly be the most poisonous! What happened next? How did Xu Guimin react when he found out?\"","Everyone has a bit of a gossip-loving heart, and Shen Yin was no exception. She was quite curious about Xu Guimin's reaction.","How would a man like Xu Guimin react upon learning that he had been betrayed by his loved one?","After Xu Xiuhe left, Xu Guimin called the police without a word. There were surveillance cameras at the entrance, so when the police arrived, they watched the footage and arrested Yang Cui.","In less than a day, the Xu family villa was empty. Xu Guimin sat alone on the sofa in the living room, feeling as if the world had become surreal.","Online, the hot search topic had shot to number one.","\"Mother of Xu Zhengyang, wife of Xu Group's CEO arrested.\"","For a moment, everyone sighed. What does it mean for a mother and son to be arrested one after another? Out of a family of three, two were going to prison.","Netizens even started to feel sorry for the CEO of Xu Group, Xu Guimin.","[Why feel sorry for him? Better feel sorry for yourself. His wife and child are just going to jail, it's not like he's fallen from grace or going bankrupt.]","[The person above, you can't say that. How important are one's wife and children?]","[You don't know? I heard that the woman was personally sent to jail by her husband.]","[Wow, what did this woman do? Who would personally send their own wife to jail?]","[Inside information, there's a rumor saying that Xu Guimin's near-drowning incident was caused by this woman.]","Shu Yi suddenly felt that the gossip online was even more exciting than what she learned from Shen Yin.","She took a screenshot and sent it to Shen Yin.","[How about that? Aren't I amazing? It's already late at night, but I'm still surfing the 5G waves. This Yang Cui is really ruthless, even more poisonous than Pan Jinlian. She actually tried to kill the man sleeping next to her.]","Shen Yin had already fallen asleep, but when she turned over in the night, her leg cramped and was in pain.","Xu Xiuhe woke up alarmed, and realizing Shen Yin was uncomfortable, he immediately opened his eyes and started massaging her leg.","\"We should go to the hospital for a check-up tomorrow,\" the man suggested.","\"No need, this is normal. I'm already having fewer reactions than others. I should be grateful. Pregnancy has never been an easy thing since ancient times.\"","\"I'm sorry, let's not have any more children after this.\" Xu Xiuhe started to regret. If he had known Shen Yin would be so uncomfortable, he wouldn't have wanted a second child.","\"You weren't thinking of having more, were you? Aren't two enough for you?\"","\"I just hate to see you suffer so much. If only I could take this suffering for you.\"","\"Hahaha, are you dreaming? But it's not too bad. I only have one in my belly now. Think about Qi Ji back then, she had two in her belly, and Xue Jingrui wasn't as attentive as you.\"","Xu Xiuhe smiled at her words.","\"How do you know Xue Jingrui wasn't worried? He wouldn't tell others, would he? That would be losing face.\"","Shen Yin's drowsiness completely disappeared. That made sense. People generally don't show their vulnerabilities to others.","Shen Yin casually picked up her phone from the bedside table and opened it to see the message from Shu Yi.","So she replied with a sentence.","[Be careful when surfing, don't forget to switch to your alt account.]","[Damn, sis, you're still awake? Isn't the baby in your belly sleepy?]","Shu Yi, who was originally lying in bed, sat up straight when she saw Shen Yin's reply and responded.","[It's just that when you're pregnant, you often feel a bit uncomfortable at night. I just woke up, otherwise I wouldn't have seen your message.]","Shen Yin replied.","[What's that sound on your end?]","[This?]","Shen Yin moved the phone to her leg.","[It's the sound of my husband massaging my leg. My leg just cramped a bit.]","[Wow, I won't disturb you lovebirds anymore. I'll continue surfing.]","Shu Yi went back to scrolling through Weibo.","\"Shu Yueru, come down.\"","Chang Zhiyuan had called several times from downstairs, but there was no response.","Chang Zhiyuan leaned against his car, at first thinking that Shu Yi was deliberately ignoring him again.","Then he realized, damn, he was being stupid. It was already cool outside, who sleeps with their windows open? Moreover, Ziyue Manor was Xu Xiuhe's property, the room quality wouldn't be poor. With such strong soundproofing, it would be a miracle if Shu Yi could hear him calling.","Chang Zhiyuan took out his phone and dialed Shu Yi's number.","\"Hello.\"","\"Why are you calling me so late? I was already asleep.\"","\"Yeah right, I don't believe you for a second.\"","\"What, you don't trust me? Were all those things you said before just lies? Hmph, men.\"","Chang Zhiyuan laughed.","\"Shu Yueru, if you're not next year's Best Actress, I'll wash your hair while doing a handstand.\"","\"Really? You better keep your word.\" Shu Yi perked up.","\"You're not planning to buy the Best Actress award just to avoid doing a handstand, are you?\"","\"Don't be silly. I'm complimenting your acting skills. If I wasn't standing outside your building right now, looking at your lit-up window, I might have actually believed you.\"","Hearing this, Shu Yi ran to the window without even putting on her slippers.","She pulled back the curtains.","Chang Zhiyuan was standing downstairs, looking up at her. She leaned out, their eyes meeting.","\"Are you coming down, or should I come up?\"","\"You come up,\" Shu Yi said, too lazy to go down and open the door.","\"How am I supposed to get up? You won't let me in.\"","\"Don't you know the door code?\"","Shu Yi said nonchalantly.","Chang Zhiyuan smiled again at her words.","Shu Yi sat by the mirror to fix her hair, only unlocking her bedroom door after making sure it wasn't messy.","When Chang Zhiyuan came up, he knocked on the door.","\"It's unlocked, come in.\"","\"I brought you some treats,\" Chang Zhiyuan said as he entered the bedroom, holding a small box of pastries in one hand and a large bag of skewers in the other.","\"Oh come on, aren't you afraid I'll get fat? If I can't get any roles, you'll earn less money too.\"","\"It's fine, you'll earn less, but my money is all yours anyway.\"","\"Sweet talk. I don't believe you.\"","Chang Zhiyuan didn't respond. Whether it was sweet talk or not would be clear in the future. There was no point in saying more now.","\"Don't worry, you won't get fat. The pastries are from that special place in the west of the city, and for the skewers, I'll eat the meat, you eat the vegetables.\"","\"...\"","\"You might as well not have come,\" Shu Yi pouted.","\"How could I not come? I haven't won you over yet, I have to keep working on it.\"","\"But it's so late.\"","There was a clock in the bedroom, its second hand ticking away. Shu Yi always had this habit of keeping a clock in her bedroom. Listening to the ticking of the clock as she fell asleep gave her a sense of security. She even brought a small alarm clock with her when staying in hotels.","\"I'll come earlier next time. Something came up tonight that delayed me,\" Chang Zhiyuan explained.","\"You weren't having dinner with some new starlet, were you?\" Shu Yi said deliberately.","As soon as she said it, she realized it sounded a bit off. Why did it come out so jealous? It didn't sound like something she would normally say.","\"Are you jealous?\"","\"Of course not, I'm just making a reasonable guess. After all, you're usually so busy.\"","Shu Yi started to get defensive, refusing to admit it no matter what.","At the same time, she started to panic. Love really could change a person, imperceptibly making her act unlike her usual self.","\"You're half right. I am busy, that's true, but having dinner with a new starlet is false.\"","Chang Zhiyuan was secretly delighted. The things left unsaid were often the most intriguing.","\"So busy, huh?\"","\"Well, I am the CEO of a media company, after all. I just dealt with some company business today.\"","\"What kind of business?\"","\"Curious?\"","Chang Zhiyuan laid out the food on a small table on the carpet.","\"Yu Dan's relationship almost got exposed.\"","\"No way!\"","Shu Yi was shocked. Yu Dan was a top-tier celebrity at the peak of her career. Although Shu Yi herself was quite famous now, Yu Dan had been a force in the entertainment industry for many years. To think she had a relationship.","\"You didn't know?\"","\"I had no idea! Who's the lucky one? Are they good-looking?\"","Shu Yi had met Yu Dan before. Her style had become increasingly powerful lately, even a bit like Chang Ningjing. To think she had a partner now, a relationship.","\"It's not someone from the industry. Yu Dan was photographed going out with him.\"","\"Then what happened?\"","\"The company's PR team intercepted it. That's what I was dealing with at the company tonight.\"","\"How did you handle it?\"","\"We bought the news. With money. Otherwise, tomorrow's top trending topic would have been 'Best Actress's Relationship Exposed'.\"","\"Sister Yu Dan is such a veteran, does she still care about this kind of public opinion?\"","\"Of course she does. Female actors have always been very restricted. Limited roles, limited by age, and even relationships can't be freely made public. The fans certainly wouldn't accept it. She's in the middle of transitioning her image, and if a relationship was exposed, it would definitely affect her career to some extent. Her transition hasn't been completed yet, so she can only maintain a single persona for now. She wants to go public, but the price is too high. It's not the right time yet.\"","Shu Yi sat down too, and they started drinking beer and eating skewers.","\"Sigh.\"","\"What are you sighing about? You don't have any worries. If you wanted to go public, you could do it right now. Us going public would be what everyone's been waiting for.\"","...","That's right, she and Chang Zhiyuan were in what he called an \"adjustment period\". She hadn't acknowledged Chang Zhiyuan as her partner yet, but Chang Zhiyuan felt that he was already Shu Yi's boyfriend. But outsiders didn't know this. At most, only Shen Yin and Qi Ji knew.","The hashtag for their \"couple\" had never stopped trending, and their fan forum was always bustling with activity."]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: Official Announcement","paragraphs":["\"Did I agree to that?\" Shu Yi looked up suddenly while eating barbecue skewers.","\"You let me into your room, didn't you? Isn't that agreement enough?\"","Shu Yi remained silent.","\"If you don't say anything, I'll take it as a yes.\"","Chang Zhiyuan was overjoyed. He took out his phone, opened Weibo, and posted at 1:30 AM.","[She finally agreed, so I'm making it official. @Shu Yi]","\"What are you doing? The skewers are getting cold.\"","\"Announcing it officially. Didn't you just agree?\"","\"What?\"","Shu Yi was so shocked that she dropped her skewer on the ground. She had just agreed to be together, and Chang Zhiyuan was playing with words.","Panicking, Shu Yi didn't even bother to wipe her hands before grabbing her phone.","In just a few seconds, Weibo went wild.","\"She finally agreed, so I'm making it official\" went viral, reaching the top of the trending topics.","\"Geez, Chang Zhiyuan, your announcement is so cheesy.\"","Chang Zhiyuan looked down at the Weibo post he had just made. Cheesy? How was it cheesy?","\"What's cheesy about it? I had thought of so many options before, like 'From now on, one umbrella for two.' But I got so excited just now that I couldn't remember any of them. Isn't this good enough?\"","Shu Yi held her forehead. How were there still so many night owls at this hour? How could she control the situation now?","\"If it's really necessary, you should make an announcement too,\" Chang Zhiyuan suggested.","\"How am I supposed to do that?\"","Shu Yi was at a loss. Normally, celebrity announcements had to go through their studio and company, with the manager's approval. But their situation was special. Shu Yi didn't have a studio, and her direct boss at the company was the one she was announcing a relationship with.","\"Give me your phone.\"","Shu Yi handed over her phone.","[Yes, it's just as he said. @Boss Chang Zhiyuan]","Shen Yin was still awake, scrolling through videos when she suddenly got a Weibo notification. She was about to swipe it away when she caught a familiar name: \"Shu Yi.\"","She clicked on it.","The trending topic \"Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan Announce Relationship\" was at the top of the list. Below were the two announcement posts from Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi.","The top few trending topics were all about the two of them. Shen Yin was so shocked that she dropped her phone beside her.","\"What's wrong? Are you tired or did you see some bad news? Good thing the phone didn't hit your face, that would have hurt.\"","Xu Xiuhe grew concerned and moved from the foot of the bed to Shen Yin's side.","\"Neither. Take a look.\"","Shen Yin picked up the phone from the bed and handed it to Xu Xiuhe.","\"They've announced their relationship.\"","\"Wait, didn't you already know? How come you're so calm about it?\"","Shen Yin furrowed her brow, looking at Xu Xiuhe with suspicion.","\"I didn't know. But wasn't it just a matter of time before they got together?\"","Shen Yin nodded. Indeed, she also knew that the two getting together was inevitable, no matter how long they tried to resist.","It was just that the announcement was quite sudden.","Just an hour ago, Shu Yi was still surfing the internet, enjoying other people's gossip. And now, in such a short time, she had become the subject of others' excitement.","\"Their announcement posts are quite interesting. One says 'She agreed, so I'm announcing it,' and the other says 'Yes, it's just as he said.' Straightforward, not bad.\"","\"Jealous?\"","\"No, I just find it interesting.\"","A pregnant woman's emotions are quite peculiar. Now, Shen Yin was wide awake. She decided to read through the Weibo comments.","\"Why is it still so active in the middle of the night? Don't these people sleep?\"","\"For some people, nightlife might just be starting now.\"","\"They have so many CP fans.\"","Xu Xiuhe pulled Shen Yin into his arms. \"They had that many fans from their TV drama already. It's a good thing they announced it in the middle of the night, otherwise, the platform might have crashed.\"","[Holy crap, this came out of nowhere! Good thing I wasn't asleep yet.]","[I knew it was true. The way he looked at Shu Yi was definitely not innocent.]","[When they were on that variety show together, I knew there was something between them. But I always thought the girl didn't like the guy enough, like water flowing past indifferent flowers. I never expected this...]","[Guys, who can relate? The CP I shipped actually became real.]","The next morning, the buzz hadn't died down.","\"The Xu family should really thank Shu Yi and Chang Zhiyuan,\" Shu Yi said, waking up close to noon.","\"Those people's popularity has certainly taken a hit.\"","\"Why aren't you at work today?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe brought a bowl of porridge to the bedside, not answering the question. Instead, he sat on the edge of the bed.","\"Here, open your mouth.\"","Xu Xiuhe held a spoon, scooped some porridge, and brought it to Shen Yin's lips.","Shen Yin complied, opening her mouth and swallowing the porridge.","Since becoming pregnant, she felt increasingly pampered, treated like a princess by Xu Xiuhe.","\"It's Sunday, the company isn't busy, so I'm keeping you company,\" Xu Xiuhe said while continuing to feed her.","\"Mom, the auntie downstairs called Zheng Zheng for lunch, so Zheng Zheng came up to call you both down to eat.\"","Hearing about lunch, Shen Yin checked her phone. It was already 11:30 AM. Indeed, it was time for lunch.","\"Honey, I think we forgot something just now,\" Shen Yin suddenly realized, then quickly climbed out of bed and rushed to the bathroom.","She grabbed her cup, rinsed her mouth, and started brushing her teeth. She had just eaten porridge without brushing her teeth or washing her face!","\"Slow down, it's my fault. I shouldn't have fed you.\"","Father and son stood at the doorway, posture perfect, waiting for Shen Yin to finish brushing her teeth before speaking.","\"Mom, let's go downstairs together.\"","Xu Yunzheng took Shen Yin's hand.","When the family of three reached the lower floor, the housekeeper had already set the table for lunch.","\"It's almost lunchtime, why did you feed me porridge earlier?\"","\"You needed to eat something.\"","Just as they finished eating, both Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe's phones rang. It was Shu Yi and Liu Bo calling respectively.","\"Are you awake, my dear Yin?\"","\"How did you know I just woke up?\"","\"Because you went to bed late last night. I saw you liked my Weibo post.\"","\"Tell me, what's going on with you two? This announcement came out of nowhere. Even we didn't know when you got together.\"","\"Last night, he went from zero to a hundred.\"","\"!!!! You two???\"","\"No, no, don't get the wrong idea. By 'zero to a hundred,' I mean getting together and announcing it happened at the same time. Can I say that I was even more behind on the news than many netizens? When the announcement was made, I, the person involved, wasn't even the first to know. How ridiculous is that?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"What happened? Didn't you post the announcement yourself? Were you announced on?\"","\"Gosh, sis, you're spot on. I was indeed announced on. When he made the announcement, I had no idea. The Weibo post had been up for two minutes before I realized I'd been announced. That dog of a man tricked me with a word game.\"","Shu Yi now didn't dare to leave her house. Who knows how many paparazzi were camped outside the company? Chang Zhiyuan, excited, hadn't slept all night. Before dawn, he had already gone back to the company, saying he needed to handle their affairs."]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: Back to the Xu Family Villa","paragraphs":["\"Liu Bo said there's news from the Xu Group.\"","After Xu Xiuhe returned from the call, Shen Yin also ended her call with Shu Yi.","\"What's going on with Xu Guimin?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe wasn't sure what was happening on Xu Guimin's side as he hadn't been keeping tabs. He had no feelings left for Xu Guimin. He used to harbor hatred, but now, he was indifferent. Whoever Xu Guimin chose to be with didn't bother him.","\"I'm going to the old villa today, would you like to join me?\" Xu Xiuhe asked.","Shen Yin nodded, and Xu Xiuhe began to worry, looking at Shen Yin's belly.","\"It's fine, I'm not that delicate. It's just having a baby. Some people are still teaching on stage at eight months pregnant, and I'm just over five months.\"","Shen Yin lightly touched her stomach, and Xu Yunzheng also ran to Shen Yin's belly to feel it.","\"Mama, Yunzheng will be with you. Yunzheng will carry your bag, and if you get tired, you can hold Yunzheng's hand.\"","Xu Yunzheng walked to Shen Yin's side and once again took Shen Yin's hand.","Xu Xiuhe wondered, had his little guy grown up so quickly after just a few days of kindergarten? The lessons must be very effective, but could he really handle carrying her bag?","\"I'm going to change. Can you wait for me?\"","Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe. She knew that he would obviously agree, but she just wanted to ask. She wasn't sure where this habit came from.","\"I'll go with you.\"","In the end, Shen Yin wore a milky blue sweater, a pair of loose white pants, and flat shoes. No matter how you looked at her, she seemed gentle.","\"Do you feel I've changed a lot recently?\"","In the car, Shen Yin asked.","\"There's no change. You've just become prettier.\" Xu Xiuhe saw Shen Yin's reflection in the mirror and remarked.","\"I'm serious!\"","\"I'm serious too. If you don't believe me, take out a mirror and see for yourself. Isn't your skin whiter and softer?\"","Shen Yin took her mirror from her bag and observed herself.","\"It seems a bit, but what I want to ask is, do you feel my personality has changed?\"","Shen Yin closed the mirror.","That caught the man driving the car off guard. Perhaps pregnancy had made her more sensitive.","\"Not at all.\"","\"I always feel like I'm not the same as I was before. I used to be able to handle several men by myself, but now I feel so fragile.\"","\"That's because mama hasn't encountered any bad guys. When you do, you'll fight back.\"","Xu Xiuhe agreed wholeheartedly with his son's words. People adapt to their environment, molding their personalities accordingly. During this period, Shen Yin indeed appeared gentle, but human personality is diverse.","\"Actually, your personality has always been this way. It's just that before, you felt you needed to be strong, so you showcased your tough side. But now, things are different. You remain strong, but there are some things you no longer need to worry about.\"","Shen Yin admitted that all these things Xu Xiuhe said were right. The lack of love made her protect herself, just like a hedgehog using its hard armor to protect its soft body.","She felt that she had changed a lot because Xu Xiuhe treated her very well. She came to realize love is armor, it gives her a sense of security; love is mutual tolerance and understanding.","He would stay up late with her, massaging her legs and shoulders, feeding her porridge in the morning, reassuring her that everything is fine, he was there for her.","\"Then I won't worry anymore.\"","\"Don't worry your head, feel at ease, I've got everything.\"","\"And me too!\"","There were several reporters at the gate of the Xu's house.","When they saw Xu Xiuhe coming with his family, they wanted to come over for an interview. Yet, as they feared to offend Xu Xiuhe, they didn't dare to approach. So, they could only watch as their potential earnings walked into the villa.","\"Why didn't they chase after us?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Maybe because you're pregnant, they didn't dare. If something happened, they wouldn't be able to bear the responsibility.\"","Xu Xiuhe started to fabricate.","\"No one.\"","It was Xu Yunzheng's first visit here. He looked at the yard, which was larger than his own, and spoke.","\"Wait for me here for a moment.\"","Xu Xiuhe ran into a small room in the yard. When he came out again, he was holding a shovel and a hoe.","\"Why is this here?\" Shen Yin looked at the tools in Xu Xiuhe's hands.","\"These are what my mother bought when I was very young.\"","There was a patch of grassland in the yard. He noticed it when he came yesterday. This patch remained a grassland, unlike other places where trees and flowers were planted.","\"You're not going to dig something, are you?\" Shen Yin looked at Xu Xiuhe and asked.","\"Yes, my mother buried something here, said it was for her future granddaughter-in-law and grandson.\"","As Xu Xiuhe spoke, his hands did not stop digging bit by bit.","\"Would it still be there after all these years?\"","Shen Yin doubted.","\"Have you all returned home?\"","Xu Guimin came out of the villa and saw the family of three. He looked excited, but the vicissitudes of life on his face could not be concealed. The man in his fifties looked a lot more exhausted after going through such major events.","\"Home?\"","Xu Xiuhe filled his tone with incomprehension. What was Xu Guimin thinking, daring to say that this place was his home? Was it? From the moment Yang Cui stepped in, it was no longer his home.","\"What are you digging, Xiuhe?\"","\"I don't need you to worry about it.\"","\"Xiuhe, I am your father.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't want to deal with Xu Guimin anymore. Despite the cold treatment, Xu Guimin didn't feel discouraged. He turned his gaze to Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng.","\"What is your name? Would you like grandpa to hold you?\"","Xu Guimin walked towards Shen Yin and Xu Yunzheng. When he reached Yunzheng, Yunzheng stepped back and hid behind Shen Yin.","\"He doesn't know you and doesn't want to talk to strangers.\"","Shen Yin stood in front of Yunzheng.","\"You are Xiuhe's wife, right? Good choice. But how could I ever be a stranger? I am Xiuhe's father, Yunzheng's grandpa. The blood flowing in Yunzheng's veins is that of the Xu's.\"","\"Xiuhe has been away for so many years, and you've also gone to see him, saying he's your family's child. Let alone Zhengzheng.\"","\"No matter what you say, it is an indisputable fact that Xiuhe is my son.\"","Shen Yin still paid no mind, she would always stand on Xu Xiuhe's side. No matter right or wrong, whatever decisions Xu Xiuhe made, she would support him, just like how he supported her.","\"Xiuhe, you see, you...\"","\"We're just here to take back what's rightfully ours and we'll leave soon. We don't want to talk if you're not in the best shape, you can go in.\""]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: A Box of Antiques","paragraphs":["Xu Xiuhe continued digging in the patch of grass, noticing that the hole was getting deeper, but still nothing had been unearthed.","\"Xiuhe, what are you digging for? Do you need my help?\" Xu Guimin asked from the side.","\"No need, you can go inside. We'll leave after we finish digging,\" said Shen Yin.","Xu Xiuhe kept digging, going deeper and deeper until he finally couldn't dig anymore.","\"Have we found a treasure?\" Xu Yunzheng ran to the edge of the dug-up hole.","\"Zhengzheng, be careful. If you fall in, you'll be covered in dirt.\"","\"It's okay, Dad's here. Zhengzheng won't fall in,\" the little one said, not worried at all.","\"Zhengzheng is right. Dad's here, so Zhengzheng won't fall. Come on, Zhengzheng, move aside a bit so Dad can bring up the treasure Grandma left.\"","Xu Xiuhe picked up Zhengzheng and put him to the side, then jumped down into the hole he had just dug and brought up a box as big as Zhengzheng.","The box looked quite old, wrapped in a layer of waterproof and moisture-proof paper.","\"This box is so big,\" Shen Yin said.","\"It's been passed down from my mother's ancestors. The Sun Family used to be a wealthy household, as you saw in South City last time.\"","Shen Yin recalled that when they were in South City before, she did feel that the Sun Family had a deep heritage.","\"Shall we go back then?\"","\"Yes, let's go back.\"","Xu Xiuhe had originally wanted to go look inside the villa, but then he thought that after so many years with Yang Cui living there, going in would be meaningless.","\"Are you leaving already? Won't you stay a while longer?\" Xu Guimin ran out.","\"This isn't our home, you know. Dad just came to take back what belongs to him. We're going home now, bye-bye,\" said Xu Yunzheng, tugging on Xu Xiuhe's clothes as he walked to Shen Yin's side. The family of three headed towards the gate of the courtyard.","\"Xiuhe, you're my son. No matter what, our blood relation can't be severed. I'm old now, and the company will have to be handed over to you eventually.\"","\"Not necessary. I'll take back the company on my own merit,\" Xu Xiuhe said. Xu Guimin wanted to say more, but the three had already gotten into the car.","Once in the car, Xu Xiuhe placed the antique-looking box under the passenger seat.","\"Do you know what's inside that box?\" Shen Yin asked on the way home.","\"I don't know. My mother and I dug the hole together back then. She said to dig up this box when I got married and had children in the future.\"","After arriving home, Xu Xiuhe carried the box out of the car. He then removed the layer of paper from the box.","\"Let me carry it. You go throw away that paper,\" said Shen Yin.","The paper, having been buried for years, was covered in a layer of black soil.","\"You two go in first. This box is too heavy; it's not convenient for you to carry.\"","Hearing this, Shen Yin said no more and led Zhengzheng into the house.","Shortly after, Xu Xiuhe also entered the house.","In the living room, Xu Xiuhe set the box on the floor, and Zhengzheng squatted down beside it.","\"Is this from Grandma for me and Mom?\"","Xu Xiuhe rubbed Xu Yunzheng's head.","\"Yes, it's for you and Mom.\"","\"Can Zhengzheng open this box?\" The little one looked at Xu Xiuhe, then at Shen Yin.","\"Sure.\"","\"Mom, come here. Open it with Zhengzheng.\" Hearing this, Shen Yin smiled and walked over.","Zhengzheng carefully lifted the lid of the box, revealing a collection of jewelry.","High-quality jade bracelets and rings.","The rings had an antique style, showing the marks of age, but undeniably, the jade in the center was of the same excellent quality as the bracelets.","Earrings, hairpins, necklaces – a complete set of accessories. Even Shen Yin, who was used to seeing such things in Dasheng, found it incredible at this moment.","These were all antiques. While they might be commonly seen in Dasheng, nowadays, one would have to go to a museum to see such items.","\"Mom, what's this?\" Xu Yunzheng picked up a jade pendant.","Shen Yin looked over. In the little one's hand was a Zichen pendant, a traditional jade pendant design symbolizing peace and aspirations for children's success. The jade was of excellent quality, translucent, with a smooth surface and superb color.","\"This is what Grandma wanted to give to Zhengzheng.\"","\"What is it used for?\" the little one asked.","Shen Yin took a look. This jade pendant probably had several hundred years of history.","\"It's worn around the neck. Jade nurtures people. One of these days, Mom will have this jade piece processed, and then Zhengzheng can wear it.\"","\"Yay!\"","Shen Yin looked again at the box full of jewelry, lost in thought. What exactly did the Sun Family's ancestors do? This box of treasures could only be seen in museums now.","\"Mom kept such a low profile when she was alive. How did Xu Guimin not know about these?\"","From what Shen Yin knew of Xu Guimin, if he had known about these treasures, he wouldn't have remained indifferent.","\"Maybe Mom always intended to leave these things for you two.\"","\"This box is worth several billion.\"","\"It's all yours.\"","\"Then I'll keep it and pass it on to my daughter-in-law in the future.\"","\"It's yours. You can do whatever you want with it.\"","\"Several billion, and you don't even blink?\"","\"I did blink. I've been blinking this whole time,\" Xu Xiuhe said, then blinked a few more times.","...","\"You have no sense of humor at all. I was using hyperbole.\"","\"I was wrong. I'll blink some more.\"","Shen Yin couldn't help but laugh at Xu Xiuhe's words.","\"Let's put these away for now. Zhengzheng can wear his.\"","As Shen Yin was about to close the box, she suddenly noticed a piece of paper at the bottom.","\"Daughter, when you see this letter, it means that my child, Xiuhe, has found someone he loves and who loves him. As I write this letter, I already know I'm ill. Life is unpredictable, and fate is hard to foresee. Many people might think my life wasn't worth much, but I don't see it that way. I still believe that two people meeting, knowing, and loving each other is fate, but some people can see fate through to the end, while others change. If I'm not mistaken, after I'm gone, Xiuhe will have a tough time. Meeting you is his fortune. Of course, I don't know who you are, but I believe you must be special. In the days to come, you must support each other and lean on one another. I don't have much else to say. Once again, thank you for being by his side.\"","The text wasn't long, but the handwriting was neat and elegant. Shen Yin could imagine Sun Wenting's feelings as she wrote this letter. It was both hopeful and a mother's blessing for her son.","\"Do you want to read the letter Mom wrote?\" Shen Yin asked.","Xu Xiuhe shook his head.","\"She said the box was for my future daughter-in-law, so naturally, the letter inside is for you. If I hadn't met you, this box might have stayed buried forever.\"","\"Mom's writing always gives me a sense of bygone times, like that of a wealthy young lady. But you can also see that she had accepted her fate. I never understood that dream Xu Guimin had.\"","\"Maybe she both hated and loved him. After you came into this world, there are many things we can't understand anymore.\"","Xu Xiuhe picked up the box and headed upstairs, while Shen Yin fell into thought.","Online, news about Chang Zhiyuan and Shu Yi was already flying around. Love is so magical, bringing lovers together.","Life returned to normal. As usual, when Shen Yin had free time, she would sit at Qingfan Tower, watching people come and go, observing the clouds gather and disperse. When inspired, she would update the menu.","Of course, she didn't forget about the studio at Qinghe Villa. The clothing studio had indeed established its brand.","At the end of the year, Kang Guopeng completed another set of Chinese-style furniture. As soon as Shen Yin listed it on the website, it was ordered. As the months passed, Shen Yin's belly grew larger and larger.","Xu Xiuhe became even more cautious, not daring to let Shen Yin do anything, and helping to handle many things himself.","In the news, there were new developments regarding Xu Zhengyang and Yang Cui. Xu Zhengyang was convicted of intentional homicide and kidnapping, sentenced to over 10 years in prison. Yang Cui received the same sentence.","Of course, this was partly due to the efforts of Xu Guimin and Xu Xiuhe.","Xu Guimin came to find Xu Xiuhe multiple times, even explicitly stating his intention to hand over the company to Xu Xiuhe, seeking Xu Xiuhe's forgiveness. But Xu Xiuhe never agreed.","\"Xiuhe, what will it take for you to forgive Dad? Dad was wrong before. Dad let you down. Dad will change in the future.\"","At the entrance of Ziyue Manor, Xu Guimin stood blocking Xu Xiuhe's car on his way home.","Xu Xiuhe sat in the car and sighed. He had said he would never forgive him. Some mistakes were fundamental issues, and some principles couldn't be changed.","Seeing Xu Xiuhe like this, Shen Yin got out of the car and stood in front of Xu Guimin.","\"Child, please persuade Xiuhe. He'll surely listen to you. Ask him to forgive me.\"","\"Mr. Xu, I can't help you with this. Do you think you're pitiful?\"","Shen Yin, with her pregnant belly, had a serious expression on her face, leaving no room for negotiation.","Xu Guimin nodded, his face bitter, his hair noticeably grayer.","He had been framed by his wife and son, nearly losing his life. After Yang Cui and Xu Zhengyang were sentenced to prison, Xu Group's stock price plummeted. Now Xiuhe was unwilling to forgive him. It seemed everything had changed in an instant. How could he not be pitiful?","\"You should know, those who are pitiful often have detestable aspects. What use is it to seek forgiveness? To make yourself feel better? To ease your conscience? Saying 'sorry' or 'I was wrong' - can that compensate for the harm my husband suffered? Why didn't you think of him before? He rented apartments, shopped at markets, did all sorts of part-time jobs. Did you see him as your son then? Did you do right by his mother? She loved you so much, and you betrayed her. Aren't all your current circumstances of your own making?\"","As Shen Yin spoke, Xu Guimin had no room for rebuttal.","\"You're quite old now, and you should understand that people must bear the consequences of their mistakes. You reap what you sow. There's no need to seek forgiveness, and you don't need it. Xiuhe can just pretend he doesn't have you as a father. Every time you come seeking forgiveness, it's difficult for him. Firstly, he never intended to forgive you. Secondly, your pitiful appearance makes others think we're bullying an old man. If you truly want Xiuhe to forgive you, just take care of yourself from now on. You're not short of money, you can still live well. In the future, let's each live our own lives without disturbing each other.\"","After finishing, Shen Yin rubbed her belly. Xu Guimin hadn't expected such harsh words from a pregnant woman.","Shen Yin didn't wait for Xu Guimin's reaction and turned to get into the passenger seat.","Xu Guimin seemed to have taken Shen Yin's words to heart and moved to the roadside, no longer blocking their way.","\"Thank you,\" Xu Xiuhe said.","\"We're family, aren't we? No need to thank me. If it weren't for the fact that he's related to you by blood, I would have hit him just now.\"","Shen Yin felt like giving Xu Guimin a beating just thinking about how difficult Xu Xiuhe's life had been before.","\"You're due to give birth in a few days, and you're still thinking about hitting people?\" Xu Xiuhe smiled indulgently. Just a while ago, she had felt she had become too gentle, unlike herself, and now she was thinking about getting physical again.","\"It'll be a few more days, probably after the New Year. Surely I won't be spending New Year's Eve in the operating room,\" Shen Yin realized belatedly.","\"The due date is the first day of the lunar new year. As for where we'll spend New Year's Eve, we'll have to ask the baby in your belly what they think.\"","\"Baby, what do you think? Please, not on New Year's Eve,\" Shen Yin patted her belly.","\"Mom asked us to spend the New Year at her place.\"","\"That's fine. Isn't Yunzheng still there? Should I pack some things? You could go over there in the next few days. I'll be quite busy, and I'm worried about you being alone at home.\"","\"Alright.\"","With that said, Xu Xiuhe did just that. After arriving home, he got out of the car and helped Shen Yin out.","Shen Yin sat in the living room eating various fruits while Xu Xiuhe went upstairs to pack some clothes and daily necessities for her. When he came back down, he was carrying a large bag.","\"Why so many things?\" Shen Yin asked.","They seemed to have their things at Yuelan Manor, and Fang Yue was at home, preparing everything for them.","\"It's not all yours. Some are for the baby. It's better to prepare in advance. Otherwise, it'll be inconvenient to come back and get things when you go into labor.\"","\"You're not planning for me to spend the entire postpartum period at Mom's place, are you?\"","\"No, I'll come back to take care of you during the postpartum period. Also, Aunt Song will come back after the New Year to look after you for a while.\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't tell Shen Yin why he was so busy during this time, and Shen Yin didn't ask. But Xu Xiuhe had promised to acquire Xu Corporation and give it to the baby as a birth gift. With the baby's birth approaching, it was time to speed up this matter.","After Shen Yin arrived at Yuelan Manor, Xu Xiuhe went to the company. With just a few days left before the New Year, only a few people were working overtime at the company. The acquisition of Xu Corporation had been ongoing for the past six months, and now it was just the final step.","The next time Xu Xiuhe met Xu Guimin was in the office of Xu Group.","\"You don't have to do this. The company is yours. There's no need for you to acquire it bit by bit like this,\" Xu Guimin sighed.","\"It's necessary. Just sign it. After you sign, the money will be transferred to you. From now on, as my wife said, let's each live our own lives. Use this money to take care of yourself in your old age.\""]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: New Year's Eve","paragraphs":["Xu Guimin frowned, wanting to continue, but Xu Xiuhe's attitude was firm, his expression serious as if there was no room for negotiation.","\"What I wanted to say, I've said to you before. You've also seen it, Xu Corporation isn't what it used to be. You should be well aware of the losses Yu Corporation incurred during the time when Xu Zhengyang was managing the company. Now more than half of the Xu Group's shares are in my hands, you...\"","Xu Xiuhe didn't continue, his eyes staring directly at Xu Guimin. Xu Guimin wasn't a fool, he understood what Xu Xiuhe was implying.","\"Is there really no room for discussion?\" Xu Guimin asked.","\"None.\"","Xu Xiuhe replied emotionless.","The man, aged over fifty, picked up the pen in his hand, and shakily wrote down Xu Guimin's three characters. Xu Xiuhe handed over the ink pad, and Xu Guimin stamped his handprint.","Xu Xiuhe took the document, turned around, and left. The rest was up to Liu Bo.","On New Year's Eve, in Yuelan Manor, the decor was just as it had been the previous year. Festive reds dominated, full of New Year's joy.","\"These few days, you must keep up with your nutrition, so when the time comes for delivery, you'll have the energy.\"","Fang Yue served Shen Yin soup for her. Although it was a New Year's Eve dinner, most of the dishes on the table were suitable for a pregnant woman.","\"I know, Mom.\"","Shen Yin picked up the soup spoon and started to drink.","\"You should get some rest early tonight. Recovery is important.\"","Fang Yue continued to remind her. This New Year's Eve meal, which was originally supposed to be eaten close to midnight was prepared early because of Shen Yin's condition.","\"OK, I'll listen to you, Mom.\"","Just as Shen Yin finished speaking, something seemed to be wrong.","\"Yin Yin, what's the matter?\" Xu Xiuhe was filled with worry and was the first to notice that Shen Yin's expression was off.","Just as he finished speaking, everyone else at the table looked their way.","Shen Yin glanced at her belly and said in a weak voice, \"I think... I might be about to give birth.\"","\"What? Isn't your due date tomorrow?\" Shen Lv put down his chopsticks.","\"Birthing is never precise. I was in labor for a long time when your sister was born. Shen Lv, start the car. Xiuhe, help Yin Yin. I'll go and grab some things.\"","Xu Yunzheng, taken aback, quickly rose and followed behind Shen Yin and Xu Xiuhe.","In the car, the family of three sat in the back while Shen Lv drove. Seeing Shen Yin's pained expression, he started the car without waiting for Fang Yue.","\"You call Mom and tell her which hospital we're headed to. I'll call to have the hospital prepare.\"","The two made their respective calls. Shen Yin leaned her head against Xu Xiuhe's shoulder, and Xu Yunzheng patted her hand.","\"Mommy won't hurt.\"","At nine o'clock in the evening, the car sped along the road. The traffic was lighter than usual, and as they passed residential areas, every house was brightly lit.","\"This little one, not obeying me, hasn't given me a chance to celebrate the New Year properly,\" Shen Yin said with a pale face but a smile.","\"Do you still feel uncomfortable? We'll be at the hospital soon,\" asked Xu Xiuhe.","\"I'm fine.\"","When Fang Yue came downstairs, she saw that Shen Lv's car had already left. She didn’t say much and made straight for the garage.","She hadn’t entered when a car came out of the garage. Shen Tianzheng was sitting in the driver's seat. Seeing Fang Yue standing at the side, he immediately got out of the car and opened the back door. He gently put the wrapped clothes and the newborn products from Fang Yue's hands onto the backseat.","\"Can you handle it? It's probably very cold at the hospital tonight,\" said Fang Yue, looking at Shen Tianzheng who was only wearing a sweater.","\"I have a thick coat in the backseat.\"","On hearing his response, Fang Yue looked in the backseat and indeed, it was there.","\"Drive slower to Rong City Hospital. We're not in a rush,\" Fang Yue reminded him earnestly, knowing that it had been a long time since Shen Lv had driven a car.","\"No problem, stop being so careful. I'm not sick now,\" Shen Tianzheng retorted.","While they were speaking, Shen Lv's car arrived at the hospital. There were already people waiting at the entrance to help. Shen Yin was lifted onto a stretcher and taken directly to the delivery room.","\"I'll go in too. Yunzheng, will you wait out here for mom and dad?\" said Xu Xiuhe, before entering. He was a little worried and left a message for Xu Yunzheng.","\"Okay.\"","Xu Yunzheng knew he shouldn't cause trouble at this moment. He was familiar with the scene and had experience. He had been here with his mother once before, waiting for Aunt Qi Ji, who later gave birth to two babies.","\"Brother, please look after him,\" Xu Xiuhe said to Shen Lv.","Shen Lv glanced at the delivery room, inserted one hand in his trouser pocket, and with the other hand gently patted Yunzheng's head. \"Don't worry, I'll take care of him.\"","After Xu Xiuhe entered, Xu Yunzheng ran to the door. Shen Lv sat restless on the chair outside. He felt somewhat guilty towards his sister.","\"Uncle, will brother and sister soon join this world to play with Yunzheng?” the little one asked.","\"Brother and sister?\"","\"Yes, just like Aunt Qi Ji. She stayed in this room and then had brother Le'an and sister Leyu.\"","\"Kid, do you like brother or sister?\"","\"I like both.\"","Shen Lv laughed; how was he supposed to explain that not everyone in this room ends up having twins? Besides, Shen Yin was bearing a little princess.","\"How are things?\" Fang Yue and Shen Tianzheng hurried over. They were carrying large bags in their hands.","\"They've just gone in not long ago, doctors and nurses have already entered,\" Shen Lv reported.","\"Have you found the patient room? Your father and I can put all this stuff away.\"","\"I'll go. You and dad wait here. Yunzheng, do you want to come with me?\"","The little boy sat on the chair, his short legs dangling in the air, swinging back and forth. He rested his elbows on his thighs, holding up his chin with his hands. On hearing Shen Lv's words, he said, \"No, I will wait here for my mom and dad.\"","Shen Lv didn't say much and went directly downstairs to arrange their things in the recently prepared hospital room.","\"Granny Fang,” the boy asked “when will my parents be out?\"","\"Just wait a little while, why don't you have a nap, Yunzheng? By the time you wake up, you'll be able to see your mom and sister.”","Fang Yue comforted him, but she also had no clue when Shen Yin would be out. Everyone's physical constitution varies in giving birth. Some women take as long as ten hours in the delivery room, others only two hours. But even in the quickest case, Shen Yin was likely to take quite a long time.","\"Yunzheng, come on, lean on Granny Fang.\"","Fang Yue draped a coat over Xu Yunzheng. Yunzheng obediently leaned towards Fang Yue's arm.","Fang Yue adjusted her position, trying to make Yunzheng more comfortable.","On the other side of the room, Shen Tianzheng was sat upright on a chair. His posture betrayed signs of tension.","\"Yunzheng, why don't you lean on Granny Fang and take a nap?\""]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Birth in the First Second of the New Year","paragraphs":["Xu Yunzheng once again insisted on refusing. He was not tired; he needed to wait for his mother to come out.","Shen Tianzheng glanced at his phone. It was already past 10 pm, and Shen Lv had also arrived.","Time ticked by slowly. Being located on a high level, the birthing room had a window that provided a distant view at a glance.","In the distance was an endless sea of lights. Rong City was economically advanced. Despite the decrease in permanent population during the New Year, there was still irresistible enthusiasm on New Year's Eve.","Everywhere, there were big red lanterns. From the window, one could gaze upon the iconic building of Rong City - The Glory Moon Tower.","The tower was broadcasting the Spring Festival Gala. Although the sound couldn't reach, the program was faintly visible.","The little one struggled to keep his eyes open, but in the end, he couldn't resist his sleep schedule. He fell asleep around New Year's Eve.","However, he didn't sleep for long. Around midnight, the sounds of firecrackers and fireworks started ringing one after another.","The sleepy toddler opened his eyes.","Just after midnight, a baby's cry was heard from the delivery room.","Xu Yunzheng perked up at once. He jumped down from the chair. Shen Lv, Fang Yue, and Shen Tianzheng stood up as well. They finally made it. The time when Fang Yue had Shen Yin was fraught with difficulty, casting a shadow over the two. They sat by the door, the unease within them inexpressible.","But now, they had finally relaxed.","\"It's the first baby of the New Year. This little princess has such perfect timing. As soon as the New Year's bell tolled, she came into the world.\"","A doctor joked as he walked out.","Later, after having a series of checkups in the delivery room, Shen Yin was wheeled out by the medical staff.","In the ward, Shen Yin was still weak. Fang Yue had used everything she had prepared, and the adults were eager to see the newborn baby.","\"This child is so handsome, just like Yin when she was a kid. Look at your small eyes and this mouth.\"","Fang Yue was astounded.","\"Let me see.\"","Shen Tianzheng impatiently leaned in.","\"The baby's smiling.\"","\"I want to see my sister smile.\" The little one strained his neck, silently wishing he were taller.","\"Uncle, Yunzheng wants to see his sister.\"","\"What, I didn't hear you correctly.\" Shen Lv, acting childishly, teased Yunzheng.","\"Uncle, lift me up now so I can see my sister.\"","Xu Yunzheng pushed his feet upwards.","\"What's in it for me?\" Shen Lv asked.","\"I'll introduce you to a girlfriend,\" replied Xu Yunzheng, straight-faced.","\"Deal.\"","Shen Lv put his words into action and picked Yunzheng up.","Yunzheng looked at the newborn baby and gave a smile.","\"Sis, I'm brother. Grow up quickly so I can take you to kindergarten.\"","Xu Yunzheng had barely finished speaking when the darling in Fang Yue's arms started to weep.","Xu Yunzheng was dumbfounded, not knowing why his sister, who was just fine, suddenly started crying.","\"Yunzheng, who bullies their sister like that? She's just been born, and already you are talking about kindergarten.\"","After being chided by Shen Lv, Xu Yunzheng realized he had misspoke.","\"Sis, no kindergarten.\" Xu Yunzheng corrected himself hastily, trying to salvage the situation.","The baby in the arms pouted.","\"Xu Xiuhe and I will stay here, Shen Lv, you and Yunzheng, and your dad, should go home first.\"","\"Alright, if you need anything, call me.\" Shen Lv knew that their whole family couldn’t fit in this room. It's more convenient for them to go back home. After all, Yunzheng is so young.","\"Dad, don't worry, my mom and Xu Xiuhe are here, there won't be any problem.\"","\"Okay, let's go home then. We'll come back early tomorrow morning.\" As Shen Tianzheng finished speaking, he picked up his coat and left.","Shen Lv, carrying Yunzheng, followed him out.","\"Uncle, what I just said is true.\"","Xu Yunzheng said with all seriousness.","\"What's serious?\" Shen Lv asked.","\"What I said about introducing a girlfriend to you is serious,\" Xu Yunzheng whispered into Shen Lv's ear.","\"Oh? Who does Yunzheng want to introduce to Uncle, Uncle likes the pretty ones.\"","Shen Lv continued teasing Yunzheng","\"I want to introduce 'Strawberry teacher' to Uncle, she's beautiful and very nice to Yunzheng, she's kind and gentle.\"","\"Really? Yunzheng likes 'Strawberry teacher' a lot?\"","The little man nodded.","\"It's gentle, not warm.\" Shen Lv corrected Xu Yunzheng's pronunciation.","\"Yes, gentle.\"","\"Tell Uncle, why is there a 'Strawberry teacher'? Do you also have an 'Apple teacher', and 'Orange teacher'?\"","\"Uncle, how did you know? But Yunzheng likes 'Strawberry teacher' the most because she said my mom is pretty!\"","\"You naughty!\"","Shen Lv and Yunzheng's conversation was very soft, and Shen Tianzheng who was walking in front of them could only hear them whispering, but couldn't hear what they were saying.","\"You two, hurry up, why are you walking so slowly?\"","Shen Tianzheng turned his head around.","\"Dad, you should tell me to hurry up.\"","Yunzheng fell asleep as soon as they got in the car.","The following day, early in the morning, fireworks were set off in every household of Yuelan Manor. It was Chinese New Year, hence the sounds of fireworks. The New Year atmosphere was still very festive. Shen Tianzheng had ordered the maids in the kitchen to prepare breakfast. After the three generations had breakfast, they packed some to bring to the hospital.","Shen Yin was still asleep in the morning, while Xu Xiuhe woke up pretty early. His phone was filled with messages and red packets from friends sent during the New Year countdown.","\"[Xiuhe, what's going on with you and your wife? Neither of you said anything in the group chat.]\"","Chang Zhiyuan was the most brash, @ing Xu Xiuhe several times in the group chat.","\"[There's nothing I can do. At the very first second of the New Year, we greeted our little princess.]\"","\"[Whoa, your wife gave birth? After midnight?]\"","Xu Xiuhe sent an expression of 'of course.'","Then he remembered something, walked to the couch inside, took out some documents from his bag.","Fang Yue also woke up, seeing the baby, who was wide awake.","\"I'll go out and call Shen Lv to bring some food over, we two can make do, but Yin Yin and the baby cannot.\"","Shen Yin woke up just when Fang Yue left the room.","\"Where's the baby?\"","Xu Xiuhe picked up the baby from the cot and handed her over to Shen Yin.","\"She's pretty beautiful.\"","\"Shen Yin said truthfully.","\"Thank you for your hard work. This is for the baby, keep it safe for her.\"","After saying this, Xu Xiuhe handed over the document he was holding to Shen Yin.","\"The acquisition document of the Xu Group?\"","Shen Yin held it in her hand. So the busy days before the Lunar New Year, was Xu Xiuhe busy all the time because of this?"]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: Cloud Jasmine","paragraphs":["Shen Yin, due to her good health, only stayed in the hospital for two days before being discharged.","On the day she returned home from the hospital, Qi Ji and Shu Yi came to Ziyue Manor to welcome Shen Yin.","Of course, Qi Ji's two babies also came, as they were on their New Year's holiday, and Xue Jingrui naturally came along too.","\"Let me see the baby,\" Qi Ji leaned in.","\"She's so beautiful! I never thought that little Le'an and Le'yu would become an older brother and sister so soon.\"","Qi Ji was a bit excited.","\"Her name is Yunmo, Xu Yunmo,\" Shen Yin said.","Everyone had brought gifts, and Shu Yi had prepared another present for Xu Yunmo.","\"I feel like I'm the biggest winner, becoming a mom without any pain,\" Shu Yi said, looking at all the children with great joy.","\"Godmother, when are you going to have a baby? Aunt Qi Ji and mom have both had babies,\" Xu Yunzheng asked.","\"Godmother's not in a hurry,\" Shu Yi squatted down and patted Xu Yunzheng's face as she spoke.","\"Then when will godmother be in a hurry? Why doesn't godmother have her own baby? That way, Zheng Zheng would have many brothers and sisters,\" the child persisted.","Shu Yi laughed awkwardly. How could she explain to a three-year-old that babies aren't born just because you want them, and that it takes more than one person?","\"I understand! Aunt Qi Ji and mom both had weddings before they had babies,\" Xu Yunzheng suddenly exclaimed.","Shu Yi was quite impressed. Xu Yunzheng was so clever. But before she could fully appreciate the child's insight, she was caught off guard by his next statement.","\"Godmother, you need to have a wedding,\" the little one declared.","Qi Ji was so amused she could barely keep her mouth closed.","\"We'll wait a bit longer. Godmother's not in a hurry,\" Shu Yi felt like Zheng Zheng was acting like a little adult, seeming to understand everything.","After giving their gifts to Xu Yunmo, the visitors left, as the new mother needed rest and shouldn't be disturbed too much.","During Shen Yin's postpartum confinement, Aunt Song took care of her. Aunt Song had arrived in Rong City from her hometown right after the New Year celebrations, on the third day of the first lunar month.","Aunt Song had cared for Shen Yin during her first pregnancy, and being quite professional with experience in caring for postpartum women and grandchildren, Shen Yin felt at ease with her.","\"Madam, this child looks just like you,\" Aunt Song said, holding Xu Yunmo and admiring her with increasing delight. She had been away for a year and a half, and now she was back to care for Shen Yin during her confinement.","\"Really? I can't tell if babies look like anyone,\" Shen Yin said with a smile.","\"Look at her nose, her mouth, they're so much like yours,\" Aunt Song insisted. Fearing Shen Yin might not believe her, she went to the nearby dressing table and brought a small makeup mirror, holding it up to Shen Yin's face.","Shen Yin looked in the mirror and then at Xu Yunmo, and indeed saw the similarities.","\"You're right,\" she admitted.","\"When this little girl grows up, she'll definitely be beautiful. The old madam would be overjoyed if she knew,\" Aunt Song said.","\"Aunt Song, you're from South City, right?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"Yes, and you know, the winters in South City are a bit warmer than in Rong City.\"","Shen Yin didn't have much of a reaction to this. She rarely went out, and with air conditioning and floor heating in the room, she didn't even need to wear a sweater indoors.","\"Grandma Song, I want to see my little sister,\" Xu Yunzheng ran in from outside. Since Shen Yin had come home, Xu Yunzheng would come in to see Xu Yunmo about eight times a day.","\"Of course, Grandma Song will hold the baby lower so Xu Yunzheng can see,\" Aunt Song said, adjusting her hold on the baby.","As Xu Yunzheng gazed at Xu Yunmo, Aunt Song watched Xu Yunzheng. She couldn't hide her happiness. When she had arrived, she had spotted Xu Yunzheng immediately. She had thought he might not remember her, as he was only two weeks old when she left. Now he was almost four years old, a big boy, and she thought he might not have any impression of her.","Indeed, Xu Yunzheng didn't recognize Aunt Song at first glance. After sneaking a few more looks, he became a bit shy. After two minutes, Xu Yunzheng asked, \"Grandma, have we met before?\"","Aunt Song was a bit surprised and nodded.","Shen Yin, who was nearby, said, \"She's Grandma Song. When Zheng Zheng was little, Grandma Song took care of you all the time. Don't you remember?\"","The little boy stood there, seeming to think. After a few seconds, he said, \"I remember now. Grandma said she'd come back to see me, and she really did.\"","\"Grandma Song always keeps her promises. What I promised Zheng Zheng, I will definitely do,\" Aunt Song said, patting Zheng Zheng's head.","Zheng Zheng shyly left the room.","Shen Yin smiled, and Aunt Song chuckled happily.","During Shen Yin's confinement, Xu Xiuhe had originally planned to stay at home with her, but circumstances didn't allow it. Xu Xiuhe had directly renamed the Xu Corporation to Yunmo Group.","He said he was giving it to Xu Yunmo, and he meant it. Heyuan Group had been intended for Xu Yunzheng from the beginning. What the son had, the daughter should have too.","There was a major staff reshuffling at Yunmo Group. Xu Xiuhe transferred some leaders from Heyuan Group, and Heyuan Group recruited some new ones. To outsiders, it looked as if the two groups had merged.","In reality, the profits of the two groups were kept separate. Xu Xiuhe made a clear distinction: the current profits of Yunmo Group all belonged to Yunmo, to be her dowry in the future.","Recently, during the winter holiday season, many new TV series and movies were released. Yet Yunmo Group managed to cut through the flood of entertainment news and topped the trending topics.","Everyone knew that Yunmo Group was formerly the Xu Corporation. They also roughly guessed that the Xu Corporation had changed owners. As for why it was called Yunmo, there were various speculations.","Some people guessed correctly. Rumors spread that the CEO of Heyuan Group had welcomed a second child, and Yunmo must be the name of the Heyuan family's daughter.","For a time, people marveled that some are born in Rome, with a net worth of billions at birth, owning their own company from day one.","When Shu Yi saw the news, her first reaction was to come and cling to little Yunmo. Who wouldn't love a baby born as a little rich girl? She just wondered which lucky boy would benefit from this in the future.","Shen Yin usually took care of Yunmo and couldn't do much else, but fortunately, the empire she had built earlier stood firm.","Qingfan Tower had been rated as a large-scale scenic area and was often featured in short videos, becoming a landmark of Rong City.","This cultural aspect was not only praised by the authorities but also strongly supported. It was frequently promoted, attracting more and more visitors. Chen Siming was thrilled; in such a short time, he had created an entire street. He had initially planned to open a private kitchen, but accidentally, it had grown into something much bigger.","To Chen Siming, Shen Yin was like a living Bodhisattva, a god of wealth.","Shen Yin's monthly share was already in the seven figures, and with her studio on top of that, she was quite satisfied. It wasn't about having a lot of money, just enough to use.","As for the future, they'd cross that bridge when they came to it.","In March, Shen Yin received a call from Su Jin, informing her that her award-winning work, the double-sided embroidered painting, had been included in the National Folk Art Museum."]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276: Faraway Years, Tender Life","paragraphs":["Shen Yin didn't have much of a reaction, but then Su Jin continued, saying that after being selected, there would not only be certificates of honor and various awards, but also prize money.","Shen Yin wasn't particularly interested in the small amount of prize money. The main thing was that being selected would further elevate her reputation.","Sure enough, Su Jin's next words brought even better news. The gist was that because of her excellent work, Shen Yin could represent their country on the international fashion stage, stepping onto the world scene.","Shen Yin now regarded Su Jin as a respected senior, speaking to her with the familiarity of a friend or family member. Su Jin reciprocated, genuinely delighted for Shen Yin's success.","Just as they finished speaking, the baby Yun Mo'er began to cry in her crib. Hearing this, Su Jin suddenly realized how quickly time had passed – in the blink of an eye, Shen Yin's baby had already been born.","At the one-month celebration for the Heyuan Group's little princess, everyone who could attend did so, including Xue Kai and Ye Rong, as well as representatives from major corporations and even media reporters.","Xu Xiuhe was already well-known in Rong City. At a young age, he had amassed billions in assets and founded a conglomerate, catapulting him to the status of Rong City's wealthiest individual. To him, Shen Yin was a capable partner, a friend, and the person he loved most in the world.","\"Mama, Grandma Su is here. She says she's come to see little sister,\" Zhengzheng ran up to Shen Yin, who had just completed her month of postpartum confinement. Thanks to the excellent care she had received, she was radiant and glowing.","Standing there, she was the center of attention in the crowd.","Xu Xiuhe stood beside Shen Yin, his face wreathed in smiles, completely unlike the rumors about him. Now he was just an ordinary husband, carrying his wife's bag and tidying the stray hairs at her temples.","The Sun Family from South City had also sent representatives. The entire hall was filled with the sounds of conversation and admiration.","\"Yun Mo'er, this is your great-uncle,\" Shen Yin said, carrying her baby to Xu Xiuhe's uncle and aunt.","Unable to speak, Yun Mo'er's eyes darted around. Seeing so many people for the first time, she wasn't quite comfortable and tilted her head to nestle against Shen Yin's chest.","\"Haha, Mo'er is feeling shy!\" everyone laughed. After seeing little Xu Yun Mo, the guests didn't linger, moving off to chat with friends.","Xu Xiuhe, worried that Shen Yin might tire, took Yun Mo from her and escorted Shen Yin to the presidential suite upstairs.","Shu Yi and Qi Ji followed, each carrying a child. When they reached the top floor, they encountered Xiao Li'er, who was also holding a baby.","With four children and three mothers, there was no end to their conversation topics. The group chatted in the room for a long time, with only Shu Yi unable to contribute much, instead entertaining the babies.","\"Sister Shu Yi, you should listen carefully. Who knows, it might be your turn next year,\" Qi Ji joked.","Shu Yi blushed for just a second before retorting, \"Who says? I'm not even married yet.\"","Qi Ji and Shen Yin shared a secret smile. Soon, perhaps by the end of the year, she would be.","That evening, when they returned home, Aunt Song had been waiting for them. Dinner was ready in the kitchen, and Xu Yun Mo lay in her crib nearby as the family of three sat down to eat.","Xu Yunzheng regaled them with amusing stories from kindergarten, and the family enjoyed a warm, harmonious meal together.","Aunt Song stood to the side, watching the scene with a contented smile. How wonderful, she thought. The wish from two years ago seemed to have come true.","That night, as Shen Yin slept, she unconsciously kicked off the blanket. Xu Xiuhe, half-asleep, noticed and habitually pulled the cover back over her.","Perhaps sensing this, Shen Yin opened her eyes to see Xu Xiuhe and gently stroked his eyebrow. In a soft, almost murmuring voice, she said:","\"Through distant years, a lifetime of tenderness.\"","Although the original phrase described brotherly affection, it conveyed exactly what Shen Yin wanted to express. It could apply to familial love, friendship, or romantic love.","In the long journey of life, feelings remain as they were. No matter how long the years, there will always be someone waiting for you in the depths of time, loving you. They will transcend time and space, cross mountains and seas, to save each other. There's a gentle tenderness, ordinary yet eternal, like a quiet stream flowing endlessly.","Nestled beneath the moonlight, they companionably gazed at each other in silence. Tomorrow would be another new day."]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277: Extra: Proposal","paragraphs":["After Little Yunmo turned one month old, Chang Zhiyuan prepared to propose. Everyone was helping him keep it a secret from Shu Yi.","Ever since the couple went public with their relationship, their fans went crazy. The two occasionally shared sweet moments on social media, and Chang's parents stopped interfering, letting things run their course. After all, they still wanted their son to be happy.","From the moment they announced their relationship, Shu Yi had decided to transition her career. Fans would flood Chang Zhiyuan's social media, wishing for him to return to acting. Now that they were invested in the couple, it didn't seem appropriate for Shu Yi to act in romantic dramas with other male leads.","When Chang Zhiyuan saw these messages, he had already begun looking at scripts. Shu Yi's career transition needed a gradual process. She couldn't suddenly stop acting in the sweet romantic dramas that young girls loved. After all, she was already 26, and with waves of younger actresses coming in, she couldn't keep playing middle school or high school students anymore.","The right roles should go to the right people.","As Labor Day approached, Shu Yi had just returned from a film set. Chang Zhiyuan asked Shen Yin to help him arrange for Shu Yi to meet at a scenic spot in Rong City.","On the day of the proposal, Chang Zhiyuan wore a very formal suit. When Shu Yi received Shen Yin's call, she didn't suspect anything and rushed over.","Upon arriving at the destination, she thought Shen Yin had made a mistake. This scenic area was more of a resort, with beautiful scenery and fresh air, mountains and water, though the mountains weren't very high. Usually, it was crowded and brightly lit, but when Shu Yi arrived, she found it pitch black and seemingly deserted.","Shu Yi suddenly realized that her attire had been unnecessary. She had originally worn a mask and hat to avoid being recognized, but now in the darkness, she could barely see her hand in front of her face.","Shu Yi began to feel scared. She was in an unfamiliar place, it was so dark, and she worried about potential dangers.","Her first reaction was to take out her phone and call Shen Yin.","After a few rings, Shen Yin answered.","\"Yin Yin, did I come to the wrong place? Why did you choose such a remote location, and there are no lights,\" Shu Yi whispered, covering her mouth.","\"Where are you now?\" Shen Yin asked.","\"I'm at the entrance of the Panshan Resort. It's pitch black, and there's no one around. Is the scenic area closed today?\"","\"Yes, it's closed. Enter through the gate and keep walking straight ahead.\"","Shu Yi didn't hang up but turned on her phone's flashlight and continued walking as Shen Yin instructed.","Inside the resort, there were artificial mountains and fountains. When Shu Yi reached the fountain, water suddenly began to spray, accompanied by music.","Then, all the lights in the scenic area came on at once. Shu Yi was stunned by the sight before her. The ground was covered with flowers, adorned with star-shaped lights, and beside it was a rose waterfall. The entire scene was both dreamy and magical.","Chang Zhiyuan emerged, wearing a white suit and holding a bouquet of flowers.","Shu Yi seemed to have guessed what was about to happen. Chang Zhiyuan walked up to her and got down on one knee.","\"Will you marry me?\"","Shu Yi looked around and saw that everyone who should be there had arrived – her friends, Chang Zhiyuan's friends, and Chang Ningjing.","Shu Yi covered her mouth. A woman's intuition was indeed accurate; she had guessed that Chang Zhiyuan might propose, but she hadn't expected it to be so soon.","\"When did you start planning this?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"At the beginning of the year,\" Chang Zhiyuan answered honestly.","\"After we're married, will I still be free?\" Shu Yi asked.","\"Of course. You can still act, travel... it's just that when you travel, you'll have me with you. Wherever you want to go in the future, I'll accompany you.\"","\"What if I want to go to Tibetan City?\"","\"No way,\" Chang Zhiyuan answered firmly. They could go anywhere else, but definitely not to Tibetan City. It was too dangerous. Although the scenery along Route 318 was beautiful, life was more important.","Their conversation made everyone around them laugh. They all knew about Shu Yi's altitude sickness incident in Tibetan City, and bringing it up in this context was indeed quite challenging for Chang Zhiyuan.","Chang Zhiyuan seemed to realize that his answer had been too abrupt, so he tried to explain himself.","\"Tibetan City is too dangerous. We can go anywhere else. I'll go with you.\"","\"You promise?\"","\"I promise.\"","They both smiled as they finished speaking. Shu Yi extended her hand, and Chang Zhiyuan slipped the ring onto her ring finger.","At that moment, everyone around them breathed a sigh of relief. The couple had been through so much to get to this point.","Fortunately, true love prevailed in the end.","\"Zhiyuan, if you ever mistreat Shu Yi, I'll be the first to punch you,\" Chang Ningjing said as she approached.","Shu Yi lowered her head shyly. She still remembered the first time she met Chang Ningjing – she was efficient and decisive, a true career woman, and even seemed to dislike her. Now, she would send her red envelopes during holidays and even visit her on set when she was filming.","The scenic setup, which cost hundreds of thousands of yuan, wasn't dismantled the next day. When the scenic area reopened, the resort had become a popular spot for visitors. However, the tourists never knew that this was a scene set up by a wealthy young man, probably to make his beloved smile."]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278: Extra: Babies","paragraphs":["\"Bro-bro, Momo hungry hungry.\"","Xu Yunmo sat on the carpet, looking expectantly at Xu Yunzheng. Xu Yunzheng was already five and a half years old, about to start first grade, but he was at a complete loss when it came to his one-and-a-half-year-old sister.","\"Just hang in there a little longer.\"","Xu Yunmo shook her head.","\"Can't hang on anymore.\"","Her voice was soft and milky, her eyes watery, her mouth pouting as she crawled to Xu Yunzheng's feet.","\"But you can't go down the stairs.\"","Xu Yunzheng said. Mom had told him to stay upstairs and play with his sister, but he wanted to go downstairs too. Momo had just learned to walk and couldn't manage the stairs.","\"Bro-bro carry.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunzheng picked up Xu Yunmo, a small person carrying an even smaller one.","\"Let's go downstairs.\"","Xu Yunzheng could carry Xu Yunmo on flat ground, but going down the stairs was still quite difficult.","So he carried Xu Yunmo to the top of the stairs and called out, \"Mom, Momo wants to come down.\"","Shen Yin was cooking in the kitchen. Hearing this, she looked up towards the second floor.","\"You and Momo wait a bit longer, I'll wash my hands and come up.\"","Just as Shen Yin finished washing her hands, the doorbell rang.","\"Wait a little more, okay? Mom's going to answer the door.\"","Shen Yin went to open the door, and three little tots rushed in: Le An, Le Yu, and Xiao Li'er's son, Xing Yi.","\"Auntie, where's Momo?\" Le Yu looked at Shen Yin.","Le Yu, Le An, and Xing Yi were all older than Momo. Le Yu and Le An, the two children, had completely opposite personalities.","Le Yu was more talkative and optimistic, but Le An was different. Le An was very quiet, just like his name suggested. He didn't like to talk much since he was little. At first, Qi Ji even thought there might be something wrong with Le An and took him to see doctors. After a series of check-ups, nothing was found. He was perfectly healthy and even a bit smarter than average.","Xing Yi was only a month older than Momo. The four little tots weren't far apart in age and could play well together.","\"Mommy, Mommy, Momo wants to come down,\" Xu Yunmo called loudly from the top of the stairs on the second floor.","\"Coming, coming.\"","Xu Yunzheng felt a headache coming on. Why did he have to be so much older than them?","After Shen Yin brought Xu Yunmo down, Le Yu trotted over with her little steps.","\"Momo!\"","The two little girls hugged each other, with Le An and Xing Yi standing nearby.","Qi Ji and Xiao Li'er suddenly felt liberated. They rushed to the kitchen to help Shen Yin, while the children played by themselves in the living room.","Le Yu and Yunmo got along for about three minutes before it started.","\"Yunzheng is my brother,\" Le Yu said.","\"No no, Yunzheng is my bro-bro,\" Yunmo shook her head.","\"An-An is your bro-bro,\" Yunmo pointed at Le An.","Le An was building blocks with Xing Yi, completely ignoring the two little girls.","\"An-An is your brother too,\" Le Yu refused to give in.","\"No no,\" Yunmo was confused, unsure for a moment if what Le Yu said was right or not.","\"Momo, I'm the big sister,\" Le Yu pointed at herself.","\"I'm the big sister!\"","Suddenly, the living room became lively.","Seeing that she was about to lose the argument to Le Yu, Yunmo ran to Xing Yi's side and said, \"Star-star, am I the big sister?\"","Liu Xing Yi looked up, then nodded and said in his baby voice, \"Big sister.\"","Having succeeded, Yunmo turned to Le An: \"An-An bro-bro, am I the big sister?\"","\"I'm An-An's big brother,\" Le An replied.","\"Yes, I'm Momo big sister,\" Xu Yunmo didn't care what An-An said.","Having sorted it out in her mind, Xu Yunmo ran back to Le Yu and said, \"Star-star and An-An bro-bro say I'm the big sister.\"","It was all mixed up. Xu Yunzheng held his forehead. Why did Yunmo, the youngest, always want to be the big sister?","\"Yunzheng, can you open the door? It's probably your godmother.\"","Xu Yunzheng got up and ran to the door to open it. Outside was another group of people.","\"Godmother, Aunt Ningjing.\"","\"Oh, godmother missed you so much!\" Shu Yi pinched Xu Yunzheng's cheeks again.","\"Xu Yunmo, your little brothers and sisters are here.\"","Hearing this, Xu Yunmo immediately trotted over with her little steps.","\"Big sister is here.\"","\"Ah, Momo has become even prettier!\" Shu Yi stroked the little ponytail on top of Yunmo's head.","\"Where are my little brothers and sisters?\" Xu Yunmo looked at Xu Yunzheng with her big eyes.","\"They're in the tummy, feel it.\"","Shu Yi took Xu Yunmo's little hand and placed it on her belly.","\"Yin Yin, I have good news for you,\" Chang Ningjing rushed straight into the kitchen.","Shen Yin turned to face her.","\"I can marry Tan Xiao now!\"","Chang Ningjing's face was full of joy.","Hearing this, Shen Yin smiled too. Since she became pregnant with Yunmo, she had been reading books and studying. Combining the books she had read in the Dasheng Dynasty with her enhanced skills in this era, she finally found a prescription to remove the old cold energy in Chang Ningjing's body.","In the blink of an eye, Chang Ningjing had been taking the medicine for a year, and it was time to see results.","\"Did you go to the hospital for a check-up?\"","\"Yes, I didn't have high hopes originally. Yesterday, when I went for a routine physical, I had it checked. The doctor said my gynecological condition was much better than before. They did a comprehensive examination and called it a miracle.\"","Chang Ningjing was so happy, not a trace of her usual strong, career woman demeanor remained.","\"Qi Ji is here,\" Qi Ji said as he helped Shen Yin set the dishes, sneaking a bite.","\"Oh right, we have Qi Ji right here with us,\" Shen Yin wiped her hands. As soon as she made this gesture, Chang Ningjing knew what Shen Yin was about to do. She obediently stretched out her hand.","Shen Yin's fingers moved slightly. A minute later, she said, \"It's almost there. Keep taking the medicine for a few more days to consolidate the effect.\"","\"Yin Yin, tell your sister, was your family in the medical profession in the past?\" Chang Ningjing joked.","\"My ancestors might have been military commanders.\"","Shu Yi's pregnancy was already showing. When she tried to enter the kitchen, she was shooed out by the others. So, in the living room, there were five children plus Shu Yi.","After hearing that there might be little brothers or sisters in Shu Yi's tummy, Xu Yunmo ignored everything else and kept close to Shu Yi, talking to her belly.","\"I'm the big sister, my name is Xu Yunmo. Grow up quickly,\" Xu Yunmo patted Shu Yi's belly.","Shu Yi was still trying to figure out the situation.","\"She was just asking An-An and Xing Yi to call her big sister earlier,\" Xu Yunzheng said. He never imagined that one day he would have so many younger brothers and sisters. If nothing unexpected happened, more people were likely to arrive soon.","Just as he was thinking this, there was another knock at the door.","Xu Yunzheng ran to open it again.","\"Aunt.\"","\"Yunzheng, are they all here?\" Fang Ningning asked.","Xu Yunzheng nodded. See? He knew it. Who knew how many more little brothers and sisters were yet to come? Aunt Ningning had another one in her belly too.","At mealtime, more than a dozen adults gathered around the table. Yunzheng also sat at the table, while the four little ones didn't join the table for the meal.","\"Daddy, hungry hungry.\"","Xu Yunmo, tired from playing, came to Xu Xiuhe's leg and tugged at it.","\"Daddy, hungry hungry.\"","Xue Le Yu also came to Xue Jingrui's leg.","\"Xing Yi, An An, are you hungry?\"","The two boys didn't say anything, continuing to play with the blocks in their hands.","Le Yu and Yunmo only ate two bites of the dishes Shen Yin had specially prepared for them before wanting to get down again.","Tottering back to the carpet, they continued their argument.","Xu Yunzheng was used to it by now. It was still okay with just four of them. In the future, with two more... well, that would be very nice.","\"Yunzheng, do you remember the wish you made when you were three? You wanted to have many younger brothers and sisters in the future.\"","Xu Yunzheng hadn't expected that everything he wished for back then would come true.","\"Let's have Aunt Apple open a kindergarten and send them all there,\" Xu Yunzheng said.","\"Hahaha, you just graduated from kindergarten yourself, and now you're thinking about sending your little brothers and sisters to kindergarten?\"","Chang Ningjing heard this idea and actually thought it wasn't bad. She was considering investing. With six little ones soon, opening a kindergarten was completely feasible.","\"Who's Aunt Apple?\" Qi Ji asked. Yunzheng had always had peculiar logic since he was little, and once again, \"apple\" had entered his blind spot.","\"It's his kindergarten teacher, Miss Apple. He introduced her to my brother, and now she's become Aunt Apple,\" Shen Yin explained.","\"Yunzheng must have learned this from the boss,\" Liu Bo chimed in.","Everyone in the room burst into laughter.","[End of the full text]"]}]);
